window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2001,"title":"Chapter 2001 Not Holding Back With the Help!","paragraphs":["2001 Not Holding Back With the Help!","Previously, Lin Yuan had been curious about why the Holy Lady had gone through the effort of collecting so many mouths of spirit springs.","If it was just a plant, there would be no need for so many mouths of spirit springs. There could even have been clashes due to the effects of different spirit springs.","However, the faerie within the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had been formed from a river.","Thus, there was no need for other considerations.","Whether the Gaea Begin River ended up passing the Heaven’s Trial, the mouths of spirit springs would not be impacted.","It would be impossible for the Gaea Begin River to finish absorbing all of the mouths of the spirit springs, no matter how hardworking it was at absorbing resources.","The transition from resignation to hope happened only in the span of a few seconds.","The Gaea Begin River had a pure mind and spirit and struggled to process the abrupt emotional transition.","Nonetheless, it still started moving.","The pink and gold river started to ripple.","Walls of water rose out from the surface of the river and stretched toward the sky.","The walls of water were like the gills of fish-species feys as they continuously absorbed the spirit qi in the air.","As it absorbed the pure spirit qi, the Gaea Begin River noticed that it had improved more in the last few minutes than it had in the past decades.","The Gaea Begin River looked at Lin Yuan with deep gratitude.","It closed its eyes and flew up into the sky in order to quicken its absorption of the pure spirit qi and other resources.","It now returned to the same state that it had been in when Lin Yuan first entered the space.","The Holy Lady’s attitude toward Lin Yuan had shifted by 180 degrees.","Previously, the Holy Lady looked at Lin Yuan the same way she would an enemy.","But now, she saw Lin Yuan as a savior.","Lin Yuan did not have time to bother with the Holy Lady.","He continuously took brocade box after brocade box out of the spatial ring before he poured the different types of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls into the river as though they were worthless garbage.","Lin Yuan’s action stunned the Holy Lady.","Since the Holy Lady had been created from the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline, she knew exactly what kind of resources the Gaea Begin River needed.","Besides pure spirit qi, what the Gaea Begin River needed the most was pure elemental energy.","But it was difficult to obtain pure elemental energy from the various factions in the Divine Wood Federation.","The Holy Lady could tell that in the previous times that the mystic realm had opened, the factions from the Divine Wood Federation instinctively avoided offering pure elemental energy in exchange for the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","However, the Gaea Begin River needed more elemental energy than it did spirit qi.","The Gaea Begin River’s body had been formed from water- and earth-elemental energy.","Now, with every brocade box that Lin Yuan took out containing 100 of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, the Gaea Begin River’s aura strengthened.","Lin Yuan communicated with Morbius using his spiritual energy and found out how difficult it was for a faerie to pass the blessing from the heavens.","This was why Lin Yuan wasn’t stingy at all and decided to invest everything he had into the Gaea Begin River.","As such, he spent the next day injecting resources into the Gaea Begin River non-stop.","Any one of the resources produced by Lin Yuan would cause a stir if anyone from the outside world saw them.","The Gaea Begin River’s elemental body fully solidified and became a body of flesh and blood.","It lifted his head up and had an austere expression.","The more energy it stored up, the more clearly it could sense the weight of the test from the heavens.","Despite the mountain of resources it had just received, it still did not feel confident of its victory.","After centuries of storing energy, faeries only attempted to take on the test from the heavens.","It had not been able to accumulate many useful resources.","Although it had gained so many resources, its roots had not solidified yet.","It would be impossible for the Gaea Begin River to use pure spirit qi and water- and earth-elemental energy to refine the entire river within a day. There just was not enough time!","However, because of Lin Yuan’s help, the Gaea Begin River no longer had to resign itself and now stood a fighting chance.","The Gaea Begin River’s emotions surrounding Lin Yuan were very conflicted.","In the beginning, the Gaea Begin River had been certain that imminent death was its destiny.","But then, Lin Yuan happened to enter the space where it was hiding.","The Gaea Begin River wanted to ask Lin Yuan what the outside world was like. It regretted never having left this space.","The first few times that the mystic realm opened, the Gaea Begin River had not used spatial-type plant-type feys to hide because it had been naive of the world.","As a result, many of those who entered the mystic realm had noticed the Gaea Begin River.","Although the Gaea Begin River’s mind was simple, every lifeform had the instinct to avoid harm.","The Gaea Begin River had not hesitated to use its river to drown the greedy beings who tried to trap it in bottles to capture it.","After those instances, the Gaea Begin River instructed the Holy Lady to set up its hiding spot.","Besides using spatial-type plant-type feys, it also planted many plants that could produce miasma to prevent any lifeforms from the external world from discovering it.","If the Gaea Begin River had not already resigned itself, it would have immediately attacked both the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp and Lin Yuan instead of producing a chair, attempting to communicate with Lin Yuan, and stopping the Holy Lady from attacking Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s words had floored the Gaea Begin River, and the harp within the Gaea Begin River that had fallen quiet long ago started to strum again.","...","When the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies were crushed and released the pure spirit qi, the Gaea Begin River saw the light of hope once again.","With renewed hope, the Gaea Begin River thanked Lin Yuan and immediately entered a state of storing energy.","But while it was storing energy, the Gaea Begin River was still strongly sensitive to the outside world."]},{"number":2002,"title":"Chapter 2002 The Gaea Begin River is Utterly Moved","paragraphs":["2002 The Gaea Begin River is Utterly Moved","The Gaea Begin River could sense how Lin Yuan had done everything he could to help it.","Its gratitude toward Lin Yuan deepened as he continued to inject resources into it.","Now, the Gaea Begin River only saw Lin Yuan as its savior and the most important person in the world. Lin Yuan was the only person in the Gaea Begin River’s life who had ever helped it.","Although the Holy Lady had been busy doing its bidding, the Holy Lady had been created by the Gaea Begin River.","!!","Otherwise, the Holy Lady would be nothing more than an ordinary peach blossom tree.","As for the members of factions who had entered the mystic realm, it was true that they had provided the Gaea Begin River with resources, but they had been obtained in exchange for the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline.","A trade was not the same as help.","The Gaea Begin River could absorb the resources Lin Yuan had poured into the river just from the river water and the fallen rocks in the water.","Just as the Gaea Begin River was about to sincerely thank Lin Yuan, it saw Lin Yuan pour several handfuls of crystalline objects into the river.","The Gaea Begin River instinctively used its undercurrents to crush the crystalline objects.","When the first crystal was crushed, the Gaea Begin River felt a mountain of spirit qi explode out.","In an instant, the spirit qi permeated the entire river.","There was even more spirit qi than from the 1,000 red flowers that had first scattered across the river.","Lin Yuan had poured almost 500 of the crystals into the river.","At that instant, the Gaea Begin River was utterly touched.","The Gaea Begin River looked down at Lin Yuan, who was still pouring resources into the river.","A special emotion emerged in its eye.","If White Speak lifted its head to look at the Gaea Begin River, it would notice that it was looking at Lin Yuan the same way that the Holy Lady looked at the Gaea Begin River.","After a day of pouring resources into the river, Lin Yuan looked up at the Gaea Begin River.","He had truly offered up everything he had that would be useful to the Gaea Begin River and had not even saved a single spirit qi crystal for himself.","After Lin Yuan poured out the 500 spirit qi crystals, he had nothing else that could help the Gaea Begin River.","“Go and crush all of the spirit qi crystals and absorb the spirit qi within. If you still need help, let me know. I don’t know if I’ll be able to help, but I can try. The most important thing you need to do is to try and overcome the Heaven’s Trial.”","When it heard what Lin Yuan said, the Gaea Begin River did not stand on ceremony with Lin Yuan.","It wanted to thank Lin Yuan, but there was no rush to express it now.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had done it the favor of enabling its transformation.","This favor could not be expressed with just a few words.","The Gaea Begin River could sense that the Heaven’s Trial would be arriving in about another two hours.","Two hours was just enough time to crush all of the spirit qi crystals and change the spirit qi into energy.","The Gaea Begin River did not hide its flaws from Lin Yuan.","“My biggest problem now is that my foundation is weak. I might have just received an enormous amount of resources, but I have no way of melding them with my foundation. With so much exquisite earth- and water-elemental energy, I should be able to refine my bloodline. However, there isn’t enough time left for my bloodline to be refined. The refinement of my bloodline would be the best stage of power improvement I could receive.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he heard what the Gaea Begin Rivers said.","“If you want to absorb elemental energy and refine your bloodline in a short span of time, I might be able to help you.”","While he was speaking, Lin Yuan’s body vanished from the Gaea Begin River’s range of sensing in a flash.","White Speak had witnessed this ability of Lin Yuan’s before.","It did not find anything Lin Yuan did to be strange.","However, the Gaea Begin River, who had developed an affection for Lin Yuan, felt a loss for the first time in its life. This left it feeling empty and slightly panicked.","This feeling was equally as torturous as when the Gaea Begin River decided to resign itself.","But it did not take long before Lin Yuan reappeared.","Elation spread across the Gaea Begin River’s face.","Lin Yuan went to the Spirit Lock spatial zone and took out all of the water from the Element Well to store it inside a Diamond fey storage box.","When he returned to the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, Lin Yuan opened the Diamond fey storage box with the Element Well’s water.","The water that did not look any different from regular water entered the Gaea Begin River.","Soon, the Gaea Begin River let out a soft cry, and its body dissolved into the river.","Small ripples spread across and covered every inch of the river.","Water and earth, two seemingly unrelated elements, were harmonized by the Element Well’s water and started to fuse together.","The pink and gold river water intensified at first before it faded and became more transparent.","When one looked at the river, they would see that the waves seemed to be swimming. The sight was so beautiful that no one would be able to tear their eyes away.","The greatest beneficiary of the past day had to be the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp.","Presently, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had reached Sovereign VIII/Creation VII.","During this time, Lin Yuan had used the Pure Land of Bliss to absorb the three World Cleansings when the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp evolved to Creation Breed. This was what had allowed Lin Yuan to obtain so many spirit qi crystals.","At the same time, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had also provided Lin Yuan with seven golden pearls.","At first, Lin Yuan intended to return the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp to a Diamond fey storage box because its absorption of the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline would cause the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline to become thinner.","However, the Gaea Begin River had stopped Lin Yuan and said it hoped that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp would continue to absorb its bloodline.","It also wanted the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp to attach to it using Feedback Application to boost its bloodline.","...","As the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline was purified, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp now took on a transparent crystalline appearance. Its fins and tail were even longer and gossamer.","As the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp swam, every movement of its tail would create waves that rolled over 1,000 meters."]},{"number":2003,"title":"Chapter 2003 Gaea Begin River’s Ending!","paragraphs":["2003 Gaea Begin River’s Ending!","The Gaea Begin River’s body was constantly being reformed inside the river.","At that moment, the Gaea Begin River still retained its original appearance.","However, its pink hair had become crystalline, and nine different moving golden patterns appeared in its eyes.","It was now wearing an exquisite pink and golden garment. It looked exceptionally pristine on the Gaea Begin River.","The Gaea Begin River came up to Lin Yuan and said softly, “My name is Begin Lady. I gave myself this name when I gained intelligence.”","Lin Yuan did not feel much when he heard what Begin Lady said. Nonetheless, Morbius knew that Begin Lady had acknowledged Lin Yuan. Otherwise, a high-level lifeform would not tell its name to others without being asked, but only to those it deemed important to it.","It would not tell its name to anyone else besides Lin Yuan for the rest of its life.","Thus, even without swearing, Begin Lady would go on to follow Lin Yuan after the Heaven’s Trial and protect him like it would family.","A contract was the greatest insult to a high-rank lifeform.","Mutual sincerity was the only acceptable medium of lifelong bonding.","Lin Yuan did not know what the significance of Begin Lady telling him its real name was.","But since Begin Lady had introduced itself, Lin Yuan smiled and reached his hand out to Begin Lady as he said, “I’m Lin Yuan.”","Faced with Lin Yuan’s smile, Begin Lady’s lips turned up, and it clasped Lin Yuan’s hands.","At that moment, 26 golden eyes suddenly appeared in the sky. They were lined up in the shape of a snake.","The 26 eyes appeared bone-chilling to anyone who saw them.","After the 26 eyes appeared, they focused on Begin Lady and were instantly filled with fury.","The eyes turned to slits.","The first eye turned into a beam of light and shot out at Begin Lady.","In order to ensure that the first attack from the test did not affect Lin Yuan, Begin Lady stepped on the tide and kicked up a gold and red wave that charged at the sky to take on the attack.","After the 26 eyes appeared, Morbius sighed, “Partner, Begin Lady isn’t a lower faerie but an intermediate one. It will be difficult for it to pass the Heaven’s Trial! If it can truly pass the Heaven’s Trial, you have to ask how it gained intelligence. It would be difficult to produce a lower faerie in the main world, even with spirit qi that is ten times more concentrated. How was an intermediate one produced here?”","Lin Yuan had already heard Morbius say that faeries needed to take the test from the heavens.","The Heaven’s Trial was just like the Trial of World Creation and World Cleansing in that the attacks only became increasingly powerful. Every attack had to be sustained in order to pass.","A lower faerie only had to sustain 16 attacks from the Heaven’s Trial, while the intermediate faerie needed to sustain 26. This meant that an intermediate faerie had to sustain ten more attacks than a lower faerie.","Morbius previously was not worried because it assumed that Begin Lady was a lower faerie, and it knew how many resources Lin Yuan had accumulated in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","It would be easy to help a lower faerie pass the Heaven’s Trial, but this would not be the case for an intermediate faerie.","“Partner, your opportunity is bigger than what I expected. However, it is rather challenging. We now have two choices. Firstly, we can leave the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm this instant. This small world exists because the Gaea Begin River produced it. If Begin Lady rips open a hole, we’ll be able to leave.”","When he heard what Morbius said, Lin Yuan asked seriously, “Will we stand a chance if we take the second choice?”","Since Lin Yuan was asking about the second choice even before it said anything about it, Morbius knew that Lin Yuan’s mind was already made up.","“We will stand a chance, but it will be a gamble. Partner, a gamble means that there’s also the possibility of losing. Begin Lady should be able to handle the first 16 attacks easily, but it should reach its limit by the 22nd attack. What we need to do is ensure that Begin Lady won’t die over the course of the remaining four attacks.”","Morbius liked how Lin Yuan looked when he was resolute, and it would not interfere with his feelings.","For some reason, Morbius found Lin Yuan’s current expression to be familiar.","It was a feeling that left Morbius sentimental.","Things indeed progressed as per Morbius’ expectations—Begin Lady handled the first 16 attacks smoothly.","But when the 17th attack arrived, Lin Yuan could clearly sense that Begin Lady was struggling.","Each of the attacks was more intense than the last one.","From the way that Begin Lady handled the first 16 attacks, Lin Yuan knew that the power of each subsequent attack did not multiply from the previous one, but the power would increase by at least 30% each time.","If things continued like this, the power of the 26th attack would be at least five times more powerful than the 17th attack.","There was no way that Begin Lady would be able to handle an attack of such power.","When he saw how difficult it was for Begin Lady to handle the 17th attack, Lin Yuan thought, Begin Lady might not even make it to the 22nd attack. No one understands Begin Lady’s current situation better than itself.","It was likely that Begin Lady was already starting to feel the twinges of despair.","Lin Yuan was right. Begin Lady could already feel that its time on this earth was coming to an end."]},{"number":2004,"title":"Chapter 2004 Lin Yuan Prepares to Use a Secret Weapon!","paragraphs":["2004 Lin Yuan Prepares to Use a Secret Weapon!","However, Begin Lady did not give up and continued to give its all in channeling the energy in its body. It did not waste any of the energy and threw itself into battle mode.","At that moment, Begin Lady felt extremely guilty toward Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had provided it with so many resources, but it had still failed to overcome the Heaven’s Trial.","At that moment, Begin Lady heard a voice shout, “Begin Lady, try your best to hold on. I will do my best to help you with the next few attacks.”","!!","While he was speaking, Lin Yuan fused with Dark Blue and went into his merman state.","A bloodline power that was comparable with that of Begin Lady started to fill the space.","The sound of gentle waves mixed with the light rushing of the river water.","Lin Yuan’s current appearance was slightly different from when he fought Qian Yu.","At that time, Lin Yuan had just received the blessing from Blue Lotus and awakened his mermaid emperor bloodline.","But some time had passed, and the mermaid emperor in Lin Yuan had solidified.","Lin Yuan’s bloodline power made Begin Lady turn around to look at him while it received the 18th attack.","The moment Begin Lady saw Lin Yuan, it looked shocked.","It could be said that Lin Yuan’s current appearance was the most beautiful of any lifeform that Begin Lady had seen.","Lin Yuan’s bloodline power gave Begin Lady a feeling of deep affection.","Moreover, both of their bloodlines were related to water.","Begin Lady could sense that Lin Yuan’s power was still not strong even after transforming.","However, there was no way that Lin Yuan was lying when he said that he would help it.","This gave Begin Lady a pump of courage amidst its despair to take on the remaining attacks.","As it prepared to receive the 18th attack, Begin Lady lifted its hand and scooped some of the pink and blue water below it.","The pink and gold river rushed to the sky in a winding path as it headed for Begin Lady. It resembled a smooth silk ribbon.","Begin Lady picked up the ribbon-like river and threw it into the sky.","The long ribbon crashed against the 18th attack and was promptly set alight.","As the silk ribbon burned, the 18th attack also slowly weakened.","By the time the attack vanished, 1/3 of the silk ribbon had been burned up.","As it prepared to take on the 19th attack, Begin Lady threw the ribbon again.","This time, the fire burning the silk ribbon was clearly much stronger than before.","As the silk ribbon burned, Begin Lady did not use any other secret weapon and silently held on.","After it survived the 19th attack, the pink and gold ribbon of river water had been reduced to the size of a handkerchief that could not even cover a hand.","At that moment, Begin Lady coughed and said, “Burning Sacrifice.”","Layers of watery light appeared on Begin Lady’s body.","Pink and gold bubbles surfaced from Begin Lady’s body, decorating the sky.","Every pink and gold bubble was like a flower that bloomed in front of the remaining seven eyes.","Morbius told Lin Yuan that Burning Sacrifice was a faerie’s final secret weapon. It would use up the faerie’s bloodline as a trade to obtain more power.","If Lin Yuan had the ability to help Begin Lady overcome the remaining seven attacks, he would do everything in his power to keep Begin Lady from using Burning Sacrifice.","Currently, even if Lin Yuan used all of his life-preserving secret weapons, he would not be able to help Begin Lady survive the remaining attacks.","Thus, there was no other option than for Begin Lady to use Burning Sacrifice.","The attack that had just descended from the Heaven’s Trial shocked White Speak.","It could be certain that it would be grievously injured if it tried to take on the 19th attack on Begin Lady’s behalf.","Although it would not die from such an attack, it would need to recuperate for a year in order to recover fully.","Lin Yuan had made a gauge of the secret weapons he possessed.","He had many secret weapons but faced with an attack of such a level, only three would be of use.","The first was to fuse with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil and use its satanic power to boost his own power. Then, he would use the two fishes from the Vast Sea Wave-Raising Flute","Before that, he needed to use a drop of the Element Well’s water to extract a water-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearl, as well as instruct Frigid to boost the Vast Sea Wave-Raising Flute so that it would reach pinnacle 8 Stars.","Clearly, this secret weapon would not be enough to take on the subsequent attacks of the Heaven’s Trial. At the very least, it would only be able to help Begin Lady until the 22nd attack.","Lin Yuan’s second secret weapon was to use the sea of faith power he had accumulated to boost White Speak’s power and enable it to cross over Eternal.","White Speak would be able to help Begin Lady overcome the 23rd attack.","Given White Speak’s power, it would also have the power to help Begin Lady take on the 24th attack.","For the 25th attack, Lin Yuan intended to use the Extreme Token that the Moon Empress had given him as a safety net.","As for the final attack, Lin Yuan decided to go all out and use all of Frigid’s power to boost the Fish World Sea Trump Card. With Frigid’s sea demon emperor bloodline, it could easily boost the Fish World Sea Trump Card to beginner 10 Stars.","Then, Lin Yuan would use the Cold Season Poisonous Fish to continue boosting the Fish World Sea Trump Card until it reached the legendary level of 11 Stars.","In Lin Yuan’s previous conversation with Lan Xun, he found out that 10 Stars precious instruments were already the stuff of legends. There had never been an 11 Stars precious instrument ever recorded in history.","After all, in order to forge an 11 Stars precious weapon, a pinnacle 11 Stars or even 12 Stars sacred source lifeform was needed.","Even if such sacred source lifeforms existed, the people who owned them would not allow others to kill their sacred source lifeforms to turn them into precious instruments.","..."]},{"number":2005,"title":"Chapter 2005 The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s Hopes Fulfilled!","paragraphs":["2005 The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s Hopes Fulfilled!","Since the main ingredient and most of the supporting ingredients in the Fish World Sea Trump Card contained the mermaid bloodline, only lifeforms with the mermaid bloodline could wield it.","The mermaid bloodline also substantially boosted the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","What Lin Yuan needed to do was to use his mermaid bloodline to boost the Fish World Sea Trump Card and unleash his absolutely strongest attack to see if it would be enough to take on the 26th attack and secure Begin Lady’s survival.","Besides the mermaid bloodline, a large amount of spirit qi was also needed to wield the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","!!","The more Stars the precious instrument, the more spiritual power it needed.","This was why even if the disciples of royalty possessed precious instruments from a young age, their precious instruments could not surpass 5 Stars.","In the fight against Han Qi, once Lin Yuan overcame Han Qi’s attack that could obtain spirit qi by killing other lifeforms, Han Qi could not use the Demon Lizard Tooth Blade for long before he tired himself out.","Even a thearch-class expert would have to use up all of the spirit qi in his body to use the 11 Stars precious instrument.","Lin Yuan was confident that he could use the 11 Stars Fish World Sea Trump Card because he had the Spirit Qi Imprint.","The sea of spirit qi in the Spirit Qi Imprint would enable Lin Yuan to use the 11 Stars Fish World Sea Trump Card for one attack and still have a lot to spare.","Lin Yuan had thought about using the Extreme Token to help Begin Lady take on the 26th attack. But when the thought surfaced, Morbius reminded him, “Partner, no matter how strong your Master is, the moonlight domain in the Extreme Token isn’t half as strong as the original. When you activate it, it won’t be able to evolve to Fantasy Breed, and its limit will be at Diamond X/Legend.","“When Eternal experts and above use the Extreme Token, their limit will be around Eternal VIII to Eternal IX. It won’t even be able to break through pinnacle Eternal XII. Meanwhile, an attack by you using your mermaid emperor bloodline with the Fish World Sea Trump Card will definitely exceed Eternal. As such, I think you should be the one to take on the last attack from Begin Lady’s Heaven’s Trial.”","Morbius actually had one more thing to say but did not end up saying it.","It wanted to say that if Lin Yuan could not handle the 26th attack, it could use the power in its roots to help him. It was willing to help Lin Yuan gamble for possibly the biggest opportunity in his career as a spirit qi professional because its roots power was currently at maximum.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan’s safety would always be the most important to Morbius.","Begin Lady had already used Burning Sacrifice and just managed to survive the 21st attack.","The gold and red garment that Begin Lady was wearing had already burned up.","After burning up its bloodline, its bloodline was already showing signs of becoming elementalized. Clearly, it was not going to be able to hold on for much longer.","The Holy Lady was close to tearing her hair out with panic, but there was nothing she could do.","Lin Yuan knew that it was time for him to take action.","First, he opened his Spirit Qi Imprint, and a wave of spiritual energy exploded out from his body.","He was silent for a moment before he decided to open the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint as well.","Only around a month had passed since the last time he opened the Vitality Imprint. Although not a lot of time had passed, the Diamond X/Fantasy V Jasmine Lily also accumulated vitality extremely quickly.","Lin Yuan waved his hand and summoned the Jasmine Lily before instructing it to use Heal. It used the Bud of Mountain Jade to form a chain of healing that landed on Begin Lady.","Begin Lady was different from regular lifeforms made of flesh and more like lifeforms made from elemental power.","Although the Jasmine Lily’s healing effects were not strong on such lifeforms, there still was some effect.","As more vitality was transferred to it, Begin Lady’s situation became visibly better.","When Lin Yuan previously used the Jasmine Lily, it could only heal through the Bud of Mountain Jade.","But now, because of the first Endless Gem that Morbius had absorbed, the Jasmine Lily had been released from the spirit lock. Thus, it could now use its Elite to Diamond abilities.","At that moment, the Jasmine Lily used its Elite ability Mountain Jade Imprint on Begin Lady.","The Mountain Jade Imprint’s existence greatly boosted the healing effects of vitality on Begin Lady.","Soon, the flower on the Jasmine Lily started to spin rapidly, and it lit up with a verdant green light as images of mountain jades swirled around it.","In an instant, the Jasmine Lily injected most of the vitality from the Vitality Imprint into Begin Lady.","With the ability Mountain Jade Prayer, Begin Lady’s vitality was maintained at peak capacity.","In this state, the Jasmine Lily used Life Protecting Soul and added a layer of protection on Begin Lady’s soul.","Besides physical damage, Begin Lady would also experience soul injuries when it took on the Heaven’s Trial.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and decided to fuse with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","Previously, he had been against fusing with female devils.","But now, for the sake of Begin Lady, he was going to do what needed to be done.","When the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil found out that Lin Yuan was going to fuse with it, it pumped its fists in long-awaited excitement.","No devil, whether it was lower, intermediate, or higher, wished to be fused with their spirit qi professional.","They would only do so to obtain resources.","The higher the bloodline of the devil, the more it hated fusing with a spirit qi professional.","However, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was fully submissive to Lin Yuan and longed to help him.","Nonetheless, despite hinting at him after each evolution of its bloodline, Lin Yuan always seemed to have no intention of fusing with it.","But now, the chance to fuse had finally come."]},{"number":2006,"title":"Chapter 2006 Lin Yuan’s Satanization!","paragraphs":["2006 Lin Yuan’s Satanization!","When the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil received the order from Lin Yuan to fuse, it immediately combined itself with Lin Yuan’s soul.","Soon, the deathly white aura of devils started to emanate from him and intermixed with the aura of spirit qi from the Spirit Qi Imprint that Lin Yuan had opened.","Soon, six horns appeared on Lin Yuan’s head. They entwined around each other to form a jet-black crown.","However, Lin Yuan did not expect the mermaid emperor bloodline in his body to be stronger than the satanic power. In fact, it was exceptionally domineering.","Ever since the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s satanic power appeared in his body, the mermaid bloodline started to clash against it to fight for dominance.","The fight of dominance between two bloodline powers was extremely dangerous. Even the slightest mishap would result in the body exploding.","But since the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was fully subservient to Lin Yuan and the mermaid emperor bloodline power came from Lin Yuan’s own body, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil controlled its own satanic power to be taken over by the mermaid emperor bloodline power. It did not even fight back when the mermaid emperor bloodline power consumed its satanic power. Rather, it enjoyed being invaded by Lin Yuan’s bloodline power.","As a result, Lin Yuan’s appearance did not change after he fused with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, and none of the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s characteristics appeared on his face.","As the mermaid emperor bloodline took over, the black crown made of six horns on Lin Yuan’s head slowly changed to dark blue and gold.","But since it was a fusing, there were still some changes.","For example, when Lu Ou fused with his higher devil, tattoos appeared on his face, and he grew a long and thick dark red tail.","Lin Yuan’s devil tattoos were not on his face but on his neck. They circled his neck but did not stretch down on his chest. It was unknown where it started or ended.","When the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil evolved to Satan, there had been 11 Calamity Flowers, each representing different elements in the Flower Basket of Calamity.","At that moment, a large mass of flowers appeared on Lin Yuan’s back. However, the colors of the 11 different bunches of flowers were no longer distinct but were blended together like a rainbow.","But if it was really to be compared to a rainbow, the mass of flowers on Lin Yuan’s back had more than just seven colors.","The flowers on Lin Yuan’s back grew wildly and covered five square meters by Lin Yuan’s feet.","If Lin Yuan sat down at that moment, the flowers would cushion his body.","If someone saw him now, they would immediately notice that the biggest change that had happened to him was to his eyes.","His eyes were still blue and gold, but his pupils had turned into 11 flowers that were slowly spinning in his eyes.","At that moment, Lin Yuan finally understood why Han Qi and Lu Ou had been able to use their bodies to take on powerful attacks.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was not skilled at defense, and it had one of the weakest bodies of all the devils.","But when Lin Yuan was boosted through his fusion with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, he felt that he would be able to use his body to fend off Diamond X/Fantasy V feys.","Even if he did not use his fighting skills to dodge the attacks, it would be difficult for him to sustain any injuries.","At that moment, the 22nd attack was already starting to descend on Begin Lady.","Although the Jasmine Lily had healed Begin Lady, it still did not have the courage to directly take on the attacks from the Heaven’s Trial.","If not for external help, Begin Lady knew that it would not have been able to make it this far.","At that moment, two exceptionally strong auras grazed past it and took on the 22nd attack from the Heaven’s Trial.","They were two fishes with satanic power equivalent to pinnacle Immortal swirling around them.","Most importantly, satanic power had strong degenerating effects that were extremely effective on attacks of willpowers, laws, and the like.","The attacks from the Heaven’s Trial were considered that of willpowers, laws, and the like.","The two fishes were a great boost of confidence for Begin Lady.","Begin Lady used everything in its body to elementalize it using Burning Sacrifice and followed the two fishes to unleash its strongest attack.","When the two fishes slammed into the 22nd attack from the Heaven’s Trial, their bodies took on the pillar of light.","The satanic power penetrated the pillar of light, causing it to become dimmer.","As a result, when Begin Lady unleashed its strongest attack, it managed to take down the 22nd attack.","However, the 22nd attack still caused Begin Lady to sustain serious injuries.","Through Mountain Jade Prayer, Begin Lady was once again filled with vitality that rapidly healed its injuries.","Lin Yuan had not yet had the chance to use the unlocked Jasmine Lily in battle.","After a real fight, Lin Yuan realized that the Jasmine Lily’s healing abilities greatly surpassed his expectations.","As long as there was sufficient vitality inside the Vitality Imprint, the target designated by the Vitality Imprint would be able to heal in an instant regardless of how serious its injuries were.","Because of Severed Limbs Growth, even injuries that involved destroyed organs and missing limbs could be regrown quickly.","Lin Yuan rarely had the opportunity to use his secret weapons in battle.","Now, he knew what his limit of combat power was when he used the Vast Sea Wave-Raising Flute and Frigid in conjunction.","The subsequent 23rd and 24th attacks from the Heaven’s Trial would depend on White Speak.","Lin Yuan turned to look at White Speak and said solemnly, “White Speak, I’m going to boost your power next! You have to protect Begin Lady regardless of how you handle the next two attacks.”","White Speak hurriedly replied, “Even if it costs my life, I will definitely carry out your order!”","While it was speaking, White Speak looked fully devoted. This was because White Speak felt that Lin Yuan looked no different from usual and would only give it tasks he was confident in.","Moreover, from the previous time that Lin Yuan used his Dictator’s body to boost it past Apostle, it felt that it would have enough power to be able to protect that strange lifeform in the sky."]},{"number":2007,"title":"Chapter 2007 Activated Extreme Token!","paragraphs":["2007 Activated Extreme Token!","Although it was expressing its loyalty, White Speak had already formed a contract with Lin Yuan and had become his Apostle.","Even if Lin Yuan wanted it to die for a specific reason or if he wanted to kill it for no reason at all, White Speak would not complain in the slightest.","In the marsh world, after an Apostle swore its loyalty to a Dictator, serving its Dictator would be the most important thing in its life.","Lin Yuan swished his fish tail when he heard what White Speak said, and a streak of bloodline power that turned into a current linked him to White Speak.","!!","When Lin Yuan boosted White Speak last time, White Speak had only just managed to surpass pinnacle Immortal but had not been able to reach Eternal.","At that time, the strength of faith power that Lin Yuan injected into White Speak was far from the limit that White Speak could handle.","But now, Lin Yuan had only injected 10% of the faith power into his body, and White Speak’s body was already starting to show signs of rejection.","Lin Yuan knew that if he forcefully injected more faith power into White Speak, White Speak’s body would start to crack.","It went without saying that Lin Yuan could ignore White Speak’s condition and continue to inject faith power into it.","Even if White Speak’s body crumbled, the faith power would enable it to continue fighting.","However, Lin Yuan was not going to do that because White Speak was no longer the strongest combatant he possessed, and he also regarded it as his companion. He would never sacrifice his companion for his own benefit.","At that moment, White Speak was trembling with anticipation.","It was finally going to cross that level when boosted by Lin Yuan and see the sight that had always been closed off to it.","White Speak now had a deeper understanding of power and control.","Previously, White Speak had been unsure if it would be able to cross that level.","But now, as long as it had enough time to grow and a sufficient quantity of believers and Favored Believers, it was ready to cross that level at any time.","The totem on White Speak’s body lit up, and the silhouette of a crocodile that was over 10000 meters long appeared behind it.","The giant crocodile opened its mouth, and a terrifying gust of wind gathered in its jaws as a ball of light was formed.","White Speak’s natural ability was replay, which could swallow other lifeforms’ attacks. As long as the enemy’s attack was within range, it would be able to use its own energy to envelop the enemy’s attack and return it back at them.","The Dark Scorpion had died because of White Speak’s replay ability.","Although White Speak was puffed with confidence now that it had crossed that level, it dared not consume the 23rd attack from the Heaven’s Trial.","But even if it did not use its natural ability, it should not be difficult for it to take on the 23rd ability now that it had crossed over to Eternal.","With White Speak’s help, Begin Lady easily overcame the 23rd attack.","However, the 24th attack was not just 30% more powerful but twice as such.","This caused White Speak’s expression to fall stern.","At that moment, it dared not let down its guard in the slightest and changed back into its original form.","It used its body to receive the 24th pillar of energy from the Heaven’s Trial and released its strongest attack.","Thousands of gusts of wind shot out from White Speak’s mouth and rammed into the pillar of light.","But in the end, even with such an overwhelming amount of wind, a portion of the beam of light still made contact with White Speak.","White Speak’s body was immediately set alight with raging flames.","The armor on White Speak’s body was now charred black.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he immediately instructed the Jasmine Lily to heal White Speak.","For White Speak’s healing, all of the vitality in the Vitality Imprint was used up.","Although it cost half of White Speak’s life, the flames on its body were eventually put out.","White Speak changed back into human form and dragged its half-blackened body over to Lin Yuan as it bowed and said, “Lord Dictator, thank you for saving me!”","Lin Yuan looked deeply into White Speak’s eyes and pointed at its injuries.","1,000 units of source-type power flowed out of Lin Yuan and entered White Speak’s body.","Lin Yuan had only used source-type power to awaken dimensional lifeforms.","Source-type power could transform dimensional lifeforms into Apostles, but Lin Yuan had never gifted Apostles with pure source-type power before.","Out of all of Lin Yuan’s Apostles, White Speak had received unique treatment. But it had used its life to trade for this gift.","Lin Yuan had not expected that the Heaven’s Trial’s last few attacks would be multiplied.","But regardless of how strong the attacks were, he would have to take them on.","White Speak looked shocked when it felt the source-type power injected into its body.","Faith power was the source of power for Apostles, but source-type power was the basis of the power.","Source-type power was the important component that made up totems.","This was the first time White Speak found out that Dictators could directly give Apostles source power.","It felt that being gifted with source-type power was the biggest honor.","Setting aside the injuries it had just sustained, White Speak would be willing to sustain 10 to 20 times more serious injuries if it could obtain 10% of the source-type power that it had just received from Lin Yuan.","When source-type power was used to strengthen totems, it could collect many more believers and Favored Believers.","White Speak estimated that it would be able to break through past Apostle in less than two years.","But at the same time, White Speak started to guess that Lin Yuan was not just a Dictator in Turning Wheel Realm. He could be an even higher being.","However, it was a level that White Speak could not currently comprehend.","It was likely that only Dictators could get a peek at the level and figure out a way to cross over to it.","After Lin Yuan injected 1,000 units of source-type power into White Speak, he pulled the Extreme Token from under his shirt and plucked the pendant out.","...","He threw the token at the Heaven’s Trial’s 25th attack with all his might.","When it sensed the 25th attack, the Extreme Token immediately released the moonlight domain within.","In an instant, the round moon in the sky dimmed, and thousands of ribbons of moonbeams fell from the round moon.","Half of the moonbeams moved over to Lin Yuan and protected him, while the other half headed for the Heaven’s Trial’s 25th attack."]},{"number":2008,"title":"Chapter 2008 Fish World Sea Trump Card Unleashed!","paragraphs":["2008 Fish World Sea Trump Card Unleashed!","In actuality, when the 26th golden eye appeared in the sky, the factions in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had already noticed the strange happenings.","None of these members of factions had seen such strange phenomena before.","Almost all of them thought a large treasure had been unearthed and immediately rushed over as quickly as possible.","But on the way there, all of the members of the factions experienced realizations.","As they watched the pillars of golden light appear and then disappear, they felt that it uncannily resembled a lifeform going through a trial.","According to their experience, any lifeform experiencing a trial would be a chance to take advantage of them.","If the lifeform could not overcome the attacks from the golden eyes, helping it could earn the loyalty of the lifeform. Alternatively, one could force the lifeform to give up its loyalty at the key juncture of the trial.","Even if the lifeform was unwilling, it would also be able to fetch a high price when dead.","Su Jian and Bai Dong possessed comparable power.","As the two of them walked side by side, they wanted nothing more than to beat the other to the punch.","In order to trigger such a large-scale natural phenomenon, the lifeform’s bloodline had to be extremely elite, or it had to be extremely powerful. Regardless of which it was, it would be extremely beneficial to the Su family and Bai family.","When Su Jian and Bai Dong rushed over with their pinnacle thearch-class power, they realized that the truth of the situation was not what they thought.","Although they were 100 kilometers away, they could already feel the burn of the attacks from the golden pillars of light.","Just how powerful did the lifeform have to be able to hold on until now?","If it had failed, the golden eyes in the sky would have vanished.","Although both of them desired to possess the lifeform, this discovery made Su Jian and Bai Dong feel conflicted about whether they should continue advancing.","While the two of them were hesitating, they saw a giant crocodile that was 10,000 meters long charging at the beam of light.","The two of them instinctively assumed that the white crocodile was the lifeform undergoing the trial.","When they saw that the white crocodile had been charred black and severely injured by the gold pillar of light, both of them decided to muster their courage to take the risk.","There were clearly still two golden eyes in the sky.","Given that the white crocodile had struggled to survive the 24th attack, there was no way it would survive the attacks from the final two eyes.","But before they could arrive under the golden eyes, a round moon materialized in the sky out of the blue.","The entire environment seemed to change.","When the belts of moonbeams descended, it was as though every living creature on earth had become as insignificant as ants.","Just the sight of the moonbeams filled the both of them with trepidation.","Su Jian and Bai Dong stood at the forefront of the Divine Wood Federation and assumed that they would have reached the peak no matter where they went.","However, neither of them even understood the powers of Class 5 Creation Masters.","The round moon in the sky projected a might that greatly surpassed their cognition.","They shared a look and saw that the other’s gaze was also filled with fear.","Su Jian said hoarsely, “Brother Bai, this round moon is clearly helping the white crocodile to defend against the attack from the golden eyes in the sky. Do you think there could have always been an expert hidden in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm?”","Bai Dong gnashed his teeth when he heard what Su Jian said and replied, “Regardless, I still want to take a look at the situation. If you’re afraid of danger, you can wait for me here.”","Su Jian narrowed his eyes at Bai Dong. He knew that Bai Dong wanted to take the risk for the sake of the Bai family’s benefits.","At this juncture, the Su family should have already charged into the imperial court and started crossing swords with the Yang family.","He could not be of any help while he was leading a team in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. What he needed to do was to ensure that nothing that happened in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm affected the Su family’s plan.","Although the Bai family and Su family had a working relationship now, they would become rivals once the Su family got rid of the Yang family.","His great-grandparents had long decided that the Bai family would be eliminated a year after the Yang family.","Suppose he allowed Bai Dong to investigate the situation ahead now. In that case, he might discover something that he could turn into the Bai family’s secret weapon and enable them to fend off the Su family.","With this thought, Su Jian steeled himself and said, “Brother Bai, I’ll go with you. We’ll be able to look out for each other. Looking at the moonbeams from the moon, only a part of it traveled over to the golden eye. Half of it is clearly protecting something. If you sense carefully, you’ll notice that the moonbeams aren’t much stronger than the pillar of light from the 25th eye. There’s no way that the moonbeams alone will be able to handle the attack from the 26th golden eye.”","While he was speaking, Su Jian started flying off in the direction of the last golden eye.","From behind him, Bai Dong shot him a murderous glare.","If Su Jian wanted to go, there was nothing that Bai Dong could do.","If his power was not comparable to Su Jian’s now, he would have planned to take Su Jian out of the picture.","If they truly encountered something monumental when they arrived, he would have to beat Su Jian to the punch and ensure that he was the one who ended up being the receiver.","...","Under the umbrella of the hundreds of moonbeams, Lin Yuan looked up at the 25th attack tangled with the moonbeams, and he felt his confidence rise.","From the moment that the moonlight domain was released from the Extreme Token, Lin Yuan noticed that he could exert slight control over the moonbeams using his willpower.","As the 25th attack from the Heaven’s Trial was about to descend, Lin Yuan separated the moonbeams protecting him into 18 portions that he aimed at the pillar of light falling from the Heaven’s Trial.","There was a faint layer of crimson, golden flames around the moonbeams.","The moonbeams extended in order to envelop the flames and temper them.","Eventually, when there were only 147 belts of moonbeams left, the 25th attack from the Heaven’s Trial was finally overcome.","The round moon in the sky slowly darkened during the assault from the moonbeams.","However, the remaining 147 belts of moonbeams would be the final aid Lin Yuan provided Begin Lady with taking on the last attack.","First, he removed his fusion with the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil before he raised the Fish World Sea Trump Card","..."]},{"number":2009,"title":"Chapter 2009 Mermaid Country!","paragraphs":["2009 Mermaid Country!","Since he needed to use the mermaid bloodline in his body to wield the Fish World Sea Trump Card, Lin Yuan had not used it yet, nor was he aware of how powerful it could be.","When he first obtained the Fish World Sea Trump Card, Lin Yuan remembered the Moon Empress sternly warning him not to use it unless the situation absolutely called for it.","The Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan had managed to obtain the mermaid bloodline through unknown means and was now extremely desirable to the Goddess of Mercy.","It was because the Goddess of Mercy had been willing to provide so many precious resources while the Moon Empress was forging the Fish World Sea Trump Card that allowed the Diving Songstress’ body to not drop Stars when it became the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","As a Creation Master, the Moon Empress could not be more aware of how much a body could be affected when one used one’s own bloodline power.","Although bloodline power was not the main source in one’s body, the loss of it would immediately cause one’s vitality to weaken.","Thus, the Moon Empress expressly reminded Lin Yuan to be cautious when he injected his bloodline into the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","Although bloodline power could be recovered, the recovery rate was extremely slow. A main-dragon-species fey whose bloodline had been extracted would need close to two months to recover its bloodline power to peak capacity.","It went without saying that Lin Yuan remembered the Moon Empress’ warning.","However, this was the make-or-break point of Begin Lady’s survival, and Lin Yuan could not afford to err on the side of caution.","The 26th and final golden eye in the sky started to move rapidly. It was like a snake that was manipulating its body in a small space.","Terrifying energy started to accumulate within the eye.","Lin Yuan did not immediately inject bloodline power and spirit qi into the Fish World Sea Trump Card. Instead, he waved his hand and summoned Frigid.","Frigid rarely had a chance to see the outside world. Thus, it was extremely excited now that it had been let out.","After all, it was not a newly born sea demon but one that had been passed up and stuck in the Lantis Mystic Realm for some time.","But at the same time, it knew that this was not the time for it to be excited.","Through its soul and spirit connection with Lin Yuan, Frigid could sense what Lin Yuan was thinking.","It was a lifeform that relied on its bloodline power and understood the weight of Lin Yuan’s choice.","Frigid took a deep breath and summoned the Cold Season Poisonous Fish before it moved toward the Fish World Sea Trump Card and attached its body to it.","With the boost from Frigid, the Fish World Sea Trump Card transformed from beginner 8 Stars to beginner 10 Stars.","A 10 Stars precious instrument could trigger celestial phenomena just like a 10 Stars sacred source lifeform could.","However, this was just the beginning. At the moment that Frigid attached itself to the Fish World Sea Trump Card, the Cold Season Poisonous Fish turned into a school of fish that surrounded the Fish World Sea Trump Card, adding layer upon layer of cold season power to the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","The Fish World Sea Trump Card started to rise from beginner 10 stars to 11 Stars.","Although Lin Yuan had not injected any spiritual power or bloodline power into the Fish World Sea Trump Card, the entire area had already transformed into an expansive ocean.","The waves that appeared in the air dipped into the sea and deepened the blue of the water.","As the sea grew larger, so did the water pressure increase.","The presence of the 11 Stars Fish World Sea Trump Card had created a deep ocean large enough to house mermaids.","There was a legend that mermaids would use pearls and coral to create palaces at the bottom of the sea.","The deeper the water, the freer mermaids could be.","The pink and gold Gaea Begin River was fully enveloped by the deep blue water that had appeared out of nowhere. It could clearly sense the energy contained in the water.","Lin Yuan held the Fish World Sea Trump Card in one hand.","The moment that he touched the Fish World Sea Trump Card, he could sense how much it craved the mermaid emperor bloodline in his body.","He injected the sea of spirit qi in the Spirit Qi Imprint as well as his mermaid emperor bloodline into the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","In an instant, an enchanting mermaid song filled the deep blue water.","Mermaids were extremely intelligent lifeforms, and their music could perfectly express any emotion.","For example, the Diving Songstress had possessed the mermaid king bloodline, and its songs were especially geared toward leading people down the road of debauchery and causing them to lose their faculties.","But now, the mermaid song that filled the sea was robust and magnificent. It seemed to be welcoming the arrival of an emperor.","Along with the mermaid song were golden-blue ripples that rolled from the bottom of the sea, covering every inch of the water.","The light from the ripples lit up the water.","White Speak noticed that there was a palace at the bottom of the water that could only be described as being supremely finely crafted.","Soon, mermaids carrying lanterns emerged in pairs from the palace and started swimming up to the surface.","When they broke through the surface, they held their lanterns up as though they were attendants who were escorting Lin Yuan.","The lanterns released brilliant gold and blue sea ripples, the light from which overpowered that of the moonbeams descending from the sky.","The lantern-holding mermaids were just the advance party.","They had fresh features and were dressed in shawls. Their appearance was considered to be ordinary amongst mermaids.","Soon, numerous mermaids wearing ceremonial robes and carrying conch shells larger than their bodies swam out from the palace.","Due to the sheer size of the conch shells, each had to be carried with both hands by one mermaid at the front while another supported from the back.","Despite the weight of the conch shell, the movement of the mermaids was not impeded at all.","While they swam, they moved in tandem in a formation where two conch shells were stacked together.","Once they reached the surface, the mermaid at the back of each conch shell blew into them, triggering thousands of giant waves to rise from the sea.","Eventually, the waves solidified into numerous large elemental whales.","The large elemental whales were swimming in the air, and White Speak could sense energy fluctuations as strong as its own from each of the whales. In fact, the longer the horns were blown, the stronger the energy within the elemental whales became.","At that moment, gold and blue light erupted from under the water.","The palace had expanded to almost three times its original size.","...","A pair of mermaids with red hair tied in high ponytails and dressed in crimson armor from head to tail appeared. Their gaze was sharp and determined."]},{"number":2010,"title":"Chapter 2010 Three in One Crown!","paragraphs":["2010 Three in One Crown!","The mermaids were all holding spears as long as their bodies.","From the moment the mermaids appeared, White Speak felt fear creeping up within it.","If any of the mermaids with red ponytails threw their spears at it, it would immediately be sliced open.","Moreover, the bloodline power within them was clearly on a whole other level than the mermaids holding the conch shells and lanterns.","Lin Yuan continued to inject mermaid emperor bloodline power into the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","Eight mermaids dressed in silvery blue shawls that extended past their tails swam out from the palace. Light blue patterns were covering their bodies, and they had a wild beauty about them.","After the eight mermaids appeared, they started to sing.","Strong winds kicked up, and eight giant waterspouts rose out of the water towards the sky, stirring up the sky with a chilling cacophony of sound. It was as though the waterspouts were determined to suck the sky into them.","Suddenly, the blue patterns on the mermaids lit up, and terrifying blue lightning crackled in the sky.","When Lin Yuan only had 20% of his mermaid emperor bloodline left, and in the instant that he injected the rest of it into the Fish World Sea Trump Card, the palace underwater split into three, and three carriages pulled by sea beasts galloped out from the underwater palace. Each of the sea beasts carried a mermaid holding a trident and dressed in armor made of blue crystals.","These mermaids looked exactly like warrior goddesses.","Female mermaids with crowns atop their heads and garments that seemed to be woven from the sea around them were sitting on each carriage. Just like Lin Yuan, they had blue and gold tails, and their golden-blue hair seemed to be formed from waves.","These mermaids were clearly a cut above the rest in both looks and charisma.","All the previous mermaids seemed to be born to serve the crown-wearing mermaids.","Normally, given their auras, the three crown-wearing mermaids should not be around each other.","But now, the three carriages stopped in front of Lin Yuan, and the crown-wearing mermaids gently lowered their heads in front of Lin Yuan.","At that moment, the attack that had been stewing in the 26th eye was finally unleashed.","The attacks from the previous 25 eyes had appeared in the form of pillars of light. But this time, the attack presented itself as a giant snake with dark gold scales.","Once the snake appeared, it spat out brilliant flames.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he instructed the mermaid country created by the Fish World Sea Trump Card to attack the giant gold-scaled snake.","The large whales and eight crackling waterspouts flew toward the giant golden snake while the lantern-carrying mermaids charged at the serpent with their lanterns brandished like swords.","The horn-blowing mermaids broke off into groups as they aimed their conch shell horns toward the giant golden snake.","When they blew into the conch shells, waves swelled and glided over to the giant snake.","The mermaids with red ponytails bowed to Lin Yuan before they swept their tails and engaged the giant golden snake in a vicious battle.","Before they died, they injected all the energy they had into the spears and thrust them into the giant golden snake.","This battle scene seemed to demonstrate the honor of the mermaid country.","The trident-holding mermaids finally released the chains on the sea beasts connecting them to the carriages and rode the sea beasts directly toward the giant golden snake that was already visibly smaller than it had originally been.","The ongoing battle between the mermaids and snake seemed to have jumped out from a poem.","When the giant golden snake burned up the last warrior mermaid, the conch-blowing mermaids and singing mermaids with blue patterns on their bodies also charged fearlessly at the giant golden serpent.","Yet, in spite of everything that was happening, the three crown-wearing mermaids who had lowered their heads to Lin Yuan seemed to be completely unaffected.","They removed their crowns and swam over to Lin Yuan before they stacked their three crowns atop Lin Yuan’s head.","The moment the three crowns became one, they turned into a dazzling golden crown.","The three mermaids started to manipulate the waves as they joined the fight as warriors fighting against the giant golden snake in the sky.","In the legend of mermaids, the Mermaid Emperor Clan appeared to be the weakest, but they had the strongest combat power of all mermaids.","The poems about mermaids had all been written by the Mermaid Emperor Clan.","Alas, the three mermaids still failed to overcome the giant golden snake.","Lin Yuan, now with the crown adorning his head, took out the Vast Sea Wave-Raising Flute and advanced on the giant golden snake as the final pride of the mermaids.","But at that moment, something happened to the giant golden snake.","A scale not formed from energy by physical substances appeared between the giant golden snake’s eyes.","The giant golden snake’s aura exploded, and it was now even stronger than when it had first appeared.","The sudden burst of the giant golden snake’s combat power could not be defeated by Lin Yuan and the 150 moonbeams.","This twist had surpassed all of their expectations.","Lin Yuan felt as though all their efforts were about to be wasted, and for the first time, he felt helpless. It also dawned on him how lacking in power he was.","At this moment, he heard Morbius’ voice, “Partner, the Endless Gem has another function besides unlocking feys. When it comes into contact with an attack, it can seal the attack within itself. However, when this function is used, the unlocking of the Jasmine Lilu will be suspended.","“When you receive the attack from the Heaven’s Trial, remove me from your wrist and toss me toward the giant golden snake. To my memory, this change should not take place during the Heaven’s Trial. The snake with dark gold scales should not have appeared during the Heaven’s Trial. There must be something behind it!”","Lin Yuan was relieved when he heard what Morbius said.","But he also knew that the price that Morbius had to pay for using the Endless Gem to seal the attack away would be more than just losing access to the unlocked Jasmine Lily’s abilities."]},{"number":2011,"title":"Chapter 2011 Heaven’s Present!","paragraphs":["2011 Heaven’s Present!","Could it be that after the attack was sealed, Morbius would fall back asleep?","Morbius knew what Lin Yuan was thinking and said softly, “Partner, do you remember me saying that after your fight with the Freedom Federation envoy group, I obtained a large amount of root power for some reason?","“It won’t require too much of my root power to just use the Endless Gem to seal one attack. It won’t put me back to sleep. Partner, you might have contracted a sacred source lifeform, but you have two souls. Your other soul is still empty. It can be used to contract another sacred source lifeform.”","Lin Yuan nodded when he heard what Morbius said.","!!","Previously, the Moon Empress had told him to wait a few years before he contracted a second sacred source lifeform for the sake of his body condition.","However, she did not know that he had two souls.","The soul that had already contracted the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen did need to wait a few years before it could contract another sacred source lifeform.","However, the empty soul could be used to contract a sacred source lifeform at any time.","Lin Yuan felt that it was indeed time for him to find a second suitable sacred source lifeform to contract.","He had contacted his first sacred source lifeform after a series of coincidences.","If he contracted a second sacred source lifeform now, Lin Yuan could use his understanding of sacred source lifeforms to combine two sacred source lifeforms.","Since Morbius would not fall asleep, there was nothing for Lin Yuan to worry about.","He had consumed the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass and learned all of the available combat skills and fighting strategies that existed in the Radiance Federation.","After Lin Yuan removed Morbius from his wrist, he threw it accurately toward the giant golden snake.","Eventually, the giant golden snake was sealed within the Endless Gem.","Since Lin Yuan had not fully released his strongest attack, the energy he had saved turned into the mermaid emperor bloodline and was stored within Lin Yuan’s body.","However, while unused bloodline could be stored up, the same did not apply to spirit qi.","Although Lin Yuan had opened his Spirit Qi Imprint and all of the spirit qi within it had been released, Lin Yuan collapsed to the ground in agony.","At this moment, Begin Lady hugged him.","After the 26th golden eye disappeared from the sky, a mystical whirlpool appeared in the sky. It seemed as though something was about to fall from the whirlpool. Even the spirit qi in the surroundings seemed to worship whatever was about to fall from the whirlpool.","At that moment, Lin Yuan heard Begin Lady say, “Lin Yuan, you helped me to overcome the Heaven’s Trial. My life is about to turn around. I would like to invite you to receive the Heaven’s Present with me. Before the spirit fire enters my body, I will manipulate it to leave an ember in your body. It will substantially benefit you in the future.”","Lin Yuan was stunned by Begin Lady’s embrace.","Begin Lady’s body had returned from an elemental state to a solid state. Moreover, the pink and gold garment it was wearing was made of fluid currents!","At that moment, Lin Yuan heard Morbius’ voice again, “Partner, when your spirit qi professional level has reached a certain level, and your power crosses Eternal, you’ll need to start walking down heaven’s path and awaken your birth horoscope. Although the ember from the spirit fire won’t be able to help a spirit qi professional set their spirit fire alight, it will remove the obstacle they would have to face when they cross Eternal and start walking down heaven’s path.”","Lin Yuan’s heart skipped a beat, and a look of disbelief spread across his face.","The Moon Empress had encountered a problem when she was awakening her birth horoscope and failed to begin walking down heaven’s path.","It was only later that she managed to overcome the risk to do so and became a Class 6 Creation Master.","The Moon Empress had to be a genius that only appeared in the world once every millennium.","Even the Bamboo Monarch and Chef Supreme’s talent could not compare with the Moon Empress’.","Something that even the Moon Empress struggled to achieve would now become easy for him after he accepted Begin Lady’s offer to share the Heaven’s Present.","Begin Lady went on to say, “I should have vanished from this earth. You’ve given me the chance to live again. I am now a true faerie and will no longer be bound to this little world that was produced for my sake. I can go out into the world to see sights I’ve never seen before.","“If you’ll have me, I hope to remain by your side. Faeries are of nature and can’t swear their loyalties. But I’ll serve you the same way Little Peach serves me when I’m by your side.”","Morbius was glad when it heard what Begin Lady said. It felt that only someone like Lin Yuan, who was willing to give his all to the feys he was interested in, could receive true reciprocation from those feys.","If someone else had been the one to help Begin Lady, the latter might not have agreed to follow them after offering the ember of spirit fire as repayment.","Lin Yuan gently pried Begin Lady off of him and stretched out his hand to it with a smile as he said, “Let’s do our best from now on!”","A radiant smile spread across Begin Lady’s face, and it clasped its hands around Lin Yuan’s.","At that moment, the mystical whirlpool in the sky started to change. It was as though something within it was reacting.","A dark gold snake eye emerged from the whirlpool and was about to fall.","Soon after the dark gold snake eye appeared, a sacred white flame emerged from the whirlpool.","Before the dark gold snake eye fully emerged, it was completely burned up by the sacred white flame.","At the moment that the snake eye disappeared, a strange snake cry was heard. There seemed to be surprise and doubt in the snake’s cry.","Both Lin Yuan and Begin Lady noticed this, but neither knew the reason for this occurrence.","Lin Yuan communicated with Morbius, and Morbius was certain it did not have any related memory of this occurrence. Thus, it was also at a loss.","However, a chilling guess surfaced in Lin Yuan’s mind.","Could it be that the snake lifeform controlled the Heaven’s Trial?","But Lin Yuan soon chastised himself for such a ridiculous thought. He shook his head gently to remove the bizarre thought from his head."]},{"number":2012,"title":"Chapter 2012 Spirit Fire Swallowed By the Shrine!","paragraphs":["2012 Spirit Fire Swallowed By the Shrine!","When the spirit fire emerged from the whirlpool, it rapidly broke through the sky and caused the entire sky to be stirred up.","The dappled sky was exceptionally beautiful.","Su Jian and Bai Dong, who were rushing over, could finally sense a pink and gold river in the distance. The bloodline power from the pink and gold river was the same as that of plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","They looked at each other and saw unadulterated joy in each other’s eyes.","Bai Dong and Su Jian knew the strange occurrences in the sky had finally led them to the secret behind the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","If they collected the water from the pink and gold river, they could use it to nourish other plant-type feys. Then they could have as many plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline as they wanted!","Both Bai Dong and Su Jian felt a twinge of desire to kill the other.","The interior of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was not stable. Every time it opened, numerous people would end up dead.","If anyone publicly broke the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm’s rules, the Holy Lady would immediately put an end to their life.","If they killed each other, they could push the blame on the Holy Lady when they exited the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, and it was unlikely that anyone would verify the truth with the Holy Lady. Moreover, given the Holy Lady’s character, she might not even provide an answer to whoever was asking.","Each time the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm closed, the Holy Lady would disappear for some time and only reappear a month before it was set to open again.","Even if she was willing to answer the question, whoever wanted to ask would only be able to do so a month before the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm opened again.","The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm only opened once every decade.","Just as Su Jian and Bai Dong were about to summon their feys to attack each other, they sensed that the sacred fire in the sky seemed to be extremely helpful in increasing Creation Master abilities.","Only the faerie that overcame the Heaven’s Trial could receive the Heaven’s Present of spirit fire.","It was unknown if there was a second faerie in the main world or if the Radiance Federation’s royalty had even seen one before, much less Su Jian and Bai Dong.","However, both of them were pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters, and their biggest dream and hope was to become Class 5 Creation Masters.","The sacred white fire that descended from the sky was a glimmer of hope for them.","As a result, they decided against attacking each other and flew off in the direction of the spirit fire.","Once Begin Lady fused with the spirit fire, it would become a lifeform that had set its spirit fire alight. Such a lifeform had to be extremely arrogant.","Both Bai Dong and Su Jian were top experts in the Divine Wood Federation that were venerated by all.","But to Begin Lady, they were nothing more than two pathetic insects.","These two pathetic insects dared to covet the thing that Lin Yuan had cost him so much effort and that Begin Lady only managed to obtain after 1,000 years of energy accumulation.","Begin Lady was enraged, and two water pillars shot out from the river and soared over toward Bai Dong and Su Jian.","When they reached them, the water pillars turned into chains and wrapped the two men.","The chains of water flung Bai Dong and Su Jian into the river water.","It was easy for thearch-class experts to hold their breaths underwater for a few hours. If they contracted feys that could breathe underwater, they would even be able to swim freely underwater.","When Su Jian and Bai Dong were flung into the river, they realized that the river water penetrated all of the orifices in their bodies as though they were tentacles.","Not counting eyes, every person only had five orifices.","Besides their eyes, Bai Dong and Su Jian’s five orifices were both stuffed full of water, and their bodies expanded like balloons.","No matter how hard they tried to circulate their spiritual power, they could not do anything to rectify the situation.","Although Begin Lady had not fused with the spirit fire, the attacks from the Heaven’s Trial had tempered its body. Now that it had handled 22 of the Heaven’s Trial’s attacks, its power had long exceeded that of thearch-class.","It would be child’s play for it to squeeze the life out of Su Jian and Bai Dong.","But Begin Lady had no intention of killing them.","Just as Su Jian and Bai Dong were about to fall unconscious and die, the chains shook, and they were violently tossed into a faraway part of the river.","With their bodies full of pink and gold river water, Su Jian and Bai Dong floated on the surface of the water in an extremely comic fashion.","By this time, the sacred white flames had arrived in front of Begin Lady. Just as it was about to enter Begin Lady’s forehead, it batted the spirit fire away so that it entered Lin Yuan’s forehead first.","At the instant that the spirit fire entered his body, Lin Yuan felt as though his entire body was being cleansed by mystical energy.","Lin Yuan had cleansed his body many times. In the short span of a year, his body had already been cleansed thrice.","The first time was when he consumed the Diamond Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar to cleanse his body of impurities. The second was when he used the Fantasy Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia to cleanse his soul of impurities. The third was when he used the Earth Center Fine Milk to remodel his genetic model. Each time only became more agonizing.","But this time, as the spirit fire was cleansing him, Lin Yuan finally experienced intense comfort. This comfort was 1,000 times greater than the happiest memory that Lin Yuan could conjure up.","Lin Yuan entered a mystical state.","Just as the spirit fire was about to cleanse Lin Yuan’s two souls, it suddenly sensed that something was wrong.","Just like when Morbius’ Pure Land of Bliss absorbed the World Grace that came after the Myth Breed feys’ World Cleansings, where the World Graces would start to reject the Pure Land of Bliss after a portion of it was absorbed, the same thing was happening with the spirit fire.","The spirit fire was rejecting Lin Yuan’s body and wanted to leave it.","Right at this moment, the situation shifted.","The shrine in Lin Yuan’s two souls advanced and swallowed the spirit fire with one gulp.","In an instant, blazing flames erupted from within the shrine.","The fire had the same aura as the spirit fire, but it was not sacred white but a dignified scarlet.","Lin Yuan only returned to his senses after the shrine swallowed the spirit fire.","He noticed that the shrine’s interior had changed drastically after consuming the spirit fire.","At first, the inside of the shrine was a wide expanse of stars. The faith that each person had in him was represented by a glowing dot that lined up nearly amongst the stars.","At that moment, the spirit fire triggered a large explosion in the stars as though it was demolishing a mountain.","..."]},{"number":2013,"title":"Chapter 2013 World Within the Shrine!","paragraphs":["2013 World Within the Shrine!","The explosion almost created cracks in the shrine.","After the explosion, Lin Yuan noticed that all the constellations formed from glowing faith power had disappeared.","In the shrine, the clean air rose while the foul air sank.","The intermixing clean and foul air slowly created a border separating heaven and earth.","Eventually, the remaining faith power formed an altar that floated in midair.","The glowing dots of faith power that were left over from creating the altar turned into a golden fountain of faith on the altar. The fountain was vibrating continuously.","Lin Yuan could tell that the change to the shrine had taken up about 90% of his faith power.","However, he was currently still unaware of what the changes meant.","Just as he was about to investigate the interior of the shrine, he found himself on the altar within the shrine.","The world was exceptionally vivid. It was as though everything was within Lin Yuan’s willpower.","The outside of this world was wrapped up in an unseen chaos.","Moreover, within the world that Lin Yuan could control, Lin Yuan could use the water pouring out of the fountain of faith to create anything he wanted. However, this would use up a portion of the water from the fountain of faith.","Previously, Lin Yuan had always been curious about something—once a person offered up their faith power, would the amount of faith power increase?","This question had been bothering Lin Yuan for some time, but he finally had his answer.","The people who had already offered faith power to him would continue to supply him with faith power.","However, the rate at which they supplied faith power was extremely slow.","Previously, Lin Yuan had assumed that faith power could only be used to help him keep up his facade in the dimensional worlds as a Dictator by enabling him to increase the power of Apostles.","But now, he found a new use for faith power.","Now, Lin Yuan felt that it was time for him to do something earth-shattering in the Startling Lines Continent to harvest a large load of faith power.","Lin Yuan was very interested in exploring the world created by faith power.","He could not shake the feeling that the chaotic space had a huge secret waiting for him to uncover. But he still did not know what the huge secret was about!","At that moment, Lin Yuan suddenly realized that the significant changes to the shrine that took place as a result of Begin Lady’s spirit fire would have used up a large amount of the spirit fire’s energy.","When he realized this, but before he could take any action, the spirit fire reached the limit of its patience and was displaying strong rejection to him.","The spirit fire struggled out of the shrine and entered Begin Lady’s body in an instant.","At that moment, the pink and gold garment it was wearing flew out, and the river water turned into hundreds of belts, forming a new body and outfit for Begin Lady.","Begin Lady’s long pink hair slowly turned upward like water ripples as a terrifying aura spewed forth from it.","This caused the small world that Begin Lady had created to start to crack.","Morbius said in Lin Yuan’s ear, “The small world that the faerie inhabited before the Heaven’s Trial will collapse once it accepts the Heaven’s Present. The collapsed world will turn into energy that will enter the faerie’s body. Once its body has been cleansed by the spirit fire and its birth horoscope is produced, Begin Lady will truly turn into what is known as a god. Friend, spirit fire can’t be tested or robbed.","“The spirit fire from the Heaven’s Trial hasn’t been combined with any birth horoscopes. Only such a spirit fire can be used to cleanse your body. Now that Begin Lady has shared its spirit fire with you, you will never have to worry about it doing anything against your benefit, no matter what happens in the future.”","Lin Yuan did not think about the possibility of Begin Lady harming him because he could sense its sincerity toward him.","He said to Morbius with slight worry, “Partner, when Begin Lady’s spirit fire was cleansing my body, it was swallowed by the shrine. As a result, I used up a portion of the spirit fire. Will the lack of spirit fire be detrimental to Begin Lady’s transformation?”","Morbius was silent for a moment before it replied, “Partner, if too much of the spirit fire is absorbed, it will indeed affect Begin Lady’s transformation. However, the extent won’t be large. This is the same as when a small amount of a Myth Breed fey’s World Cleansing and a Creation Breed fey’s Creation World Ley Line is absorbed, it won’t greatly affect their power.","“Although a portion of Begin Lady’s energy has been lost, its transformation can still be completed. However, it will need some time later to recover the lost energy from the spirit fire.”","Lin Yuan only relaxed when he heard Morbius’ response.","Clearly, Begin Lady needed some time in order to complete its transformation.","The water from the entire Gaea Begin River had entered Begin Lady’s body and was fusing with it along with the riverbed.","The area under Lin Yuan’s feet was nothing more than dry earth.","The bloated Su Jian and Bai Dong were looking up at Lin Yuan while they were spread on the dry ground.","There was terror in both their eyes, but there was a large difference in the terror they were expressing.","Bai Dong’s terror was because he had recognized Lin Yuan as Young Master Chu of Sky Creation.","The spirit fire had long burned up the Faceless Paper that had been on Lin Yuan’s face.","Bai Dong did not understand how Young Master Chu, who came from outside of the Divine Wood Federation, managed to appear within the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Could it be that Sky Creation’s tree castle had appeared in Sacred Forest City at this time just so he could enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm?","This was the only plausible explanation.","Bai Dong had clearly felt all of the astonishing energy fluctuations.","After Lin Yuan gifted the 1,000 units of source-type power to White Speak, it had remained in its crocodile form as it recovered from its injuries and refined the totem on its back.","White Speak was clearly a part of Lin Yuan’s combat power.","White Speak’s combat power had surpassed even Bai Dong’s realm of imagination.","Bai Dong was afraid that Lin Yuan would kill him.","However, Su Jian’s fear was much more complex than that."]},{"number":2014,"title":"Chapter 2014 You Won’t Be Able to See All the Secret Weapons!","paragraphs":["2014 You Won’t Be Able to See All the Secret Weapons!","The moment Su Jian saw Lin Yuan, he knew how powerful Sky Creation was. In the face of that power, he was nothing more than a worthless gnat.","He had experienced the might of his great grandparents’ power before.","But compared to the might of the aura he just felt, his great grandparents’ Immortal expert powers were just slightly less worthless gnats. They would be helpless to defend against that power.","The injured white crocodile morphed into a man, and it was a large step up in power compared to his great-grandparents.","!!","Given the circumstances, the Su family had even captured Sky Creation’s Class 5 Creation Master.","Previously, Su Jian had been blinded by the thought of profits. But now that his eyes had been opened by reality, he realized just how moronic his previous decision had been.","If they had done what Su Han had said, the Su family should still have managed to maintain an amicable relationship with Sky Creation.","Su Jian did not know if Sky Creation’s Class 5 Creation Master being captured by the Su family was an act or if she had not fought back because she was truly unable to overpower his great grandparents.","But regardless of what the reason was, even if the Su family defeated the Yang family and successfully took over the imperial court, they would eventually have to face Sky Creation.","However, there was no way that the Su family could defeat Sky Creation.","It could be said that Su Jian was deep in the throes of despair. He did not have a hint of desire to fight back.","Lin Yuan walked over to Su Jian and Bai Dong and looked down at them as he said with amusement, “I’m sure my Class 5 Creation Master has been an inconvenience after her long stay with the Su family.”","Su Jian smiled bitterly. Contrary to his usual haughtiness, he was momentarily speechless.","Even if he could hide the truth, what was the point? It would eventually be exposed once they left the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","The Su family did not have the means to make a Class 5 Creation Master lose her memories.","Furthermore, from Lin Yuan’s tone, it seemed that he knew the truth and was just watching from the shadows with an evil glint in his eye.","But if this was true, it meant that Lin Yuan had an ulterior motive.","Suddenly, Su Jian’s heart skipped a beat, and his head snapped up as he looked into Lin Yuan’s eyes and asked, “You’re the one who has been pushing us to attack the Yang family! Sky Creation is the one who nurtured the Peaceful Calm Air Moss. What is your aim in doing so?”","Suddenly, many things came to Su Jian’s mind. He felt that from the first moment that the Su family made contact with Sky Creation, they had fallen into a trap.","Lin Yuan glared at Su Jian and said, “Everything that the Su family has done is of your own choice. I never forced you. However, if you were to say that I added fuel to the flames, I would agree with that. I need the Su family to open my crusade for me.","“You should be curious about how things are going out there! Will the Su and Bai families be able to successfully topple the Yang family and take over the imperial court after colluding?","“If you want the answer, I can give it to you. The Su and Bai families have already become part of the Divine Wood Federation’s history. Besides the two of you and Bai Qinghuan, who has taken shelter in Sky Creation’s tree castle, no one from the Su and Bai families will have survived.”","Lin Yuan did not say what he said to scare Su Jian and Bai Dong, but because Liu Jie had used Thoughts Letter Paper to inform Lin Yuan of the situation in the outside world.","Thoughts Letter Paper communicated using thoughts and did not have to travel through space.","Even when he was in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, Lin Yuan could immediately receive updates on the outside world.","Frankly, less than half an hour after he heard that the Su and Bai families had attacked the imperial court, the bodies of the members of both families were already hanging off the walls outside the imperial court.","This caused Lin Yuan to be amazed at the immense combat power that the Yang family had been hiding, which allowed them to slaughter the Su and Bai families’ three Immortal experts.","It seemed that the Yang family was the family in Sacred Forest City that had the most secrets.","It was no wonder the Yang family had managed to take over the imperial court all those years ago.","However, the Su and Bai families’ all-out assault had opened an outsider’s window of opportunity.","Bai Dong also knew who this outsider was.","When he heard what Lin Yuan said, Bai Dong’s face drained of color, and he shrieked, “Impossible! Don’t spout nonsense here! Even if the Su and Bai families don’t have enough power to defeat the Yang family together, how could they all have been killed?”","Lin Yuan smiled back at Bai Dong and replied, “You asked a good question. I’m also curious about how many secret weapons the Yang family has hidden. But regardless of how many secret weapons they have, the two of you won’t have the chance to see them.”","Lin Yuan grabbed the Vast Sea Wave-Raising Flute, and two fish appeared on either side of Bai Dong and Su Jian.","After being attacked by the two fishes, Bai Dong and Su Jian became the final nutrients for the small world before it cracked.","Now that he had handled Bai Dong and Su Jian, Lin Yuan prepared to store away the mouths of spirit springs.","The mouths of spirit springs were no longer of any use to Begin Lady, but they were extremely important for Lin Yuan’s Element Well.","It could be said that Lin Yuan was at the poorest he had been ever since obtaining the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan had used almost all of his resources to help Begin Lady transform.","However, the purity of spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone allowed the Spirit Lock spatial zone to produce resources every second.","In just two weeks, Lin Yuan could recover all the resources he had lost.","However, while it was easy for Lin Yuan to recover his resources, it would take him at least six months to recover the mermaid emperor bloodline he had used.","Lin Yuan did not foresee many opportunities in the next six months for him to use the mermaid bloodline power.","Hence, the six months needed for recovery would not greatly impact Lin Yuan.","After killing Su Jian and Bai Dong, Lin Yuan had no intention of killing the other members of Sacred Forest City’s factions who had entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","This was because Su Jian and Bai Dong were the only ones who had witnessed Begin Lady’s transformation.","In order to keep the secret, there was no way that those two could have been allowed to live. Otherwise, he would not have killed them.","After storing the mouths of spirit springs, he decided to patiently wait for Begin Lady to finish transforming.","When the Su and Bai families attacked the Yang family, Di Wanmi summoned her main fey and broke the Adjudication Dung Beetle’s lock.","Di Wanmi and the Mother of Bloodbath had returned to Sky Creation’s tree castle and set up the defenses."]},{"number":2015,"title":"Chapter 2015 No! I Have to Report the Workplace Injury!","paragraphs":["2015 No! I Have to Report the Workplace Injury!","At that moment, Lin Yuan was filled with queries. He did not know how the Yang family had managed to eliminate the Bai family and Su family’s three Immortal experts.","According to Liu Jie, no obvious marks of attacks were left on the interior of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. Apparently, the three Immortal experts had been killed in an instant without being given any opportunity to fight back.","Although Di Wanmi’s power was at pinnacle Immortal, the Mother of Bloodbath could use its precious instrument and Blood New Moon’s blessing to obtain pinnacle Immortal combat power.","But somehow, Lin Yuan felt that Di Wanmi and the Mother of Bloodbath’s powers would be insufficient to take control of the situation.","The Yang family had been eyeing Sky Creation’s tree castle for some time. Otherwise, Yang Sijie would not have made contact with Lin Yuan at the Crown Wood Banquet.","Thus, there was no way that the Yang family would give up on the opportunity to make contact with Sky Creation.","Lin Yuan hoped that the Yang family would decide to settle the matter and deal with the aftermath issues with regard to the Bai family and Su family first. He wanted them to seek Sky Creation out later.","The belts of pink and gold river water had decreased almost by half. The cracks of this small world were only becoming more obvious.","This told Lin Yuan that Begin Lady would be able to finish transforming within the hour and become a true godly lifeform that had unlocked its spirit fire.","...","There was a man wearing dark gold armor standing in a glittering hall.","Amidst his doubt, the pupils in his eyes suddenly elongated and turned into snake eyes.","There were many snake pupils spinning in his eyes, and the air became sticky.","“How did a faerie appear in this world? An intermediate faerie is also rare in Class 3 worlds. I secretly added a reverse scale to find out the truth of the matter. Why is the connection with the reverse scale lost?”","The more he thought about it, the more evident his confusion expressed itself on his face.","When he could not hold back anymore, he slapped the transparent sphere in front of him.","“No! I have to go and report the workplace injury! I can only produce a reverse scale once every thousand years.”","Just as he was about to go and report the workplace injury, he suddenly remembered that it was a serious crime to alter the Heaven’s Trial secretly.","If he reported the workplace injury, the ensuing investigation would definitely be able to uncover the truth.","As such, he sat back down with a dull thud.","If another strange event took place in this Class 1 world, he would definitely get to the bottom of it!","At that moment, something happened to the crystal ball. The image of a mountain jade appeared.","The man chuckled and said, “Hehe, a volcano has awakened a lower faerie in a Class 2 world.”","While he was speaking, the snake eyes started to spin rapidly, and 16 pupils appeared in the crystal.","Now that he was done with his job, the man touched his forehead, which now lacked a scale as melancholy spread across his face.","...","About 40 minutes later, bloated energy rushed out from Begin Lady’s body.","In front of this energy, Lin Yuan felt that he was nothing more than a dinghy in the ocean.","Begin Lady did not aim the energy at him, yet he already felt engulfed within it.","If Begin Lady aimed the energy at him, he might enter a state of imitation death.","Even an Eternal expert could not kill using their aura, and the most they could do was exert pressure.","But after setting its spirit fire alight, Begin Lady could now use its aura to kill other lifeforms.","At first, Begin Lady wore a garment woven of pink and gold.","But now, Lin Yuan did not know if it was because it was trying to imitate him, but the spirit qi clothes it wore were extremely similar to his attire. The difference was that it was wearing a skirt that reached its ankles instead of pants.","Begin Lady’s pink and gold hair was now also black like his own. The only difference was that its pupils were still gold.","Now that it was done with its transformation, Begin Lady looked at Lin Yuan and longed to embrace him.","But when it remembered how Lin Yuan had killed Bai Dong and Su Jian, Begin Lady used its spirit fire to refine the two souls and consumed their memories.","It could be said that in an instant, Begin Lady transformed from a blank canvas to a complicated painting. It now understood the ways of adults and what was appropriate between the two genders.","Thus, Begin Lady forced itself to suppress its yearning to hug Lin Yuan.","Begin Lady looked around at the world that had been created for its sake before it squeezed its fist, and the entire world crumbled.","Begin Lady, Lin Yuan, the Holy Lady, and the other members of the Divine Wood Federation’s factions who had entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm were returned to the sacrificial altar.","Before this, Lin Yuan had returned White Speak into the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad and released Ding Chengshuo.","At that moment, the Holy Lady received Begin Lady’s order and regained her original haughty expression.","She also distanced herself from Lin Yuan and Begin Lady as though she did not know them.","Lin Yuan had sensed all of this but did not know what Begin Lady’s reason for doing this was.","Nonetheless, he did not ask.","When he walked around the sacrificial altar, Lin Yuan saw that it had already been surrounded by numerous spirit qi professionals wearing dark blue vine armor. Behind the spirit qi professionals was the Suzerain X/Myth I Poison Cotton Willow.","The Poison Cotton Willow had the ability to numb spirits and cause sepsis. It was extremely lethal to lifeforms made of flesh and blood.","The Myth I Poison Cotton Willow was as deadly as other Myth II poison-type feys.","The dark blue vine armor was only used by the guards from the imperial court.","Evidently, the Yang family was trying to take control of the situation.","Lin Yuan had many pieces of the Faceless Paper. He put on a new one when he left the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Hence, he recognized that the one leading the Yang family’s team was Yang Sijie, who he had met at the Crown Wood Banquet, but Yang Sijie did not recognize him.","Yang Sijie looked at the crowd and issued the order, “Yang Jiu, lead your team and kill everyone from the Su family and Bai family. Take the rest prisoner.”","...","The moment Yang Sijie spoke, a chilling female voice suddenly said from the crowd, “Yang Sijie, what do you mean? Does the Yang family intend to break your contract with me? Do you not want me to open the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm from now on?”","It was clear that the small world in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had fallen to pieces, and the Holy Lady had said that because she had been instigated or rather taught by Begin Lady."]},{"number":2016,"title":"Chapter 2016 Deal With it Here!","paragraphs":["2016 Deal With it Here!","The Holy Lady’s words were indeed effective.","Yang Sijie hurriedly raised his hand to halt Yang Jiu before he smiled apologetically and said, “Holy Lady, what are you talking about? How could we break our contract with you? The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm will go on opening as per usual.”","The Yang family had just eliminated the Su and Bai families.","Because of the help sent by the Truth Association, the Yang family did not suffer many losses past the initial stage.","Without the Su and Bai families, Yang Sijie was not happy in the slightest.","This was because, by accepting the Truth Association’s help, they were now indebted to them.","He did not know what his parents were thinking.","The Truth Association came from the Great Lush Federation, and the Yang family controlled the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. Yet, they had submitted to a group from the Great Lush Federation.","If word of this got out, how could the Yang family still bring themselves to continue lording over the other factions in the Divine Wood Federation?","Moreover, the Truth Association clearly had a serious ploy that they were trying to orchestrate.","All of the law crystals and World Crystals had been taken by the Truth Association many years ago. This had cut off the Yang family’s experts’ means of increasing their power and development.","Without Class 5 Creation Masters, they could only rely on things that contained laws, such as law crystals and World Crystals, to increase their power.","But after the Truth Association had taken all of them away, they would be strengthened while the Yang family’s development would stop in its tracks.","After killing the Su and Bai families’ experts, the Truth Association also requested the law crystals and World Crystals that were stored in the two families’ treasure vaults.","It could be said that the Truth Association had only helped the Yang family to obtain these resources.","This made Yang Sijie feel that the Truth Association was playing a complicated game of chess.","If they were really so greatly lacking in law crystals and World Crystals, they could obtain them from the feys of their thearch- and emperor-class experts.","When he thought of this, Yang Sijie felt a twinge of fear, as though he was being treated like prey.","Moreover, from the perspective of the Divine Wood Federation’s development, eliminating the Su and Bai families would take away from their elite combat power.","In such a circumstance, when the Divine Wood Federation fought against the Iron Hammer Federation, they would not have enough power to emerge victorious.","Because the Great Lush Federation had killed the bandit groups in masses and restricted the movements of the chambers of commerce, the Iron Hammer Federation was in a state of extreme hunger.","During the winter, the starving Iron Hammer Federation could do anything.","After losing so many experts, the Divine Wood Federation was helpless against the Iron Hammer Federation.","Moreover, after eliminating the Su and Bai families, the members of the Truth Association expressed the desire to leave.","The more Yang Sijie thought about it, the more he felt that the Great Lush Federation was playing a large game of chess.","First, they caused the Iron Hammer Federation to fall into starvation. Then, they reduced the Divine Wood Federation’s elite combat power. It was as though it was trying to trigger a war between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.","Nonetheless, these were all just Yang Sijie’s guesses.","Usually, when he made such guesses, Yang Sijie would immediately discuss them with his father.","But now, his father seemed to have become a follower of the Truth Association.","Thus, Yang Sijie no longer dared to tell his father about such guesses about the schemes that the Truth Association could be planning.","As one of the Yang family’s direct disciples, all of Yang Sijie’s actions were done while placing the Yang family’s profits as the highest priority.","Compared to the Great Lush Federation and Truth Association, the Holy Lady who had been in Sacred Forest City for decades was much more deserving of trust.","No matter what happened, Yang Sijie would not choose to offend the Holy Lady.","Yang Sijie even wanted to discuss with the Holy Lady about giving all the seats on the council to the Yang family now that the Su and Bai families were gone.","After all, they did not lack the Creation Master resources they needed to provide to the Holy Lady.","However, there were still members of the Su and Bai families present.","The members of the Su and Bai families on the outside had all been killed. There was no way that the Yang family would mercifully leave any survivors.","With this thought, Yang Sijie continued speaking. “Holy Lady, the experts from the Su and Bai families sieged the imperial court for some reason. The Yang family thought their goal was to prevent the opening of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, so we killed all invading experts.","“Now, we have to take all the members of the Su and Bai families who had entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm away with us. I hope you can understand! Furthermore, I have something to discuss with you. Will you come and have the discussion with me in the imperial court?”","The Holy Lady thought, Thankfully, Lordess Begin Lady hid the entrance to the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm every time it closed. As a result, Yang Sijie hasn’t noticed that the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm has been ripped apart.","The strange events in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had not been seen clearly by the members of the Divine Wood Federation’s factions because they had been too far away, but they had still noticed what had happened.","As such, it would not take long before everything that happened in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm spread throughout the factions in the Divine Wood Federation.","At that time, the Yang family would definitely find out as well.","The Holy Lady could hint the next time the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm opened to the Yang family and offer all of the treasures within to the Yang family. This way, she could take advantage of the Yang family’s weakness to rob them blind.","Since Begin Lady had instructed the Holy Lady to stay in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court to gather information, she could continue playing along with Yang Sijie.","Hehe, Yang Sijie sure is shameless! The factions under his family are a mess, but he’s still trying to act innocent in front of me.","“Since you claim that the Su and Bai families’ experts are targeting the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, you don’t have to take them away. Deal with them here. This will send the message that there will be no good end for anyone who tries to target the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.”","While she spoke, the Holy Lady turned her hand over.","The members of the Su and Bai families were feeling a mix of astonishment and despair when they saw green leaves enter their bodies.","Soon, an unexplainable agony erupted from within their bodies.","However, the green peach tree leaves had the effect of maintaining consciousness. No matter how much pain they were in, they could not fall unconscious.","All they could do was watch as green branches sprouted from their flesh, and their bodies were reduced to bones as their spiritual power and souls disintegrated.","The Holy Lady’s method and Yang Sijie’s news immediately stirred up the crowd.","Ding Chengshuo was currently next to Lin Yuan.","...","Although he did not know what had happened while he was stored within Lin Yuan’s spatial instrument, he was not concerned in the slightest.","The members of the Su and Bai families who had entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm usually always had their noses in the air. But now, they did not have any means of fighting back.","This sight only cemented Ding Chengshuo’s belief that he could only walk toward a bright future when he was by Lin Yuan’s side."]},{"number":2017,"title":"Chapter 2017 He is He?","paragraphs":["2017 He is He?","As Yang Sijie looked at the members of the Su and Bai families who had green branches growing out of them and were already reduced to bones, his pupils immediately contracted.","Yang Sijie remembered that his father had checked on the Holy Lady’s power and confirmed that she was only at intermediate Immortal. His father was more powerful than her.","This was why the Divine Wood Federation had agreed to maintain a working relationship with the Holy Lady for so long.","Otherwise, there was no way that the Yang family would allow a power that they could not control to insert itself in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","!!","But it was clear that the Holy Lady was releasing an aura that surpassed intermediate Immortal. Her aura was even more concentrated than that of his father.","The gears in Yang Sijie’s head started turning.","Could it be that the Holy Lady had been hiding her power all this time? Or did the Holy Lady’s power only increase during this opening of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm?","The more he thought about it, the more he leaned toward the former.","All the factions in the Divine Wood Federation could obtain plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","All of the feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline had the same aura as the Holy Lady, except that the Holy Lady’s aura was much more concentrated.","Because of this, the Yang family had even held a meeting to discuss the matter.","The members of the Yang family assumed that the Holy Lady had been the one who created the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline and had done so to trade for Creation Master resources from the outside world.","She opened the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm every decade so that she could maximize the Creation Master resources that the factions from the Divine Wood Federation would be able to provide.","The Holy Lady could have used these resources to quickly increase their power.","Yang Sijie previously felt that the Yang family had no means of taking on the Truth Association.","But after he felt the aura from the Holy Lady, he knew that it was comparable to that of the leader of the Truth Association.","If the Holy Lady could side with the Yang family, they would not have to worry about taking on the Truth Association.","Now that he had this idea, Yang Sijie fell silent for a moment as he thought, There’s no way I can let Father know about this plan of mine. Otherwise, he’ll end me before the Truth Association even has the chance to get to me. Third Brother died because he opposed the idea of the Truth Association entering the imperial court, and Father was the one who had done the deed.","Thus, if he wanted to partner with the Holy Lady, Yang Sijie could only do so secretly.","Suddenly, a thought took shape in his mind.","If I provide the Holy Lady with Creation Master resources, will she become loyal to me? My father is too deep in his belief in the Truth Association and is no longer fit to develop the Yang family any further. Why don’t I make use of the Holy Lady’s power to replace him?","This thought sank its claws into Yang Sijie and occupied the entirety of his mind.","As a result, Yang Sijie’s attitude toward the Holy Lady changed significantly.","Previously, Yang Sijie had just been polite to the Holy Lady. But now, his tone was full of flattery.","The change in Yang Sijie’s tone was noticed by Lin Yuan, Ding Chengshuo, and the rest of the members of the Divine Wood Federation’s factions.","Lin Yuan looked at Begin Lady and knew that it was the one that had instructed the Holy Lady on what to do. Otherwise, the Holy Lady would not have made such a decision on her own.","Lin Yuan and Red Thorn’s bloodlines were connected. He had fed Red Thorn with his own blood to get Red Thorn to germinate.","Since their bloodlines were connected, Red Thorn was able to sense what he was thinking.","This was likely the same for Begin Lady and the Holy Lady.","When Begin Lady saw Lin Yuan looking at it, it communicated with Lin Yuan through its mind, “When I set my spirit fire alight, I absorbed Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls. As such, I gained an understanding of the spirit qi professional society. The internal affairs of the Divine Wood Federation are a mess. As such, I pushed Little Peach to make contact with the Yang family. This way, she should be able to help you with the first-hand information she receives.”","In Begin Lady’s mind, power was everything.","But after absorbing Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls, she learned that there were times when strategy needed to cooperate with power to achieve more than what power could do on its own.","Begin Lady had already decided to follow Lin Yuan. It could use its power to protect Lin Yuan as well as bring Lin Yuan’s plans to fruition.","When Lin Yuan was communicating with Begin Lady, the members of Sacred Forest City’s factions were swept up in waves of astonishment.","Besides the strange phenomena in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, the outside world had changed completely after their short romp into the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Any faction member with strategic abilities and intelligence now looked worried.","Yang Sijie walked over to the Holy Lady and invited her to travel with him.","Before he left, Yang Sijie shot a pointed look in Lin Yuan’s direction.","For some reason, he found Lin Yuan familiar.","Since he was standing next to Ding Chengshuo, he should be a junior of the Ding family.","Yang Sijie had never seen any of the Ding family’s juniors.","However, how could a junior of the Ding family have such an elite aura?","But Yang Sijie did not think too much about it. He felt that the most important matter on hand was the Holy Lady.","In order for him to protect the Holy Lady’s ego, Yang Sijie ordered the dark-blue-vine-armor-wearing guards from the imperial court to disperse and not put the members of the factions who had just left the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm on the spot.","Lin Yuan led Begin Lady and Ding Chengshuo to Sky Creation’s tree castle.","The members of Sacred Forest City’s factions all rushed home as well to report what had just happened within the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Lin Yuan’s tree castle was the only place untouched by the chaotic events.","After bringing the Holy Lady back to the imperial court and preparing a platter of fruits for her, a thought suddenly struck Yang Sijie just as he was about to discuss his partnership with the Holy Lady.","Yang Sijie finally knew why he found that young man standing next to Ding Chengshuo to be so strange.","The young man had the same aura as Young Master Chu of Sky Creation.","Yang Sijie had noticed that no one besides Young Master Chu had that aura.","When he thought of this, Yang Sijie could no longer sit here. He had to inform his father.","No matter how many wild thoughts formed in his mind, he had to protect the Yang family’s profits first.","Yang Sijie looked at the Holy Lady and said with utmost seriousness, “Holy Lady, did you notice anything strange in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm?”","..."]},{"number":2018,"title":"Chapter 2018 Sister, You’re Too Capable of Lying!","paragraphs":["2018 Sister, You’re Too Capable of Lying!","The Holy Lady thought about the way that Yang Sijie looked at Lin Yuan as well as how Yang Sijie looked at the moment, and a guess formed in her mind.","There was no way he could not report this discovery.","Such an enormous change had happened to the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Although the Yang family had not sent anyone to enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, they quickly heard the news from the other factions.","Since the explanation was not clear, it would be better to play the blame game.","The Holy Lady’s expression turned cold.","“I can’t believe you have the cheek to ask me! What did the Yang family promise me? Didn’t you promise that every person who enters the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm is below Immortal power? Why did Immortal experts enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm this time? They almost destroyed the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm that is only produced after many years!”","Yang Sijie hurriedly explained, “Holy Lady, it’s not that the Yang family’s filter was careless but that there might be members of foreign factions who entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. However, what is the treasure you’re referring to?”","The Holy Lady scoffed and replied, “What does the treasure produced in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm have to do with the Yang family? Since members of foreign factions entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, isn’t it due to the Yang family’s carelessness?","“Although the treasure wasn’t destroyed, it was still damaged. It will need at least 10 years to be recovered. Ten years later, you can provide me with more Creation Master resources, and I can provide only the Yang family with plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.”","Lin Yuan would have gasped in amazement if he was currently by the Holy Lady’s side.","“Sister, you are too capable of lying! If I wasn’t aware of the situation, you would have fooled me too!”","The Holy Lady’s actions dangled a non-existent bait in front of the Yang family. They were utterly hooked.","The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was a mystical existence to the Yang family, and all of their actions in the past proved that the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was very important to them.","Hence, there was no way that the Yang family would be uninterested in a treasure that was only produced in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm after many years.","It could be said that the Holy Lady had become a priority guest to the Yang family through its acting skills and lies.","Yang Sijie started to plot when he heard what the Holy Lady said.","He had never interacted with the Holy Lady before, but she had always been in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm and was likely simple-minded. Otherwise, she would have revealed the situation within the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Although she said that the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm’s treasure was unrelated to him, she still told him everything about the treasure.","Yang Sijie felt that the Holy Lady was so innocent that he would be able to take advantage of her.","With this thought, Yang Sijie was no longer in a rush to report the situation to his father. After all, the Yang family was now supported by the Truth Association.","Even if they did clash with Sky Creation, they would have the Truth Association to hold them up.","The Truth Association had never revealed that they had a Class 5 Creation Master.","But judging from the current situation, it seemed that it was indeed true that the Truth Association had a Class 5 Creation Master. Otherwise, how would they have so many Immortal experts?","Additionally, it was likely that their leader had already exceeded Immortal.","During the Crown Wood Banquet, Yang Sijie had sensed that Lin Yuan and his retainer had the aura of precious instruments around them.","In order to verify his hypothesis, Yang Sijie had visited the Yang family’s hidden treasure vault and sensed the precious instrument the Yang family had traded from the Sand Island Continent.","They indeed had the same aura.","However, the aura from the precious instruments that the Yang family had regarded as their secret weapons were far from being as concentrated as those of Lin Yuan and his retainer’s precious instruments.","If even Lin Yuan’s retainer had a 2 Stars and above precious instrument, it meant that Sky Creation’s store of resources had to be greater than that of the Yang family.","This caused Yang Sijie to be extremely jealous and also gain a greater understanding of a Class 5 Creation Master’s impact on a faction.","The leader of the Truth Association also had a precious instrument. He had used it to kill the Bai and Su families’ experts.","Both Truth Association and Sky Creation were factions that had Class 5 Creation Masters.","If the two factions started fighting, the Yang family might be able to pull away from the Truth Association’s control and benefit from the fall of the two factions.","With this thought, Yang Sijie’s body started to tremble uncontrollably.","It could be said that this plan was the only path to survival for the Yang family.","However, he still needed to properly lay out the brickwork for this plan.","The most important thing Yang Sijie had to do was to turn her into his true supporter. Otherwise, he would no longer seem important once the Holy Lady met his father.","Thus, Yang Sijie said, “Holy Lady, in the next ten years, I will do my best to provide you with Creation Master resources. Are you willing to secretly provide me with plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline?”","The Holy Lady and Begin Lady’s minds were connected.","Begin Lady was walking next to Lin Yuan and looking at a world it had never seen before. Its mouth watered as it looked at the delicacies made of various fruits that were sold in street stalls.","But when she found out what Yang Sijie said through the Holy Lady, her hungry expression turned into one of shock.","Out of desperation, Yang Sijie was a drowning man clutching at straws. He was even willing to strike up such a partnership with Little Peach.","At first, Begin Lady had tried to come up with a way to enter the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","But now, Yang Sijie provided Little Peach with this opportunity himself.","After receiving the instruction from Begin Lady, the Holy Lady rolled her eyes at Yang Sijie and said, “The resources I need are very valuable. If you can help me find them, it goes without saying that I’ll be willing to give you plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline. If you provide me with enough resources, I might be able to use the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm to give you a one-time large boost ten years later.”","Through Bai Dong and Su Jian’s souls, Begin Lady understood that spirit qi professionals badly craved to increase their power.","Since she was going to dangle a large bait and lied about the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, she might as well sweeten the deal for Yang Sijie even more.","This way, Yang Sijie would be willing to become her informant.","Just from swallowing Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls, Begin Lady had learned of the evils of the souls of humans and how it could use them for its own benefit."]},{"number":2019,"title":"Chapter 2019 Hidden Faction!","paragraphs":["2019 Hidden Faction!","Previously, when it was in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, Begin Lady had been a blank canvas. But now, it was a master schemer.","After all, Bai Dong and Su Jian had been major players in large factions, and their heads were full of schemes.","However, no matter what schemes ran through its head, Begin Lady’s mind would always return to pureness when it saw Lin Yuan.","Begin Lady felt that only two people in the world would treat it so well with pure sincerity. The first would be Little Peach, who it had created, and the other would be Lin Yuan, who had given up everything he had and even risked his life for its sake.","No matter how its mind changed, Lin Yuan was already Begin Lady’s moon and stars—the most important person in its life.","Yang Sijie and the Holy Lady spoke for some time.","Faced with the bait that the Holy Lady was dangling, Yang Sijie was utterly blinded.","Yang Sijie even agreed to let the Holy Lady enter the Yang family’s treasure vault and take her pick of resources.","After the thoughts appeared in Yang Sijie’s mind, he continued to prioritize the Yang family’s profits but no longer considered his father as part of the picture.","He needed to have his father’s permission to take the Holy Lady into the Yang family’s treasure vault. Yang Sijie would not be able to avoid this.","After all, he was not the head of the Yang family yet.","However, he had already thought it through. As long as he convinced his father that he would be accompanying the Holy Lady throughout, he would be able to take his negotiations with the Holy Lady to the next level.","At that moment, the Holy Lady said, “However, before the Yang family can work with me, you owe me an explanation. How did outsiders get into the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm? Don’t think that you’ll be able to move past the matter by changing the topic!”","This was not the first time that Yang Sijie was interacting with the Holy Lady.","Previously, he had noticed that the Holy Lady was especially anxious regarding the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Thus, when it came to outsiders entering the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, he might end up as the Holy Lady’s enemy if she found anything strange about his explanation.","Once the Holy Lady thought of him as an enemy, she would not side with him.","Yang Sijie resolved himself and said, “It’s likely that the outsider who entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm is Chu Yuan from Sky Creation. I don’t know how he managed to enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, but honestly, there is another faction besides Sky Creation in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court that has their eye on the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. These two factions have experts beyond Immortal power. You can’t deal with them, but I can help you!”","The Holy Lady immediately transmitted what Yang Sijie said to Begin Lady.","If Begin Lady encountered this matter after overcoming the Heaven’s Trial to become a faerie on its own, the Holy Lady would have panicked.","Previously, the Holy Lady was solely responsible for keeping the secret of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm and gathering Creation Master resources for Begin Lady.","Begin Lady knew that it would have a hard time with the Heaven’s Trial.","When the Holy Lady found out about this, she had been doused in despair and sorrow.","But now that Begin Lady had become a divine faerie and its bloodline had been used to create the Holy Lady, the Holy Lady’s power had successfully reached Immortal.","Thus, the Holy Lady was not worried at all.","Presently, the Holy Lady was toying with Yang Sijie.","Given Begin Lady’s power, the Holy Lady did not have to worry about the Yang family at all.","Begin Lady frowned when it heard what Yang Sijie said.","Lin Yuan had indeed come from outside of the Divine Wood Federation. But he had saved BeginlLady.","Begin Lady had instructed the Holy Lady to make contact with the Yang family because Lin Yuan was curious about how the Yang family managed to kill the Su and Bai families’ experts so easily.","But without Little Peach needing to dig too deep, Yang Sijie had revealed that there was another foreign faction in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Thus, this other faction could be a possible enemy for Lin Yuan.","Yang Sijie had not lied about Lin Yuan, so it was unlikely that he would lie about the other faction in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Begin Lady ordered the Holy Lady to find out as much about that faction as possible.","Regardless of whether Yang Sijie was willing to divulge information, Begin Lady did not have to worry.","After all, the bait had already been set. As long as Yang Sijie looked forward to the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, he would tell Little Peach everything he knew.","Moreover, Begin Lady felt that Yang Sijie had schemes of his own.","Any and all desires that humans had could b taken advantage of.","Begin Lady was just about to tell Lin Yuan about this update when it saw Lin Yuan handing it a pink bracelet.","Small pink fingernail-sized crystals were embedded in the bracelet, which was gorgeous.","Bai Dong and Su Jian were unaware of the Diamond fey storage boxes in the Radiance Federation. Thus, Begin Lady did not realize what it was and assumed that Lin Yuan had given it an accessory.","But when Begin Lady held it in its hands, it immediately understood how it was used.","Begin Lady found this item to be extremely useful. With it, it would not have to walk around while being weighed down.","But at the same time, Begin Lady noticed many fruits and food inside the Diamond fey storage box.","Lin Yuan had four such Diamond fey storage boxes, all of which had been prepared by Wen Yu for the Mother of Bloodbath.","The Mother of Bloodbath was a black hole for food. Ever since it tasted spirit qi professionals’ food, it could not stop.","Everything in the outside world was fascinating to Begin Lady.","When Lin Yuan saw Begin Lady looking longingly at the food items, he decided to give it more opportunities to taste good food.","Begin Lady gently placed the Diamond fey storage box around its waist, and excitement spread across its face.","“Lin Yuan, Little Peach found out in one of her conversations with the Yang family that there is a foreign faction in the Yang family. It’s likely that she will be able to learn everything there is to know about the faction from the Yang family before tonight.”","Lin Yuan frowned.","The Yang family was the ruler of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. From every angle, it was strange that they were voluntarily keeping a powerful faction in the imperial court."]},{"number":2020,"title":"Chapter 2020 Clash Swords with You!","paragraphs":["2020 Clash Swords with You!","With a hidden faction helping the Yang family, it was no wonder they could retaliate against the Su family’s secret ploy so easily.","The hidden experts in the imperial court had managed to kill three experts who had reached Immortal, two of which had reached intermediate Immortal.","Even pinnacle Immortal experts might not be able to kill intermediate Immortal experts so easily.","It was likely that that faction had Eternal experts.","It seemed that the Yang family had been secretly controlled by the faction for some time.","Lin Yuan could not help but think of the Truth Association.","Jin Qianxun of the Great Lush Federation’s Jin family had been sending Lin Yuan frequent updates using the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Jin Qianxun had sworn his loyalty to Lin Yuan, and there was nothing to be suspected about the information he supplied.","When Jin Qianxun had mentioned that the Truth Association was the supporter of all the factions in the Great Lush Federation, Lin Yuan had not thought much of it.","Jin Qianxun had reached pinnacle thearch-class and was almost at Immortal. However, he was only the 7th most important person in the Jin family.","Additionally, the Jin family was barely a part of the eight secret aristocratic families.","The Truth Association had to possess Eternal power in order to have such a firm lock over the Great Lush Federation’s eight secret aristocratic families.","The Truth Association had to be hiding something. Otherwise, they would not have hidden so many experts in the Great Lush Federation’s chambers of commerce and killed so many bandit groups from the two federations.","Since the Truth Association had already instructed the Great Lush Federation to take action, Lin Yuan felt that the faction hiding in the Yang family was likely to be the Truth Association.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Begin Lady, help me to ask Little Peach what the Yang family can give the faction in exchange for eliminating the Su and Bai families.”","Regardless of whether the faction behind the Yang family was the Truth Association, a faction had to have a special reason for hiding in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court but have no intention of replacing the Yang family.","Lin Yuan was very curious about this reason.","He could only better understand the faction when he learned of the reason. He would also find out how he should make contact as well as handle the faction.","When Begin Lady heard what Lin Yuan said, it immediately relayed Lin Yuan’s question to the Holy Lady.","To the Holy Lady, the most important person in her life was Begin Lady, followed by Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had saved Begin Lady, meaning he had also saved the Holy Lady. She was even more grateful to him than if he had saved her.","In order to fulfill Lin Yuan’s request, the Holy Lady started to deepen its interaction with Yang Sijie.","Lin Yuan did not intend to stay in the Divine Wood Federation for too long.","Soon, Liu Yanshan would fetch Luo Lan to the underground palace.","At that time, Lin Yuan would need to snatch the Iron Hammer Federation back for Luo Lan.","In the process of growing, Lin Yuan learned more and more about the meaning of battle between factions and federations.","Because of this, Lin Yuan felt that Luo Lan had a noble soul. Or rather, she was slightly naive.","After Luo Lan reclaimed the imperial court, she would at least be able to give the regular citizens of the Iron Hammer Federation comfortable lives.","Lin Yuan regarded the entire Startling Lines Continent as Sky City’s back garden. Thus, stability in the Startling Lines Continent would be advantageous for Lin Yuan.","Frankly, the Startling Lines Continent was a place that was rich in resources. However, the Great Lush Federation and Iron Hammer Federation greatly lacked resources.","This was because tectonic plate movement under the Startling Lines Continent caused two completely opposite environments to form at the north and south poles of the Startling Lines Continent.","The south was full of fertile ground for growing food and plant-type feys, while the north was filled with mineral resources.","If the resources from the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation could interact, it would solve each region’s lack of resources and result in prosperity for the Startling Lines Continent.","Class 5 Creation Masters could only be produced in a prosperous environment.","The Great Lush Federation’s position was more advantageous than the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","At the center of the Great Lush Federation was a deep harbor. It was twice as large as the largest harbor in the Radiance Federation, and the nearer to the center of the harbor, the deeper the water was.","A deep harbor was an important strategic resource to any federation because the Island Whales needed to dock at their shores.","It could be said that the Great Lush Federation was the best place for sea trading.","It was just a shame that the Great Lush Federation had not properly utilized the deep harbor.","Only three to five Island Whales were in the Great Lush Federation’s deep harbor.","Once they made good use of the deep harbor and started trading with other federations, the Great Lush Federation would receive foreign resources and quickly become prosperous.","However, the Great Lush Federation had to have its own considerations for not establishing any trading deals with other federations.","After all, without powerful combat power, the trading could become a trap for the Great Lush Federation if the other federations realized that there were valuable resources.","In the entire main world, federations without Class 5 Creation Masters lacked stability.","There used to be seven of the Dark Federations in the Dark Continent that competed endlessly.","It was because Su Yiren’s grandmother became a Class 5 Creation Master that she established a balance between the seven federations and formed the Seven States of Darkness.","However, the Truth Association was hidden in the Great Lush Federation!","Lin Yuan could be certain that there were Class 5 Creation Masters within the Truth Association. Otherwise, they would not have so many experts.","Since the Truth Association had not appeared to help with the Great Lush Federation’s trading, it meant that the Truth Association was not interested in helping the Great Lush Federation’s development.","With this thought, Lin Yuan suddenly felt that the inner workings of the Startling Lines Continent were suddenly interesting.","The Truth Association was already deeply rooted in the Great Lush Federation, and Lin Yuan did not intend to head to the Great Lush Federation anytime soon.","Nonetheless, it would not hurt to clash swords with the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court and Truth Association first.","This would let the Truth Association know there was a powerful enemy in the Startling Lines Continent.","Rather than him seeking and giving the Truth Association a chance to hide, it would be better for them to seek him out instead.","...","With this thought, Lin Yuan lifted his head and asked, “Begin Lady, you probably need to sleep for some time after setting your spirit fire alight, right? When do you plan on sleeping?”","Begin Lady nodded and replied, “After absorbing the spirit fire from the Heaven’s Present, my physical body and strength have been bolstered. However, my soul still needs to be slowly improved. My slumber will be meant to improve my soul. I plan on sleeping once you’re done with what you need to do in the Divine Wood Federation.”"]},{"number":2021,"title":"Chapter 2021 I Want to Find a Place to Rest!","paragraphs":["2021 I Want to Find a Place to Rest!","While Begin Lady was speaking, it plucked three strands of its silky hair and handed them to Lin Yuan.","“When I’m sleeping, my soul will enter a state of stillness. Until my soul is done transforming, I can be awoken three times. If you ever need me, set a strand of hair alight using spiritual energy and I will awake. Before my soul is done transforming, it will be a burden to me to use my soul to sustain my body. I would like to find a place on you to rest.”","While Begin Lady was speaking, it changed into a pink and gold crystal and gently landed on the corner of Lin Yuan’s eye as though it was nothing more than a shining teardrop.","Lin Yuan did not expect Begin Lady to choose to go through its transformation on his face.","In its crystal form on the corner of his eye, all Lin Yuan felt was refreshing coolness. He was not uncomfortable in the slightest.","Lin Yuan just took it as there was a pink and gold crystal adorning his eye and did not think much of it.","However, when Ding Chengshuo saw Lin Yuan’s face, he was shocked by beauty in a way that he had never experienced before.","Ding Chengshuo was a pinnacle king-class expert and had lived for a long time. When he was young, he had entered the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, gunning for a brighter future.","Eventually, he entered the Yu family and remained there for almost 40 years.","It could be said that he had seen countless handsome faces in his time.","Moreover, he had seen Lin Yuan’s true appearance long ago and had not yet gotten over his amazement at Lin Yuan’s features and aura.","But when Ding Chengshuo first saw Lin Yuan’s true appearance, he had not felt this sense of marvel so deep that it rattled his soul.","He was so amazed that he found it difficult to tear his eyes away from Lin Yuan’s face.","Ding Chengshuo took a closer look and noticed that the pink and gold crystal that Begin Lady had transformed into complemented Lin Yuan’s aura extremely well.","Moreover, the aura from the pink and gold crystal was somewhat similar to Lin Yuan’s innate aura.","Soon after Ding Chengshuo entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, Lin Yuan had stored him in the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad.","As such, Ding Chengshuo did not know who Begin Lady was. Nonetheless, he was certain that Begin Lady came from inside the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Soon after Ding Chengshuo was released, he could feel that the Holy Lady had inexplicable respect for Begin Lady.","This discovery shocked Ding Chengshuo.","But ever since becoming Lin Yuan’s subordinate, Ding Chengshuo learned it was better not to ask too many questions. All he needed to do was play his own role.","This was because more knowledge did not always bring more benefits.","On the way back to the tree castle, Lin Yuan could clearly sense the people around him staring. However, he did not pay too much mind to it.","Once Lin Yuan returned to the tree castle, the faction members keeping watch by the entrance were all astonished.","To their memory, Lin Yuan had not left the tree castle ever since two days ago when he returned from having a meal.","So how did he appear outside of the tree castle without them noticing?","If this was the case, who was the person who had returned to the tree castle!?","The faction members present knew of what had transpired in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court because the imperial court had not tried to hide the Su family and Bai family’s assault on the Yang family at all.","After the many events that took place in the Divine Wood Federation, the faction members who were stationed to keep watch became aware that Sky Creation was extremely important.","Hence, none of them dared to be careless.","Lin Yuan found out long ago that many factions from the Divine Wood Federation had stationed their members outside the tree castle to keep watch over him.","This was why he instructed the Death Demon Concubine Beast to change into a clone of him to distract these prying eyes.","But now that he had achieved what he wanted and his goal of entering the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, there was no need for Lin Yuan to hide anything.","From what Begin Lady had told him, it meant that Yang Sijie had already realized who he was and that the Yang family was about to take action.","Lin Yuan turned to Ding Chengshuo and said, “City Lord Ding, it’s likely that the Yang family knows that I entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. If you go back to staying where you usually reside, you’ll probably be in danger. Why don’t you spend the next few days in the tree castle?","“Once the matter is settled, I will send you back to Oak City. You performed very well this time. When you return to Oak City, I will evolve the Dragon Horns Mysterious Turtle to Creation Breed and you to thearch-class.”","Lin Yuan handed a brocade pouch to Ding Chengshuo. There were ten earth-type and ten water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls inside the brocade pouch.","Ding Chengshuo excitedly received the brocade potch.","Ding Chengshuo had been thinking about what he would do if the Yang family discovered Lin Yuan’s identity.","He was the one who had brought Lin Yuan into the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. The faction members who made it out of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm alive could prove this.","Thus, he was likely to become a target for the Yang family.","Once he became a target for the Yang family, his crime of taking an outsider into the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm would be enough for him to be served the death sentence.","At first, Ding Chengshuo wanted to wait until they arrived at the entrance of the tree castle to bring this up to Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan extended an invitation to him first.","Ding Chengshuo had realized early on that Lin Yuan did not only see his subordinates as tools. If he did, he would not reward Ding Chengshuo so handsomely after he had lost all of his value.","The way that Lin Yuan treated his subordinates made Ding Chengshuo aware that Lin Yuan always had a backup plan and was also capable of attaining enormous opportunities.","The value of the 20 water- and earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls was even greater than the family that Ding Chengshuo had spent the past few decades working hard to build.","If he had not coincidentally become Lin Yuan’s subordinate, he would not be able to become a thearch-class expert even after another 20 years.","With so many resources, it was possible that thearch-class would not be his limit as long as he remained by Lin Yuan’s side.","Ding Chengshuo was currently weaker than Yi Huailong. Yet, Ding Chengshuo did not see himself as less valuable than Yi Huailong.","After all, he was a Class 4 Creation Master. Even if Lin Yuan’s faction had a Class 5 Creation Master, he would not turn his nose up at a Class 4 Creation Master.","Ding Chengshuo bowed to Lin Yuan in gratitude before he said, “Young Master, I shall be inconveniencing you in the tree castle for the next few days.”","Back in the tree castle, Lin Yuan saw that it was packed full of people, most of whom were from the Yi family."]},{"number":2022,"title":"Chapter 2022 What They Do, We’ll Do Too!","paragraphs":["2022 What They Do, We’ll Do Too!","Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu were afraid that their family’s main members would be targeted due to this storm of events and moved their entire family into the tree castle at the beginning of the Su family’s operation.","Besides the people from the Yi family, there were also the people from the Love Music Center.","Su Yiren had selected Su Man to be one of the 14 Poppy Fruits, and she oversaw the Love Music Center in Sacred Forest City.","Su Man had learned of Lin Yuan’s identity long ago.","It was not easy for Su Yiren to use the Absolute Love Poppy to pick the 14 Poppy Fruits. The death of any one of the Poppy Fruits would severely injure the Absolute Love Poppy, and it would need some time in order to recover.","Thus, Su Yiren did not want Su Man to be injured.","After Su Man reported the situation in Sacred Forest City to Su Yiren, the latter immediately transferred the news to Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper. She hoped he would look after Su Man while he was in Sacred Forest City or, at the very least, ensure that she did not die.","When Lin Yuan received the news from Su Yiren, he immediately instructed Su Man to bring everyone from the Love Music Center to the tree castle.","With Di Wanmi and the Mother of Bloodbath around, even if Lin Yuan was not around, the safety of the tree castle would be assured.","Su Man was the first to have led a group to seek shelter in the tree castle.","By the time Yi Huailong led the people from the Yi family over, they noticed that everyone from the Love Music Center had arrived at the tree castle.","This made Yi Huailong remember that the Love Music Center had only appeared in the Divine Wood Federation a few months ago.","It was likely that they were also under Lin Yuan’s control.","This meant that Lin Yuan had had his eye on the Divine Wood Federation for a long time.","When Yi Huailu and Yi Huailong saw Lin Yuan at the entrance of the tree castle, they immediately rushed up to greet him.","Both of them noticed the pink and gold gem at the corner of his eye that had not been there before.","The gem turned Lin Yuan’s aura from that of a dignified prince to an unreachable deity.","Both of them were extremely grateful to Lin Yuan, but they were also once again ascertained that their decision to make the Yi family a subsidiary of Sky Creation had been a very right one.","Yi Huailong was unaware of the Su and Bai families’ schemes.","If the Su and Bai families joined forces and killed the Yang family in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, there was no way that they would let the Yi family off either.","Even if the Yang family managed to kill the Su and Bai families, it was unlikely that the Yang family would be willing to continue letting the Yi family go free after experiencing such betrayal.","It could be said that Lin Yuan was the Yi family’s savior.","Lin Yuan nodded at Yi Huailu and Yi Huailong, who greeted him.","Su Man also approached and curtsied humbly to Lin Yuan.","Su Man knew that the Yi family was a friendly force and said candidly, “Lord, the Yang family’s first grandson Yang Ji is very fond of the Love Music Center and has spent a large sum on many occasions to book private sessions.","“In order to obtain information, all of the food and wine served in the Love Music Center has been laced with poppies. On numerous occasions, Yang Ji became pliable after consuming the laced food and beverages. I learned from him that the Yang family anticipated the Su family’s plot long ago. He seemed indignant about it, as though he did not believe that the Su family had what it took to hurt the Yang family.","“The effects of the doped food will only increase in strength the more of it is consumed. The last time that Yang Ji drank the laced wine, he had been terrified. He said that he had seen a scary ball of flesh in the Yang family’s banquet hall. That ball of flesh had rolled around on the ground and would even swallow an entire table during meals.","“When I asked Yang Ji what the name of the faction was, all he said was ‘truth’. It was clear that there was more to the name, but he escaped the control of the poppy’s effects after he uttered the word ‘truth’.”","Su Man’s words caused Ding Chengshuo, Yi Huailu, Yi Huailong, and the rest of the Yi family’s main members to feel chills running up their spines.","Previously, they assumed that the Love Music Center was a group meant to accumulate wealth.","But it turned out that they were not just accumulating wealth, but information as well.","The Yi family had never heard of the information that the Love Music Center had obtained.","Since Su Man’s information had come from Yang Ji, and given Yang Ji’s position in the Yang family, it was unlikely that it would be wrong.","However, what did the ball of flesh and truth mean?","Lin Yuan’s eyes narrowed when he heard Su Man mention ‘truth’.","The faction hidden in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court was indeed the same Truth Association that was controlling the Great Lush Federation.","If this was the case, the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation were trapped in the palm of the Truth Association.","It was likely that the changes in the Iron Hammer Federation were also linked to the Truth Association.","Otherwise, a person like Luo Cai, who had been nurtured by the previous king, would not have the ambition nor the ability to single-handedly kill the previous king and steal the throne from Luo Lan.","Lin Yuan was curious about what the Truth Association was after.","At that moment, Liu Jie walked down the stairs holding a small beast with pretty fur. It had an air of inauspiciousness around it.","When the small beast laid eyes on Lin Yuan, it immediately leaped out of Liu Jie’s arms and into Lin Yuan’s before it started nuzzling his hand.","Liu Jie walked over to Lin Yuan and said, “Lin Yuan, Yi Huailong and Su Man have helped me to gather the reserve members of the white-clothed followers. There are a total of 143 of them. I have handled all the people sent by the Su family to spy on us.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","The Su family had been eliminated and the spies they had sent were like rudderless boats.","However, from the moment they entered the tree castle, they had been working for the Su family and did not have a shred of loyalty to speak of.","There was no way that Lin Yuan could keep such people around.","If he did not have the means to take on the Su family, the spies sent by the Su family would bring danger to everyone within the tree castle.","Even if Liu Jie did not handle them, Lin Yuan would do so himself when he returned.","Lin Yuan coughed, which attracted the attention of everyone in the tree castle.","He went on to say, “Everyone, get ready! Before the day after tomorrow, regardless of whether the Yang family or Truth Association seeks us out, we will head to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court together.”","Yi Huailong was stunned and asked in confusion, “Young Master, why are we going to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court? The Yang family...”","Before Yi Huailong could finish speaking, he saw Lin Yuan grin at him and reply, “We will be doing what the Su family and Bai family went to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court to do! How else is the Yi family going to enter the imperial court and become its ruler?”","..."]},{"number":2023,"title":"Chapter 2023 Liu Jie’s Growth","paragraphs":["2023 Liu Jie’s Growth","Lin Yuan’s words caused Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu’s breaths to become ragged.","Lin Yuan’s words had essentially raised the Yi family up to the sky.","It used to be that the Yi family was the weakest of the Yang, Bai, and Su families. Although they were called the Hundred Treasures Family, they only managed to survive by keeping their heads down around the other families.","There was nothing that Yi Huailong could do about this because, in terms of hard force, it was true that the Yi family could not measure up to the Yang, Bai, or Su families.","!!","The Yi family did not have Immortal experts. No matter how seriously they were bullied, they dared not burn bridges with the other three families.","Some other families even bullied the Yi family because of their close relationships with the other three families. Those families were well aware that the Yi family did not have much power. So even if they were bullied to the point of being called worthless, they could not do anything more than suffer silently.","The Bai family had been eyeing the Yi family for very long, and it seemed as though they would pounce on the Yi family at any time.","The most powerful combatant in the Yi family was Yi Huailong.","No matter how brave and noble-hearted he was, he had to live in fear every day.","Yi Huailong never dreamt that the day would come when the Yi family had the chance to enter the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","He nurtured the Snake Blood Nether Rose secretly, as well as numerous snake-species feys so that the Yi family would not be helpless when the day came that they were finally attacked.","Now, the Yi family’s chance finally came.","Although Yi Huailong trusted Lin Yuan and knew that Sky Creation had a Class 5 Creation Master, as well as unimaginable power, the Su and Bai experts had died under mysterious circumstances in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Moreover, Lin Yuan knew that there was a hidden faction in the imperial court.","Given the situation, charging into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court like the Su and Bai families did seemed too dangerous.","Yi Huailong reminded Lin Yuan carefully, “Young Master, the Yang family has the ability to kill three Immortal experts without getting too deep into the fight themselves. Do you think...”","Lin Yuan replied, “If three Immortal experts enter Sky Creation’s tree castle, we’ll be able to kill them too. So there’s nothing to worry about. The Yi family just needs to be ready.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Yi Huailu, Yi Huailong, and the rest of the Yi family dizzy.","Immortal experts were already legends and the strongest powerhouses to strong factions in the Divine Wood Federation.","They had never even heard of experts beyond Immortal, much less seen them.","Eternal was a completely new concept to Yi Huailu, Yi Huailong, and the rest of the Yi family.","Lin Yuan’s words exploded the Yi family’s realm of understanding.","Liu Jie was also shocked when he heard what Lin Yuan said. However, he knew that Lin Yuan was not the type to spout wild lies.","Hence, faced with Eternal experts, Lin Yuan had to have his own way of dealing with them.","Liu Jie’s mind was focused on Lin Yuan.","From the moment he saw Lin Yuan, Liu Jie noticed that there was a pink and gold gem at the corner of his eye.","Liu Jie thought, The gem at the corner of his eye is probably an opportunity Lin Yuan gained on his trip to the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Liu Jie preferred to take the simple method.","Liu Jie felt that in order to control the Divine Wood Federation, it was necessary to take out the Yang family, who currently lorded over the imperial court.","Liu Jie felt that the leader of a faction that led a federation had to do everything while placing the federation’s best interests first.","However, even if the Yang family knew of the Su family’s motives, they had ignored it and exterminated the Su and Bai families later.","The Yang family would be doing harm to the Divine Wood Federation if they killed most of the experts from the Divine Wood Federation.","The Truth Association could not support the Yang family endlessly. It would always be better to rely on oneself than others.","By having the Yi family replace the Yang family as the head of the Divine Wood Federation, the entire Divine Wood Federation would be under the protection of Sky Creation.","This would be a blessing for the entire Divine Wood Federation.","After Lin Yuan told the Yi family about his plan, he went upstairs with Liu Jie.","Liu Jie said seriously, “Lin Yuan, ever since I arrived at the Startling Lines Continent, I’ve been sending out large numbers of the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths to scout out the surroundings. Besides the winter that has swept through the Iron Hammer Federation and the blizzards that come with it, which prevent the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths from entering the area, they have searched through all other regions.","“I noticed that most of the gold resources in the Startling Lines Continent are in the Great Lush Federation. According to the information from Su Yiren, the Great Lush Federation appears to be weaker than the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","“I am curious to learn what method the Great Lush Federation used in the early days to obtain so many gold resources. The deep harbor in the Great Lush Federation is the most precious sea strategic resource. I wonder if there has been a faction hidden in the Great Lush Federation from the moment of its establishment.","“But now, that faction is starting to extend its tendrils into the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation. I have a feeling that the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation’s combat power can’t compare with that of the hidden faction in the Great Lush Federation.”","Lin Yuan looked at Liu Jie curiously.","To Lin Yuan’s memory, Liu Jie lacked planning capabilities and was not skilled at analysis. Otherwise, he would have only assigned Liu Jie to be the head of the white-clothed followers.","Lin Yuan found Liu Jie’s improvement to be almost unbelievable.","When he saw Lin Yuan’s gaze, Liu Jie said, “In the few days that you were in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, I noticed that Bai Qinghuan was busy writing something and took a look at it. I saw that she was using the information she had on hand to deduce the situation in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. As such, I started chatting with her. After half a day of chatting with her, I gained a lot of knowledge. Bai Qinghuan is indeed a talent!”","Lin Yuan rarely heard Liu Jie praise another person.","When he previously saw the information that Bai Qinghuan organized, Lin Yuan knew how exceptional Bai Qinghuan’s skills of deduction were. Moreover, almost all of Bai Qinghuan’s skills of deduction were geared toward strategy.","If Liu Jie could grow through his interaction with Bai Qinghuan, Lin Yuan hoped that both of them could interact more.","Sky City was started by Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu. It was not Lin Yuan’s effort alone.","It could be said that Liu Jie did not participate in Sky Creation’s daily operations besides leading the white-clothed followers.","If Liu Jie could improve in terms of strategy, he would be able to help more in managing Sky City.","Lin Yuan could tell that Liu Jie was very willing to contribute to Sky City."]},{"number":2024,"title":"Chapter 2024 Marrow!","paragraphs":["2024 Marrow!","Liu Jie did not like interacting with outsiders.","After he became Lin Yuan’s retainer, he did not feel the need to interact much with anyone besides the few friends he had from before.","After all, the duty of a retainer was to protect the spirit qi professional they were bound to.","Liu Jie had interacted with Bai Qinghuan because the latter had sworn her loyalty to Lin Yuan and was one of them. Otherwise, Liu Jie would not have spoken so much to her either, much less improve himself through their interactions.","“Big Brother Liu, why don’t we have Bai Qinghuan follow you from now on? Both of you can discuss strategies surrounding the Startling Lines Continent together.","“Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform has risen to 4 Stars. The next time she uses the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu can take you in too. Big Brother Liu, once you’ve grown more, you can not only manage the white-clothed followers but also try your hand at managing Sky Creation’s other branches.”","Liu Jie immediately looked excited. He had always known that he was lacking in strategizing skills and could not help much when it came to building factions.","But now, he was presented with the chance to improve himself.","Liu Jie had always wanted to be of help to Lin Yuan and Wen Yu in managing Sky City.","He intended to learn as much as he could from Bai Qinghuan in the next year.","He knew that Lin Yuan and Wen Yu would use Wen Yu’s Astronomical Parliament to hold a meeting in the stars every once in a while. Neither Lin Yuan nor Wen Yu had hidden this from him.","They did not include him in the past because the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars had not been high enough.","Every additional member seated on the 12 golden thrones would increase the drain of spiritual energy.","But now, this was no longer an issue.","Liu Jie could communicate perfectly with Lin Yuan and Wen Yu in real life, and pulling him into the meetings would be wasting a seat.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu decided to let Liu Jie take one of the golden thrones.","The three of them had decided to set up a faction together, and regardless of what happened, it had to be carried on by the three of them.","After pulling Liu Jie into the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan did not intend to instruct Wen Yu to pull anyone from reality into the Astronomical Parliament.","The remaining nine golden thrones would be filled up by the members of the north-south constellation seats, as determined by the results they achieved.","After chatting with Liu Jie for some time, Lin Yuan returned to his room and woke up Begin Lady.","Soon, the pink and golden gem at the corner of Lin Yuan’s eye turned into Begin Lady’s figure.","Lin Yuan said, “Begin Lady, I need to talk with you about something. The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s bloodline absorption ability is very important to me. I want to feed it my bloodline. It goes without saying that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp absorbing my bloodline will not have any impact on your bloodline.”","Begin Lady blushed when it heard what Lin Yuan said.","Bloodlines were very mysterious and sacred to feys with elite bloodlines.","When male and female feys came together to produce new life, it was fundamentally a process involving the combination of their bloodlines.","Now that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had absorbed its bloodline, Begin Lady was the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s mother.","Once Lin Yuan fed his bloodline to the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp, his bloodline would guide it to transform.","Thus, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp was now a fey that contained both Begin Lady and Lin Yuan’s bloodlines.","In a way, they were now the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s parents.","If Begin Lady heard what Lin Yuan said when it was experiencing the Heaven’s Trial, it would not have thought much of it.","But now, Begin Lady had absorbed Bai Dong and Su Jian’s souls and knew more about human relationships than Lin Yuan.","But in spite of its reddened face, Begin Lady would not turn down Lin Yuan’s request.","Begin Lady summoned the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp and handed it to Lin Yuan as it said, “Our bloodlines have concentrated water-type aura and are rather similar. The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp probably won’t reject them.”","After Lin Yuan received the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp, it turned into water currents in his arms and started swimming around him.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp remembered that it only became so strong with Lin Yuan’s help.","At present, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp was edging closer to Immortal and had intelligence comparable to average humans.","After Lin Yuan had a discussion with Morbius, he decided not to keep Begin Lady in the dark about the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","This was because Begin Lady’s original body was the mouth of a spirit spring. When it was placed in the Element Well, it could increase the quantity of water produced in the Element Well.","Thus, he decided to place Begin Lady and the 37 mouths of spirit springs inside the Element Well while Begin Lady was sleeping so they could all aid in increasing the volume of water.","Before he told Begin Lady about this and brought it into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan decided to ask Begin Lady how it had become an intermediate faerie.","Begin Lady replied honestly, “I don’t remember the specifics of how I came upon the opportunity. When I gained intelligence, I remember that there was the marrow of a lifeform that was releasing concentrated energy. It was this energy that increased my intelligence. I don’t know exactly what the lifeform is. Eventually, the lifeform’s entire body dissolved in the river water. I only became a faerie because of that unknown lifeform’s marrow.”","Begin Lady paused before it continued seriously. “But that marrow only created me. The one who saved me and gave me a new lease of life is you!”","A blissful grin spread across Begin Lady’s face as it spoke.","Without Lin Yuan, it would never have been able to experience the outside world like it was doing now.","When Lin Yuan heard what Begin Lady said, he was curious about what lifeform had created an intermediate faerie using just its marrow.","But at the same time, he knew that the world was definitely more complicated than he thought.","The world in his shrine that had been created by the spirit fire, as well as Begin Lady’s existence, had both refreshed Lin Yuan’s previous understanding of the world.","Lin Yuan knew that he still had a long way to go before he became a true expert.","Compared to Begin Lady, the Moon Empress was no longer the strongest expert that Lin Yuan had ever met.","Now, Lin Yuan possessed more power than the Moon Empress.","In the past, the Moon Empress had been the one who protected him.","From now on, he would be capable of protecting the Moon Empress. He might even be able to help the Moon Empress reach even higher heights after she awakened her spirit fire and took control of her birth horoscope."]},{"number":2025,"title":"Chapter 2025 The Element Well’s Evolution!","paragraphs":["2025 The Element Well’s Evolution!","Lin Yuan took out the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad and said, “Begin Lady, enter this spatial instrument for a while. I will take you somewhere. If you want to sleep, your body will benefit greatly if you sleep at that place. You’ll also be able to help me.”","Begin Lady immediately nodded and said, “You don’t have to be so polite to me! I’m happy to be of help to you!”","Lin Yuan used spiritual power to activate the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad, and Begin Lady entered it.","Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and released Begin Lady from the Jewelled Cabe Golden Toad.","The instant Begin Lady was released, it found itself in a magical realm filled with spirit qi.","Although Begin Lady had successfully overcome Heaven’s Trial to become an intermediate faerie, spiritual power was still very beneficial to it.","If it spent a prolonged period of time in a place full of spirit qi, Begin Lady could fortify its roots and gain another opportunity to evolve.","The stronger the bloodline the fey had, the more the fey would hope to become stronger and evolve.","It went without saying that Begin Lady was no exception.","Begin Lady wanted to remain by Lin Yuan’s side to repay its debt to him.","But before it had even returned the favor, Lin Yuan was presenting it with another opportunity.","Begin Lady softly asked in embarrassment, “Lin Yuan, can I absorb a small amount of the pure spirit qi every day?”","Lin Yuan honestly replied, “As long as energy ores are poured into the spirit pool, the spirit qi within the energy ores will be refined and released from the spirit pool. There is no lack of spirit qi here. You can absorb as much as you want.”","If Begin Lady remained in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for a day, it would easily familiarize itself with the 480 square meters of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","This was why Lin Yuan was willing to tell Begin Lady about the circumstances of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Begin Lady started to smile brightly, but Lin Yuan still had to say what he needed to say. “Begin Lady, when you’re absorbing the pure spirit qi in this space, you have to ensure that the spirit qi in the space won’t be over-drained and that the other lifeforms here have enough to absorb as well.”","Begin Lady nodded hastily and responded. “I don’t need to absorb too much pure spirit qi. After my spirit fire was set alight, my life rank was transformed. I can’t rely on just spiritual power to increase my power anymore. I only need spirit qi to fortify my roots. By the way, what do you need my help with?”","Lin Yuan pointed at a distance away and said, “There is the Element Well over there. It can produce elemental water. Before you underwent the Heaven’t Trial, the water from the Element Well was what allowed you to rapidly absorb the water- and earth-elemental energy and refine your body. There is very little of the Element Well’s water. The mouths of spirit springs will be able to boost the Element Well.”","Begin Lady immediately knew what Lin Yuan was referring to.","“I was wondering why you were so hung up on the 37 mouths of spirit springs! It turns out that they can also be used in such a way! My foundation is similar to the mouths of spirit springs. I should be able to increase the production of water in the Element Well!”","Begin Lady walked over to the Element Well and jumped in.","In an instant, violent energy fluctuations exploded out of the Element Well.","Lin Yuan jumped out of his skin when he saw this and immediately thought that something had happened to Begin River in the Element Well.","Lin Yuan had not experienced such a situation since the Element Well appeared.","By the time he ran over to the edge of the well, Lin Yuan heard happy noises from Begin Lady at the bottom of the well.","“Lin Yuan, if I took shelter in the Element Well 20 years ago, I might not have needed your help to overcome the 26 attacks from Heaven’s Trial! At first, I needed to sleep for a year. But inside the Element Well, I only need to sleep for around half a year in order for my soul to transform.","“Previously, I gave you three strands of hair and told you that you could use them to summon me thrice. The Element Well is able to greatly nourish my body so I can put myself in a state of fake slumber while my soul is transforming. This way, you’ll be able to summon me if you ever encounter difficulties.”","Lin Yuan looked delighted when he heard what Begin Lady said.","Begin Lady was currently Lin Yuan’s strongest secret weapon.","Lin Yuan was the strongest he had ever been.","At this stage, Lin Yuan still had a long way to go before he became a true top expert.","If he could attain Begin Lady’s protection, he would not need to worry at all while he was training.","Furthermore, he had already communicated with Morbius that Begin Lady would be staying in the Element Well.","Although powerful elemental fluctuations had exploded out of the Element Well, they had not harmed the Element Well at all.","Due to Begin Lady, the Element Well’s production rate increased by 94%. This meant that Begin Lady had almost doubled the production rate of the Element Well.","After putting in the 37 mouths of spirit springs, the Element Well’s production rate would rise again.","Lin Yuan took out the mouths of spirit springs from the Guard Sea Silver and tossed them one by one into the Element Well.","The energy fluctuations exploding out from the Element Well became more violent, and indentations appeared in the wall of the Element Well.","The mouths of spirit springs were embedded in the indentations, and spring water poured out of them.","The Element Well absorbed the spring water and turned it into the Element Well’s own water.","Each mouth of spirit spring increased the Element Well’s yield by about 3%.","However, Lin Yuan had quantity on his side.","The 37 mouths of spirit springs increased the production rate of the Element Well by 111%.","With the boost from Begin Lady, the Element Well’s production rate had increased by a total of three times its original rate.","Now, Lin Yuan did not have to be stingy with his use of the Element Well’s water.","Previously, the volume of the Element Well’s water had been enough to meet the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil and Dark Blue’s needs.","But with the increased production rate, Lin Yuan could now set aside a portion of the Element Well’s water for emergencies.","The 37 mouths of spirit springs were almost the entire stock that was available in the Startling Lines Continent.","The spring water from the mouths of spirit springs had all-inclusive functions, but all of the spring water was currently being absorbed by the Element Well to be turned into the Element Well’s water."]},{"number":2026,"title":"Chapter 2026 Evolve! Perfect Touch Wisteria!","paragraphs":["2026 Evolve! Perfect Touch Wisteria!","If Lin Yuan truly needed the spring water, he could fill a bucket with the water.","Begin Lady was the Gaea Begin River and the mouths of spirit springs had created a cozy environment for it.","Begin Lady could not be happier at the bottom of the Element Well.","Next, Lin Yuan instructed Morbius to spirit lock the Perfect Touch Wisteria and turned it into Morbius’ Gold spirit-locked fey.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s Normal ability Forbidden Growth could break the limit of any lifeform it had contracted. As long as it had enough energy, it would be able to increase its power endlessly.","Once it absorbed a sufficient amount of power, it would automatically comprehend a Willpower Rune.","Lin Yuan was very fond of the ability Forbidden Growth.","After the Perfect Touch Wisteria had been spirit locked by Morbius, it could break through the limit of the spirit lock to increase its power continuously.","Lin Yuan would not have to provide it with a Willpower Rune, and it would be able to increase its power continuously as long as it had enough energy.","As for the energy that the Perfect Touch Wisteria needed, it required vitality and pure spirit qi.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was cultivate the Perfect Touch Wisteria in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Liu Jie had recruited many reserve members of the white-clothed followers in the Divine Wood Federation.","Previously, Lin Yuan only gave high-quality Bronze feys to the white-clothed followers.","Ever since then, the white-clothed followers had collected the resources themselves.","But now, Lin Yuan intended to give the white-clothed followers a helping hand.","This was because he needed their feys to evolve to Myth Breed.","He intended on using the Pure Land of Bliss to absorb the World Graces from the main feys of the white-clothed followers and using the spirit qi crystals produced from the World Graces to rapidly increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power.","If he could not use resources to increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s strategic significance would be greatly discounted.","After Morbius spirit locked the Perfect Touch Wisteria, its Elite Peak Sturdiness ability would still exist.","Lin Yuan had gained one of the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s triggered abilities even without using the Endless Gem to unlock the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Although Peak Sturdiness would allow the Perfect Touch Wisteria to fortify itself through absorbing energy, the ability greatly discounted the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s value to the Divine Wood Federation’s factions.","However, Peak Sturdiness fitted Lin Yuan’s direction of only nurturing his feys in the best direction.","Peak Sturdiness also enabled the Peak Sturdiness to self-heal.","Previously, Lin Yuan had not been in a rush to nurture the Perfect Touch Wisteria because he wanted to use the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline to transform the Perfect Touch Wisteria into a fey with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","From the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s absorption of Begin Lady’s bloodline, Lin Yuan realized how powerful Begin Lady’s bloodline was. It was easy for Begin Lady’s bloodline to contaminate other plant-type feys.","Thus, Lin Yuan did not hold back and told Begin Lady what his plan was.","Begin Lady was silent for a moment before it said, “Lin Yuan, when you use my bloodline to contaminate plants and animals, you will indeed be able to raise the level of their bloodlines and strengthen their abilities and exclusive skills.","“However, unless they are lifeforms like the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp that can consume bloodlines, the other lifeforms will be restrained by my bloodline. From then on, their growth will be restricted. I have been using my bloodline to carefully nurture Little Peach, but she will never be able to reach Eternal. So, you must consider carefully before you use my bloodline to contaminate other feys.”","If Begin Lady had not absorbed Bai Dong and Su Jian’s souls, or if it had not absorbed the souls of two Creation Masters, it might not have brought anything up and given its bloodline to Lin Yuan directly.","But because it had absorbed the souls of two Class 4 Creation Masters and gained their knowledge, Begin River decided to give Lin Yuan such a stern warning.","Fear streaked through Lin Yuan. His idea of bloodlines had been too simple!","If not for Begin Lady’s warning, the Perfect Touch Wisteria might have been doomed to never reach Eternal. Morbius would also be stuck at Eternal and never be able to advance further.","Lin Yuan would never want to see this.","He immediately gave up on using Begin Lady’s bloodline to contaminate the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","He would also not use Begin Lady’s bloodline to contaminate feys like the Jasmine Lily that were spirit locked by Morbius in exchange for a short-term increase in power.","Lin Yuan had always been the type to play the long game. He preferred a long-term increase in potential over a short-term increase in power.","The scale in the 26th attack of Heaven’s Trial and the marrow that had transformedBegin Lady into a faerie informed Lin Yuan that his horizons had not been expanded enough yet.","This was the same as when Lin Yuan wanted to leave Redbud City and the Radiance Federation to take a look at what was out there.","Now, he also wanted to see the world of the giant beast that the marrow came from.","Lin Yuan decided that he would steadily increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power instead and have Morbius spirit lock the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Perfect Touch Wisteria again after it was spirit locked and saw that it was only left with its Normal ability.","He reached out and grabbed the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines as he injected spirit qi into the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s gold vines were like tentacles that started to flail around quickly and wildly when they received pure spirit qi.","Soon, the vines that started out only around 10 centimeters long grew to around 30 centimeters.","Now, the Perfect Touch Wisteria had been evolved to Bronze X/Epic.","Lin Yuan had spoken with Yi Huailu about the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","If the Perfect Touch Wisteria had not been evolved to Epic quality before it was evolved to Bronze grade, there was a 90% and above chance that it would develop Tool Transformation as its exclusive skill.","If the Perfect Touch Wisteria was evolved to Epic quality before it evolved to Bronze grade, it would develop three options for exclusive skills like other feys did.","However, the three options would not be better than Tool Transformation.","Because of this, people who found the Perfect Touch Wisteria usually did not take the effort to evolve it to Epic quality.","However, Lin Yuan’s Perfect Touch Wisteria had mutated.","He had a feeling that it would give him a surprise with its exclusive skill when it evolved to Bronze grade.","As Lin Yuan continued to inject spirit qi into the Perfect Touch Wisteria, it grew four new vines, and its grade evolved from Elite to Bronze.","..."]},{"number":2027,"title":"Chapter 2027 Swallow Same Source","paragraphs":["2027 Swallow Same Source","After the Perfect Touch Wisteria evolved to Bronze grade, three options of exclusive skills appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","As Lin Yuan looked through each of them, he saw that the first was called Double Parasite.","[Double Parasite]: When the vines wrap around a target, and the sharp ends pierce the target’s body, two seeds will be planted inside the target. The seeds will germinate after some time and cause damage to the target.","Double Parasite was a strong combat ability but not useful in the practical sense at all.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria had already wrapped its vines around the target and pieced the target with the spikes on its vines. In such a situation, there would be no need to plant two seeds in the target to cause damage to the target.","Furthermore, the damage would only be dealt after some time.","Delayed damage abilities were never favored by spirit qi professionals, regardless of the amount of damage they could produce.","In order to use Double Parasite to plant two seeds in the target, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines had to be strong enough to penetrate the target.","At its core, the Perfect Touch Wisteria was not a combat-type plant-type fey. Thus, Lin Yuan gave up on choosing Double Parasite.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s second option of exclusive skill appeared.","This exclusive skill caused Lin Yuan’s expression to shift.","[Double Tool Transformation]: Two forms can be produced during Tool Transformation. When the two forms are used, they will cause twice the drain of spiritual power.","It was evident that Double Tool Transformation was a mutation of Tool Transformation.","It had its flaws as well as its benefits.","Its benefit was that it could produce two different forms. This narrowed the unpredictability of Tool Transformation. With two forms, there would be a wider range of usage for the ability, and they could be switched during battle to adapt to the changing circumstances. It was likely that this would lead to unexpected effects.","However, the flaw was also obvious—ιt caused double the drain of spiritual power.","This drain of spiritual power would affect not only the Perfect Touch Wisteria but Lin Yuan as well.","Due to its ability Forbidden Growth, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power could climb endlessly.","The higher the Perfect Touch Wisterias grade, the bigger the drain on Lin Yuan’s spiritual power it would cause when Double Tool Transformation was used.","Regardless of whether it could reach Eternal, Lin Yuan could not sustain Double Tool Transformation for long, even with the Spirit Qi Imprint opened by the time the Perfect Touch Wisteria reached Immortal.","Nonetheless, compared to Double Parasite, Double Tool Transformation was undoubtedly a much better choice.","If the third option of exclusive skill was not promising, Lin Yuan would choose Double Tool Transformation.","The moment Lin Yuan saw the third exclusive skill, he could not help but inhale sharply.","It could be said that the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s third option of exclusive skill was the most wicked exclusive skill he had seen from a plant-type fey.","[Swallow Same Source]: Every vine will have the same grade and quality, but they can be separated to act as individual entities. Every vine can consume something and take control of its attributes. The swallowed entity cannot be spat out, but an even higher level item can replace it. (Once it gains attributes, the vine cannot be separated again.)","Clearly, this exclusive skill had much more potential than Double Parasite and Double Tool Transformation.","One look was all that was needed to see that Swallow Same Source could only unleash its full might when the Perfect Touch Wisteria was supplied with a large number of resources.","If the Perfect Touch Wisteria chose Swallow Same Source, the Perfect Touch Wisteria could use one of its vines to consume Begin Lady’s bloodline and gain the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Begin Lady was currently an intermediate faerie and could still evolve into a higher faerie.","If he ever came across the bloodline of a more elite faerie, Begin Lady’s bloodline could also be swapped out, and the Perfect Touch Wisteria could be strengthened further.","At first, the Perfect Touch Wisteria only had four vines. But after it evolved to Bronze grade, it grew another four vines.","The only drawback to choosing Swallow Same Source would be that the number of vines would be stuck at eight forever.","However, eight vines were already enough.","Currently, Scholars, Fey Observers, and Spiritual Ingredient Analysts had yet to even come up with a clear ranking of fey exclusive skills.","But as Lin Yuan continued to evolve feys, he became increasingly familiar with fey exclusive skills.","If it was up to him to decide if an exclusive skill was good or bad, he would rank them into the gray, green, blue, purple, orange, and red categories.","For example, the Jasmine Lily’s Severed Limbs Growth skill would belong to the purple category.","The Spirit Qi Imprint and Vitality Imprint were on a similar level to Severed Limbs Growth.","In the purple category, the abilities were strong strategic-class and could overturn battles.","Little Iron Block’s Annihilation Gaze skill was extremely useful in a battle, but in terms of strategic significance, it would only rank in the green category.","It was only when it was paired with its ability Sacrifice, which improved the quality of its body, that it managed to move up into the blue category.","If there was a pure healing-type spirit qi professional and support-type spirit qi professional in the team, Little Iron Block’s abilities would then be able to reach the purple category.","Double Parasite would only belong to the gray category, and Double Tool Transformation would belong to the green category.","But, placing Swallow Same Source in the orange category would not be an overestimation.","As for the red category, Lin Yuan had it especially reserved for Morbius.","Only when a fey’s exclusive skill reached the level that the Spirit Lock spatial zone did would Lin Yuan consider it part of the red category.","When a regular spirit qi professional encountered the exclusive skill Swallow Same Source, he would not be able to unleash its full capabilities because they lacked sufficient high-quality resources for the Perfect Touch Wisteria to absorb.","However, Lin Yuan was overflowing with treasures.","He immediately picked Swallow Same Source as the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s exclusive skill.","Next, after pondering for a moment, Lin Yuan took out a piece of ferromanganese and fed it to the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Bronze to Diamond metal spiritual ingredients could be bought on the market. After that came Suzerain and Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients.","There was also High Sovereign after Sovereign.","High Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients were currently just a concept, and none had actually been discovered.","However, the Moon Empress possessed Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients and stored them in the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure vault.","...","He chose to have the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorb a metal spiritual ingredient because metal spiritual ingredients had high limits, and the different types of metals could be swapped out almost constantly.","Lin Yuan had already tested this through the Source Sand."]},{"number":2028,"title":"Chapter 2028 Coiling Dragon Blood Gold!","paragraphs":["2028 Coiling Dragon Blood Gold!","Lin Yuan instructed the Perfect Touch Wisteria to use one of its vines to wrap around the ferromanganese and combine with it.","The golden vine of the Perfect Touch Wisteria was quickly covered with a layer of blue and black scales that were made of ferromanganese.","Lin Yuan took out a pole made of ferromanganese and ordered the Perfect Touch Wisteria to attack it.","The vine that was covered with blue and black scales continuously struck against the ferromanganese pole, letting out ear-piercing sounds of the friction between metal.","Eventually, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine broke the metal pole to pieces.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine was not unscathed from its assault on the metal pole. However, Peak Sturdiness also took effect, and the Perfect Touch Wisteria used its own stored energy to heal itself.","After the experiment with the ferromanganese, Lin Yuan took out the Silver Wind Shadow Steel and fed it to the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Once the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorbed the Wind Shadow Steel, the blue scales withered and slothed off, leaving the patterns of the Wind Shadow Steel on the vine.","A slicing noise came from the smooth vine of the Perfect Touch Wisteria when it moved.","Lin Yuan took out another metal pole made of ferromanganese and gestured for the Perfect Touch Wisteria to slash at it.","Although the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine appeared smooth, it was sharp enough to slice the ferromanganese pole with one slash.","The impact from the slash was so wide that Lin Yuan was in the range of impact.","If the Source Sand had not used Close Guard Sand to protect Lin Yuan, his hand would have become a mess of bloody cuts.","The two experiments showed Lin Yuan how terrifying the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s improvement in power was when its vines were strengthened.","During the strengthening, Lin Yuan noticed that when the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines combined with metal spiritual ingredients, they became the medium that took on the attributes of the metal.","Nonetheless, the metal spiritual ingredients had not rejected the Perfect Touch Wisteria at all.","This time, Lin Yuan did not use Gold metal spiritual ingredients to test the Perfect Touch Wisteria, but used the highest grade of metal spiritual ingredient he possessed—the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","The Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold was produced when a Sovereign main-dragon-species fey died or a group of Suzerain main-dragon-species feys died.","One could feed one’s blood to nourish a metal spiritual ingredient like blood gold, which could absorb blood and increase its metal attributes.","Only one piece of Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold was produced every few centuries.","Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold could be produced using Diamond blood gold, but no one was willing to wait for that long.","Thus, almost every piece of Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold was produced naturally.","The Coiling Dragon Blood Gold was considered a fairly common Suzerain metal spiritual ingredient.","Although the conditions for its productions were tough, most dragon-species feys had the habit of collecting metal spiritual ingredients.","Whenever a main-dragon-species fey encountered the Diamond blood gold, it would take it back to its nest.","Main-dragon-species feys also had the habit of choosing to die in their own nest.","But when Lin Yuan was looking through the Bai family’s treasure vault, he had no chance to stumble on the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","Coiling Dragon Blood Gold could produce different effects according to the type of dragon blood it absorbed.","The Coiling Dragon Blood Gold that Lin Yuan possessed had clearly absorbed a violent terrifying-main-dragon-species fey.","As he held the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold in his hand, he could feel the beating of a heart.","Lin Yuan fed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold into the Perfect Touch Wisteria to see how it would change.","Just as the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorbed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold, the surface of the vine was covered with light red blood vessels.","The blood vessels did not protrude, and the vine quickly became increasingly sturdy. It resembled the arm of a bodybuilder who was suddenly flexing.","Additionally, the sharp tip of the vine was turning into the head of a terrifying dragon.","As the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorbed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold, the Perfect Touch Wisteria abruptly started to display a strong craving for vitality and spirit qi.","The vitality could come from the Soldier Ration Radish that had filled almost 30 Diamond fey storage boxes as it was allowed to grow freely in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan instructed the vine that had absorbed the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold to reach into the Diamond fey storage boxes filled with the Soldier Ration Radish.","The tip of the vine that now resembled a dragon started to vigorously absorb the juices of the Soldier Ration Radish.","While it absorbed the vitality, the other vines absorbed the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Once the Perfect Touch Wisteria was done absorbing the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold, it pulled out of the Diamond fey storage boxes.","At that moment, Lin Yuan could see that the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine was now covered with vessels and was mainly gold with a hint of red.","The tip of the vine now fully resembled the head of a dragon. It could even open and close its mouth with a strong biting force.","According to Lin Yuan’s knowledge, he immediately recognized the fey created by the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold to be the Violent Tyrannical Saddle Dragon.","The Violent Tyrannical Saddle Dragon was a main-dragon-species fey that relied on its body to fight.","Its bite was strong enough to crush the skulls of main-dragon-species feys of the same grade.","It was considered to be one of the more outstanding main-dragon-species feys that could be evolved from terrifying-dragon-species feys.","Lin Yuan took out a board made of radium and instructed the Perfect Touch Wisteria to bite down on it.","Lin Yuan noticed that since the Perfect Touch Wisteria was only Bronze grade, its power was limited.","Despite having combined with the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold, it still could not bite through the radium board. Nonetheless, it managed to leave marks on the radium board.","This discovery caused Lin Yuan to put even more stock into the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s Swallow Same Source skill.","It could be said that of all the feys that Lin Yuan was aware of, none of them could leave marks on a radium board at only Bronze grade.","But the Perfect Touch Wisteria had managed to do so.","Begin Lady had entered a state of mock slumber, but Lin Yuan did not need to wake it up in order to obtain its bloodline.","He released the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp that had almost evolved from Normal to Immortal in a day after absorbing Begin Lady’s bloodline.","...","There was pure intermediate faerie bloodline within the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp.","Lin Yuan immediately fed some of the bloodline from within the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp to one of the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines."]},{"number":2029,"title":"Chapter 2029 Scales Being Used!","paragraphs":["2029 Scales Being Used!","Lin Yuan intended to see how the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine changed after it used Swallow Same Source to absorb the bloodline of an intermediate faerie.","After Lin Yuan told the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp his request, it turned into a ball of water that swirled and moved toward the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp released Begin Lady’s bloodline that it had absorbed, and the Perfect Touch Wisteria started to absorb it.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s food was bloodline power and its main medium to increase its power. Thus, it was the most important thing to the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp was willing to give the bloodline power from its body to the Perfect Touch Wisteria as per Lin Yuan’s request because it knew that Lin Yuan was the reason for its increase in power.","Furthermore, as the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp continued to absorb Begin Lady’s bloodline, it developed a deep affection for Begin Lady just like the Holy Lady did, albeit their situations were different in that the Holy Lady had been raised on Begin Lady’s bloodline while the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had consumed Begin Lady’s bloodline. The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp was very against leaving Begin Lady’s side.","Begin Lady’s attitude toward Lin Yuan, coupled with the help that Lin Yuan had given the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp turned it as obedient as a fey that Lin Yuan had contracted.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria did not need to absorb much of Begin Lady’s bloodline.","Although the Perfect Touch Wisteria could combine with Begin Lady’s bloodline, Begin Lady’s bloodline was so elite that the Perfect Touch Wisteria was currently only powerful enough to absorb a small portion of it.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria had not even absorbed 5% of the bloodline power that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had absorbed before it stopped.","After absorbing Begin Lady’s bloodline, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s body turned faintly pink.","More and more gold patterns of waves appeared on the pink and gold vine, and the vine itself also became more transparent until it eventually looked fully elementalized.","As a fey that Morbius had spirit locked, no one was more aware of the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s changes than Morbius.","“Partner, the Perfect Touch Wisteria can be the next fey that you focus on nurturing. The vine that absorbed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold now has strong physical combat abilities. Now, the Perfect Touch Wisteria will be able to easily break through the defenses of Diamond feys that aren’t defense-type.","“However, the effect of rolling grades like this will weaken as the Perfect Touch Wisteria becomes stronger. After all, metal spiritual ingredients that have only passed on their physical combat abilities to the Perfect Touch Wisteria are more useful than metal spiritual ingredients that give rise to the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s exclusive skills.","“The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine that fused with the intermediate faerie bloodline now has a special support effect. When the vine makes contact with friendly targets, it will increase the target’s resistance to water and earth elements. When it makes contact with enemy targets, the water and earth-elemental energy within their bodies will be stolen. Since Begin Lady is a faerie, its abilities mainly lie in controlling elements.”","Lin Yuan nodded when he heard what Morbius said.","It was true that the Perfect Touch Wisteria could break through the defenses of Diamond feys that were not defense-type. But even when it reached Gold grade, it would not be able to break through the defenses of a Suzerain fey that was not defense-type.","As the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s grade rose, the effect of rolling grades would diminish.","In order to make the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines stronger, it needed to consume a higher grade metal spiritual ingredient.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power was not only limited to raising grades and qualities but also the strength of the entities that it absorbed through Swallow Same Source.","In order to nurture the Perfect Touch Wisteria, Lin Yuan needed to find even more treasures.","The abilities that the Perfect Touch Wisteria gained through absorbing Begin Lady’s bloodline were rough and violent. It could aid friendly forces and weaken enemies.","As such, it was now able to offer double-edged support.","The ability to offer resistance to water and earth elements was very limited. This was because the effect would be rendered useless when faced with feys that were neither type.","However, the Perfect Touch Wisteria could weaken lifeforms made of flesh while still dealing lethal force.","From Lin Yuan’s learnings in his previous life, he knew that lifeforms were mainly comprised of water and carbon.","By robbing lifeforms of water and earth elements, the Perfect Touch Wisteria would be taking away these two key components.","Flesh lifeforms that were weaker than the Perfect Touch Wisteria could even be reduced to scrap.","When it faced lifeforms that were more powerful than it, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s repeated assault could cause the target to lose a large amount of the water and earth elements in its body. This could lead to the cracking of shells or the drying up of blood.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s highly lethal effects on flesh lifeforms already made it extremely useful. It would become even more of a force to be reckoned with when it faced water- and earth-type feys.","It would only be rendered useless when it faced lifeforms related to fire, wind, or other elements.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria had eight vines, and it was enough for one of its vines to be able to accomplish this much.","Lin Yuan’s other feys were also able to complement the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s abilities.","It could be said that Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the changes that Begin Lady had brought out in the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine.","At that moment, Morbius’ voice appeared in Lin Yuan’s mind. “Partner, do you still remember the dark gold scale that appeared in the sky during Heaven’s Trial? It was extremely powerful and was of a much higher level than Begin Lady. My guess is that it came from a snake-species lifeform.","“There isn’t much point in keeping it around. Why don’t you let the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorb it so it can be turned into your combat power? This will also verify my guess as we’ll be able to tell if it came from a snake-species lifeform.”","Lin Yuan’s heart started pounding when he heard what Morbius said.","When the Perfect Touch Wisteria used Swallow Same Source to consume something, it would show signs of that entity.","The changes that happened to the Perfect Touch Wisteria after it absorbed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold could prove this.","Lin Yuan decided that he would do as Morbius said and feed the dark gold scale to the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Since there was no point in keeping it around, it would be better to use it.","The fact that it was able to remain completely undamaged during the 26th attack from Heaven’s Trial proved that the scale was extraordinary.","Moreover, the scale had enabled the 26th attack to be boosted back to maximum capacity when it had been waning.","Just how would the scale that had dictated Heaven’s Trial change the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine?"]},{"number":2030,"title":"Chapter 2030 Lin Yuan’s New Strongest Secret Weapon!","paragraphs":["2030 Lin Yuan’s New Strongest Secret Weapon!","Lin Yuan released the dark gold scale that Morbius had sealed away.","Now, the scale had turned brown. Even if it was tossed onto the road, it would not catch the eye of anyone.","Lin Yuan took a closer look and noticed faint cracks all over it.","The faint cracks resembled the 26 golden eyes of Heaven’s Trial.","!!","Lin Yuan did not make too many guesses and handed the scale to the third Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Once the Perfect Touch Wisteria made contact with the snake scale and used Swallow Same Source, the Perfect Touch Wisteria was lit up with a dark golden flame.","The scale was reactivated and turned dark gold.","Lin Yuan was very familiar with these flames. It was exactly the same as the flames that had appeared during Heaven’s Trial.","The flames could burn Begin Lady’s body, and even the moonlight domain could not deal with it.","The dark gold flames now were even purer than the ones during Heaven’s Trial.","But because of Swallow Same Source, the Perfect Touch Wisteria was unaffected by the dark gold flames.","Rather, as the dark gold scale entered its body, the Perfect Touch Wisteria started to grow even more voraciously.","Besides the dark gold flames, the vine also started to extend until it changed into the form of a snake and was covered with lifelike snake scales.","The snake scales looked like they had exploded, just like the giant snake of the 26th attack of Heaven’s Trial had been.","The pieces of the exploded scales sprayed everywhere and turned into fiery snakes that spread everywhere in the air.","If the Perfect Touch Wisteria was not in charge of the energy, the flames would have burned up everything in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","When the Perfect Touch Wisteria was done absorbing the dark gold scale, two cracks appeared on the snake head at the front of the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","At the center of the two cracks were pupils.","There was also a slit on the snake’s forehead.","The shape of a scale could be faintly seen in the slit.","The shape of the scale was very similar to the shape of the snake scale that the Perfect Touch Wisteria had consumed.","The changes to the Perfect Touch Wisteria had verified Morbius’ guess.","The scale indeed came from a snake-species lifeform.","A guess appeared in Lin Yuan’s mind.","Could the Heaven’s Trial that Begin Lady encountered have been controlled by the snake-species fey?","If a lifeform could control a Heaven’s Trial, it controlled the rules of a faerie’s evolution.","Just how powerful did the lifeform have to be to achieve something like that?","In that instant, Lin Yuan’s horizons exploded apart.","After the Perfect Touch Wisteria swallowed the dark gold snake scale, the aura of the vine completely suppressed that of the vine that had absorbed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold and the one that had consumed the intermediate faerie bloodline.","Lin Yuan was no longer capable of checking on the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine that had consumed the dark gold snake scale. This was because the moment Lin Yuan threw the radium board at the dark gold flames, the radium board was immediately burnt to the point of sublimation. It was as though the radium board had been nothing more than a withered weed.","When the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine burned up the dark gold flames, Begin Lady woke up from its mock slumber.","The aura of the flames could only be described as traumatic for Begin Lady.","Begin Lady had almost died from the dark gold flames.","It looked at Lin Yuan with a troubled expression and said, “Lin Yuan, even I don’t have the courage to allow the dark gold flames from the vine to touch my body. Although the flames won’t be able to burn me to death, they will be able to injure my roots.”","Lin Yuan could not help but suck in a cold breath.","This meant that after the Perfect Touch Wisteria absorbed the dark gold scale, it could now harm an expert that had set their spirit fire alight despite only being Bronze grade.","Previously, Lin Yuan’s most lethal weapon was using the Cold Season Poisonous Fish to strengthen the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","But now, his biggest secret weapon was the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power, and its overall combat ability would be increased significantly.","Since the Perfect Touch Wisteria had been spirit locked by Morbius, it would not harm Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan touched the Perfect Touch Wisteria, it retracted all of the dark gold flames.","Lin Yuan circulated his spiritual power and injected a large amount of pure spirit qi into the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","It did not take long for Lin Yuan to increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria to Gold I/Legend.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","[Fey Name]: Perfect Touch Wisteria","[Fey Species]: Strong armor wisteria species/long wisteria species","[Fey Grade]: Gold (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Forbidden Growth]: After contracting any lifeform, it can break the limit that comes with the contract. As long as it has sufficient energy, it would be able to continuously increase its power.","When it has absorbed the maximum amount of energy, it will be able to comprehend a required Willpower Rune.","Exclusive skill:","[Swallow Same Source]: Every vine will have the same grade and quality, but they can be separated to act as individual entities. Every vine can consume something and take control of its attributes. The swallowed entity cannot be spat out, but an even higher level item can replace it. (Once it gains attributes, the vine cannot be separated again.)","...","1. First Vine: Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold (Violent Tyrannical Saddle Dragon)","2. Second Vine: Intermediate faerie bloodline (Gaea Begin River)","3. Third Vine: Snake-species lifeform scale (???)","From this point forward, Lin Yuan did not intend to inject his spiritual power into the Perfect Touch Wisteria to evolve it.","He had many things to do and did not have the time to do so.","Once he obtained a large amount of spirit qi crystals by nurturing the white-clothed followers, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s grade and quality would skyrocket.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria’s Swallow Same Source skill was extremely strong.","Lin Yuan hoped that the Perfect Touch Wisteria would obtain another powerful exclusive skill when it evolved to Fantasy Breed or Myth Breed.","For feys that naturally comprehended Willpower Runes, the strength of the Willpower Rune depended on the strength of its bloodline and other factors that affected its quality.","Even if the Perfect Touch Wisteria had the worst luck, there was no way that its Willpower Rune would be weak, given its quality and bloodline.","..."]},{"number":2031,"title":"Chapter 2031 The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp Transforms Into a Mermaid!","paragraphs":["2031 The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp Transforms Into a Mermaid!","If the exclusive skills that the Perfect Touch Wisteria gained when it evolved to Fantasy Breed and Myth Breed also had strong strategic significance, the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s position in Lin Yuan’s heart would rise again.","Even if the exclusive skills only increased its power and did not have any strategic significance, Swallow Same Source would be enough.","Lin Yuan kept the Perfect Touch Wisteria in the Spirit Lock spatial zone so it could absorb the pure spirit qi to increase its power on its own.","When Lin Yuan had been helping Begin Lady to overcome Heaven’s Trial, the mermaid emperor bloodline in his body had decreased substantially. Hence, Lin Yuan did not have too much mermaid emperor bloodline to feed to the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp.","!!","He collected all of the mermaid emperor bloodline he could circulate in the tip of his finger and placed his finger on the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s forehead.","A blue and gold bloodline power poured out from Lin Yuan’s finger, and the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp hurriedly absorbed the bloodline power that Lin Yuan was releasing.","The mermaid emperor bloodline was elite, which made it attractive to the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp.","After the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp absorbed Lin Yuan’s mermaid emperor bloodline power, a faint azure light entered its pink and gold body.","The azure light was not rejected by Begin Lady’s bloodline. Instead, it easily fused with Begin Lady’s bloodline.","Besides the change in the color of its body, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s body shape had also changed.","First, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s body elongated, and the blue mermaid bloodline moved downward in the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s body.","The top half of its body changed into human form while the bottom half retained its fish tail.","At this point, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had not finished its transformation from absorbing the bloodline. But one look at it and one could tell that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp now looked like a mermaid.","One’s bloodline also decided one’s outward appearance.","Since the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had consumed Lin Yuan and Begin Lady’s bloodline and it had consumed more of the Begin Lady’s bloodline than Lin Yuan’s, the features of its human half resembled Begin Lady more than Lin Yuan.","Nonetheless, there were traces of Lin Yuan to be seen on the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s human face.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had fully transformed into a lifeform that was a mix of Lin Yuan and Begin Lady’s bloodlines.","The Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp’s attitude toward Lin Yuan had changed clearly. It now felt the same toward him that it did toward Begin Lady.","When Begin Lady had been in a state of mock slumber, it had not mentioned that it would be taking the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp along with it.","But now that the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp had absorbed Lin Yuan’s bloodline, Begin Lady asked Lin Yuan for permission to keep the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp by its side.","While it was in its state of mock slumber, the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp would continue to absorb Begin Lady’s bloodline to continue increasing its power.","It was as though the Bloodline-Cutting Black Carp was more important to Begin Lady now that it had absorbed Lin Yuan’s bloodline.","Lin Yuan did not think too much about it and focused on Chop Dark.","Begin Lady had already killed Su Jian’s wind-type source-type lifeform Chop Dark.","Chop Dark had already absorbed the wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls provided by Ding Chengshuo and transformed.","The Elemental Heart that Chop Dark had produced was now in Lin Yuan’s hands.","Lin Yuan already possessed sufficient phoenix blood.","Every two weeks, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine provided Lin Yuan with almost 10 drops of main-phoenix-species fey essence blood. Thus, he gained almost 20 drops of blood monthly.","However, the faction that Lin Yuan and Long Tao had built together would only be able to provide Lin Yuan with a stable supply of dragon liver a month later.","Hence, there was no rush to evolve the Golden Wings.","Lin Yuan did not use the Elemental Heart to evolve Shiny immediately.","For the rest of the day, Lin Yuan intended to wait to hear more from Little Peach about her interaction with Yang Sijie so he could obtain more information from Yang Sijie.","He was not worried that Little Peach could be in danger.","This was because Little Peach had mentioned that there was a treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","For the sake of the treasure, the Truth Association would not lay a hand on Little Peach even if they found out what was happening. They would definitely wait until the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm opened again and they obtained the treasure before they got rid of Little Peach.","Additionally, Begin Lady and Little Peach’s minds were linked due to their bloodline power.","Begin Lady could sense everything that was happening to Little Peach, and the latter could use the bloodline power in its body to awaken Begin Lady.","If Little Peach was ever in any danger, Begin Lady would swoop in to save her.","To Lin Yuan, the day passed by peacefully.","Amidst the chaos that Sacred Forest City was in, Sky Creation, which had suspended operations, started operating again. They continued to only accept 20 orders per day,","When Sky Creation decided to continue operating normally at such a time, it caught the attention of most members of local factions in the Divine Wood Federation.","All of them were ready to offer large payments if it meant they could work with Sky Creation.","It was likely that this was because the local factions in Sacred Forest City were panicked and wanted to secure more methods of preserving themselves.","Thus, Lin Yuan’s remuneration from this day was almost twice the amount of the day of Sky Creation’s opening.","With such a large amount of precious spiritual ingredients in Lin Yuan’s hands, he could not help but be amazed by how bountiful the Startling Lines Continent was.","Lin Yuan instructed Sky Creation to begin operating again because he wanted to see how the Yang family reacted.","But even after the day had passed, the Yang family did not make any special moves.","Although the Yang family appeared to be the picture of composure, they were actually holding an imperial meeting because of Lin Yuan.","During the previous imperial meetings, the Yang family would invite all of the members of the council.","However, the people present at this imperial meeting were the Yang family and four figures clad in red robes.","Yang Sijie and the rest of the Yang family’s direct descendants were all present.","The Yang family’s direct descendants were all staring at the four red-robed figures.","From the reactions of all the people looking at the four red-robed figures, it was clear they had never seen these four figures before.","They were also astonished that there were strangers in attendance at the imperial meeting.","...","At that moment, the head of the Yang family, Yang Hanxian, was seated in the main seat.","Yang Hanxian saved the first four seats for the four red-robed figures.","The four red-robed figures sat in their seats quietly.","They made for a very unsettling sight.","Yang Ji sat on the seat to the left of the main seat, and next to him was Yang Sijie.","Yang Sijie’s eyes were fixed on Yang Hanxian, and he noticed that his expression looked the same as it always was."]},{"number":2032,"title":"Chapter 2032 Aren’t You Afraid of Angering Him?","paragraphs":["2032 Aren’t You Afraid of Angering Him?","However, Yang Sijie was no longer looking at Yang Hanxian with such a pure gaze but with scheming eyes instead.","Yang Ji looked at the four red-robed figures with fear.","When one of the four adjusted their robes, Yang Ji instinctively avoided their gaze.","Yang Sijie knew of the four red-robed figures’ existence long ago. However, he never expected them to turn up at an imperial meeting.","!!","No outsiders had ever been present at previous private imperial meetings.","Yang Sijie knew that this unprecedented situation was taking place because his father no longer wanted to hide the existence of the Truth Association.","This caused Yang Sijie’s chest to contract.","Presently, the Truth Association was controlling the Yang family from the shadows.","But once the matter was exposed, the unity of the Yang family’s internal affairs would crumble in an instant.","It would be impossible to rebuild the unity once it crumbled.","Even if he had recruited Little Peach and was trying to incite a fight between Sky Creation and the Truth Association through mobbing, until the Truth Association and Sky Creation took each other out and left the Yang family to regain control, there would be no point in him controlling the Yang family then.","Thus, Yang Sijie was secretly trying to come up with a way to prevent his father from revealing the existence of the Truth Association at the imperial meeting.","Alas, he could not come up with anything.","He was now fully in charge of the matter regarding Little Peach.","Little Peach had become Yang Sijie’s biggest source of support.","Yang Sijie did not want to mention Little Peach at the imperial meeting.","If he spoke too much, he could attract his father’s attention.","This would cause his plan to fail before it even began.","An idea popped into Yang Sijie’s head.","Before Yang Hanxian announced that the imperial meeting was going to begin, Yang Sijie looked anxious and said, “Father, I have confirmed with the Holy Lady that Chu Yuan of Sky Creation indeed entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","“Sky Creation is still in Sacred Forest City, and I have placed people to keep watch on Sky Creation’s movements. As such, I was informed that they had resumed business today. Sky Creation has a Class 5 Creation Master. I’m afraid that if they stay in Sacred Forest City for too long—”","Before Yang Sijie could finish speaking, the fourth Truth Association member, sitting to Yang Hanxian’s right, sneered haughtily, “Yang Hanxian, what is going on? Why didn’t you report to me that a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master has appeared in Sacred Forest City? If you have the gall not to report such a matter, aren’t you afraid of angering him?”","The words of the Truth Association member caused the eyes of all the Yang family members to widen, and they soon started shouting their concerns.","Most of the direct descendants of the Yang family did not understand the situation and had been guessing the identities of the four red-robed men.","But what the man said made the Yang family seem like a leashed dog.","What was going on?","Yang Sijie’s chest tightened when he heard what the Truth Association member said.","He had mentioned Sky Creation to shift his father’s attention. However, he had not expected to attract the Truth Association’s attention instead and for him to instantly put his father on the spot.","Unless his father could kill the four members of the Truth Association, his father’s authority would vanish.","But regardless of whether his father was able to kill this member of the Truth Association, his father’s current attitude toward the Truth Association would cause him to apologize immediately.","His words had made things difficult for his father.","In such a situation, it was unlikely that things would end well for him.","Yang Sijie already caught sight of Yang Hanxian, looking at him with rage. But there was also unmistakable fear in his eyes.","Yang Hanxian, the head of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, hurriedly bowed to the Truth Association member and said, “I invited the four of you to attend the imperial meeting because I wanted to tell you about this matter so you can make a decision! The Yang family won’t be able to handle a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master without your help.”","Yang Hanxian’s words caused the dignity and honor of everyone from the Yang family to crumble.","Yang Sijie sat in his seat with his hands clasped in his lap, but there was nothing he could do.","Previously, Yang Sijie only knew that his father was afraid of the Truth Association.","But he did not expect his father to debase himself to such an extent in front of the Truth Association.","The Truth Association member was clearly not sold by what Yang Hanxian said. His voice was as arrogant as ever as he said, “The Yang family only has two Class 4 Creation Masters, yet you have the audacity to try to take on a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master.","“Class 5 Creation Masters are like the sky, while Class 4 Creation Masters are like dirt. Even pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters are nothing more than just larger rocks.","“Now, report all you know about the Class 5 Creation Master this instant! The Lord’s envoy has personally come to Sacred Forest City! If you leave out even one piece of information, Lord Envoy will turn your body inside out.”","Previously, the Truth Association member’s words had only been impolite to Yang Hanxian.","But now, he was clearly deciding the fate of Yang Hanxian’s life or death.","At first, Yang Sijie thought that Yang Hanxian was only deep in the Truth Association’s pockets and only needed to be pulled out.","But it turned out that his father was nothing but an inconsequential pawn in the eyes of the Truth Association.","At first, Yang Sijie had been smug over his recruitment of Little Peach. But now, his heart plummeted.","His father was a pinnacle Immortal expert. In the eyes of the Truth Association, he was nothing more than a bug that could be crushed at any time without making a difference.","Little Peach was only willing to help him because he could offer her sufficient profits.","But he had not even reached Immortal. What right did he have to involve himself in this storm?","Regardless of what the ending of the fight between Sky Creation and the Truth Association was, it would not have anything to do with him.","When Yang Hanxian heard what the Truth Association member said, he seemed to remember something horrifying as his body started trembling uncontrollably."]},{"number":2033,"title":"Chapter 2033 Spouting Nonsense Won’t Save Your Life!","paragraphs":["2033 Spouting Nonsense Won’t Save Your Life!","However, Yang Hanxian’s mind had been fully occupied by the Su and Bai families recently, and he had not paid much attention to Sky Creation.","Previously, Yang Sijie had tried to make contact with Sky Creation at the Crown Wood Banquet.","Due to the good relationship between Sky Creation and the Su family, Yang Sijie had not tried to learn more about Sky Creation.","How could Yang Hanxian give an update about Sky Creation now?","Since Yang Sijie had been the one who mentioned the matter, he should be the one to give the explanation! If the explanation was bad, he would be the one who took the heat from the four members of the Truth Association.","His fear of the Truth Association had caused Yang Hanxian to lose his fatherly love long ago.","To Yang Hanxian, Yang Sijie was nothing more than a pawn that could be used as a scapegoat.","Yang Hanxian bowed and said to the Truth Association member, “Lord, Sky Creation hasn’t been in Sacred Forest City for long. The one who has been interacting with Sky Creation is my son Yang Sijie.","“Sijie! Since you brought up Sky Creation, you should be the one to tell the Lord from the Truth Association about Sky Creation!”","When Yang Sijie heard what Yang Hanxian said, he froze, and beads of cold sweat started running down his back.","Yang Sijie looked at Yang Hanxian with a complicated gaze. Yang Sijie did not understand what Yang Hanxian’s current intention was.","He was now a pathetic insect that had been pushed under the bus because Yang Hanxian was afraid of taking on the Truth Association.","As for Sky Creation, he had already reported the situation to Yang Hanxian. Yang Hanxian had told him that he should stop interacting with Sky Creation because of Sky Creation’s relationship with the Su family.","But now, Yang Hanxian was acting as though nothing was happening.","While Yang Sijie was looking at his father, the fourth Truth Association member removed his hood, revealing a face that was without an eye and nose.","The lone eye that was left was looking at Yang Sijie with amusement.","When Yang Sijie turned his head, he happened to meet the gaze of the singular eye, and he was so frightened that his body trembled.","From the gaze, Yang Sijie could sense how inferior he was.","He was like a cockroach pressed under the clawed paw of a cat. He could only convince the cat to lift its paw and survive if he made the cat happy.","Yang Sijie hastily said, “Lord, in response to what you said! Sky Creation has been close with the Yi family. Now, the Yi family is hiding in Sky Creation’s tree castle. Sky Creation likely has an unknown reason for being in Sacred Forest City!","“The Su family mentioned that Sky Creation’s Class 5 Creation Master is staying with them. But there didn’t seem to be Class 5 Creation Master support when the Su and Bai families recently attacked the Yang family. So, I can’t be sure if the rumor about Sky Creation having a Class 5 Creation Master is true! Lord, if you’re interested in Sky Creation, I can send someone to surround them.”","The noseless and single-eyed man pursed his lips and said, “Is this your report for me? You aren’t even sure if there is a Class 5 Creation Master in Sky Creation? Do you think that Class 4 Creation Masters nurtured the three-colored Peaceful Calm Air Moss that the Su family’s elite team was wearing? Are Class 4 Creation Masters that capable? Spouting nonsense won’t save your life! If you help me see the value in keeping you alive, why don’t you become a meal for my Cut Tooth Shark Loach?”","Beads of cold sweat dripped from Yang Sijie’s head, and his mind was dizzy with panic.","It was true that he had not put much effort into learning about Sky Creation.","What he had said was already everything that he knew.","There was no way that he could make up information and feed it to the man.","Once the Truth Association interacted with Sky Creation, the truth of his updates would be verified easily.","If it was confirmed then that what he said was fake, there was no way that he would be able to continue living.","The most pressing matter to Yang Sijie at the moment was self-preservation.","Regardless of his many ideas, everything would be for naught once he died.","Now, Yang Sijie no longer cared about his previous plans.","The treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm was the only news that could help him continue living.","Faced with the threat of death, Yang Sijie said anxiously, “I specially escorted the Holy Lady. The people from Sky Creation somehow managed to enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. The Holy Lady said that a treasure would be produced in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm ten years later. I’m sure the treasure will be useful to you!”","Yang Sijie’s words caused Yang Hanxian to frown. Yang Sijie had never mentioned such a monumental matter to him in previous reports.","Apparently, Yang Sijie had his own schemes!","Yang Hanxian immediately became wary of Yang Sijie.","The other three members of the Truth Association, who had not spoken yet, were clearly interested when they heard Yang Sijie mention that a treasure was going to be produced in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Given their ties with the Yang family, there was no way that the Truth Association would be unaware of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","In fact, the members of the Truth Association had intentionally asked Yang Hanxian about the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","When they first heard that there was a treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, the second Truth Association member removed his hood, revealing a head of golden-brown hair and beautiful features.","However, the figure was clearly a woman who was very advanced in age.","“Handsome boy, you don’t have to lie! If you lie, Number Four’s fey will just eat you, simple as that!”","Yang Sijie hurriedly replied, “I can swear on my Law Rune that I am not lying! The Holy Lady is currently in the room I arranged for her! If you want to verify the information, I can take you to see the Holy Lady.”","Yang Sijie’s assurance was very resolute.","No spirit qi professional would swear on their Law Rune flippantly.","Moreover, besides swearing on his Law Rune, he was also willing to verify the information with Little Peach. He did not leave any way for himself to be outed.","Previously, Little Peach might have told him the information because she saw him as trustworthy.","Yang Sijie’s action was a betrayal to Little Peach.","Little Peach would definitely be enraged and deem him a thorn in her side because of this betrayal."]},{"number":2034,"title":"Chapter 2034 Free Access to Rain Water!","paragraphs":["2034 Free Access to Rain Water!","Yang Sijie had clearly made this woman happy.","“We will not be meeting with the Holy Lady. From our investigation, the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm is a small world. Since the treasure will only mature ten years later, the Holy Lady doesn’t have any value now. Now that you’ve told the Truth Association about the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, we will take it as the Yang family demonstrating their respect for the Truth Association! You continue to connect with the Holy Lady, and I’ll enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm with you ten years later to retrieve the treasure.”","When Yang Sijie heard what the girl said, not only was he not angry, but he was even slightly happy.","By telling him to continue interacting with Little Peach, the woman had extended his life by ten years.","This gave him ten years to prepare.","He might even be able to reap large rewards from Little Peach during the ten years.","He had not told Yang Hanxian about the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm’s situation.","If the Truth Association member had not just given him a task, Yang Sijie knew that his father would have dealt with him the moment after the meeting ended.","This was exactly how his older brother had died.","Yang Sijie hurriedly replied, “Don’t worry! I will definitely perform the task you’ve given me to your satisfaction!”","Yang Sijie’s desperate attitude and Yang Hanxian once again lowering his head to gain favor with the Truth Association decimated whatever little had been left of the Yang family’s pride and honor.","Although they were still in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, they had lost the necessary dignity of the family that lorded over the imperial court.","At that moment, the Truth Association member sitting in the first seat said, “The Yang family will immediately send someone to make contact with Sky Creation. Go in strong! Kill two of Sky Creation’s inner members and see how Sky Creation reacts!”","Yang Sijie and Yang Hanxian’s hearts skipped a beat.","The Truth Association member meant for the Yang family to be the lackey.","There was no way that Sky Creation would let the Yang family off after the Yang family killed their inner members.","Once the Yang family carried out the task from the Truth Association, they would make an enemy of Sky Creation.","This order would burn the possibility of any bridge forming between the Yang family and Sky Creation.","They could change from being unrelated to bitter enemies.","At that point, the Yang family could rely on the Truth Association.","Frankly, even Yang Hanxian was unable to carry out this task.","After he interacted with the Truth Association, Yang Hanxian found out how scary a faction with Class 5 Creation Masters were.","There was no way that the Yang family could afford to offend such a faction.","However, did the Yang family truly have the luxury of choice now?","Eventually, Yang Hanxian could only gnash his teeth and say, “Lord, Sky Creation might have experts more powerful than me. Do you think...”","Before Yang Hanxian could finish speaking, the Truth Association sitting in the first seat cut him off, “Before the Yang family takes action, I will report to Lord Envoy so he will be able to secretly provide you with a squad. Your son needs to contact the Holy Lady. You shall personally lead the team in getting in touch with Sky Creation! Once the matter is settled, I will ask Lord Emperor to give you a recommendation so you’ll be able to join the Truth Association!”","Yang Hanxian had looked conflicted. But once he heard that he could be recommended to join the Truth Association, Yang Hanxian’s troubled expression vanished, and he quickly said, “With Lord Envoy’s squad, I will immediately lead the team to head to Sky Creation’s tree castle.”","The imperial meeting between the Yang family and the outsiders was about to end.","Yang Hanxian led the Yang family’s experts out of the imperial court and headed to the busiest business district in the Divine Wood Federation.","This was the Yang family’s first movement ever since the Su and Bai families were eliminated, and they were making huge waves.","These huge waves caused countless native factions of the Divine Wood Federation to put up their guard.","Every large faction in Sacred Forest City had a team specifically meant for gathering information.","Up and down the street, any worker could be a spy sent out by a faction.","With Yang Hanxian personally leading people out of the imperial court, the factions of Sacred Forest City were all guessing what Yang Hanxian’s goal could be.","But when they saw Yang Hanxian leave the central area where the members of veteran elite families gathered to head toward the business district, every spy’s mind immediately went to Sky City.","The Yang family was definitely heading to Sky Creation.","However, he was leading such a large team, and the guards had even summoned their feys.","By coming in so strongly, did it mean that the Yang family was going to attack Sky Creation? Or could it be because of the Yi family?","While Yang Hanxian was leading the Yang family’s experts to Sky Creation’s tree castle, rain started to fall on a severely dehydrated continent during its driest season.","When Peace collapsed due to dehydration and severe sunburns while she was digging for the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish, she thought that her life was about to end.","But, she accidentally entered a meeting amongst the stars.","It was there that the lonely Peace found a home.","When she awoke, she realized that everything that had happened in the stars had not been a dream but reality.","She now had the Tide Rain Mantis that could bring forth a tide with only a small amount of her spiritual power.","Even the Finger Blade Insect that she usually relied on for survival had also evolved to Platinum thanks to the gifts from the figure in the constellations.","When the Finger Blade Insect attached itself to her fingernails now, Peace could easily kill wolves that were skulking the desert for food.","The wolves that hunted in the deserts usually came in packs of three to five and usually were at Gold grade.","In the Broiling Rock Continent, any person who encountered a pack of wolves while searching for water would only have death waiting for him.","Peace had encountered them twice in the past two days.","At first, she had panicked. But eventually, she was able to kill them easily with the Finger Blade Insect attached to her fingernails.","She now had wolf skin and meat as her personal possessions.","Peace instructed the Tide Rain Mantis to clean the gray-brown wolf skin before she stored the cleaned wolf meat inside the teardrop-shaped ring.","Peace could not help but beam broadly when she glimpsed the ring.","Firstly, the person who had gifted her with the ring had given her a chance to continue living. Secondly, the person had solved a doubt that had been plaguing her for years just by using her name.","...","The previously disheveled Peace now wore clothes sewn wolf skin."]},{"number":2035,"title":"Chapter 2035 Pang Luo’s Invitation!","paragraphs":["2035 Pang Luo’s Invitation!","Peace was used to leading a life where she lacked water and was afraid of the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish in the rivers during the monsoon season floods, so she dared not go to collect water from the river.","But now, she had achieved true free access to rainwater.","Peace walked into the drizzle created by the Tide Rain Mantis.","In the time that the Tide Rain Mantis produced the small shower from solidifying elements, Peace had recovered her spiritual power.","!!","Despite wearing wolf skin, Peace did not feel hot at all. Instead, she was extremely comfortable.","Without needing to search for rocks to take shelter under, Peace arrived at the entrance of the city.","Peace’s appearance shocked the entire city.","There were many Rain Masters in the Broiling Rock Continent’s cities. All of them were capable of producing water. This was why they were so respected.","Water was more valuable than any other resource in the Broiling Rock Continent.","One tonne of water could be used to exchange for many spiritual ingredients.","Water did not have any value in a place where water was abundant. But in a place where water was scarce, it was an absolute necessity for survival.","However, most of the Rain Masters from the large cities contracted the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish.","They used their spiritual power to trigger the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish’s glands to produce foul-smelling secretions. When the secretion was distilled, brownish-yellow mucus would sink while the water that had been evaporated would be safe to drink.","If someone drank the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish’s secretions, their body would bloat and produce pus.","During the summer season of the Broiling Rock Continent, any damage to the skin would cause the wound to fester due to the high temperature.","40- to 50-degree weather was a hotbed for bacteria.","The Silver Duck-Mouthed Lungfish will be able to produce 75 kilograms of secretions a day at the very most. After distillation, 60 kilograms of water could be produced.","Even after distillation, the water from the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish would cause regular people to itch all over.","However, there was no way that regular people could survive in the Broiling Rock Continent.","Even spirit qi professionals would feel a certain level of itching after drinking the water from the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish’s secretions.","In the large city, any spirit qi professional with power and resources would not drink the water produced from the Duck-Mouthed Lungfish’s secretions.","However, other feys that could produce water produced too little of it.","Every outstanding Rain Master was almost worshiped in the Broiling Rock Continent’s large cities","The city that Peace had been eyeing for some time was a big mystery to her.","If Lin Yuan walked around the city, he would notice that it was comparable to Phoebe Zhennan City.","The strongest expert in the city only had the Diamond Duck-Mouthed Lungfish.","Peace’s Platinum X/Fantasy Tide Rain Mantis was the most powerful combat power in the city.","The most well-respected Rain Master in the city had contracted the Platinum X/Epic Iron Pole Shield Coconut Tree.","The Platinum X/Epic Iron Pole Shield Coconut Tree could produce 50 fruits each day that were fought over by the factions.","However, compared to the rain around Peace, the Iron Pole Shield Coconut Tree no longer seemed as desirable.","All of the coconuts produced by the Iron Pole Shield Coconut Tree had the issue of being too sweet. One could not quench their thirst by drinking it.","In other continents, the sweeter the coconut, the better.","However, in the Broiling Rock Continent, being overly sweet became a drawback for coconuts.","In the summer season, not even the strongest spirit qi professionals could guarantee that they would have the chance to shower once every week. Even if they did shower, they could only use two buckets of water at most.","Yet, Peace could envelop herself in a 10-meter radius of rain.","The news of Peace’s appearance at the city entrance quickly spread throughout the city.","At that moment, all of the factions were floored.","In a place where water was scarce and danger was abound, people started battles over water. Nonetheless, they were polite with each other in the big picture.","Any spirit qi professional living in the city increased the stability of the city.","When water was at its most scarce during the summer season, wandering packs of wolves joined forces to form an army that attacked the large cities together.","There were many cities that crumbled under the army of wolves because they lacked power.","In order to increase the stability between the spirit qi professionals in the cities, the cities held a weekly Rain Master offering.","During the offering, the spirit qi professionals who did not have water to drink could take something they deemed to be the most valuable to offer to the Rain Masters.","If they were lucky enough for the Rain Masters to agree, the Rain Masters would immediately take the treasures being offered.","In the next week, the Rain Masters would then provide the spirit qi professionals with water.","This method lowered the crime rate in the large cities as the spirit qi professionals would not have to commit crimes out of thirst.","Furthermore, this increased the status of the Rain Masters, who could provide rainwater to exchange for high-quality labor.","Almost anything could be used as an offering in the Broiling Rock Continent.","Even Rain Masters only admired other Rain Masters who were stronger than them but would not think of laying a hand on them.","The stronger the Rain Master, the more experts he would have by his side. This was a long-established culture in the Broiling Rock Continent.","The factions of the city were stepping over each other to greet Peace.","However, there was only one thought in Peace’s mind.","This city was enormous! Here, she would not have to worry about not being able to find shade in the afternoon.","Peace walked through the entrance of the city with her heart pounding.","...","To someone like Peace, who fought for survival in the wilderness every day, large cities were almost sacred.","Peace was about to knock on the city gates when the gates swung open on their own, and out came a throng of spirit qi professionals.","All of the spirit qi professionals were dressed better than Peace, but they were looking at her with admiration.","At that moment, a young man dressed in leather armor stepped forward. He had handsome features.","The young man walked closer to Peace and bowed as he said, “Welcome Lordess Rain Master to Green Continent City! I am the City Lord, Pang Luo. I hope that you will stay in Green Continent City for a few days. If you are pleased with Green Continent City, I thank you on behalf of Green Continent City for choosing to spend time here.”","Rain Masters were leaders in the Green Continent City, while the City Lord and City Guards were nothing more than groups meant to maintain the city’s stability and protect the Rain Masters’ profits."]},{"number":2036,"title":"Chapter 2036 Green Continent Goddess!","paragraphs":["2036 Green Continent Goddess!","If Peace’s rain entered Green Continent City, countless people in the city would be nourished.","Although there were already many Rain Masters in Green Continent City, the city still lacked water.","The size of the pools of the cities in the Broiling Rock Continent depended on the abilities of the Rain Masters to create water.","Once a Rain Master was sufficiently capable of creating water and had a surplus of water, the city would be able to expand and protect even more people, thus increasing their power as well.","Pang Luo assumed that Green Continent City was set up very well.","The people from Green Continent City were generally very kind.","Pang Luo hoped that this girl would acknowledge Green Continent City and begin living here.","This was because he hoped that Green Continent City could improve and become a haven where everyone could be protected.","Additionally, for some reason, he was overwhelmed with emotions when he laid eyes on this girl with short red hair. It was as though a beacon of light had entered his previously bland life.","Peace was very timid around the crowd of people. But at the same time, she put up her guard for fear that the people from the city would harm her.","It was only when she sensed that these people did not mean her any harm that Peace relaxed. Nonetheless, her guard was still as high as ever.","She had almost died once and gained a new dream once she achieved true free access to rainwater.","That dream was to be someone who could be of use to Leo.","After experiencing despair, a person naturally learned how to repay debts.","Peace had been using Thoughts Letter Paper to communicate with the other members of the Astronomical Parliament for the past two days. She now saw them as her family.","During the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan had given Peace enough resources to keep her alive but had not issued any tasks to her.","She found out about the tasks that Lin Yuan had given to the other members of the Astronomical Parliament through her conversations on the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Before Peace arrived at Green Continent City, she tried to come up with a way to build a faction.","In her few encounters with wolf packs, Peace discovered that the alpha wolf had absolute control over the pack.","This was because the alpha wolf was always female and could expand the pack.","Additionally, the alpha of the pack was always the strongest wolf.","Thus, from what she learned from the wolf packs, she knew that she needed to be strong enough in order to provide an endless supply of water and build her faction.","Peace had already achieved both criteria.","She could not produce one wolf after another like the female wolves could to build up the pack.","Thus, the best place to build a faction would be Green Continent City.","Although Peace had not read much, her experience living on the brink between life and death allowed her to easily pick up what motivated humans.","Peace knew that the crowd of people greeting her and the invitation to stay in Green Continent City was because she had a light rain shower enveloping her.","This was the best time for her to demonstrate her might and value.","Peace said softly, “Thank you for your invitation. Since you left your city just to invite me, I should also make a gesture.”","While she spoke, Peace ordered the Tide Rain Mantis to use Leaping Tide.","Given that the Tide Rain Mantis was a Platinum/Fantasy fey, it was easy to control its abilities’ strength.","Since Peace had contracted the Tide Rain Mantis, their thoughts were connected.","The Tide Rain Mantis knew that Peace did not want to attack these people. Thus, it controlled the strength of Leaping Tide to only create a tide.","Peace had used around 20% of the spiritual power in her body.","The water elements around her enlarged, and the thin drizzles of rain turned into bead-sized droplets that formed a curtain of rain around Peace.","The tide rushed toward the door and the over 500 spirit qi professionals standing there.","Almost every spirit qi professional was swept up within the tide.","Peace had enveloped everyone present with one move.","The 10-meter radius of thin drizzle around Peace could produce only ten buckets of water. But the water produced by this tide contained at least 150 tonnes of water.","The tide already surpassed the amount of water that all of the Rain Masters in Green Continent City could collectively produce in a day.","The water from the tide was refreshing without any strange tastes. It was a wonderful source of water.","From the way that the young girl so easily summoned the water, it was likely that it was not difficult for her to do so.","At that moment, everyone in Green Continent City yearned to cling to Peace.","As long as Peace was willing to stay in Green Continent City and continue creating water, with the help of everyone, Green Continent City would become a giant metropolis. They could continuously increase the size of the city to develop unknown regions around the city.","The environment around Green Continent City was unknown to the people within Green Continent City.","There were people who went out and explored during the rainy season. However, none of them had returned.","One of those people was Pang Luo’s father.","After Peace thanked these people for greeting her by demonstrating her power, she walked through the gates of Green Continent City.","She had communicated with Yin Lin and Su Yiren in the past few days.","Luo Lan was still floating down the river as she fled for the border of the Divine Wood Federation and waited for Lin Yuan to rescue her.","All she had on her hands was time.","She had spiraled thinking about her circumstances. The death of her father gave her the urge to flee.","Hence, the bored Luo Lan had been giving lessons to Peace through Thoughts Letter Paper to teach her how to establish a faction.","Previously, she had been too kind in her management of her faction. As a result, Luo Cai had the chance to usurp her.","...","This matter had been plaguing Luo Lan.","Thus, while she was teaching Peace, Luo Lan learned from her own lessons and stressed to Peace that when managing a faction, one had to keep an iron grip over every member of the faction. There was no bigger taboo than being soft-hearted.","Peace greatly improved once she learned this lesson.","Although she was still innocent-minded, she now knew what she had to do in order to manage a faction.","Peace decided to remain quiet and wait while she was in Green Continent City until the people saw her value. It was only then that she would have leverage for negotiations.","Luo Lan, Su Yiren, and Yin Lin’s teachings to Peace enabled a metropolis to rise in the Broiling Rock Continent.","Every family in the city had the statue of the Green Continent Goddess. Regardless of whether one was a new resident or an old one, they all knew that the water they drank came from the Green Continent Goddess.","By this time, Yang Hanxian had arrived at the entrance of Sky Creation and given his first order."]},{"number":2037,"title":"Chapter 2037 Giant Bone Spiny Snake!","paragraphs":["2037 Giant Bone Spiny Snake!","All along the way to Sky Creation’s tree castle, Yang Hanxian was grappling with himself to the point that he even felt suffocated.","Yang Hanxian took several deep breaths, but it did not help.","He dared not go against the Truth Association’s order. Any member of the Truth Association would be able to crush him.","However, Yang Hanxian was also unwilling to make an enemy of a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master.","!!","The Truth Association had become so powerful because they had Class 5 Creation Masters who provided them with Class 5 Creation Master resources.","Yang Sijie barely interacted with the Truth Association and did not understand just how terrifying a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master was.","However, Yang Hanxian was well aware of this.","Hence, given the choice, Yang Hanxian did not want to make an enemy of Sky Creation.","Alas, the Truth Association had already issued their order. If he dared to show a hint of unwillingness, he would not be able to answer to the Truth Association.","He had no choice but to carry out the order of killing two of Sky Creation’s inner members to get a rise out of Sky Creation.","Now, the Truth Association was using him as a lackey to eliminate Sky Creation. Rather, he was testing the waters on their behalf.","It was possible that after he tested the waters and uncovered how exceptional Sky Creation was, they would abandon him and work with Sky Creation instead.","It was likely that with a Class 5 Creation Master, Sky Creation had a large store of the resources the Truth Association needed.","This was Yang Hanxian’s greatest fear.","Once the Truth Association made contact with Sky Creation and got on good terms, the Yang family would lose all value to the Truth Association.","From how Yi Huailong could lead the entire Yi family into Sky Creation’s tree castle, it showed how close the Yi family was with Sky Creation.","He needed to issue the necessary order no matter how conflicted he was.","After Liu Jie handled the spies sent by Su Han, he picked a few of the reserve white-clothed followers who were young, had decent features, and had the most potential to keep them by Lin Yuan’s side by becoming the tree castle’s helpers.","The second day after Lin Yuan returned to the tree castle, he handed out a large number of Bronze/Epic feys.","A few of them had comprehended special Willpower Runes and thus had unique potential when it came to their contraction of feys. As such, Lin Yuan provided them with Bronze/Legend feys.","In a place like the Divine Wood Federation, Bronze/Flawless feys were already treasures to regular people who did not come from reputable families. They dared not dream of obtaining them.","Bronze/Epic feys were of an even higher level than Bronze/Flawless feys.","These people had never even heard of Bronze/Legend feys.","Any regular person would want to change their fate and the reserve white-clothed followers were no exception.","Once they obtained the Bronze/Epic and Bronze/Legend feys, the reserve white-clothed followers were immediately thankful to Liu Jie, who had chosen them, and Lin Yuan, who had given the feys to them.","They now felt a strong sense of belonging to Sky Creation.","Before the white-clothed followers contracted feys, they had all first sworn their loyalties to Liu Jie. As such, they could not be more trustworthy.","Lin Yuan sent most of the reserve white-clothed followers to the marsh world so they could train there.","This was because Wen Yu needed helpers and Lin Yuan had already removed the strong invaders from the territory. Hence, the white-clothed followers would not be in any danger while they trained in the marsh world.","Lin Yuan had given the white-clothed followers feys so quickly because he wanted the World Graces that fell from the feys’ World Cleansings so the spirit qi crystals would increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power.","Besides increasing the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power, Lin Yuan felt that he also needed to accumulate spirit qi crystals.","Spirit qi crystals had been necessary both in the Mother of Bloodbath’s evolution to a Heavenly Family Fey and Begin Lady’s transformation into an intermediate faerie.","If Lin Yuan had any fewer spirit qi crystals, the Mother of Bloodbath and Begin Lady would not have succeeded.","The reserve white-clothed followers who Liu Jie stationed by the door were the two that Liu Jie saw the most potential in.","Neither of them had reached 30 years old but had already comprehended four Willpower Runes.","One of them was affiliated with fire-type power offense-type feys, while the other was affiliated with fey support-type feys.","Both of their fey affiliations were fire-type and were also able to cooperate perfectly during combat.","The two reserve white-clothed followers knew that something big was happening.","They never had the chance to interact with Yang Hanxian in the past, but they recognized the uniforms of the imperial court’s guards.","The imperial court’s guards had appeared numerous times to arrest criminals and drag them back to the imperial court to be tried.","Every time the imperial court’s guards appeared, bloodshed followed.","The two reserve white-clothed followers were already very frightened of the Yang family’s troops.","Only an important member of the Yang family could lead the guards here.","The imperial court’s guards had already summoned their main feys and went into their battle stances.","In the midst of their fear, the two reserve white-clothed followers heard Liu Jie say, “Once you become white-clothed followers, you won’t have to be afraid of any faction. You’ll be able to take on any faction.”","Because of what Liu Jie said, the two reserve white-clothed followers fought their fear and said, “Sky Creation is no longer accepting any orders! If you still need to, you can come early tomorrow to queue!”","The two reserve white-clothed followers knew that they needed to have the proper demeanor of people who guarded the entrance of Sky Creation’s tree castle.","Yang Hanxian decided that he would start his massacre with these two helpers.","He felt that these two door-watchers should have the lowest rank in Sky Creation.","He did not think that Sky Creation could make an enemy of the Yang family over the deaths of two helpers.","It was even possible that if he showed the proper attitude, he could even build a bridge with Sky Creation and begin working together.","Yang Hanxian did not reply to the two reserve white-clothed followers. Instead, he narrowed his eyes and gently waved his hands."]},{"number":2038,"title":"Chapter 2038 Release Yourself! Decay Body Flesh Ginseng!","paragraphs":["2038 Release Yourself! Decay Body Flesh Ginseng!","Two of the imperial guards who stood at the back of the group ordered their main feys, the Giant Bone Spiny Snake, to flick out their bladed tongues.","The Giant Bone Spiny Snake was specially cross-bred by the Yang family’s two pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters using several snake-species feys.","It needed to consume a large amount of lifeforms’ marrow in order to increase its power.","It did not have a great need for spirit qi, making it easy to nurture.","!!","Due to the appearance of the Giant Bone Spiny Snake, the imperial guards formed the Giant Bone Spiny Snake Guard Team.","Every imperial guard of the Giant Bone Spiny Snake Guard Team had contracted the Giant Bone Spiny Snake and only the Giant Bone Spiny Snake. Every member of that team had at least three of the Giant Bone Spiny Snakes.","Although it was easy to nurture the Giant Bone Spiny Snake, it was not weak at all. In fact, its tongue blade could even roll grades to fight.","Nonetheless, the Giant Bone Spiny Snake was not without its flaws.","It needed half a day to grow one of its tongue blades.","Spitting out their tongue blades was their only way of fighting from a distance.","Once it spat out its tongue blade, it had no choice other than close-quarter combat.","However, the Giant Bone Spiny Snake was very weak at close-quarter combat and could not stand toe-to-toe with other feys of the same grade.","The two imperial guards who were about to attack were the assistants of the Giant Bone Spiny Snake Guard Team. The power of their snakes had reached Suzerain X/pinnacle Myth II.","The tongue blades the Giant Bone Spiny Snake shot out were venomous and could even kill Suzerain/Myth III feys.","Everything happened in the blink of an eye.","The spies from Sacred Forest City’s factions, as well as the onlookers, assumed that this was the end for these two helpers.","Yet, when the Giant Bone Spiny Snakes’ tongue blades were about to make contact with the two helpers, two fleshy roots burrowed out the tree castle’s door.","The two fleshy roots were like tentacles that caught the two tongue blades in the air.","With slight movement from the roots, the roots immediately crushed the two tongue blades.","The sight was bizarre. It did not seem as though the fleshy roots caught the tongue blades to protect the helpers. Rather, it seemed more as though the tongue blades were food for the fleshy roots.","After eating, the fleshy roots appeared visibly satisfied.","The appearance of the fleshy roots caused Yang Hanxian’s eyes to widen.","From the fleshy roots’ aura, Yang Hanxian could be certain that it was a sacred source lifeform.","With the Truth Association’s help, Yang Hanxian had contracted a sacred source lifeform. It was this sacred source lifeform that made Yang Hanxian decide to follow the Truth Association.","But the more he came to learn about the Truth Association, Yang Hanxian had changed from wanting to follow them to having no choice but to listen to their commands.","Yang Hanxian was not shocked by the fact that the fleshy roots could be a sacred source lifeform.","It was normal for a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master to have a sacred source lifeform.","Since he was here as the Truth Association’s lackey, his order that led to the Giant Bone Spiny Snake Guard Team attacking was just him carrying out the Truth Association’s order.","Yang Hanxian waited for the owner of the fleshy roots to walk out of the tree castle so he could establish contact.","The spies from Sacred Forest City’s factions never expected Yang Hanxian to attack Sky Creation’s helpers the moment he arrived.","Could it be that after eliminating the Su and Bai families, the Yang family was going to deal with Sky Creation now?","No faction in Sacred Forest City wanted to make an enemy of Sky Creation.","The Yang family was the head of the imperial court and ruled the entire Divine Wood Federation.","All of the factions in Sacred Forest City had to keep their heads low around the Yang family.","This was especially so after the Yang family revealed the claws they had kept retracted for years.","Even if the clash between the Yang family and Sky Creation did not manage to produce a victor, Sky Creation would no longer be willing to work with the Yang family to trade for high-class Creation Master resources due to the grudge between them.","At this time, no faction dared to take the risk of getting on the Yang family’s wrong side.","However, every faction could tell that Sky Creation was the kind of faction that took care of their own.","When Sky Creation first rooted their tree castle in the business district, someone had spoken out of turn in the tree castle and caused trouble. As a result, he had lost his life.","The Yang family did not have any Class 5 Creation Masters.","Weren’t they afraid that killing two of Sky Creation’s helpers so publicly would bring the vengeance of Sky Creation’s Class 5 Creation Master down on them?","While the faction’s spies were all sharing this thought, a figure dressed in a black robe walked out of the tree castle.","It was clear that the fleshy roots were coming from under the black robe.","In the eyes of the Su family, the Class 5 Creation Master Di Wanmi was an irreplaceable core of Sky Creation.","But in reality, Di Wanmi was nothing more than a tool in Sky Creation. She was nothing more than a product of one of Red Thorn’s abilities.","Red Thorn had stationed Di Wanmi at the entrance of the tree castle so she could react immediately when anything happened.","When Di Wanmi stepped in to block the two Giant Bone Spiny Snakes’ tongue blades and protected the two reserve white-clothed followers, Lin Yuan was immediately informed.","Now, there were at least 200 of the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths that Liu Jie sent out in Sacred Forest City.","The Lonely Night Hurricane Moths had powerful blocking abilities. They were able to hide perfectly in the wind while moving at high-speed.","The Lonely Night Hurricane Moths had found out early on that the Yang family was leading troops to siege Sky Creation’s tree castle.","However, neither Lin Yuan nor Liu Jie had predicted that the Yang family would attack immediately upon arrival.","They had not even had the time to touch the Yang family yet, but the Yang family had already struck first.","If that was the case, he did not need to continue being polite. He promptly gave the order to open fire.","After Red Thorn gave Di Wanmi the order, Di Wanmi was immediately filled with unexplainable excitement and expectations.","...","The Tongue of Relinquish controlled her thoughts, spirit, and soul.","Di Wanmi had not fed the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng at all.","Red Thorn’s order allowed Di Wanmi to know that the time to eat had come.","In a fit of excitement, Di Wanmi removed her black robe, and a gruesome smile appeared on her scar-filled face.","She placed her hand on her chest as she croaked, “Release yourself! Decay Body Flesh Ginseng!”"]},{"number":2039,"title":"Chapter 2039 Attacking Ginseng Roots!","paragraphs":["2039 Attacking Ginseng Roots!","It could be said that all factions, including the Yang family, were very curious about Sky Creation’s members.","Di Wanmi was a familiar face to the Su family that had been eliminated, but she was a complete stranger to the other families.","When the other factions entered the tree castle to trade, they mostly dealt with Liu Jie and Lin Yuan.","Sky Creation had sent out such a strong expert to block the Yang family’s Giant Bone Spiny Snake’s tongue blades from killing the two helpers.","This was enough to tell what Sky Creation’s internal structure was like.","All the faction spies, as well as Yang Hanxian, were curiously surveying the black-robed Di Wanmi so they could understand what stance Sky Creation was taking on the Yang family’s provocation.","However, the black-robed figure removed her robe and revealed a face that would give rise to goosebumps to anyone who saw it.","Even the most open-minded person would not be able to bring themselves to be attracted to such a face.","The Tongue of Relinquish’s penetration of a target to take control of the host was very different from when the strange plant had invaded Ji Feng.","Ji Feng was living and breathing, and the strange plant had been a parasite in his body. He still retained control over his actions and thoughts.","Nonetheless, his face had been covered with small scars that made it uncomfortable to look at his face.","But now, with Red Thorn’s Tongue of Relinquish’s tongue tip inside Di Wanmi’s body, it could be said that every scar was a part of the Tongue of Relinquish’s tongue tip.","The protruding scars spread across every inch of Di Wanmi’s bloodless skin, releasing distinct ringing noises.","Di Wanmi was still wearing the long black dress she had worn while she was alive.","Besides her face, her hands were also exposed.","Many moving ginseng roots had burst out from her hands and seemed to be continuously searching the air.","Di Wanmi placed her left hand over her chest and croaked, “Release yourself! Decay Body Flesh Ginseng!”","The fleshy ginseng roots on Di Wanmi’s left hand retracted into her body while the ginseng roots on her right hand extended to wrap around the members of the Yang family.","Di Wanmi had pinnacle Immortal feys and was considered a pinnacle thearch-class expert. In terms of power, she was on par with Yang Hanxian.","Although Yang Hanxian had already summoned his main fey the Iris Wood Vine Dragon, which had released many vines to clash against Di Wanmi’s fleshy ginseng roots, he was unable to protect all of the guards behind him.","As a result, many of the ginseng roots managed to wrap around the imperial guards as well as their feys. Among those caught were the two Giant Bone Spiny Snake assistants and their feys that had shot out their tongue blades.","The ginseng roots appeared soft but could actually break apart radium boards with ease.","The fleshy roots pierced the bodies of the captured targets, who then became part of Di Wanmi’s meal.","Most of the ginseng roots from Di Wanmi’s right hand were battling with the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s vines.","Yang Hanxian had not expected Sky Creation’s expert to attack him so mercilessly over his attempt on the two helpers’ lives.","He saw this as an insult to the Yang family.","Many of the imperial guards had been killed, and one of them had even been a direct descendant of the Yang family.","As a result, Yang Hanxian’s losses were great.","With the blood feud formed, there was no hope for reparations.","Thus, Yang Hanxian decided to stop holding back.","Although the Iris Wood Vine Dragon was a dragon-species fey, it had the weakest power amongst all of the main-dragon-species feys.","However, not every fey depended on itself to fight.","When the Iris Wood Vine Dragon evolved into the main-dragon-species fey, many Iris Wood Dragon Birds started living on its body, forming a symbiotic relationship.","The Iris Wood Vine Dragon provided them with food while the Iris Wood Dragon Birds protected it.","Although it was a symbiotic relationship, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds had not formed contracts with Yang Hanxian and were usually not under his control.","But now that the Iris Wood Vine Dragon had been attacked, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds all entered battle mode.","Since the Iris Wood Dragon Birds shared their abilities and roots with the Iris Wood Vine Dragon, they had comparable power.","The beak of the Iris Wood Dragon Bird was a very precious resource.","It was very rare to see wood-type spiritual ingredients being sharper than metal-type spiritual ingredients when both were of the same grade.","If the Iris Wood Vine Dragon could reach Eternal, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds would also be able to reach Eternal.","The beaks of the Iris Wood Dragon Birds would then become one of the ten-most precious wood-type spiritual ingredients.","The Iris Wood Dragon Birds violently pecked the roots of the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng. Every attack broke off a piece of the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng’s roots.","The Iris Wood Dragon Birds’ assault caused visible damage to the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng’s roots.","Yet, Yang Hanxian could not bring himself to smile because this round of attacks made him aware of how sturdy the fleshy roots were.","The Iris Wood Dragon Birds could only use their beaks to break off pieces of the ginseng roots when they used their exclusive skill.","Given his store of spiritual power, it would not be difficult for him to enable all of the ginseng roots to be pecked off.","However, the fleshy roots he was seeing before him were only coming from the strange girl’s right palm.","At that moment, the strange girl’s body started to bloat and become distended.","It could not be easy for her left hand to release roots continuously.","At that moment, Yang Hanxian noticed many fleshy roots emerging from the seven orifices on Di Wanmi’s body.","Eventually, the fleshy roots burst out from her back.","Previously, the fleshy roots had been brown. But now, they were all bright crimson.","Before its death, the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng had been a 7 Stars sacred source lifeform. Thus, it had three abilities.","The first ability, Ginseng Roots Accept Intelligence, allowed Di Wanmi to gain the knowledge of the target’s spirit and soul after the ginseng roots entered a target’s body and destroyed their spirit and soul. The knowledge and experience would then be accumulated to aid her.","...","This ability had been the key to Di Wanmi finding the path to becoming a Class 5 Creation Master."]},{"number":2040,"title":"Chapter 2040 The Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Bird!","paragraphs":["2040 The Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Bird!","The second ability was called Withered Ginseng Continuous Rain and allowed Di Wanmi to absorb the vitality from her environment to nourish herself when she was about to run out of vitality.","At that moment, Di Wanmi used the flesh of the imperial guards to continuously repair the roots that the Iris Wood Dragon Birds had damaged.","The Decay Body Flesh Ginseng’s third ability was called Blood Flesh Battery. It allowed the ginseng roots to fuse with targets with the same source of energy. It would be able to use the energy in the target’s body to replenish its own energy, lifespan, and spiritual energy. It could even use the energy in the target to defend against lethal attacks.","After the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng fused with Di Wanmi, she inherited the three abilities.","Once the Tongue of Relinquish controlled Di Wanmi, she shared the same root energy with Red Thorn. Thus, she could draw energy from Red Thorn using her fleshy roots.","Red Thorn was a furnace of flesh.","Every day, while it slept, it consumed a large amount of Class 5 dimensional lifeforms and metal-type spiritual ingredients.","Di Wanmi had already used the many flesh roots to replenish her blood energy and increase her attacking power.","Since Di Wanmi had chosen to drain the energy from the Mouth of Relinquish, the blood energy made the fleshy roots stronger, more agile, and have greater attacking power.","Numerous ginseng roots shot toward the Iris Wood Vine Dragon.","As the fleshy roots coiled and pulsated, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds could not find anywhere to land to peck at the ginseng roots.","Under Di Wanmi’s wild assault, Yang Hanxian was already stretched thin and completely incapable of protecting the imperial guards behind him.","In less than a minute, the imperial guards who had lost Yang Hanxian’s protection, as well as their main feys, all fell prey to Di Wanmi.","When Yang Hanxian came to Sky Creation’s tree castle, he brought almost half of the imperial guards in order to show that he was taking the Truth Association’s order seriously.","The death of almost 1,000 imperial guards had scared the wits out of the spies.","When Yang Hanxian attacked Sky Creation’s two helpers, the spies did not expect Sky Creation to retaliate in such a manner.","It could be said that half of the Yang family’s best combat power had died due to this abrupt occurrence.","At first, all of the faction spies wanted to avoid working with Sky Creation for the time being to prevent insulting the Yang family.","But now, their minds had changed completely.","Rather than caring about what the Yang family thought, it would be better to try to come up with a way to butter up Sky Creation and side with them.","Yang Hanxian was the most powerful combatant the Yang family had, but even he did not seem as terrifying as this girl.","This horrifying girl with bizarre features seemed to have no intention of going easy on Yang Hanxian.","Could it be that this girl intended to kill Yang Hanxian?","If she did kill Yang Hanxian, it was highly likely that the Yi family, who had entered Sky Creation’s tree castle long ago, would be entering the imperial court to become the new rulers of the Divine Wood Federation.","Yang Hanxian had the pinnacle Immortal Iris Wood Vine Dragon, which had been produced using Class 4 Creation Master resources.","A fey produced through Class 4 Creation Masters would have a much worse foundation than one produced through Class 5 Creation Master resources.","Previously, Di Wanmi’s foundation had been inferior as well.","But ever since Red Thorn’s Tongue of Relinquish took control of her, Lin Yuan’s Class 5 Creation Master resources elevated her foundation day by day.","Thus, the stalemate did not last long before Yang Hanxian realized that he was no match for Di Wanmi.","In order for the fleshy roots to consume Yang Hanxian, the Iris Wood Vine Dragon, and Iris Wood Dragon Bird as soon as possible, Di Wanmi summoned the Dark Lightning Spike Shell.","After the Dark Lightning Spike Shell was summoned, the sky was filled with flashes of dark purple lightning.","The lightning caused the spies to go numb in an instant.","As the lightning crackled, they felt as though white ants were tunneling into their bodies and gnawing at their flesh from the inside.","The Dark Lightning Spike Shell produced lightning of three different colors that turned black as they intensified.","Yang Hanxian knew that if the lightning struck the Iris Wood Vine Dragon, it would immediately be paralyzed.","At that time, the crimson fleshy roots would be able to pierce the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s body and end up meeting the same fate that the Giant Bone Spiny Snakes had.","Yang Hanxian had other feys but had invested almost all of his resources into the Iris Wood Vine Dragon. His other feys had not even reached Immortal.","If he summoned them now, not only would they be of no help, but their deaths would even damage his spiritual energy and affect his ability to command the Iris Wood Vine Dragon.","Yang Hanxian did not naively believe that this female expert created by Sky Creation would be joking about killing him.","Up till now, the members of the Truth Association had not stepped in to help him yet.","In order for him to survive, he could only rely on his own power.","With this thought, Yang Hanxian activated his sacred source lifeform.","In an instant, faint green pools of light appeared on his body.","The green pools of light landed on the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds, and their auras were significantly raised.","The three black bolts of lightning struck the Iris Wood Vine Dragon but did not affect it.","With the aid of the green pools of light, the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds clashed against the fleshy roots again, entering another stalemate.","Lin Yuan had been standing by a window in the tree castle as he looked down at everything happening right outside the tree castle.","Lin Yuan was nonchalant when he saw Yang Hanxian summon the Iris Wood Vine Dragon.","It was common to see a fey like the Iris Wood Vine Dragon that had transformed from a flood dragon into a main-dragon-species fey. Such feys existed in the Radiance Federation as well.","The pinnacle Immortal Iris Wood Vine Dragon should be able to provide him with a large dragon liver.","The Iris Wood Dragon Birds’ beaks would also be useful as spiritual ingredients. However, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds had not evolved to Eternal, so their beaks had not crystallized. Thus, they could not be of great help.","Given Lin Yuan’s experience and power, he could easily discern the extent of Yang Hanxian’s power.","If the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds were nurtured with sufficient Creation Master resources, their combat power could be increased by 2.5 times.","But when Yang Hanxian used his sacred source lifeform, a look of surprise appeared on Lin Yuan’s face.","...","Lin Yuan was not shocked that Yang Hanxian had a sacred source lifeform but that its abilities were above average."]},{"number":2041,"title":"Chapter 2041 Request for a Meal!","paragraphs":["2041 Request for a Meal!","Yang Hanxian was the head of the Yang family, and the Yang family was the ruling family of the Divine Wood Federation.","It should be easy for him to obtain a sacred source lifeform.","The challenge when it came to sacred source lifeforms was that they were difficult to contract.","The cleansing of souls was a Class 5 Creation Master ability.","!!","It was likely that the faction secretly supporting the Yang family was the reason for Yang Hanxian being able to form a marrow contract with a sacred source lifeform.","What Lin Yuan was truly surprised by was that Yang Hanxian’s sacred source lifeform had such strong abilities.","The strength of Yang Hanxian’s sacred source lifeform was purely from a support standpoint. It might even be stronger than Liu Yifan’s Gem Witch.","[Sacred Source Name]: Forest Green Mayfly","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 2 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Wood","Abilities:","[Elemental Enhancement]: Choose a fey and touch it in the eighth way. It will start to evolve alongside the fey’s attribute. When it boosts a fey of the same type, it can multiply the fey’s store of elements and the activity of the elements.","Any fey that fought with elements would be able to multiply its combat power once the store of elements in its body was multiplied.","Increasing the activity of the elements would increase the speed of the elemental abilities and enable the fey to use its abilities and exclusive skills quicker.","The Forest Green Mayfly was currently only 2 Stars, but it could already significantly increase the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds’ combat power.","Once the Forest Green Mayfly’s Stars were increased, the effects of Elemental Enhancement would become even stronger.","It was clear that the Forest Green Mayfly had picked the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and touched it in the eighth way.","Its own attributes and the Iris Wood Vine Dragon had both evolved.","If the Forest Green Mayfly had picked a fey of another type. its own type would change.","It could be said that no one who contracted the Forest Green Mayfly would find it useless.","Yang Hanxian was lucky to have contracted such a sacred source lifeform.","However, Di Wanmi had fused with the 7 Stars Decay Body Flesh Ginseng and high-stars sacred source lifeform could exert strong pressure on low-stars sacred source lifeform.","Despite using the Forest Green Mayfly to support the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds, he would eventually lose to Di Wanmi.","As Lin Yuan looked out the window, he was quietly observing how the events were unfolding.","Yang Hanxian had just eliminated the Su and Bai families and was at a key juncture where he needed to muster control.","He would not be able to take over all of the Su and Bai families’ resources in just one or two days.","Given that he was still willing to attack Sky Creation at such a time, it was likely that he was receiving help from the Truth Association. Otherwise, he would never dare to anger a faction with a Class 5 Creation Master.","The armor made of the Peaceful Calm Air Moss that the Su family’s experts wore allowed the Yang family to understand the difference between Class 5 Creation Master resources and Class 4 Creation Master resources.","The Yang family had not interacted with Sky Creation yet, but they must have already investigated Sky Creation.","Lin Yuan was curious about how the Truth Association had managed to convince the Yang family to attack Sky Creation.","The people from the Truth Association were hiding behind the Yang family.","If Yang Hanxian was at risk of being killed by Di Wanmi, the people from the Truth Association would not sit by and let that happen.","The Truth Association had to have a reason for taking control of the Yang family. If Yang Hanxian died, the Truth Association’s reason would fall through.","At that moment, Lin Yuan saw that Red Thorn had landed on his shoulder.","It used its small hands to cuddle his face as it sniffed his scent lovingly and said, “Lin Yuan, Di Wanmi has made a request to me. She really wants to eat that old man’s sacred source lifeform.”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Di Wanmi and the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng were in a special state. Both of them had been pieced together by the tip of the Tongue of Relinquish.","In this state, it could not be said that Di Wanmi was the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng’s contractor.","The two had fused together and the entity was a monster that was half spirit qi professional and half sacred source lifeform.","The Forest Green Mayfly had to be beneficial to Di Wanmi for her to want to consume it.","“Red Thorn, what benefits will Di Wanmi receive when she eats the Forest Green Mayfly?”","After the Forest Green Mayfly died, it would leave a part of its body that could be used to turn into a precious instrument.","As a Class 5 Creation Master, Di Wanmi could forge precious instruments.","Yi Huailu was close to becoming a Class 5 Creation Master.","Hence, the bodies of low-stars sacred source lifeforms were useful resources to Lin Yuan.","If the Forest Green Mayfly could not bring significant benefits to Di Wanmi, it would be better to turn it into a precious instrument instead.","Di Wanmi was now Red Thorn’s puppet that was controlled through the Tongue of Relinquish.","Red Thorn had full awareness of Di Wanmi’s situation.","“Lin Yuan, the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng is able to consume everything. The Decay Body Flesh Ginseng can try to consume living sacred source lifeforms of the same type. The Forest Green Mayfly is only 2 Stars. There’s no way the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng will fail at eating it. After it’s eaten, there’s a definite chance that the Decay Body Flesh Ginseng will gain part of the Forest Green Mayfly’s ability.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up.","According to what Red Thorn said, the Forest Green Mayfly would be able to boost other feys of the same type once Di Wanmi used the fleshy roots to consume the Forest Green Mayfly! This would increase Di Wanmi’s combat abilities.","Lin Yuan did not see Di Wanmi as a combat-class spirit qi professional, but only as a Class 5 Creation Master.","As a Class 5 Creation Master, Di Wanmi was irreplaceable.","...","Thus, Lin Yuan felt that it was a great deal to use resources to trade for an increase in Di Wanmi’s strategic significance.","Compared to subordinates like Ding Chengshuo and Yi Huailong who had sworn their loyalties to him, using Red Thorn to control Di Wanmi was much more reliable.","“Red Thorn, tell Di Wanmi to swallow the Forest Green Mayfly! She can eat the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Iris Wood Dragon Birds too. However, she has to leave the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s liver and essence blood, and the Iris Wood Dragon Bird’s eyes and beaks.”","Red Thorn communicated the response to Di Wanmi.","Delight spread across Di Wanmi’s face.","She had been starving herself but now, she could finally fill her belly.","She consumed the flesh of lifeforms and did not care for the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s essence blood and liver or the Iris Wood Dragon Birds’ eyes and beaks."]},{"number":2042,"title":"Chapter 2042 Save Me, Lord Envoy!","paragraphs":["2042 Save Me, Lord Envoy!","With Red Thorn’s permission, Di Wanmi now saw Yang Hanxian, the Iris Wood Vine Dragon, and Iris Wood Dragon Birds as its food.","The roots shot out of Di Wanmi’s right hand even more rapidly.","When the roots tangled themselves in the air, they formed the shape of a large fleshy ginseng.","While Di Wanmi was attacking, all of the imperial guards that Yang Hanxian brought and their feys had their energy drained by the ginseng. They withered and were reduced to dust.","!!","All that was left was their armor made of spiritual ingredients that fell to the ground with dull clangs.","It could be said that Di Wanmi’s combat style went beyond the comprehension of the spirit qi professionals present.","From all angles, Di Wanmi was like a monster.","Although she only targeted Yang Hanxian, the faction spies who were watching all felt chills go up their spines. Many of them were already too afraid to stay to continue gathering information.","Regardless, the only option they had was to butter up to Sky Creation and do everything they could not to get on Sky Creation’s wrong side.","The stalemate lasted for less than half an hour before a crimson root grabbed one of the drained Iris Wood Dragon Birds.","The seemingly soft ginseng pierced the Iris Wood Dragon Bird as though it was a needle. The ginseng roots started to divide endlessly.","The newly divided ginseng roots were like starving beasts that gobbled up the Iris Wood Dragon Bird’s flesh.","The Iris Wood Dragon Bird was not large—its wingspan was only around 50 centimeters.","The small Iris Wood Dragon Bird was quickly emptied out by the starving roots.","Once it was injured, the already drained Iris Wood Dragon Bird started to move even slower.","The roots entwined around each other in the Iris Wood Dragon Bird’s body, forming a tumor that took up 1/3 of the space in the Iris Wood Dragon Bird’s body.","The Iris Wood Dragon Bird soon drew its last breath in the river of roots that had conquered its body.","The roots delivered the Iris Wood Dragon Bird’s eyes and beaks to Di Wanmi as though they were fragile treasures.","After the first Iris Wood Dragon Bird died, the second and third fell quickly.","Yang Hanxian had been using the Forest Green Mayfly to support the Iris Wood Vine Dragon. However, the Iris Wood Dragon Birds were the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s method of attacking.","Yang Hanxian did not want to see the last Iris Wood Dragon Bird go down as well.","Setting aside the resources he had invested into nurturing the Iris Wood Dragon Birds, he would lose his control over the Yang family once the last Iris Wood Dragon Bird died.","There were two other Immortal experts besides Yang Hanxian. One of their main feys had reached Sovereign VIII/Immortal VII.","Without the Iris Wood Dragon Birds, the Iris Wood Vine Dragon would not be able to defeat this Immortal expert’s main fey.","With this thought, Yang Hanxian hurriedly instructed the Forest Green Mayfly to use half of its energy to use Elemental Enhancement on the last Iris Wood Dragon Bird.","The Forest Green Mayfly was a 2 Stars sacred source lifeform and had limited abilities.","In a battle between top experts, the slightest of mistakes would change the course of the battle.","When the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s aura weakened, Di Wanmi saw an opening, and many fleshy roots pierced through the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and started to consume the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s muscles and flesh, until they reached its organs.","The fleshy roots did not immediately consume the organs. Instead, they formed a net that protected the organs and whipped the heart to increase the heart rate and stimulate the production of essence blood.","Yang Hanxian let out a sorrowful groan when he sensed the Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s situation.","As the head of the imperial court, Yang Hanxian had decided to kneel to the Truth Association and abandon the honor of the imperial court.","The main reason for doing so was his fear of death.","At that moment, he could clearly sense that he was a hair’s breadth away from death.","Yang Hanxian could not help but circulate the remainder of spiritual power in his body and shrieked in the direction of the imperial court, “Lord Envoy! Save me!”","Half of Sacred Forest City heard the full-powered roar of this pinnacle Immortal expert.","Yang Hanxian’s roar not only shocked the faction spies but also caused them to frown.","Who was the Lord Envoy that Yang Hanxian was screaming for?","As the ruler of the Divine Wood Federation, Yang Hanxian’s cry for help not only blemished the Yang family’s might but was also humiliating for the entire Divine Wood Federation.","Numerous faction spies did not believe that the Yang family had the power to eliminate the Su and Bai families.","But since the Yang family had succeeded, it seemed that it was related to the Lord Envoy who Yang Hanxian had just cried out to.","Attacking the Su and Bai families was considered an internal conflict amongst the upper echelon and should not be solved by the involvement of external forces. This was an unspoken rule that every federation needed to uphold.","Yet, the Yang family had sought out external forces to help to take out the Bai and Su families. As a result, the Divine Wood Federation’s power had decreased by half.","How could the Divine Wood Federation match up to the Iron Hammer Federation and Great Lush Federation?","The Iron Hammer Federation was facing the threat of starvation, and the savages were willing to do anything just for a mouthful of food.","Inside the tree castle, Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu observed the situation unfolding outside.","When Yang Hanxian sent people to cause trouble, both of them were over the moon.","The Yi family could only move up when the Yang family and Sky Creation engaged in an all-out war.","Although both of them had sworn their loyalty to Lin Yuan, they had their own schemes in mind.","After Ding Chengshuo swore his loyalty to Lin Yuan, he still looked out for the Ding family while he carried out tasks on Lin Yuan’s behalf.","When Di Wanmi killed the first Iris Wood Dragon Bird, Yi Huailu and Yi Huailong knew that there was no turning back.","The Yi family was about to usher in their brightest era.","Previously, they were at the bottom of the four major families.","Neither Yi Huailu nor Yi Huailong ever imagined that they would ever enter the imperial court.","At that moment, Yi Huailu and Yi Huailong were once again reassured that their decision to join Sky Creation and become loyal to Lin Yuan was the right one.","...","In spite of both of their excitement for the Yi family’s future, both of them could not help but feel insulted when they heard Yang Hanxian cry out for help.","At that moment, Liu Jie and Lin Yuan furrowed their brows.","This was because four auras stronger than that of Yang Hanxian appeared in the imperial court in the distance."]},{"number":2043,"title":"Chapter 2043 Injured Goddess of Mercy!","paragraphs":["2043 Injured Goddess of Mercy!","Layers of waves rolled and crashed against an island made of stacked crystals.","As the waves washed the edges of the island, the crystals there were smoother than the rest.","As sunlight fell on the island, the crystals absorbed the sunlight and refracted rays of light.","Two girls with fishtails peeking out of their long skirts were using brushes with animal hair bristles to scrub the blue moss growing on the surface of the island.","While the two girls were scrubbing, they looked extremely serious. It was as though they would be punished if they did not scrub all of the moss off.","Once they scrubbed all of the moss off, one of the girls said quietly to another girl, “Ah Jing, do you think that things have been strange recently? The Goddess of Mercy hasn’t punished any servant in the past month. In the past, at least ten servants were sunk to the bottom of the ocean to feed the sharks monthly.”","The girl who was about to stand nodded and replied, “It’s true, Ah Ying! The Goddess of Mercy hasn’t lost her temper at all this past month! When we were washing the coral near the bottom of the island, we were late by half an hour and delayed the Goddess of Mercy’s afternoon swimming time. In the past, we should have lost our lives.","“Do you think that something happy has happened to the Goddess of Mercy? Previously, Lord Qian Yu visited twice weekly. He was the Goddess of Mercy’s favored expert, and there’s a rumor that he died in the Radiance Federation. The Goddess of Mercy should be angry. Why is she happy? It’s so strange!”","While the two girls were talking, an elderly voice said, “Ah Jing, Ah Ying, both of you should focus on working and gossiping less about the Goddess of Mercy. You should be grateful that she lets you live because she’s in a good mood! Her mood is very volatile so be careful I don’t complain to her about you two!”","Ah Jing and Ah Ning stiffened when they heard the elderly voice and hurriedly replied, “Grandma Coral, we are already done with our work here! We will head down to the bottom of the island to scrub the coral there now! We promise we will watch our mouths!”","The elderly woman shot them a glare and responded, “I brought the two of you up. I hope the day doesn’t come when both of you disappear from this island. Go and work now! In another half an hour, the Goddess of Mercy will be done sunbathing and will be heading into the sea to swim.”","There was a mansion that resembled a palace in the center of the island, and there was a source of power within the castle.","Seven waterfalls were rushing out from within the mansion that washed over the building, causing half of the castle to be covered by water.","There was a large wind chime made of coral at the front of the castle. The entire wind chime was ten-meters-tall.","At the bottom of the wind chime hung fairy source-type lifeforms that had been turned into toys.","As the wind chime spun, the fairies’ wings opened and closed, producing almost no sound.","Nonetheless, there were almost 1,000 fairy source-type lifeforms so the sound was clear and very pleasant.","However, the people on the island who served the Goddess of Mercy trembled with fear when they heard the wind chime.","The Goddess of Mercy sat on her throne enveloped in water currents.","She stretched out her hand and took out a small beautiful fish.","She placed the fish in the currents around her, quickly agitated the water, and sat back to admire how the currently happy fish was about to drown in the currents within two minutes.","There were young girls with fishtails wearing long dresses that delivered tanks of these beautiful fish every day.","Once the Goddess of Mercy was done sunbathing, only half of the fishes survived.","At that moment, the Goddess of Mercy heard a terrified female voice from outside the mansion. “Goddess of Mercy! The Mirror God is here to see you! Do you—”","Before the voice could finish speaking, the Goddess of Mercy extended her slender finger and gently flicked the dead fish.","The gold and red fish turned into a gold and red streak that shot in the direction of the voice.","There was a low groan followed by the sound of fluids quickly splattering on the ground.","A man with long gold hair that reached his calves strode in.","The man had a feeble face that exuded weakness. It was as though the smallest gust of wind would knock him over.","But once the man appeared, the Goddess of Mercy frowned.","“Mirror God, you’re still the same whenever you visit my mansion. You enter without even greeting me!”","The Mirror God said coldly, “Goddess of Mercy, stop targeting Na Na and Li Yang. She is going to awaken her birth horoscope eventually and start walking down heaven’s path. At that time, she will become a Class 6 Creation Master. It won’t be helpful to the Freedom Federation’s unity if you keep targeting her.”","The Goddess of Mercy said mockingly, “When has the Freedom Federation ever been united? If the Freedom Federation is united, why did the deep sea mermaids I supported below the island disappear when I managed to break through in the Freedom Federation’s sea? Haven’t I awoken my birth horoscope, started walking down the heaven’s path, and become a Class 5 Creation Master? Mirror God, your double standard disgusts me!”","The Mirror God did not waste time talking to the Goddess of Mercy and flipped his hair to send it flying toward the Goddess of Mercy.","The Goddess of Mercy flicked her tail, and the water currents around her immediately turned gold and red.","The gold and red water currents made contact with the golden hair.","However, the long hair transformed into two mirrors.","At the instant that the two mirrors cracked, the sound of two mirrors breaking appeared next to the Goddess of Mercy.","The golden hair continued to shoot toward the Goddess of Mercy.","At that moment, the Goddess of Mercy’s furious eyes turned into pools of water.","“Mirror God, don’t force me to use the Tanabata River of Desire!”","The Tanabata River of Desire was clearly already protecting the Goddess of Mercy.","The Tanabata River of Desire’s nine currents encircled the Goddess of Mercy and looked like a gossamer vest that she was wearing.","It did not protect the Goddess of Mercy as per her expectation.","The Mirror God’s golden hair was set aflame with silver flames.","The silver flames pierced through the Tanabata River of Desire in an instant and struck the Goddess of Mercy.","Although the Goddess of Mercy gnashed her teeth, she could not stop herself from letting out a low whimper"]},{"number":2044,"title":"Chapter 2044 The Puppy-Dog Crocodile!","paragraphs":["2044 The Puppy-Dog Crocodile!","The Goddess of Mercy could sense that the attack had caused a crack to appear in her birth horoscope.","The Goddess of Mercy’s eyes were like deep oceans with endless rolling waves.","“Mirror God, you have set your spirit fire alight!”","Devil tattoos appeared on the Goddess of Mercy’s face.","!!","Four long horns sprouted from the Goddess of Mercy’s head and intertwined.","At that moment, the Mirror God said, “Goddess of Mercy, this is my lesson for you. If Big Brother came instead of me, your life would have already come to an end. Don’t forget who makes the rules in the Freedom Federation. I hope that I never have to hear news of you targeting Na Na and Li Yang again. If I do, I will make you regret it!”","A silver mirror appeared in front of the Mirror God.","The silver mirror cracked, and the Mirror God walked through it, disappearing from the mansion.","At that moment, the Goddess of Mercy slammed her hand viciously on her throne.","The throne made of Deep Sea Blood Jade Coral, which was even harder than Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredients, was smashed to smithereens by the Goddess of Mercy’s attack.","The Goddess of Mercy touched her waist where the Mirror God’s attack had made contact with her.","The Goddess of Mercy felt as though the area had been roasted by the spirit fire.","She could not use the energy and spirit qi in her body to heal herself, and the scars would remain on her waist forever.","The Goddess of Mercy knew that the scars were the lesson that the Mirror God had spoken of.","The two scars had utterly trampled the Goddess of Mercy’s pride.","Ever since the Goddess of Mercy awoke her birth horoscope and started walking down the heaven’s path and discovered that the mermaids she was cultivating had vanished, the Goddess of Mercy had lost all sense of belonging to the Freedom Federation.","Previously, the Goddess of Mercy, who was a native of the Freedom Federation, was just like any other citizen and felt a sense of belonging to the Freedom Federation.","However, reality had given her a bad wake-up call. She now knew how ridiculous she had been in the past for having a sense of belonging.","This was the main reason that the Goddess of Mercy had become so unhinged in her methods afterward.","Later, the member of royalty the Goddess of Mercy had brought up had died while on assignment.","The Goddess of Mercy did not believe that the Mirror God and God of Fools were not involved.","Normally, the member of royalty brought up by the Goddess of Mercy would not allow himself to be in danger.","Moreover, that member of royalty had accidentally crossed the Moon Empress.","Otherwise, he would not have been killed by the Moon Empress without receiving any aid.","The Goddess of Mercy did start to hate the Moon Empress afterwards. However, the Goddess of Mercy hated the Mirror God and God of Fools even more.","The God of Fools and Mirror God had always been on the same page.","Although she also had ‘goddess’ in the way she was addressed, she was always restrained by the God of Fools and Mirror God.","Both of them had cut off her road to development more than once.","Although she had already solidified her birth horoscope, the Mirror God sided with Na Na and Li Yang when the Goddess of Mercy put them on the spot.","If not for the fact that she was no match for the Mirror God, the Goddess of Mercy would definitely turn the entire Freedom Federation upside down.","She had always yearned to set her spirit fire alight.","However, she needed to evolve her bloodline to set her spirit fire alight. To do so, she needed Lin Yuan to feel affection for her.","In order to aid her efforts in triggering affection in Lin Yuan for her, she decided to work with the Radiance Federation.","At that time, the Goddess of Mercy had done so because the situation called for it.","But now, as the Goddess of Mercy touched the scars on her waist, she found herself wanting even more for the Radiance Federation to destroy the Freedom Federation.","The Goddess of Mercy knew that she had very important strategic significance to the Radiance Federation.","Previously, the Goddess of Mercy did not want to tell the Radiance Federation too much about the meetings in the Freedom Mystic Temple.","But now, her mind had changed.","For some reason, she thought of Lin Yuan.","She murmured within the water currents, “I wonder how much mermaid emperor bloodline power is in Lin Yuan’s body...”","The Goddess of Mercy thought back to the mermaid bloodline aura that came from Lin Yuan’s body. It had caused the Goddess of Mercy’s fishtail to go soft.","Suddenly, the Goddess of Mercy’s body disappeared from the mansion.","The elderly woman the two girls called Grandma Coral was currently kneeling outside the mansion as she welcomed the Goddess of Mercy to begin her swim.","She had no idea that the Goddess of Mercy was no longer in the Freedom Federation.","At Sacred Forest City...","Lin Yuan immediately summoned White Speak when he felt the four auras.","White Speak’s burned half had not recovered yet, and it looked weak at the moment.","However, White Speak’s aura had become much more solid than before.","The foundation of an Apostle was a sacred source lifeform. Apostles needed source-type power more than faith power.","Lin Yuan had given White Speak 1,000 units of source-type power.","If White Speak had to accumulate this amount of source-type power on its own, it would need close to 50 years even after using all of its means.","After Lin Yuan summoned White Speak, he said, “Go and protect Di Wanmi outside the tree castle. Kill anyone who tries to hurt her!”","Lin Yuan also had strong combat abilities on his own. However, he did not intend to step in himself.","This was because he needed a large amount of mermaid emperor bloodline power to activate the Fish World Sea Trump Card.","...","He did not have much mermaid bloodline power in his body left and needed a long time to recover all of it.","Given the situation, Lin Yuan would have to harm his body to use his mermaid emperor bloodline power.","Moreover, Frigid had also used a large amount of its emperor sea demon bloodline power.","Frigid needed to absorb pure spirit qi and pure water-elemental energy from the Element Well every day in order to recover its bloodline. By Lin Yuan’s estimation, it would need at least two months.","Thus, he could leave this matter to White Speak.","White Speak had sworn its loyalty to Lin Yuan and accepted Lin Yuan’s dictator’s prize. It was only right that it died doing battle for him.","White Speak had never received a gift as large as the 1,000 units of source-type power that Lin Yuan had given it.","Now, it would treat everything that fell from Lin Yuan’s lips as a sacred order. It was now as tame and obedient as a puppy dog!","The four auras from deep in the imperial court were about to reach Yang Hanxian when the silver-armored White Speak appeared next to Di Wanmi.","The four auras did not try to hide at all.","When the members of Sacred Forest City’s native factions felt the four auras, they froze with fear and knew that the Su and Bai families had died at the hands of these four experts.","...","At the same time, the faction spies had noticed White Speak. It was a completely new face to them.","However, everyone present knew that the silver-armored man who just exited the tree castle had more to him than met the eye."]},{"number":2045,"title":"Chapter 2045 Red Thorn’s Eternal Weapon!","paragraphs":["2045 Red Thorn’s Eternal Weapon!","Two new faces had walked out of the tree castle.","The first new face wore a black robe. When she walked out, everything seemed normal. But once she removed it, she gave everyone present goosebumps","The second new face wore silver armor. He was tall and burly and had a combat-worn face. He did not release even a hint of his aura. From all angles, he was much more normal than the first face.","But there was no question of his reason for walking out of the tree castle. He was here to deal with the four auras that had emerged from the imperial court.","!!","In the blink of an eye, four figures dressed in red robes appeared near Yang Hanxian. They were the four Truth Association members who had attended the imperial meeting.","The four of them had been busy reporting the situation in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm to Lord Envoy. Since the Truth Association was secretly behind the Yang family, there was no way they did not have their eyes on the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","Ten years was a very short period for experts.","Since there was a treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm that had been discovered, it had to belong to the Truth Association.","The four Truth Association members had not expected Sky Creation to be so strong.","They were utterly merciless against the ruler of the Divine Wood Federation, Yang Hanxian.","They looked at Di Wanmi and furrowed their brows. She was in an abnormal state.","She looked like a broken doll with parasitic roots inside her that danced around freely. However, both of their auras were fully complementary.","The four of them were experts from the Truth Association and had contracted sacred source lifeforms. Thus, all of them could sniff the scent of a sacred source lifeform from Di Wanmi.","This made the four of them think of Lord Envoy. Both of them had the same scent. However, there was no question that Di Wanmi was much weaker than Lord Envoy.","As for White Speak, the four of them could sense that White Speak’s power was comparable to that of Di Wanmi.","Compared to the grotesque Di Wanmi, the four of them were not overly concerned about White Speak.","Almost half of the Iris Wood Vine Dragon had been eaten, and the roots had protruded out from its eyes.","Given the situation, the four of them could save the Iris Wood Vine Dragon as well as the Iris Wood Dragon Bird, but there would not be much point in it.","The Iris Wood Vine Dragon’s roots had been injured, and it would take more resources to heal it than it would to nurture three of the Iris Wood Vine Dragons.","This would involve the use of numerous Law Crystals and World Crystals.","This did not align with their goal of coming to the Divine Wood Federation.","Thus, there was no longer any point in the Iris Wood Vine Dragon and Yang Hanxian’s existence.","There were direct disciples of the Yang family.","Yang Sijie had a better brain and knew what to do when he had a task.","If Yang Hanxian died, Yang Sijie could replace him.","After all, the goal of the Yang family’s existence was only to help the Truth Association absorb all of the resources in the Divine Wood Federation.","This was all for the sake of Lord Truth.","The four of them ignored Yang Hanxian’s cries and went on to attack Di Wanmi.","They felt that Sky Creation had a motive for coming to Sacred Forest City.","The people from Sky Creation had entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm.","They had already told Lord Envoy that a treasure would be produced in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm ten years later. It would not take long for the news to reach Lord Truth.","If Sky Creation had come for the sake of the treasure, it meant that Sky Creation and the Truth Association’s goals were in conflict.","Since Sky Creation was coming in so strongly, the four of them needed to establish the hierarchy of power to make Sky Creation aware that fighting for resources with the Truth Association was futile.","So what if Sky Creation had a Class 5 Creation Master? They were all nothing more than prey to Lord Truth.","Three of the four figures summoned their main feys to attack Di Wanmi and the Dark Lightning Spike Shell.","Three Sovereign X/Immortal IX feys appeared.","From the moment the three feys appeared, they activated their Immortal bodies. This increased their feys’ attacking power and allowed them to skyrocket in power.","However, the use of a large amount of spiritual power would affect a fey’s endurance.","Thus, Immortal experts only unleashed their feys’ Immortal bodies when they were ready to use their most powerful attacks.","White Speak stood calmly behind Di Wanmi.","White Speak knew that Lin Yuan had sent it out here to protect Di Wanmi.","Currently, it was not powerful enough to protect Di Wanmi. Hence, it was likely that it would be boosted by Lin Yuan’s faith power soon.","White Speak liked the feeling of Lin Yuan’s faith power coursing through its body.","Just as it predicted, a beam of faith power shot out from the tree castle and landed on White Speak’s body.","With the boost from the faith power, White Speak’s power was raised to around Eternal IV.","Now, White Speak did not have to activate its source sacred body in order to take on the three pinnacle Immortal experts.","White Speak clearly remembered Lin Yuan’s order to kill anyone who tried to harm Di Wanmi.","Since Lin Yuan had said so, White Speak was not going to hold back in the slightest in combat.","Three silhouettes of crocodiles formed on White Speak’s fists. It gently swung its fists and sent the three crocodiles flying out.","As White Speak’s aura increased, fear and shock appeared on the faces of the three Truth Association members.","The sudden jump in White Speak’s power boggled their minds.","The gap between Creation Breed and Immortal Breed was already a world of difference, but the gap between Immortal Breed and Eternal Breed was even larger.","Thus, the three of them could not handle White Speak’s casual attack.","The Truth Association member that had not acted yet released his aura when White Speak’s power was boosted by faith power.","...","He was the leader of this team, and his power had reached beginning Eternal.","As Lin Yuan stood in the tree castle, he said calmly, “Red Thorn, instruct the Tongue of Relinquish to release Han Tianhe. Once Liu Yanshan leads Luo Lan back to the underground palace, release him too. You will possess Immortal and Eternal weapons in the future.”","Red Thorn happily broke off the link with Han Tianhe.","In the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce in Oak City...","The scars on Han Tianhe slowly disappeared, and the ginseng roots in his body slowly rotted. His body split into two and crumpled to the ground.","The Earth Core Dragon Snail also split into two.","Its imitation form turned solid and smashed through the room where Han Tianhe had been staying, scaring Li Wan and Zhao Jiazhi."]},{"number":2046,"title":"Chapter 2046 Aurora Broken Night Fox","paragraphs":["2046 Aurora Broken Night Fox","Li Wan and Zhao Jiazhi hurriedly ran to Han Tianhe’s room.","They were filled with intense terror when they saw the sight that greeted them.","What! The thearch-class expert and his main fey that Lin Yuan had sent them were split into two! Who did it? Could there be a powerful expert from an enemy faction hidden in the tree castle?","If this were the case, didn’t that mean that everyone present could be in unthinkable danger?","At that moment, they saw a short man wearing a white robe walk in. He looked somewhat similar to Lin Yuan.","This was Shadow. Lin Yuan had sent it to guard Oak City.","Lin Yuan knew that releasing Han Tianhe from the Tongue of Relinquish would frighten everyone in the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce. Thus, he instructed Shadow to go and inform Li Wan and Zhao Jiazhi about what was happening so they would not be overcome with hysteria and cause the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce to come to a standstill.","Lin Yuan did not intend on returning to Oak City for a very long time.","...","This Eternal member of the Truth Association intended on giving his all to attack White Speak.","Lord Envoy had to have noticed such a monumental change and would definitely come to save them.","Even if Lord Envoy could not defeat the silver-armored middle-aged man, it would also be fine to force the middle-aged man into a stalemate and eventual retreat.","Hence, this Truth Association member summoned the Sovereign III/Eternal I Aurora Broken Night Fox.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox was transformed from the Aurora Forever Day Fox, which had the best bloodline of fox-species feys.","The mutation of top bloodlines would either become extremely strong or extremely weak. The Aurora Broken Night Fox belonged to the former.","The Aurora Forever Day Fox was a pure light-type fey that was skilled at healing.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox was both light- and dark-type. Light-type feys were skilled at healing while dark-type feys were terrifyingly deadly. Dark-type attacks mostly evolved curse effects that were challenging to escape from.","However, the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s core was nothing to be amazed at. After all, feys with normal cores could never evolve to Eternal.","Once the Aurora Broken Night Fox appeared, it wanted to howl at the sky.","However, once it sensed White Speak’s aura, the Aurora Broken Night Fox immediately became focused.","Even without an instruction from the Truth Association member, it immediately revealed its Eternal Heart.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox was not multi-tailed. It had a tail that was four to five times longer than its body that seemed to be able to block out sunlight.","When the Aurora Broken Night Fox revealed its Eternal Heart, its body spun and turned into a dappled space.","The space was faintly fused with the main world but also seemed to be separate from the main world.","Within the space was the aura and root power of the Aurora Broken Night Fox.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox’s Eternal Heart could be seen within the dappled space and was constantly throbbing.","By that time, the three crocodile silhouettes that White Speak had produced had reached the three pinnacle Immortal feys.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox was about to receive the attack that had been sent out by the silver-armored man.","The three pinnacle Immortal feys might not be able to handle the attack, but the Eternal Aurora Broken Night Fox could.","White Speak did not give the Aurora Broken Night Fox time to defend against the three attacks. It smiled and opened its jaws to chomp down in the direction of the Aurora Broken Night Fox.","During this time, White Speak entered its source sacred body state, and the totems on its body started to spin rapidly.","A crocodile jaw that seemed to be a part of the main world while also being separate from the main world bit down on the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s Eternal Heart.","This attack from White Speak used all of its power.","It was trying to tell the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s contractor that he had to use the full-powered attack of the Eternal Heart in order to save those he wanted to save.","White Speak’s power was greater than the Aurora Broken Night Fox. If White Speak’s attack struck the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s Eternal Heart, the Eternal Heart would most likely be damaged or even broken.","Although he was a Truth Association member, the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s contractor would not allow his fey to be injured for the sake of saving others.","If his fey was injured, he would lose his position within the Truth Association. Moreover, he would waste all of the resources that Lord Truth had invested in him. How could Lord Truth forgive him?","Thus, the Aurora Broken Night Fox had to retract its attack and protect itself.","Once a Truth Association member increased their power, they would not have many chances to fight against opponents of the same power.","After all, there were no Eternal experts in the Startling Lines Continent. Even if there were, they would all be members of the Truth Association.","Thus, the Aurora Broken Night Fox was not capable of judging how strong White Speak’s attack was.","White Speak bit down on the Aurora Broken Night Fox and bit off one of the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s front legs and half of its tail.","At the same time, the three attacks made contact with the three pinnacle Immortal feys.","Lin Yuan had instructed White Speak to try to keep the three Immortal feys intact.","The three thumb-sized crocodile silhouettes pierced through the three pinnacle Immortal feys’ foreheads and then killed the three Truth Association members.","These three experts were powerful enough to control the Divine Wood Federation’s fate, yet they died so easily at the hands of White Speak’s attack.","The remaining Truth Association member felt afraid and also conflicted by the deaths of his three companions.","The four of them had been hidden in the Divine Wood Federation for almost nine years and had long come to see themselves as the emperors of the Divine Wood Federation.","They never saw such a day coming.","Now, the Aurora Broken Night Fox was seriously injured. Once a fey reached Eternal, its type would be substantially affected in terms of combat.","At its core, the Aurora Broken Night Fox was a healing-type fey. Although it had mutated and gained combat abilities, it was still weaker than pure combat-type feys in terms of combat.","Moreover, fox-species feys were naturally weak when it came to defense.","Luckily, the Aurora Broken Night Fox excelled at healing.","But no matter how powerful it was at healing, it could not regrow its tail.","...","It could be said that the Aurora Broken Night Fox had been crippled by the opponent’s attack."]},{"number":2047,"title":"Chapter 2047 The Strongest Healing Entity in Lin Yuan’s Possession!","paragraphs":["2047 The Strongest Healing Entity in Lin Yuan’s Possession!","The crippled Aurora Broken Night Fox’s movements were greatly limited.","It was possible that the Aurora Broken Night Fox would not be able to handle the silver-armored man’s next attack.","The head of this Truth Association team never expected that instructing the Aurora Broken Night Fox to reveal its Eternal Heart still failed to prevent such a disastrous result.","If Lord Envoy did not come, it would truly be the end for him.","Just as White Speak was about to continue attacking the Aurora Broken Night Fox, the air warped next to White Speak.","There was the noise of an expanding ball of flesh coming from the warping space.","A pale hand reached out from the space and made a grab for White Speak’s neck.","White Speak had a wealth of combat experience.","After experiencing Heaven’s Trial, White Speak knew that in the wider world, there were always going to be greater talents.","As such, White Speak never let its guard down during battle and always remained aware of its surroundings.","If White Speak had been distracted by the changes in its surroundings, it would have allowed the pale hand to close around its neck.","But since it was prepared, the phantom image of a crocodile tail appeared behind it and violently smacked the pale hand.","White Speak felt as though he had just smacked a hard iron wall. The recoil from the impact caused White Speak to take a step back.","However, White Speak’s attack had not been completely ineffective.","As a result of White Speak’s attack, the white hand became rather crooked. Clearly, the hand had been injured.","A roar ripped through the space next to White Speak.","Soon, a menacing large ball of flesh appeared next to White Speak.","When the ball of flesh cracked open, ready to swallow White Speak. However, White Speak was already prepared.","There was no way it would fall to such an attack.","Once it flashed itself away to dodge, White Speak gathered its power and released three punches.","The nine silhouettes of crocodiles appeared to hit the ball of flesh but were actually aiming at the Aurora Broken Night Fox and the member of the Truth Association.","White Speak’s goal was to do everything it could to kill the member of the Truth Association.","The task that Lin Yuan had given it was to kill the person who had attacked Di Wanmi.","The aura of the ball of flesh was comparable to White Speak’s own after it had been boosted.","White Speak was well aware that if it tried to flee, it would not be able to take anyone with it. Thus, it would be best for it to stick to playing its role.","It would leave the ball of flesh for Lin Yuan to handle.","After the Aurora Broken Night Fox’s tail and front leg were broken, it started letting out strings of woeful whimpers.","It focused most of its vitality on its legs and tail to stop the bleeding.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox had evolved to Eternal, and its body had reached Immortal IX. At this level, it could use its Immortal body to reconfigure its body.","However, this took a long time, and the Aurora Broken Night Fox could not afford to wait.","White Speak’s attack was so fast that there was no way for the Aurora Broken Night Fox to dodge it.","The pressure from the power forced the Aurora Broken Night Fox and its contractor to have no choice but to sustain White Speak’s nine attacks.","Moreover, White Speak’s performance before attacking had clearly deceived the ball of flesh next to it. As a result, the strange ball of flesh was unable to protect its subordinates.","Ever since Lin Yuan saw the strange ball of flesh, his brow furrowed.","Ever since the Radiance Federation officially declared war against Tower Canon, disciples of royalty like Lin Yuan gobbled up all information related to Tower Canon that they could.","There had always been records of the Eight Pages of Tower Canon in the Radiance Federation. This especially applied to Fifth Page Truth who had murdered the Sky Sundial Jade Spider.","This ball of flesh was very similar to the information about Fifth Page Truth that was recorded. Fifth Page Truth liked to wrap itself within a moving ball of flesh.","The group behind the Great Lush Federation was called the Truth Association. There was a high chance that it was related to Fifth Page Truth.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan would not naively believe that the expert hidden in the ball of flesh was Fifth Page Truth.","The expert within the ball of flesh had power that was around Sovereign/Eternal IV. There was no way that this was enough power to infiltrate the Radiance Federation and kill the Sky Sundial Jade Spider.","Although the Sky Sundial Jade Spider was pregnant and much weaker than usual, it could still take out an expert with Eternal IV power with no issue as long as it gave its everything.","But even if the expert within the ball of flesh was not Fifth Page Truth, it would still allow Lin Yuan to gain a deeper understanding of the Great Lush Federation’s secrets.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s mother had died at the hands of Fifth Page Truth.","Although Lin Yuan had managed to help the Mother of Bloodbath’s mother come back to life in the form of her soul, revenge still needed to be taken.","It was Fifth Page Truth who had caused Blood New Moon to lose his love and the Mother of Bloodbath to be left to fend for itself.","Both Blood New Moon and the Mother of Bloodbath had been suppressing this thirst for vengeance.","Even if Jade Sundial could come back to life in flesh and blood, the hate could not be resolved.","It was not impossible to use the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring to produce Jade Sundial’s physical body.","The Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring’s effects would grow stronger as the Mother of Bloodbath fed it more plant-type feys with medicinal properties.","But no matter how strong the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring’s effects were, it would not allow Jade Sundial to produce her Eternal Heart.","Thus, in order to truly enable Jade Sundial to come back to life, they needed to seek out Fifth Page Truth and retrieve Jade Sundial’s Eternal Heart.","But at the same time, Lin Yuan was happy to see the Truth Association member and the Aurora Broken Night Fox die by White Speak’s attack.","Amongst the four types of spirit qi professionals, there was no question that Sky Creation lacked healing-type spirit qi professionals the most.","Currently, the only healing-type spirit qi professional that Sky Creation had was Lin Yuan.","...","Endless Summer had contracted the Barren River Orchid Bud and could technically be called a below-average healing-type spirit qi professional.","Ji Feng’s main fey the Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus’ main effect was to heal souls. It could not produce any visible effects when it came to healing flesh.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox had not performed well because White Speak had become too powerful after it was boosted by faith power.","However, when it faced enemies that were not as strong as White Speak, the Aurora Broken Night Fox could perform amazingly.","When an Eternal expert contracted a healing-type fey, they would become unbelievably valuable.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox could not heal its own limbs, but Lin Yuan could, by using the Jasmine Lily’s Severed Limbs Growth.","The Aurora Broken Night Fox could meet all of Sky Creation’s healing needs for a long time."]},{"number":2048,"title":"Chapter 2048 Can’t Afford to Anger a Class 5 Creation Master!","paragraphs":["2048 Can’t Afford to Anger a Class 5 Creation Master!","Red Thorn only had three of the Tongues of Relinquish.","Since Di Wanmi was a Class 5 Creation Master, she could not be replaced.","The only suitable Eternal expert that the Tongue of Relinquish could take control of was the healing-type spirit qi professional who had contracted the Aurora Broken Night Fox.","Once Liu Yanshan returned, Lin Yuan would instruct Red Thorn to take control of one of the three dead pinnacle Immortal experts.","As for the ball of flesh that was likely related to Fifth Page Truth, Lin Yuan intended to release Begin Lady to deal with the situation and dig out information as well.","Finding Fifth Page Truth and retrieving Jade Sundial’s Eternal Heart was more important than finding another Eternal weapon for Red Thorn.","Moreover, Red Thorn controlled corpses. Once the ball of flesh lost its value, it could be used as a backup corpse.","Once the Tongue of Relinquish was lacking weapons to control, Red Thorn could take control of the ball of flesh.","If he wanted Red Thorn’s Tongue of Relinquish to take control of other corpses when there was no lack of corpses, he would lose a corpse that was already under control.","It was a big waste to let go of an Immortal weapon.","Moreover, in order for Red Thorn to produce an additional Tongue of Relinquish’s tongue tip, a long time was needed.","Although the Tongue of Relinquish could absorb the energy within the Mouth of Relinquish to speed up the growth of the tongue tip, doing so would come at a heavy cost. It could even cost Red Thorn to fall in grade.","No matter how many resources Lin Yuan had, for the sake of his growth, he could not waste them unless the situation was absolutely dire.","Standing in the tree castle, Lin Yuan was eyeing the figure in the ball of flesh.","The figure within the ball of flesh was shocked and furious.","As the envoy of Lord Truth who had led a team to the Divine Wood Federation to gather resources on behalf of Lord Truth, he ended up coming up against such a powerful enemy.","It could be said that Sky Creation ended up being more powerful than he expected.","He would have to be punished for the deaths of the four Truth Association members.","When one performed well in front of Lord Truth, there was no guarantee of a reward. But when one performed badly, there was sure to be punishment in store.","This was clearly not the time to be forceful.","What he needed to do now was to retreat.","Only two experts had emerged from Sky Creation.","Who knew if even stronger experts were about to emerge from Sky Creation?","With this thought, cracks appeared in the air around the quickly moving ball of flesh.","In the blink of an eye, the ball of flesh embedded itself into the space and slowly disappeared.","White Speak had already received Lin Yuan’s order.","While White Speak was attacking the four Truth Association members, Di Wanmi secretly slunk back into the tree castle.","Di Wanmi was a Class 5 Creation Master with important strategic significance. It would be a waste to risk her at the hands of an Eternal opponent.","Now, Di Wanmi did not need to be protected, and White Speak did not need to worry.","White Speak was the White Evil Marsh Crocodile and was skilled in terms of speed, strength, and explosiveness when it came to combat.","Since Lin Yuan wanted it to tangle with this ball of flesh and find out the secrets behind it, there was no way that White Speak would allow the ball of flesh to flee.","Moreover, White Speak could sense a strange aura from this ball of flesh that sparked its curiosity.","White Speak’s hands turned to claws that it clasped together and formed the shape of a crocodile jaw.","At the instant that White Speak pressed its hands together, the jaws snapped together and let out a bone-chilling noise.","The enormous crocodile jaws closed around the ball of flesh and trapped it in a small space.","White Speak’s action clearly prevented the ball of flesh from fleeing.","If the ball of flesh wanted to flee, the only thing it could do was duke it out with White Speak.","If it won, it could leave. Otherwise, it could take a few beatings from White Speak in exchange for fleeing.","However, once a lifeform reached Eternal, it would have its own unique deadly move that even lifeforms that were skilled at defense would not dare to receive.","Thus, this envoy from the Truth Association had no choice.","The ball of flesh started to release terrifying energy fluctuations and disgusting bulbous boils rose on the surface of the ball of flesh.","The boils released special energy that continuously consumed the cage made of the crocodile jaws.","Two ghastly white hands reached out from the ball of flesh and tore a hole in it as a white-haired elderly man walked out from the ball of flesh.","The elderly man did not attack immediately. Instead, he snarled, “Don’t think that you can do whatever you want just because you have a Class 5 Creation Master! There are some factions that can’t be angered even if you have Class 5 Creation Masters.”","The words of the elderly man that had emerged from the ball of flesh stunned all the members of the Divine Wood Federation’s factions who were present.","What did this mean? They could not do what they wanted even with Class 5 Creation Masters? Could there be Class 6 Creation Masters in this world?","White Speak ignored the elderly man because it did not understand what he had just said.","What were Class 5 Creation Masters? Could they be compared to the Lord Dictator it was following?","At that moment, the door of Sky Creation’s tree castle opened fully, and a young man in long blue and gold robes walked out.","This young man was Lin Yuan who had been dealing with the factions.","White Speak bowed the moment it caught sight of Lin Yuan. At the same time, it used its aura to envelop Lin Yuan in order to protect him.","Previously, all the other faction members assumed that Lin Yuan was just a young man acting as the mouthpiece for the true leader behind Sky Creation.","But it turned out that this was not the case.","If Lin Yuan was only the mouthpiece for the leader behind Sky Creation, White Speak, an Eternal expert, should not be taking such a respectful attitude toward Lin Yuan.","...","At that moment, all the factions in the Divine Wood Federation knew that Lin Yuan’s identity was much more complex.","In order to enter Sky Creation’s tree castle, one usually only needed to pay a fee.","The faction spies had all seen Lin Yuan when they entered the tree castle.","But at that moment, Lin Yuan’s face was obviously different from before.","There was now a gold crystal gem at the corner of Lin Yuan’s right eye.","This gem caused Lin Yuan’s aura to change radically.","Lin Yuan raised his gaze to calmly look at the elderly man and asked, “I’m curious to know what kind of faction can’t be angered by a Class 5 Creation Master.”"]},{"number":2049,"title":"Chapter 2049 Sixth Type of Dimensional Lifeform?","paragraphs":["2049 Sixth Type of Dimensional Lifeform?","Lin Yuan had gained an idea of who the elderly man was through the information he had on Tower Canon.","Lin Yuan felt that the white-haired elderly man was likely deeply linked to Tower Canon’s Fifth Page Truth. Only a subordinate of the Eight Pages of Tower Canon could be so cavalier about Class 5 Creation Masters. Lin Yuan could not think of any other faction that had such nerve.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was not walking out of the tree castle to speak with the elderly man to obtain information.","Some pieces of information could not be obtained by asking.","!!","Lin Yuan could make his plans based on his deductions.","What he needed to do was to end this commotion quickly.","According to the news from Red Thorn, Liu Yanshan had found Luo Lan.","Lin Yuan already had a good grip on the situation in the Divine Wood Federation and had also entered the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. He also obtained the largest opportunity since beginning his career as a spirit qi professional.","Given the circumstances, Lin Yuan did not want to waste any more time in the Divine Wood Federation.","Once the Yang, Su, and Bai families were out of the picture, the Yi family that had submitted to him would become the strongest faction in the Divine Wood Federation and legitimately enter the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Any native Divine Wood Federation faction that was not stupid would do everything they could to support Yi Huailong.","Overall, the factions in the Divine Wood Federation were at their weakest.","It was likely that the native factions in the Divine Wood Federation were most afraid of having to fend off an invasion from the Iron Hammer Federation.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had already promised Luo Lan that he would allow the members of factions in the Iron Hammer Federation to remain fed during the winter season.","In exchange, she would do as Lin Yuan said when she entered and started ruling over the Iron Hammer Federation.","Lin Yuan had been in the Startling Lines Continent for more than a month but had already found two legitimate ways to turn the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation into incubators for Sky Creation.","As for the Great Lush Federation, if the Truth Association was truly linked to Fifth Page Truth, the Truth Association would become an enemy of the entire Heavenly Family Cottage.","The elderly man who had emerged from the ball of flesh was staring at Lin Yuan. He could tell how much White Speak respected Lin Yuan.","White Speak respected Lin Yuan in the same way that he respected Lord Truth. Thus, the man wearing the long blue and gold roves was the head of the entire faction.","The elderly man smiled menacingly and said, “Given your experience, I’m sure you can’t see why Class 5 Creation Masters are pitiful in the eyes of some factions.”","The elderly summoned a large gray and brown bird. Its body was broken and incomplete, and it resembled a corpse that had already begun rotting.","Yet, it was also brimming with life. Evidently, it was a living lifeform.","The faction spies could sense that this large gray and brown bird was even more powerful than the Aurora Broken Night Fox.","But besides power, the large gray and brown bird also had a special aura that was very different from regular feys.","However, the faction spies could not identify the aura.","Lin Yuan furrowed his brow when he saw the large gray and brown bird.","White Speak could sense that the large gray and brown bird was just like him. Both of their main power sources were source-type power.","However, there was no totem on the large gray and brown bird, nor a hint of faith power.","Lin Yuan had also noticed this.","After training in the marsh world, Lin Yuan was already well-versed in dimensional lifeforms.","The large gray and brown bird had the aura of deadly loneliness and withering. It was completely different from the auras of the dimensional lifeforms of the five dimensional rifts he was already familiar with.","Lin Yuan immediately came up with a guess.","Could there be a sixth dimensional rift besides the five that he was already familiar with?","Lin Yuan shook his head and told himself that he was overthinking. He felt that this was improbable.","This was because dimensional rifts opened at random in the main world. Humans could not interfere in this.","Even if a type of Class 6 dimensional rift opened in a continent, no other type of Class 6 dimensional rifts would open in the same place. However, Class 1 to 5 dimensional rifts of other types could still open at random there.","If there was really a sixth dimensional rift, why had it never opened in the Radiance Federation before?","Although this was common knowledge that told Lin Yuan that it was impossible for there to be a sixth type of dimensional rift, Lin Yuan could not help but lean toward this guess.","This elderly man who the Truth Association member had addressed as ‘Lord Envoy’ had summoned a fey that was similar to a dimensional lifeform because he had found a way to escape.","When this elderly man fought against White Speak, he noticed that White Speak was very fast and its attacks were very strong.","Although its attacks were uncreative, it was not feasible to expect him to receive a few of White Speak’s attacks and still flee afterward.","If White Speak pursued him, his injured state would also result in him being caught.","But during combat, White Speak had to protect the young man wearing long blue and gold robes.","Since it needed to dedicate a portion of its energy to defense, all he needed to do was concentrate on attacking the young man wearing long blue and gold robes, and White Speak would have no choice but to shift its focus away from him.","After the strange gray and brown bird was summoned, the elderly man immediately instructed it to launch its strongest attack at Lin Yuan.","The broken and incomplete gray and brown bird flapped its wings with the skeleton peeking out.","As it strained its abdomen, maggots fell out from the hole and landed on the ground.","The earth rumbled with the faint sounds of wailing. It was as though something was about to awaken.","A gray and black mist was sprayed out from the bird’s mouth. The mist had the flavor of decay, deterioration, and putrefaction.","This attack had been meant for Lin Yuan.","However, the aura that came with this attack caused the trunk and branches of the Hollowed Tamarix behind Lin Yuan to be covered with a gray layer.","More than half of the Hollowed Tamarix fell from its branches.","The Hollowed Tamarix’s root power started to drain away under the decaying aura.","Lin Yuan could sense that the decay, deterioration, and putrefaction from the mist sprayed out by the gray and brown bird did not only target plants but would also cause all lifeforms to slowly lose their lives.","..."]},{"number":2050,"title":"Chapter 2050 Pilgrimage Corpse Bird","paragraphs":["2050 Pilgrimage Corpse Bird","White Speak sensed the strength of the attack and immediately placed itself in front of Lin Yuan.","To the shock of the elderly man, White Speak opened its jaws and swallowed the strange gray and brown bird’s attack.","When White Speak opened its mouth again, a white beam of energy with streaks of gray and black shot out toward the strange gray and brown bird, piercing it clean through from head to tail.","The remainder of the beam of energy shot toward the elderly man.","!!","After this attack, White Speak became even more certain that the strange gray and brown bird was a dimensional lifeform. This was because White Speak had strongly sensed source-type power in the attack.","White Speak thought that its attack would have ended the strange gray and brown bird’s life.","Yet, the strange gray bird that had been pierced through from head to tail was completely unaffected.","To White Speak’s shock, the bird folded its wings in front of the elderly man.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the strange gray and brown bird.","The strange gray and brown bird had already reached Eternal so the Gold Morbius could not check on it.","However, Lin Yuan still discovered that it was called the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","From Morbius’ sensing, Lin Yuan could tell that the strange bird’s energy core was in its abdomen.","White Speak had not struck that area.","Moreover, Lin Yuan felt that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s intelligence was too low for a Class 14 dimensional lifeform.","Compared to marsh dimensional lifeforms, it had around the same intelligence as the Class 3 Marsh Crocodile.","Normally, feys’ intelligence increased along with their grades.","Lin Yuan had never seen a lifeform of Eternal and above that had such a low intelligence.","The Pilgrimage Corpse Bird had used all of its power in spraying the mist.","White Speak used its own ability ‘replay’ to add the power of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s attack to its own.","There was no way that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird could use its body to sustain the attack and a portion of the energy crashed into the elderly man, sending him flying back by over 20 meters as blackened blood exploded out from his lips.","It was obvious that the color of the blood was unusual and it had the same aura as that of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","Normally, as the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s contractor, the elderly should not have been affected by the attributes in the attack even if his body could be injured by it.","When the elderly man emerged from the ball of flesh, his pale hands already appeared very unhealthy.","An Eternal expert’s body should not have such an appearance.","Now, Lin Yuan understood that the elderly man’s pale body was likely due to him having contracted the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","The Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s bloodline had changed the elderly man’s bloodline and made him appear like a dead man walking.","Although Lin Yuan’s mother had given birth to him, he was also a transmigrator.","According to the rare and unorthodox information that Lin Yuan had from his previous life, two words immediately came to his mind—the undead and zombies.","If there truly was a sixth type of dimensional rift in the world, it was likely that it would be linked to those words.","At that moment, the elderly man sent out by the Truth Association to the Divine Wood Federation was boiling over with shock and fury.","Lin Yuan planned on taking the chance to squeeze the elderly man for information","There was a lot of intelligence that could only come from the mouth of the enemy. Their eyes and expression would give Lin Yuan the answer he wanted.","“If Fifth Page Truth were here, he would step in to help you sustain the next attack!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes were locked on the elderly man’s eyes.","All of the Divine Wood Federation’s faction spies were confused by what Lin Yuan said. They did not understand who the Fifth Page Truth that Lin Yuan spoke of was.","Meanwhile, the elderly man’s expression changed drastically. He now had an expression of disbelief.","Without the elderly man having to respond in any way, Lin Yuan knew that he was acquainted with Fifth Page Truth.","It seemed that the Truth Association was indeed linked to Fifth Page Truth.","He had already gained enough information from the elderly man.","This elderly man did not have the authority to know what secret weapons Fifth Page War had.","Lin Yuan said softly, “Leave this elderly man’s corpse intact. Then, take control of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.”","The moment the last word fell from Lin Yuan’s lips, a water current with faint lines of hair flew out of the pink and gold gem at the corner of Lin Yuan’s eye.","Pink and gold flames arose all over the surface of the water.","The water current shot into the elderly’s body with no intention of being stopped.","This elderly Eternal expert lost his last breath while in a fit of shock and rage.","When the water current left the elderly man’s body, it turned into delicate pink and gold chains that wrapped snugly around the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","Lin Yuan intended to carefully examine the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird later to understand the inner workings of its body.","Red Thorn had just abandoned the thearch-class weapon Han Tianhe and the new Tongue of Relinquish had not grown out yet.","Thus, he needed some time before he could take control of the elderly man from the Truth Association.","At that time, the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird would also fall under Red Thorn’s control.","Given the intelligence of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird, it was unlikely that it had sensed that anything was wrong with its contractor.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird would allow him to unlock a secret that he had never been able to touch in the past.","From the throngs of firepower that Yang Hanxian had brought in the form of imperial guards, to the later arrival of Immortal and Eternal experts, the events of the past 20 minutes had completely changed the horizons of the members of the native factions of the Divine Wood Federation.","The factions in Sacred Forest City no longer had any desire to fight back against Sky Creation.","...","Frankly, it was normal for upper-ranked factions of a federation to fight for resources.","However, these factions were very xenophobic.","For example, when they were angered by the knowledge that the Yang family was being controlled, they were also angry and looked down on the Yi family for climbing the ranks with Sky Creation’s help. Slowly, they even became indignant at being ruled by the Yi family.","However, after the power and deadliness that Sky Creation had demonstrated, any leader of a faction with intelligence would know that there was no point in being angry and resisting.","Rather, when the Divine Wood Federation’s experts were weakening, they could only be able to survive the feral Iron Hammer Federation by clinging tightly to Sky Creation.","It was unlikely that Sky Creation would sit by and watch as the Divine Wood Federation met their doom after they helped the Yi family assume control!"]},{"number":2051,"title":"Chapter 2051 Are You Still Acting?","paragraphs":["2051 Are You Still Acting?","Yang Sijie was completely unaware of everything that was happening over at Sky Creation’s tree castle.","Ever since the imperial meeting where he gained a deeper understanding of the Truth Association’s power, Yang Sijie’s attitude had changed completely.","Previously, he wanted to be independent and lead the Yang family in wrenching out of the grip of the Truth Association. But now, all he wanted to do was curry favor with the Truth Association and find a way for them to see him as more important than his father.","This was because Yang Sijie was weak by nature. After being spoiled in the imperial court for all his life, he had long lost the bloodthirst that he should have possessed.","Furthermore, he knew that he would not be able to fight the Truth Association on his own.","The Truth Association’s power was glaring and even his father, the Yang family’s strongest expert, was no match for them. If he tried to take them on, he would only be jumping toward a pointless death.","After all, his father was the one who had humiliated the Yang family. It was under his leadership that the Yang family had turned into the Truth Association’s puppet.","When the time came that he replaced his father as the leader of the Yang family, no one from the Yang family would blame him.","The Truth Association had to have decided to take control of the Yang family because they were of use to the Yang family.","The treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm would only mature ten years later. The most urgent task at hand for Yang Sijie was to make Little Peach trust him.","As long as he could continue acting as the bridge between Little Peach and the Truth Association, he would be useful in the eyes of the Truth Association.","Yang Sijie was born in a top faction and knew that only people with worth survived the longest. The worthless could be replaced at any time.","Thus, after Yang Sijie was done with the imperial meeting, he immediately headed where Little Peach was staying to begin doing all he could to safeguard the relationship between himself and Little Peach.","He seemed to have forgotten his promise to Little Peach to keep the secret.","Little Peach appeared humble and relaxed in front of Yang Sijie but in fact, she could not despise Yang Sijie even more than she already did.","She could not be clearer about what was running through Yang Sijie’s mind.","He was unfilial to his father and was trying to stir trouble in front of her.","He was completely oblivious that the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm that was said to mature ten years later did not exist at all, or that the entire Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had already vanished.","Little Peach had entered the Yang family’s treasure vault more than once in the past few days.","She had carefully studied the contents of the treasure vault before she reported her findings to Begin Lady, who then relayed the information to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was amazed at how well-padded the Yang family’s treasure vault was but was also bewildered.","The Yang family’s treasure vault was so large, but they did not even have Law Crystal and World Crystal fragments, much less complete crystals. This was not normal at all.","Lin Yuan told Begin Lady to instruct Little Peach to try to trick Yang Sijie into divulging information.","This was when a troubled expression spread across Yang Sijie’s face.","It turned out that the Truth Association had been collecting Law and World Crystals from the Yang family and had great need for them.","This also explained why Yi Huailong had said that half of the Law and World Crystals in the Yi family’s treasure vault had been taken by the Yang family.","At first, Lin Yuan had not thought much of it.","But slowly, as time went on, Lin Yuan began to get the feeling that something was wrong.","Class 5 Creation Masters could purify Law and World Crystals but could also tap into the worlds and laws within the crystals to help feys of the same type to better absorb the laws and world.","Lin Yuan was not capable of this. However, the most effective things for breakthroughs were still pure Law and World Crystals.","Alas, it was not easy to purify Law and World Crystals and called for only the top creation Master resources.","Although the Moon Empress had awakened her birth horoscope and become a Class 6 Creation Master, she could not purify many Law and World Crystals in a day.","It was much easier to search for suitable Law Crystals to evolve respective feys.","Class 5 Creation Master techniques could allow feys of the same type to better absorb Law and World Crystals.","The Truth Association had to have an unorthodox reason for needing such a large amount of Law and World Crystals.","“Holy Lady, if you have any resource needs, I can take you into the treasure vault. However, please don’t make things difficult for me by asking for Law and World Crystals! I can’t help you!”","Little Peach was not about to believe Yang Sijie.","This was because Little Peach was trying to get him to divulge information and also because her original intention was to make things difficult for Yang Sijie.","Little Peach did not like Yang Sijie’s attitude of trying to harm her while still taking advantage of her.","“Hmph! You can’t help me? You can’t even get something like this? Then what is the point in me continuing to work with you? Take me to see Yang Hanxian! When I collaborated with him, he was very easy to work with.”","Little Peach’s words made Yang Sijie panic.","If she went to his father and started working with him, Yang Sijie would become useless to the Truth Association.","He did not know if the Truth Association would kill him once he became useless to them but was certain that his father would.","He still remembered how his father had looked at him when he mentioned the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. It had been the exact same way that his father had looked at his brother soon before the former murdered the latter.","However, Yang Sijie truly could not fulfill Little Peach’s request.","The Truth Association needed Law and World Crystals. If he helped Little Peach to obtain Law and World Crystals instead of leaving them for the Truth Association, there was no way that the people from the Truth Association would let him off!","Little Peach had complimented his father because she still had not tried asking him for Law and World Crystals. Or, the Truth Association had not needed Law and World Crystals when she had worked with him.","Yang Sijie knew that he needed to soothe Little Peach. Only then would things proceed smoothly.","Thus, Yang Sijie had no choice but to agree to Little Peach’s request.","He could relay Little Peach’s request to the Truth Association members and seek their opinions.","It was likely that the Truth Association members would be willing to give up on some Law and World Crystals to satisfy Little Peach for the sake of the treasure that would only mature a decade later."]},{"number":2052,"title":"Chapter 2052 The Holy Lady’s Cleansing!","paragraphs":["2052 The Holy Lady’s Cleansing!","If it was truly impossible, he could put on a disguise to kill some experts from other factions and steal their Law and World Crystals to give to Little Peach.","The fate of Yang Sijie’s life rested on Little Peach’s attitude toward him. This was why he was so panicked when Little Peach hinted that she wanted to work with his father instead.","“Holy Lady, I will do my best to fulfill your request. My father is no longer in the imperial court. Moreover, if you speak with my father, I can’t ensure that my father won’t go after the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm himself.”","Little Peach shot Yang Sijie a look of amusement before she asked, “Are you saying that you never thought about going after the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm after finding out about it?”","It went without saying that Yang Sijie had targeted the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. He had even told the Truth Association members about the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm in exchange for prolonging his life.","He could not care less about the life or death of Little Peach.","But there was no way he would respond to Little Peach’s question with the truth.","Thus, he started to placate Little Peach, “Holy Lady, how could I eye the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm? You have been in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm for so long, but the Yang family never sullied our promise to you.","“I genuinely respect you. My main fey is the Poison Arrow Sweet Flag with the Sacred Wood bloodline that came from the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm! You might not be aware, but my father’s old age has come with many maladies of the mind. If he learns about the treasure in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, I’m truly afraid that something will happen. I don’t want to see that happen.”","Yang Sijie used both emotional manipulation and logic in his words.","However, all he accomplished was disgusting Little Peach.","When Little Peach and Yang Sijie interacted, she placed Begin Lady’s imprint on Yang Sijie.","Begin Lady had already told Little Peach about how Yang Sijie had sold her out at the imperial meeting.","Yang Hanxian had already died at the hands of Lin Yuan’s subordinate, and there was no way for him to target Little Peach.","The situation over at Sky Creation’s tree castle had already been concluded.","It was clear that Yang Sijie had no idea that the five Truth Association experts had died.","This was unsurprising as Yang Hanxian had personally led a team of imperial guards to Sky Creation’s tree castle.","Including Yang Hanxian, everyone he had brought with him had died.","Yang Sijie dared not to send people to shadow Yang Hanxian while the latter was in charge.","When she saw that Yang Sijie was still acting in front of him, Little Peach looked amused.","“Yang Sijie, your acting skills aren’t bad. With such acting skills, you stand a chance at becoming the head of the Divine Wood Federation.”","Yang Sijie could not help but smile when he heard Little Peach praise him.","But a moment later, he noticed that Little Peach’s words were layered.","What did she mean by saying his acting was not bad? Could it be that she had realized he was acting? This should not be!","Yang Sijie could be certain that his facade had been perfect.","At that moment, Yang Sijie truly became alarmed.","If Little Peach was sure that he was acting and abandoned him by refusing to work with him, how would he be allowed to continue living?","When she saw that Yang Sijie was about to make up excuses, Little Peach went on to say, “The people from the Truth Association are dead, including your father and the troops he brought. All of you deserve to die for disrespecting Lord Lin Yuan who saved Begin Lady!","“I’ll send you to meet with him now! If you want to fight with him you can do so in hell!”","Little Peach’s words caused terror and despair to spread across Yang Sijie’s face.","She did not give him any chance to speak before she reached out her hand and killed him immediately.","The Yang family had two Immortal experts in the imperial court. One was at beginner Immortal while the other was at intermediate Immortal.","Ever since Begin Lady had successfully set its spirit fire alight and evolved into an intermediate faerie, Little Peach had reached advanced Immortal and was very close to reaching pinnacle Immortal.","Little Peach knew that her power had increased because of Little Peach’s bloodline and that she would never be able to reach Eternal.","However, she had more than enough power to eliminate the two Immortal experts from the Yang family.","Little Peach wanted to do all she could to help Lin Yuan. This was her way of doing her part in repaying Lin Yuan.","After Little Peach killed Yang Sijie, she left the bedroom and decided to trigger her Immortal body.","Peach flower branches extended out from her sleeve. Almost immediately, white and pink peach flowers bloomed all over the branches.","Every step Little Peach took would be followed by flying flower petals.","Little Peach was holding two swords made of peachwood. There were rustling white and pink peach flowers blooming all over the swords.","The peach flower branches that extended out of the bottom of her skirt stole the lives of everything within the cage that her aura created.","Little Peach’s unrestrained unleashing of her aura immediately attracted the attention of two of the Yang experts who did not understand the situation.","The two peach flower swords drew two beautiful lines consisting of ten words in the sky.","Two flowers of blood bloomed in the sky.","Little Peach started to truly purge the imperial court.","Little Peach killed every lifeform in the imperial court, including a small ant in the garden.","She knew that Lin Yuan now had irreparable enmity with the Yang family after his subordinates had killed Yang Hanxian.","Little Peach would not allow such nuisances to continue existing in the world.","After interacting with humans for decades, Little Peach knew how hatred could morph into terrifying motivation that also propelled growth.","At that moment, the imperial court could be described as the aftermath of a massacre of every living creature.","On this lifeless land, Little Peach was a picture of white and pink as she stood arrogantly above the carnage.","She used peach blossom branches to gather the corpses and push them into the palace of the imperial court.","Although Little Peach was a plant-type fey and could consume flesh as her nutrients, it did not like doing so.","After growing off of Begin Lady’s bloodline, Little Peach now saw the flesh of other lifeforms as dirty.","...","Lin Yuan had a subordinate that liked to consume flesh, and it could finish off this pile of corpses so they did not go to waste.","After settling everything, Little Peach deactivated her Immortal body and waited for Lin Yuan to lead his people into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court."]},{"number":2053,"title":"Chapter 2053 Sky City’s Second Class 5 Creation Master!","paragraphs":["2053 Sky City’s Second Class 5 Creation Master!","When Begin Lady killed Fifth Page Truth’s envoy and took control of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird, it cast its gaze on the faction spies who were watching.","None of the faction spies dared to hold Lin Yuan’s gaze for more than a second, and anyone who did meet his eyes would instinctively look away.","Given the circumstances, the faction spies should be fleeing in droves. However, none of them dared to move an inch while Lin Yuan was here, for fear of earning his ire and ending up like Yang Hanxian.","Since Lin Yuan even dared to kill Yang Hanxian, there was no way that their lives mattered to him.","Lin Yuan stored the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird that Begin Lady had captured using the water currents into his ring before he returned to the tree castle.","He could leave White Speak to clean up the battlefield.","Although White Speak was a dimensional lifeform, it knew what was useful and could be kept and what could be thrown away.","Yi Huailonga and Yi Huailu led the members of the Yi family into the hall in the tree castle. Both of them were beside themselves with excitement.","However, their excitement stemmed from different reasons.","Yi Huailong was excited because after Lin Yuan killed Yang Hanxian, there was no way that the rest of the Yang family had any chance of joining Lin Yuan even if they got on their knees and begged.","It was time for the Yi family to rise in ranks. Soon, he would be able to lead the Yi family into the sacred imperial court.","Without the Truth Association, the Yang, Su, and Bai families, the Yi family was indeed the strongest native faction in Sacred Forest City.","Yi Huailong was confident that he would be able to handle any resistance from the other families.","Moreover, Sky Creation had revealed their true power.","All the other factions knew that the Yi family was supported by Sky Creation. It was unlikely that any faction wanted to die.","Thus, the Yi family’s entrance into the imperial court would be extremely smooth.","However, Yi Huailong also knew the reason he could lead the Yi family into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","In order to enter the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, he needed to remain loyal to Lin Yuan and sincerely carry out tasks for him.","Besides being the head of the Yi family and the incoming ruler of the imperial court, Yi Huailong knew that he was just a normal member of Sky City.","Meanwhile, Yi Huailu was not happy because the Yi family was about to become the rulers of the Divine Wood Federation.","His sole focus was on increasing his Creation Master power.","Ever since he was young, Yi Huailu knew that his older brother had control issues and did not need a second opinion when it came to managing the family.","Otherwise, it would affect their brotherly relationship.","When Yi Huailu realized this at a young age, he put all of his efforts into his Creation Master skills.","Ever since he consumed the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar and cleansed his body of impurities to recover his health, he felt as though his sensing of that road had reopened again.","He had just abruptly captured that feeling.","Yi Huailu was like a person who had been pacing outside a gate for a long time but could not step through them.","However, an accidental step through the gate allowed Yi Huailu to finally see the opportunity to enter the gates.","Once he entered the gates, he would be part of a new world related to Creation Masters. He would be able to truly understand many different things that perplexed him in the past.","At that moment, he finally understood why the gap between federations with and without Class 5 Creation Masters was so large and why the federations with Class 5 Creation Masters looked down on those without.","If Class 4 Creation Masters were dirt on the ground, Class 5 Creation Masters would be clouds floating in the sky. How could dirt compare with clouds?","The first thought that Yi Huailu had after becoming a Class 5 Creation Master was not to help his brother develop the Yi family but to feel genuine gratitude for Lin Yuan.","Ever since Yi Huailu was young, he was a dreamer.","Lin Yuan had allowed Yi Huailu to fulfill his dreams and begin walking down the path he had been yearning for a long time.","It could be said that Lin Yuan had given Yi Huailu a new life.","When Lin Yuan returned to the tree castle, Yi Huailong was about to say something to him, but Yi Huailu was faster and said with moving thankfulness, “Lord, I just grabbed an opportunity. If my guess is right, I should be a Class 5 Creation Master now!”","Yi Huailu’s words shocked Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, Yi Huailong, and the rest of the Yi family’s direct disciples.","Lin Yuan was not stunned because of Yi Huailu’s news. He had been expecting Yi Huailu to become a genuine Class 5 Creation Master. After all, he had already been so close.","But he did not expect Yi Huailu to cross the obstacle that stumped other Class 4 Creation Masters their entire lives so soon.","This meant that Sky City finally had its second Class 5 Creation Master. This time, it was a living, breathing, true Class 5 Creation Master.","It was true that Di Wanmi was a Class 5 Creation Master. However, she no longer had any potential to speak of.","Meanwhile, Yi Huailu had boundless potential in his future.","Liu Jie looked at Yi Huailu seriously.","Now that Yi Huailu had become a Class 5 Creation Master, his identity and status had changed completely.","Although Yi Huailu had joined Sky City, he was still part of one of the Divine Wood Federation’s native factions.","With Yi Huailu now a Class 5 Creation Master, the Divine Wood Federation would become a federation with a Class 5 Creation Master. This would cause their power to skyrocket.","Previously, Liu Jie had not felt much about Lin Yuan helping the Yi family.","After all, Yi Huailong had not even reached Immortal and did not have what it took to command the Divine Wood Federation.","Rather than helping the Yi family climb the ranks, it might be better to nurture a few obedient helpers to take control of the Divine Wood Federation.","Yi Huailong was very ambitious. Despite having joined Sky City, he still did all he could to protect the Yi family’s benefits while he was working for Sky City.","But now that Yi Huailu was a Class 5 Creation Master, he could help Yi Huailong reach Eternal.","Given the situation, the previously only somewhat significant Yi family could not only help Lin Yuan manage the Divine Wood Federation but even the Startling Lines Continent in the future.","There was now a Class 5 Creation Master in the Startling Lines Continent.","If the Startling Lines Continent’s three federations fused, they could send out attendees to the Major Federation Meeting and fight for resources.","...","Yi Huailu had just grabbed the opportunity to become a Class 5 Creation Master but had not told Yi Huailong and the rest of the Yi family about it previously.","Yi Huailong and the members of the Yi family were not just excited.","The Divine Wood Federation was in a state of chaos, and the native factions were all afraid of being unable to sleep soundly."]},{"number":2054,"title":"Chapter 2054 This is the Yi family’s Own Glory!","paragraphs":["2054 This is the Yi family’s Own Glory!","Yet, the Yi family was the exception.","Just as much as the other factions were anxious, the Yi family was excited and hopeful.","As Yi Huailong led the members of the Yi family into the tree castle and waited for Lin Yuan to restore the Yi family.","Yi Huailong and the rest of the Yi family saw from the window in the Hollowed Tamarix how Yang Hanxian and the imperial guards were killed by Di Wanmi.","The sight filled Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu with a conclusive happiness.","But now, there was additional joy.","Everyone in the Yi family knew what Yi Huailu becoming a Class 5 Creation Master meant for the Yi family.","Lin Yuan helping the Yi family to enter the Divine Wood Federation was saving them. But Yi Huailu evolving to Class 5 Creation Master strengthened the Yi family’s foundation.","These two situations could not be discussed as the same matter.","Lin Yuan said to Yi Huailu with a smile, “Congratulations on becoming a Class 5 Creation Master! I will send Di Wanmi to have a chat with you later.”","Lin Yuan’s intention was not for Di Wanmi to teach Yi Huailu.","Every Class 5 Creation Master walked down a different path that had to be their own. It was impossible for them to learn from each other.","But Yi Huailu belonged to the Divine Wood Federation, which had never had a Class 5 Creation Master. Thus, he had to have less knowledge about Class 5 Creation Masters than Di Wanmi, who came from the Radiance Federation.","Di Wanmi could share the knowledge with Yi Huailu to save him some detours.","Yi Huailu immediately understood Lin Yuan’s intention and bowed in thanks to Lin Yuan as he said, “Lord, now that I’m a Class 5 Creation Master, I’m much more useful than before. You can instruct me to do anything you need.”","Yi Huailu’s words sounded like he was trying to curry favor with Lin Yuan and demonstrate his loyalty.","This was exactly what Yi Huailu was thinking. However, he was being genuine and not putting on a show.","The moment that Yi Huailu became a Class 5 Creation Master, he knew that Sky City’s foundation was much stronger than he could even imagine.","Lin Yuan had gifted heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to Yi Huailong.","Pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters could nurture heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls with outer layers. However, just like nurturing a Bronze/Legend fey, both events only had a small probability of happening.","It was possible that a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master could not nurture one even after 20 to 30 years had passed.","Yi Huailu clearly remembered that the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that Lin Yuan had gifted Yi Huailong were not the kind that were commonly seen.","Yi Huailu had tested the purity of the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls and found that it had 98% purity.","At the time, Yi Huailu thought that all Class 5 Creation Masters could achieve this.","But now that he was a Class 5 Creation Master, he noticed that it was just as difficult for him to nurture such a level of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that it was for pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters to nurture Bronze/Legend feys.","This was enough for Yi Huailong to know that Sky Creation had an even more powerful Creation Master.","The gap between him and Sky Creation’s Creation Master might be even larger than the gap between pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters and his current level.","By being willing to offer heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls of such level as gifts, it meant that it was not difficult for him to obtain such level of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","This was even more terrifying!","At that moment, Yi Huailu finally understood that once one reached a higher level, one would realize that the world was even larger than expected.","Whether it was from the angle of repaying the favor or for the sake of his future development, Yi Huailu was glad he could join Sky Creation.","Lin Yuan was delighted that Yi Huailu had become a Class 5 Creation Master.","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “You and your brother should lead the family into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court now. Everything is settled in the imperial court.”","Begin Lady had given permission to Little Peach to slaughter and clean up the lifeforms in the imperial court.","Otherwise, Little Peach would not have dared to do so.","Begin Lady had conjured this idea because it had absorbed Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls.","When Su Jian and Bai Dong planned for their families to siege the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, both of them had the same idea of killing every person in the imperial court to ensure that there would be no fallout from the matter.","This was indeed the most advantageous decision for the Su and Bai families.","Doing so would also be the most beneficial for the Yi family.","This was why Begin Lady had told Little Peach to do so.","After Little Peach settled matters and cleansed the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, Begin Lady reported the situation to Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan had only recently arrived in this world, he might have felt that Begin Lady’s methods were too cruel.","But after a year of growth and training, and changing from a feeble regular person to who he was now, Lin Yuan knew that being merciful toward one’s enemies would be an act of cruelty to their own faction.","When Yi Huailong heard what Lin Yuan said, he knew that it was time for him to speak. He hurriedly took a step forward and said, “Lord Lin Yuan, the Yi family are who we are today because of you! We have six White Elephant Vine Flower Sedans. Please ride in the frontmost one into the imperial court!”","Yi Huailong was trying to invite Lin Yuan and express his respect.","The White Elephant Vine Flower Sedan was iconic for the Yi family.","The Yi family’s crest had a flowering vine wrapped around a white elephant on it.","By having Lin Yuan sit on the frontmost White Elephant Vine Flower Sedan while Yi Huailong sat behind him, everyone in Sacred Forest City would be able to see what was essentially a declaration of Lin Yuan being king.","Moreover, Yi Huailong also extended this invitation to Lin Yuan as a means of testing Lin Yuan’s intention. He wanted to know what his plans for the Yi family were after they entered the imperial court.","If Lin Yuan accepted his invitation to sit on the frontmost White Elephant Vine Flower Sedan, this meant he would interfere in all matters of the Divine Wood Federation.","If Lin Yuan turned him down, it meant that the Yi family would be able to truly rule over the Divine Wood Federation.","Selfishly, Yi Huailong hoped that Lin Yuan would turn him down. Otherwise, he would not be able to act freely even if he entered the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","At that moment, Lin Yuan said, “I won’t be going with the Yi family to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. This is the Yi family’s own glory. I’m sure you will call for a meeting of all the factions in Sacred Forest City as your first action in the imperial court. I won’t be participating in the meeting either. The Yi family can preside over it yourselves.”","..."]},{"number":2055,"title":"Chapter 2055 The Divine Wood Federation’s Ambition!","paragraphs":["2055 The Divine Wood Federation’s Ambition!","Lin Yuan paused for a moment before he went on to say, “Yi Huailu has become a Class 5 Creation Master. Although the shadow of Sky Creation hangs over the Yi family, the Yi family is the one who has to safeguard the Divine Wood Federation.","“Remember what you told me. I hope that there won’t be any more slums in the Divine Wood Federation ten years from now. At the very least, everyone must have a place to stay. Additionally, the Divine Wood Federation can now proudly attend the Major Federation Meeting and let the entire world know of your existence.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused Yi Huailong, Yi Huailu, the rest of the Yi family, and Ding Chengshuo’s eyes to well up with tears.","Yi Huailong, Yi Huailu, and Ding Chengshuo knew that Lin Yuan came to Sacred Forest City for the sake of resources.","Lin Yuan clearly had sufficient power to forcefully dominate the Divine Wood Federation.","However, he did not use brute force like the Truth Association after entering the Divine Wood Federation. Instead, he used Creation Master resources to trade for resources.","Although Lin Yuan could take control of the Divine Wood Federation anytime he wanted, he had no intention of doing so. Rather, he warned Yi Huailong to do good by the Divine Wood Federation.","This was enough to tell Lin Yuan’s character and that it was one worth being respected.","Yi Huailong looked at Lin Yuan with tears in his eyes and said, “Lord, I will make sure to do everything I promised you. Don’t worry. In my hands, the Divine Wood Federation will definitely prosper!”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “I will stay in Sacred Forest City for another two days before leaving. I will be taking the Hollowed Tamarix with me. If anything happens in the future, remember to contact me with that piece of paper I gave you. I will also respond to you using that paper.”","Yi Huailu responded to Lin Yuan with a question, “Lord, do you want me to follow you? You...”","Before Yi Huailu could finish speaking, Lin Yuan cut him off by saying, “If you follow me, Yi Huailong won’t be able to truly help the Divine Wood Federation prosper. The Yi family doesn’t have to worry about the Iron Hammer Federation. The next ruler of the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court will make contact with you and strengthen the trade between your two federations so that there will no longer be starvation during the Iron Hammer Federation’s winter season and the Divine Wood Federation will have no lack of metals, minerals, leather, and furs. They won’t have to be luxury goods anymore!”","Lin Yuan’s words put Yi Huailong at ease.","Yi Huailong was most afraid that under his leadership, the Iron Hammer Federation would lose their minds over hunger and invade the Divine Wood Federation.","Even if Yi Huailu was now a Class 5 Creation Master, he could not produce Class 5 Creation Master resources in an instant.","Spirit qi professionals also needed time to digest the Class 5 Creation Master resources.","Given the situation, if most of the tribes and experts from the Iron Hammer Federation invaded the Divine Wood Federation and started slaughtering mindlessly, the Divine Wood Federation would be helpless to fight back. It was even possible for the experts of the Iron Hammer Federation to make it into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","However, there was no need for Yi Huailong to worry about this anymore. In fact, he hoped that the trade between the two federations would be strengthened just like Lin Yuan said.","After getting to know Lin Yuan and learning how large the world was, Yi Huailong’s tunnel vision was gone and his thinking had changed.","In order for the Divine Wood Federation to develop properly, it was necessary for them to become close to the Iron Hammer Federation and deepen their trading relationship.","With Lin Yuan facilitating the process, the Divine Wood Federation would truly be able to secure profits in their current weak state.","Lin Yuan saw the Startling Lines Continent as Sky City’s incubator. Since it was an incubator, it would be better to nurture development than to rob and steal.","Lin Yuan did not need to keep too many resources on hand.","In the future, when he was establishing Sky City, he only needed to let Yi Huailong know and Yi Huailong would do all he could to help him obtain the resources he needed.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan had already taken control of the Divine Wood Federation and no longer needed to gather information on his own. If he needed any information, he could go to Yi Huailong directly.","Although Yi Huailong had his own selfishness, he had still sworn his loyalty to Lin Yuan on his Law Rune. Thus, he would do all he could to fulfill Lin Yuan’s requests and remain loyal.","However, the Love Music Centers were still everywhere in the Divine Wood Federation because Su Yiren depended on them to raise the Absolute Love Poppy’s Stars.","Lin Yuan intended to let Su Yiren know when he returned that the Love Music Centers would be working with the Yi family so the Love Music Centers could oversee all of the resources in the Divine Wood Federation.","Once the Love Music Centers seamlessly controlled all of the resources in the Divine Wood Federation, Yi Huailong would not have to exert that much effort to fulfill Lin Yuan’s requests and could make use of the Love Music Centers’ sources.","After he sent the Yi family off, Lin Yuan stretched.","After more than a month, the matters in the Divine Wood Federation had finally been settled.","Lin Yuan had decided to remain in Sacred Forest City for another two days before returning to the underground palace because he wanted to help the Yi family stabilize the situation. If anything unexpected happened, he would be able to help the Yi family.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan wanted to hand an order to Yi Huailong so Yi Huailong could help Lin Yuan to gather the resources at the imperial court tomorrow morning.","It went without saying that there were no specific names of resources on the list but just types.","For example, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil needed feys that could extract pure elemental energy in order to evolve its bloodline after it evolved to Satan.","It could be said that Lin Yuan also needed spiritual ingredients that could extract pure elemental energy.","The Sovereign Perfect Touch Wisteria also needed it.","When Yi Huailong accumulated all of this type of resources during the imperial meeting tomorrow, he would be able to sweep the Divine Wood Federation clean of it.","Liu Jie walked over to Lin Yuan and said, “Lin Yuan, it’s been hard on you. Go and rest properly!”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “Big Brother Liu, we haven’t properly browsed Sacred Forest City yet. Why don’t we shop through Sacred Forest City for the next two days? We’ll also be able to bring back some regional products for Su Yiren and Ta Lei when we return to the underground palace. We can also send a portion of it to Wen Yu and Su Ningxiang.”","The two days flew by quickly. Two days ago, Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu had been sitting side by side on the White Elephant Vine Flower Sedans as they journeyed from Sky Creation’s tree castle to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","On the way there, no faction dared to act indignant towards the Yi family.","Even the direct disciples of the Yu family who always butted heads with the Yi family instinctively kept their heads down as a sign of respect when they saw the members of the Yi family riding on the White Elephant Vine Flower Sedans."]},{"number":2056,"title":"Chapter 2056 Belongs to Only You!","paragraphs":["2056 Belongs to Only You!","In terms of power, the Yi family was the undisputed ruler of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Resisting against the Yi family at such a time would be no different from running to one’s own death.","After these series of changes, all of the families in Sacred Forest City retracted their ambitions. All they wanted now was peace.","The White Elephant Vine Flower Sedans headed straight into the imperial court’s inner hall.","!!","Yi Huailong did not see a single person along the way.","Yi Huailong immediately understood what Lin Yuan said by ‘settling’.","The moment that he opened the door of the main hall, Yi Huailong saw Little Peach and the pile of corpses next to her.","Yi Huailong, Yi Huailu, and the rest of the Yi family’s main members sucked in sharp breaths when they glimpsed this sight.","Little Peach looked at Yi Huailong and said, “Go and organize the corpses and send them into the tree castle. Lord Lin Yuan’s subordinates need to eat these. The Sacred Wood Mystic Realm no longer exists and I will no longer be staying in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. Lord Lin Yuan knows this.”","When she was done speaking, Little Peach did not wait for Yi Huailong to respond but immediately headed over to Begin Lady.","Yi Huailong only regained his senses a moment later and pointed out 20 of his most trusted members of the Yi family, including his daughter Yi Lingxi.","Yi Huailong wanted Yi Lingxi to lead the rest of the 19 members of the Yi family to deliver the bodies over to Lin Yuan’s subordinate.","This would demonstrate the importance he placed on the matter as well as give these members of the Yi family the chance to appear before Lin Yuan.","Once he became old, Lin Yuan would need to protect these members if the Yi family was ever in danger.","Rather than waiting till then for these members to make contact with Lin Yuan, it would be better for them to leave an impression on Lin Yuan now.","Once the bodies were moved out of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, there was not even an ant left.","Yi Huailong instructed the main members of the Yi family to fetch the collateral members and servants of the Yi family who had fled Sacred Forest City to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","As one of the four main families in Sacred Forest City, they had hundreds of direct descendants and thousands of collateral descendants.","These were just the main and collateral members. After many years of development, one could only imagine how large the collateral families had grown.","Each collateral member of the Yi family had at least two servants while each main member of the Yi family had over 20 servants. In total there were over 1,000,000 servants.","The Divine Wood Federation was large. Previously, the entire Yang family, including their collateral members, stayed in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Yi Huailong planned on doing the same.","Once the Yi family’s collateral descendants and servants were fetched into the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, the servants could clean up the imperial court and decorate the place.","Once the imperial court was properly decorated, they would be able to host all of the native factions in Sacred Forest City in an imperial meeting to welcome the Yi family as the new rulers of the Divine Wood Federation.","During this imperial meeting, Yi Huailong intended to get rid of all the factions that opposed him.","Many things needed to be done in the Divine Wood Federation. Because of Lin Yuan, Yi Huailong had a noble goal.","Anyone who did not side with him would affect the goal from coming to fruition.","Yi Huailong was greatly looking forward to his and Yi Huailu’s hard work enabling the Divine Wood Federation’s Divine Wood Envoys to attend the Major Federation Meeting in ten years’ time. They would use bloodshed and stake their lives to defend the Divine Wood Federation’s pride.","The collateral descendants and servants who had fled Sacred Forest City were hiding in a small villa outside of Sacred Forest City. All of them were filled with fear and anxiousness.","If anything happened to the Yi family’s direct descendants who remained in the Sacred Forest City, there was no way that these collateral descendants and servants would be allowed to continue living as the enemies of the Yi family would definitely exterminate them.","The Yi family’s collateral descendants and members watched the fighting between factions all these years.","In the past, the Yi family had almost been destroyed because of the Bai family. The events were still vivid in the minds of many Yi elders.","However, they were even more terrified of the future.","Since Sacred Forest City had been sealed off, they could not catch a hint of what was happening within the city.","As such, the collateral descendants and servants continued living life while gripped by nervousness.","None of them imagined receiving such magnificent news so quickly.","When they fled, even the head of their family had clearly been perturbed.","But now, the Yi family had become the rulers of the Divine Wood Federation.","Once they returned to Sacred Forest City, they would no longer be living at the Yi family’s residence but in the imperial court.","All of the Yi family’s collateral descendants and servants started whooping with excitement.","The villa they were hiding out at was not far from Sacred Forest City. It was only about an hour away.","The sky had not even turned dark by the time that the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court was cleaned up to look as good as new, with the Yi family’s crests placed everywhere.","All of the Yang family’s crests had been destroyed and replaced with the crest featuring the Yi family’s white elephants surrounded by flowering vines.","Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu sat in the main hall of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","After a moment of silence, Yi Huailong said, “Huailu, we are brothers from the same mother. No matter how hard I think. I still think you should take the seat as the leader of the Divine Wood Federation.”","Yi Huailu calmly looked at Yi Huailong.","It was because they came from the same mother that Yi Huailu knew Yi Huailong so well.","Yi Huailu was well aware of how badly Yi Huailong wanted to sit at the top of the Divine Wood Federation.","Yi Huailong always had a strong desire for power and control. He had also been the one who managed every single matter in the Yi family and did not like it when Yi Huailu gave his input.","Hence, Yi Huailong’s words were not sincere but a test.","Yi Huailu did not like Yi Huailong’s mindset.","If he did not set Yi Huailong at ease, it was very likely that Yi Huailong would put up his guard against him.","As such, Yi Huailu said seriously, “Big Brother, you know that I’ve only been focused on Creation Master abilities. I’ve never managed the Yi family in the past, and there’s no way I have what it takes to manage the Divine Wood Federation now.","“I will properly assist you and nurture a group of Creation Masters for the Yi family and Sky Creation. In the next few years, I will do all I can to make your feys stronger than Yang Hanxian’s Iris Wood Vine Dragon was. Now that I’m a Class 5 Creation Master, I can do this. So, the throne of the Divine Wood Federation belongs to only you. You also need to fulfill your promise to Lord Lin Yuan!”","..."]},{"number":2057,"title":"Chapter 2057 Disaster of Extermination!","paragraphs":["2057 Disaster of Extermination!","Yi Huailong was fully at ease when he heard what Yi Huailu said. He opened his arms and wrapped Yi Huailu in an embrace.","Yi Huailu’s face broke into a grin when he received the brotherly hug.","His words caused Yi Huailong to put down any barriers he had up against his brother.","Yi Huailu did not plan on staying by Yi Huailong’s side for his entire life.","Once he used his hard work to elevate the Divine Wood Federation, Yi Huailu hoped to remain by Lin Yuan’s side to achieve even higher heights as a Creation Master.","This was what he wanted to do. His dream was to reach even greater heights of being a Creation Master.","If not for this mindset, Yi Huailu would never have been able to find the path to becoming a Class 5 Creation Master in a place like the Startling Lines Continent.","Although he had only become a Class 5 Creation Master with Lin Yuan’s help, this was because he had been sabotaged and injured his roots.","If many impurities had not entered Yi Huailu’s body and injured his roots, he would not have needed Lin Yuan’s help to use the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar to cleanse his body of the impurities and recover his roots.","If that were the case, he could have become a Class 5 Creation Master a decade ago.","For a person to rely on their own abilities to become a Class 5 Creation Master in middle age without going down a path of wickedness like Di Wanmi had, it could be said that Yi Huailu had the same level of Creation Master talent as the Bamboo Monarch and even more than Chef Supreme.","Once the Yi family successfully entered the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, Yi Huailong could lay a large burden down.","He immediately gave the order for the Yi family’s collateral descendants to disseminate the news to all the factions in Sacred Forest City and to inform the other City Lords of cities across the Divine Wood Federation to head to the imperial court to attend the imperial meeting.","As the new king of the Divine Wood Federation, Yi Huailong had to set the right tone of might.","It would be terrifying if a ruler did not demonstrate might.","If the people below him did not respect him as the ruler, the Divine Wood Federation would crumble and fall apart in an instant.","He had already promised Lin Yuan that he would lead the Divine Wood Federation to prosperity, and there was no way he would fail at just demonstrating his might.","At that moment, Yi Huailong was ready to kill.","If any faction appeared even the slightest bit opposed to the Yi family’s rule, there was no need for that faction to continue existing.","After Yi Huailong sent out the order, it did not take long for the various factions in Sacred Forest City to prepare to head to the imperial court to show their support for the Yi family.","Frankly, even before the Yi family’s collateral descendants arrived to give them the instruction, many factions had already received word from their spies and wanted to express their congratulations to the Yi family.","This was because no other faction in Sacred Forest City besides the Yi family was deserving to preside over the imperial court.","Furthermore, Sky Creation had killed Yang Hanxian and the members of the Truth Association. There was no way they would not support a faction they had acknowledged.","It was clear that the Yi family and Sky Creation were close.","Every head of the faction in Sacred Forest City knew what kind of person Yi Huailong was. They knew that they needed to respect him.","If he ever sensed a loss of respect from them, it would be the time that their lives came to an end.","However, Yi Huailong was not the type to have personal vendettas. It was unlikely that Yi Huailong would eliminate the factions that had offended the Yi family in the past now that he had taken control of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","In the years that the Yi family had been bullied by the Bai family, almost all of the factions that had been on good terms with the Bai family had done their part in trampling the Yi family.","It was true that the Bai family had been stronger than the Yi family.","Although the Yi family’s previous leader had taken out two of the Bai family’s Immortal experts, the Bai family still had one more.","The Yi family was fully held up by Yi Huailong.","The Bai family had bitter hatred toward the Yi family, and it was only after pressure from the Yang and Su families that the Bai family did not successfully destroy the Yi family.","The Bai family had built their own chamber of commerce within Sacred Forest City and begun many large-scale trading businesses.","Many factions had racked their brains to get on the good side of the Bai family and trade with them.","Eventually, many faction members noticed that the best way to convince the Bai family to acquiesce was not to engage with the Yi family.","Thus, while many factions dared not offend the Yi family publicly, they secretly turned away all business dealings with the Yi family.","This allowed the Yi family’s development to be severely compromised.","If the Yi family wanted to set the record straight, they would have to eliminate at least 60 factions.","It was likely that the most terrified of the 60 factions was the Yu family!","In the past few years, the Yu family had been striving to become one of the four largest families in Sacred Forest City.","The leader of the Yu family, Yu Yihe, had once publicly issued a challenge to the Yi family and called Yi Huailong a coward during many drinking sessions.","At that time, the Bai family had been doing all they could to make life difficult for the Yi family. Thus, they had been secretly supporting Yu Yihe.","As a result, Yu Yihe was shaking with terror.","Yu Yihe dared to publicly challenge Yi Huailong because of the Bai family’s support and because he was a pinnacle thearch-class expert.","For the past few months, he had provoked Yi Huailong into a fight. Eventually, Yu Yihe had even emerged victorious over Yi Huailong by half an attack.","Yu Yihe’s main fey was able to counter Yi Huailong’s feys.","But at the crux of the matter, Yu Yihe was the only thearch-class expert of the Yu family while the Yi family had four thearch-class experts besides Yi Huailong. In terms of overall power, the Yu family was not on the same level as the Yi family.","All the factions of Sacred Forest City watched as the direct descendants of the Yi family walked out of Sky Creation’s tree castle and climbed onto the White Elephant Vine Flower Sedans as they headed to the imperial court.","Even if Yu Yihe did openly clash against Yi Huailong, he would have to consider Sky Creation’s consequential reaction.","To all the factions in Sacred Forest City, Sky Creation was a peak that they could never hope to reach.","The direct descendants of the Yu family were all terrified to the point of pulling their necks in like ostriches.","Yu Yihe sat in his study room with his brow furrowed as he looked at the girl sobbing in front of him.","When he could no longer stand her sobbing, Yu Yihe could not help but slam his hand down on the table, releasing a loud bang.","“How can I, Yu Yihe, have such a useless daughter! The Su family deserved to be destroyed! What did the Su and Bai families do? Even if they’re dead, they have no one to blame! Even if Su Yunduan wasn’t dead, I wouldn’t allow you to marry him!”","...","The sobbing girl halted and looked at Yu Yihe with disbelief."]},{"number":2058,"title":"Chapter 2058 I’m Waiting For You!","paragraphs":["2058 I’m Waiting For You!","“Father, what are you saying? You’re the one who wanted me to marry Su Yunduan and was so insistent on us getting engaged! I never liked him so what does his death have to do with me?","“Mother told me that the Yi family is about to become the rulers of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. Our family has always been at odds with the Yi family. There’s no way they will let us off!”","Yu Yihe scoffed angrily.","“What a stupid way of thinking! Truly a stupid way of thinking! Yi Huailong will not only leave our family alone but will also support us in the future! There isn’t any other faction like our family in the entire Sacred Forest City! Once we’re gone, Yi Huailong will have no one to rule over!”","!!","When she heard what Yu Yihe said, Yu Feifei immediately stopped crying and asked, “Father, is what you say true?”","Yu Yihe nodded and replied, “It’s very likely to be so! I’m headed to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court now to speak with Yi Huailong!”","Yu Yihe rose to his feet and headed to the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court without riding a sedan.","Yu Yihe and Yi Huailong had been rivals for decades and felt that he knew Yi Huailong well.","This was why he was sure that Yi Huailong would not be taking any action despite the trouble he had caused him in the past.","However, there was a condition for this, which was that he needed to submit to Yi Huailong before the imperial meeting.","It was likely that Yi Huailong was waiting for him now!","If he did not submit to Yi Huailong before the imperial meeting, the Yu family would end up destroyed.","In spite of knowing this, Yu Yihe was not nervous at all.","All he did was look at the imperial court in the distance and let out a small sigh.","After all these years, it still ended in his loss to Yi Huailong.","For the sake of the Divine Wood Federation, he was going to be one of Yi Huailong’s subjects.","If Yi Huailong was able to sincerely accept him, he would support Yi Huailong with the full capabilities of the Yu family.","But if Yi Huailong only disregarded their past scuffles and was unwilling to give the Yu family the chance to develop, he would lead the Yu family away from Sacred Forest City and build a new city in a remote area that was far from the Divine Wood Federation’s main business district.","When Yu Yihe arrived at the entrance of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, he saw Yi Lingxi standing there as though she was waiting for someone.","Although Yu Yihe had been rivals with Yi Huailong and they were considered enemies, he had never put a junior like Yi Lingxi on the spot.","When he saw her in the past, he could ignore her and breeze past her.","But now, it was clearly inappropriate to do the same.","Yi Lingxi was Yi Huailong’s only daughter. Now that Yi Huailong was the ruler of the imperial court, Yi Lingxi was the First Princess of the Divine Wood Federation and had an extremely high status.","Yu Yihe had come to submit to Yi Huailong. Since this was his aim, he bowed and greeted Yi Lingxi, “Greetings, First Princess!”","Yi Lingxi accepted Yu Yihe’s address but did not put on any airs as she said, “Uncle Yu, my father asked me to wait for you here. He was sure that you would turn up. Let’s go into the main hall together. My father is waiting there!”","Yu Yihe was slightly stunned but managed to smile wryly.","Evidently, no one knew him better than his longtime rival.","Since Yi Huailong was willing to send Yi Lingxi to wait for him, it showed how important Yu Yihe was to him.","His importance to Yi Huailong gave him a better understanding of Yi Huailong’s character.","If he became the ruler of the imperial court, he would not put the Yi family at a spot and kill Yi Huailong but he would not offer Yi Huailong the same treatment he was receiving now.","Yi Huailong’s magnanimity and graciousness exceeded his own.","He followed Yi Lingxi into the main hall of the imperial court.","Yu Yihe was the head of the Yu family and the Yu family had maintained themselves second to the Yi family.","Not long ago, Yu Yihe decided to marry his daughter to the most outstanding direct disciple of the Su family, Su Yunduan.","Yu Yihe had not fought for this marriage because he was after the Su family’s power but because Su Yunduan was the only one with a countenance that met Yu Yihe’s satisfaction.","Yu Yihe had walked the path from the entrance of the imperial court to the main hall many times in the past.","But this time, the surname hanging over the imperial court had changed.","He was not going to greet Yang Hanxian but Yi Huailong.","When they arrived at the entrance of the main hall, Yi Lingxi made an ushering movement.","“Uncle Yu, please go in! I won’t be joining your discussion with my father!”","Yu Yihe nodded and strode into the imperial court’s main hall.","Yu Yihe saw that Yi Huailong and Yi Huailu were standing and discussing something.","There was a tradition in the Divine Wood Federation that when subjects entered the imperial court, they had to perform nine bows and 16 kowtows.","When Yu Yihe saw that Yi Huailong noticed his arrival, he immediately fell to his knees and began the tradition.","When he got to the last kowtow, Yu Yihe felt a pair of strong hands help him to his feet.","Yi Huailong chuckled cheerily and said, “Yihe! I knew you would come! You didn’t disappoint me after all!”","Yu Yihe clasped his hands together and shook them in front of Yi Huailong.","“I used to clash with you because I’m the head of the Yu family and want to give the Yu family a better future. When I arrived, I performed the customary nine bows and 16 kowtows to express my position as a subject. The top powers in the Divine Wood Federation have never been this week, and I’m sure you won’t have much labor under you. I’m willing to wholeheartedly support you. I hope that you’ll be able to give the Yu family a bright future! I can swear on my World Law that the Yu family will not do what the Su and Bai families did.”","Once Yu Yihe was done speaking, he heard Yi Huailong chuckle again.","“Yihe, I am indeed lacking helpers like you. You don’t have to swear. There is no need for that! Yi Huailu has become a Class 5 Creation Master, and anyone with a brain knows what to do. Since the Yi family has what it takes to become the rulers of the Divine Wood Federation, no one will dare to push us off our throne. In the future, the Yi family will become so strong that other factions will be clambering to join us.”","When Yu Yihe heard what Yi Huailong said, he looked at Yi Huailu in disbelief as astonishment flooded him.","What? Yi Huailu actually became a Class 5 Creation Master!"]},{"number":2059,"title":"Chapter 2059 Submission and Favor!","paragraphs":["2059 Submission and Favor!","Previously, Yi Huailu had been wheelchair-bound.","There was no question that his miraculous recovery was linked to Sky Creation.","It was no surprise that Sky Creation favored the Yi family so heavily since Yi Huailu had become a Class 5 Creation Master.","Yu Yihe had wondered whether the Yi family and Sky Creation were secretly in cahoots. Once their collaboration was over, the Yi family would take over the imperial court while Sky Creation would leave Sacred Forest City.","!!","Given Sky Creation’s power, there was no way that they would take root in Sacred Forest City.","But now, Yu Yihe dismissed that idea.","The Yi family now had a Class 5 Creation Master. Thus, no matter how strong Sky Creation was, there was no way they would cut their ties to the Yi family. At the crux of it all, Yi Huailu was very useful to Sky Creation.","It was no wonder the ever-cautious Yi Huailong was being so magnanimous now that the Yi family had a Class 5 Creation Master. He did not even need Yu Yihe to swear on his World Law.","Yu Yihe was glad that he had come to the imperial court to see Yi Huailong.","Although Yu Yihe was not aware of what Class 5 Creation Masters were capable of, he knew that pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters could already nurture emperor-class experts or even thearch-class experts if they were given sufficient resources.","Given the power that Sky Creation and the Truth Association demonstrated, it was likely that Class 5 Creation Masters could nurture Immortal experts.","Since the Yi family was capable of nurturing Immortal experts, Yu Yihe was no longer as important to the Yi family and the Divine Wood Federation as he had thought. If the Yi family wanted, they could produce armies of pinnacle thearch-class experts like him.","Yu Yihe was glad he chose to visit the imperial court to express his loyalty to Yi Huailong.","Given Yi Huailong’s suspicious personality, despite his claim he did not need Yu Yihe to swear his loyalty, there was no way he would trust and make use of Yu Yihe if he did not swear his loyalty.","Thus, Yu Yihe used the World Law he had comprehended to swear his loyalty to Yi Huailong.","Although Yi Huailong had said there was no need for Yu Yihe to swear his loyalty, he did not stop Yu Yihe from doing so. Rather, he smiled and waited for Yu Yihe to be done before he said,","“Yihe, we might be longtime rivals, but this is why we know each other well. You know what kind of person I am, and I know how you think.","“As long as you do your best for the Divine Wood Federation as one of my subjects, I can help the Yu family to prosper under the Yi family’s rule. However, I have a condition, which is that when my daughter succeeds me as the ruler of the imperial court, the Yu family must swear their loyalty to her just like you did for me!”","Yu Yihe did not look sorrowful that the future generations of the Yu family would have to submit to the Yi family. Rather, he smiled excitedly.","Yu Yihe was not extremely ambitious. He never strove for the Yu family to become the rulers of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","If Yi Huailong could keep his promise and help the Yu family become the most prosperous family in the Divine Wood Federation after the Yi family, it would be enough for Yu Yihe.","“Thank you, Your Majesty! I will definitely do everything I can to lead the Yu family in carrying out your wishes! Once I give up my seat, it will be passed to my daughter. I will assign my daughter to shadow the First Princess and swear her loyalty to her. From now on, the Yu family will support the First Princess in the same way that we support you.”","Yi Huailong beamed with ease when he heard Yu Yihe’s assurance.","As Yi Huailu watched the interaction between Yi Huailong and Yu Yihe, he felt troubled.","Yi Huailu felt that it was much simpler to increase his Creation Master power than it was to plot and scheme.","Yi Huailu intended to communicate with Di Wanmi before he used his Class 5 Creation Master abilities to increase his own and Yi Huailong’s powers to at least pinnacle Immortal even if they could not reach Eternal.","Otherwise, he would seem like a useless Class 5 Creation Master.","Yi Huailong now had complete control over the Yu family. Thus, he no longer needed to be overly considerate of Yu Yihe when he spoke and said straightforwardly, “Yihe, the Divine Wood Federation appears to be at our weakest in the past centuries, but this is only temporary! The Divine Wood Federation will be able to become strong very soon!","“At that time, we’ll be able to select Divine Wood Envoys, and the Divine Wood Hundred Sequence selection will be taken seriously instead of just a hoop that all families throw their direct descendants through. A decade later, the Divine Wood Federation will be able to try to send five Divine Wood Envoys to participate in the Major Federation Meeting.”","Participating in the Major Federation Meeting was an incredible honor for a small federation like the Divine Wood Federation.","Yu Yihe could tell that Yi Huailong was not overreaching for the sake of pulling wool over his eyes.","With Yi Huailu now a Class 5 Creation Master and the support of Sky Creation, there was no reason for him to put on an act.","Thus, Yi Huailong was talking about the responsibilities he would undertake now that he was the ruler of the Divine Wood Federation.","This set Yu Yihe’s passion aflame.","Firstly, Yu Yihe was a native of the Divine Wood Federation. Regardless of whether he was good or evil, he truly hoped that the Divine Wood Federation would be able to thrive. This was part of his sense of belonging to the Divine Wood Federation as a native.","Moreover, for the sake of the Yu family, they would only be able to garner more authority if the Divine Wood Federation became more powerful.","Once the Divine Wood Federation became stronger, they would be able to expand their trade to reach other federations or even the entire main world.","At that time, when the other continents mentioned the Divine Wood Federation and the Yi family, the Yu family that was directly under the Yi family might pop into their minds as well.","This was a prestige that Yu Yihe had always been chasing.","Yu Yihe said to Yi Huailong, “Your Majesty, if you’re willing to trust me, why don’t you let me handle the rules of the Divine Wood Hundred Sequence selection and the reignition of the Divine Wood Envoy selection?”","Yi Huailong could tell that Yu Yihe was taking initiative to alleviate his burdens so he patted Yu Yihe’s shoulder.","“I’ll leave this matter to you. Remember that this matter is extremely important. How well you do will determine my attitude toward the Yu family in the future.”","Soon after Yu Yihe came to see Yi Huailong, the imperial meeting officially began.","Besides Sacred Forest City, all the other City Lords of major cities came to Sacred Forest City because of the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm. It did not make a difference if the City Lords of smaller cities who could not enter the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm attended the imperial meeting or not."]},{"number":2060,"title":"Chapter 2060 Confirmed Sixth Type of Dimensional World!","paragraphs":["2060 Confirmed Sixth Type of Dimensional World!","Yu Yihe had become Yi Huailong’s servant, which meant that the Yu family was now subservient to the Yi family.","Yu Yihe decided that if any faction was disrespectful to Yi Huailong during the imperial meeting, he would take it upon himself to eliminate the offender without Yi Huailong having to do so himself.","However, among those who had managed to survive in Sacred Forest City to this day, none were stupid. All of them were aware of the circumstances.","Thus, during the imperial meeting, every family was extremely respectful and chose to submit to the Yi family.","Many families mentioned the Iron Hammer Federation during the imperial meeting.","Yi Huailong knew they were all afraid that the Iron Hammer Federation would attack the Divine Wood Federation in a starvation-fuelled frenzy and because they knew that the Divine Wood Federation lacked top combat power.","Yi Huailong had declared that Yi Huailu was a Class 5 Creation Master in order to bolster confidence.","He also promised that there was no way that the Iron Hammer Federation would go to war with the Divine Wood Federation, and that the two federations would be deepening their trade relationship so that the Divine Wood Federation would no longer lack fur, leather, and spiritual ingredients.","All of the promises that Yi Huailong made during the imperial meeting had come from his conversation with Lin Yuan.","Yi Huailong knew there was no way that Lin Yuan was lying. Hence, there was no need for him to be nervous and guarded against the Iron Hammer Federation. All he needed to do was expand the Divine Wood Federation as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan and Liu Jie put on the Faceless Papers and strolled around Sacred Forest City like any other regular person.","They bought a fair amount of delicacies.","The food in the Divine Wood Federation had a completely different style and taste to that of the Radiance Federation.","There were also redeeming qualities of the delicacies in the Divine Wood Federation.","Lin Yuan sent a large amount of food into the marsh world to give to Wen Yu and Sun Ningxiang.","The Mother of Bloodbath filled the Diamond fey storage box with the delicacies from the Divine Wood Federation so it could eat them whenever it wanted.","The Diamond fey storage boxes of the Radiance Federation had strong preservation effects.","After leisurely enjoying life for a short while, Lin Yuan returned to the tree castle and released the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird that Begin Lady had trapped within water currents.","Begin Lady changed into human form and said seriously, “Lin Yuan, the strange bird that you asked me to control is very weird! All of the energy in its body is controlled by a crystal emitting the aura of death. Even its soul is stored within the crystal. Its soul is very messy and is only focused on absorbing the aura of lifeforms. I used Su Jian and Bai Dong’s souls to sense it, but they don’t have any memory of this lifeform.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Lin Yuan had used True Data to check on the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird, but it was too strong. Thus, Lin Yuan had only been able to see its name.","But through Lin Yuan’s sensing of the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird and how the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s body had not been injured in the slightest, he knew that it was special in a way that other feys were not.","When the restrained Pilgrimage Corpse Bird was released, it struggled violently but still failed to escape the water currents.","Lin Yuan intended to properly examine the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","Lin Yuan sensed there was source-type power within the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird.","He was compelled to find out if the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird was a dimensional lifeform.","If the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird was a dimensional lifeform, Lin Yuan could ascertain from its characteristics that it did not come from the marsh, abyssal, water world, alien insect, or the subterranean dimensional rift.","If the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird came from a sixth type of dimensional world, such a dimensional world had never opened in the Radiance Federation before.","This meant that Tower Canon had used a special method to take control of a sixth type of dimensional rift.","It was possible that the sixth type of dimensional rift was related to Tower Canon’s 100-year ‘Sleeper’s Revival’ plan.","If the Truth Association had truly been set up by Fifth Page Truth, Lin Yuan decided that he would duke it out with Fifth Page Truth.","This would be his revenge on Fifth Page Truth who had stolen the Mother of Bloodbath’s mother, Jade Sundial’s, Eternal Heart.","Luckily, the Moon Empress had stolen Jade Sundial’s heavenly family crystal back and returned it to Heavenly Family Cottage.","Without the heavenly family fey’s heavenly family crystal, the heavenly family fey’s Eternal Heart could not be triggered. Otherwise, Fifth Page Truth would already have used Jade Sundial’s Eternal Heart.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan wanted to dig deeper into Tower Canon and find out more of their secrets.","Fifth Page Truth was the perfect seam for him to do so.","Previously, the Truth Association had been hiding in the shadows. But now, Lin Yuan had pulled back the curtain.","Lin Yuan was now a part of the shadows.","Now that he had the protection of Begin Lady, Lin Yuan did not think that Fifth Page Truth was capable of defeating Begin Lady.","Since Begin Lady had ignited its spirit fire, it was now stronger than the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan instructed Begin Lady to use a sword of water currents to slash at the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s body so he could better sense the source-type power within the bird’s body.","After sensing it, Lin Yuan could be absolutely certain that there was source-type power in the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird’s body.","Lin Yuan closed his eyes and decided to inject the faith power in his body into the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird to see if it would react.","Lin Yuan had tried injecting faith power into feys of the main world, but they had not reacted at all.","By contrast, dimensional lifeforms reacted to faith power like cats to catnip.","From the moment Lin Yuan released faith power, the captured Pilgrimage Corpse Bird let out a cry.","Lin Yuan could sense that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird badly craved faith power. Its craving was so strong that it leaked out of its body.","Even after Lin Yuan retracted the faith power, the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird did not settle down. It thrashed about until it exhausted itself before it finally quieted.","Lin Yuan was now 100% sure that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird was a dimensional lifeform.","Besides the five known types of dimensional worlds, there was a sixth dimensional world. Its lifeforms had the aura of decay, degradation, and death. The lifeforms’ souls and power were all housed in a crystal within their bodies.","This was very different from regular dimensional lifeforms.","When the bodies of these dimensional lifeforms were attacked, they were not harmed.","The only way to kill them would be to locate and destroy the crystal within their bodies.","..."]},{"number":2061,"title":"Chapter 2061 The Moon Empress’s Summoning!","paragraphs":["2061 The Moon Empress’s Summoning!","Lin Yuan intended to relay the information he had uncovered to the Moon Empress through the Thoughts Letter Paper so the Radiance Federation could become aware of it.","When they encountered these dimensional lifeforms in the future confrontations against Tower Canon, the Radiance Federation could be prepared instead of being caught off guard and toppled by their enemy.","During the time that Lin Yuan had been in the Divine Wood Federation, the Thoughts Letter Paper had been a very convenient means of communication.","Lin Yuan had kept up correspondence with the Moon Empress through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","For example, when he used the Extreme Token the Moon Empress had given him in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, the Moon Empress had been unable to sense it because the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had been a separate and sealed-off space.","It was only when Lin Yuan exited the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm and returned to the main world that the Moon Empress immediately realized that Lin Yuan had used the Extreme Token.","Lin Yuan immediately informed the Moon Empress that he was safe and not in any danger to set her mind at ease and prevent her from setting off to the Divine Wood Federation.","If the Moon Empress sensed that the Extreme Token had been used but had not received word through the Thoughts Letter Paper that Lin Yuan was safe, she would not have been able to sit still.","The Moon Empress quickly replied to Lin Yuan after hearing from him and told him to return to the Radiance Federation as soon as possible.","When Lin Yuan heard back from the Moon Empress, he immediately knew what she was thinking.","When the Moon Empress learned that the Great Lush Federation was under Fifth Page Truth’s control, she was afraid that he would get into a conflict with Fifth Page Truth.","The Moon Empress was unaware of Begin Lady’s existence, or that the major sea demon with the Purple Frigid Heavy Water had transformed into the emperor sea demon, as well as the rare sea demon Sacrifice.","Hence, the Moon Empress had no idea that he could boost the 8 Stars Fish World Sea Trump Card to 11 Stars.","However, if he were really to fight Fifth Page Truth, Lin Yuan was not confident he would emerge victorious even after using all his secret weapons if he did not have Begin Lady.","Fifth Page Truth had been able to kill Jade Sundial, who had been a pinnacle Eternal Heavenly Family Fey, despite also being in gestation.","It was easy for Lin Yuan to return to the Radiance Federation. All he had to do was head to the underground palace and pass through the Space Tunnel.","Lin Yuan had not returned to the Radiance Federation in more than a month.","It would also be good for him to go back and visit occasionally while he was training.","He had obtained many rare resources in the Divine Wood Federation that could not be found in the Radiance Federation.","Lin Yuan believed that they could be of use to the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan penned his serious response on the Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Lin Yuan: Master, I’ll be able to return within three days. I’ll head directly to the Radiant Moon Palace to see you!]","When she received Lin Yuan’s reply, the Moon Empress was able to rest slightly easier.","Lin Yuan could sense the Moon Empress’s deep concern for him through their communications on the Thoughts Letter Paper.","In her eyes, he would always be her disciple who he needed to protect.","At first, Lin Yuan had relied on the Moon Empress’ help. But slowly, he had progressed to the point where he was now able to help her.","Ever since he gave her the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, he slowly began paying her back. From the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies full of pure spirit qi to the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan had helped the Moon Empress to achieve immortality and removed the obstacles in her path to enable her to use the pure spirit qi to awaken her birth horoscope, begin walking down heaven’s path, and become a Class 6 Creation Master.","Yet, his journey of paying her back had only just begun.","Since he had promised the Moon Empress he would return to the Radiance Federation within three days, Lin Yuan could not stay any longer in the Divine Wood Federation.","He pondered for a moment before deciding to leave Begin Lady in the Divine Wood Federation.","However, Begin Lady turned him down.","Begin Lady saw Lin Yuan as the most important. It felt that its first priority was ensuring his safety. Thus, it should stay by his side.","If there was concern that Fifth Page Truth would cause trouble for the Yi family, Little Peach could be left in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court.","Little Peach could summon Begin Lady through her bloodline.","Lin Yuan was assured when he heard what Begin Lady said.","With Yu Yihe’s submission, the imperial meeting held by Yi Huailong went very smoothly.","Lin Yuan had instructed Yi Huailong to help to gather resources during the imperial meeting so Yi Huailong had seen this as his most important item on the agenda.","He had not been able to help Lin Yuan obtain spiritual ingredients and feys that could produce pure elemental energy but had managed to obtain two pieces of Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients. Both pieces came from the Yu family’s secret stash.","Lin Yuan was in no rush to use these two pieces of Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients. Instead, he planned to bring them back to the Radiance Federation and look through all the Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients in the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure vault before he decided which was suitable to be absorbed by the Perfect Touch Wisteria that had already consumed the Suzerain Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","Something as precious as Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients could be considered core resources.","As the Source Sand continued to increase its power, Lin Yuan would have great need for Sovereign metal spiritual ingredients. Thus, he did not want to waste any if he could help it.","The Yi family had used all their means to gather spirit qi professionals who had comprehended numerous Willpower Runes but lacked resources or had some other obstacle that prevented them from increasing their power. These people allowed Sky City’s team of white-clothed followers to grow to almost 650 strong. When the reserve members were included, the number reached 1,000.","The white-clothed followers were one of Sky City’s main sources of power. It went without saying that they needed to be properly nurtured.","Lin Yuan disseminated the Bronze/Epic feys he had nurtured to them.","When he returned to the Radiance Federation, Lin Yuan intended to log into Star Web to buy some feys that were suitable for the reserve white-clothed followers to contract.","In the Radiance Federation’s 36 major cities, almost every type of geography and environment could be found.","The Radiance Federation could not compare with the Divine Wood Federation when it came to plant-type feys, but in terms of overall fey storage, the Radiance Federation was far ahead of the Divine Wood Federation.","When Lin Yuan sent the reserve white-clothed followers to the marsh world, it would be much easier for them to train than if they were in the marsh world.","However, the main source of energy in the marsh world was different.","Thus, even if a fey reached Myth Breed, it could not undergo the World Cleansing to gain the World Grace.","But once they returned to the main world, they could recover the World Cleansing and World Grace.","At that time, Lin Yuan could help the army of white-clothed followers to overcome the World Cleansings at once and gain a large amount of spirit qi crystals."]},{"number":2062,"title":"Chapter 2062 White Bone Throne!","paragraphs":["2062 White Bone Throne!","When the white-clothed followers’ main feys evolved to Creation Breed, Lin Yuan could collect a large amount of golden pearls from their Creation World Ley Lines as well.","Now that he knew how strong the Perfect Touch Wisteria was after it consumed the dark gold snake scale, Lin Yuan felt pressed to increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power.","Two days later, the new ruler of the imperial court, Yi Huailong, appeared in Sky Creation’s tree castle.","Yi Huailong was overflowing with charisma when he presided over the imperial court and accepted the nine bows and 16 kowtows from every faction in Sacred Forest City.","!!","But now, he was kneeling in front of Lin Yuan. He was extremely reluctant to see Lin Yuan leave.","Lin Yuan pulled Yi Huailong up and said, “While I’m not in the Divine Wood Federation, do your best to develop the Divine Wood Federation! The Holy Lady will be staying in the Divine Wood Federation. You can go to her with any questions or communicate them to me through the Thoughts Letter Paper.”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan took out a brocade box and handed it to Yi Huailong.","“I promised that I would help you reach Immortal. Use the three World Crystals in the brocade box and you should be able to reach Immortal!”","Yi Huailong’s biggest wish was to reach Immortal, but he did not immediately receive the brocade box from Lin Yuan.","This was because Yi Huailu was already a Class 5 Creation Master and could help him become a Class 5 Creation Master.","Furthermore, Yi Huailong knew that the Yi family already owed Lin Yuan far too much.","Neither the Yi family nor the Divine Wood Federation would be able to repay Lin Yuan even after generations had passed.","Thus, Yi Huailong did not immediately receive the brocade box, despite its contents being able to help him break through and become an Immortal expert.","When Yi Huailong did not take the box, Lin Yuan said, “You are currently the ruler of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court but aren’t powerful enough yet to overcome them. You must evolve your main fey to Immortal in order to stabilize your position in the Divine Wood Federation and make the other factions submit to you.","“Yi Huailu might have become a Class 5 Creation Master but he is still feeling his new capabilities out. It will be a long time before he’s able to purify Law Crystals. He will need about three to five more years before he is able to refine Immortal bodies to the point that they are able to be absorbed by feys. You can’t afford to wait that long!”","Yi Huailong did not hesitate any longer and received the brocade box with trembling hands before he raised it in the air and performed the greatest expression of respect in the Divine Wood Federation, the nine bows and 16 kowtows.","While he was performing the nine bows and 16 kowtows, Yi Huailong’s expression was austere, and there was a sense of ceremony.","Lin Yuan knew that Yi Huailong was thanking him.","Thus, he waited until Yi Huailong was one before he pulled him up.","Yi Huailong took out 15 Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts that were filled with precious resources. He had prepared all of them especially to show his respect to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Yi Huailong and carried them with him as he returned to the underground palace.","This trip to Sacred Forest City had lasted almost a month. During this time, Lin Yuan had received far more than he had anticipated.","His business in the Divine Wood Federation had reached a checkpoint.","Since the Truth Association had been interfering in the Divine Wood Federation all this time, it was likely that they had also dispatched experts in the Iron Hammer Federation to help Luo Cai from behind the scenes. Otherwise, there was no way that Luo Cai would have been able to kill the previous king and usurp the throne from Luo Lan.","Lin Yuan intended to help Luo Lan return to the Iron Hamer Federation’s imperial court.","After eliminating the Truth Association members in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court and taking control of the Iron Hammer Federation, he would have taken control of both the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","At that time, he would engage the Truth Association in a final face-off in the Great Lush Federation.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly flew at breakneck speed. As he rode on it, Lin Yuan looked down at the forest below.","His state of mind was completely different from when he had arrived.","Liu Jie’s eyes never left Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie could sense how much Lin Yuan had improved and grown on this trip to the Divine Wood Federation.","He realized that it was becoming increasingly difficult for him to see through Lin Yuan.","This made Liu Jie feel significant pressure.","He realized that no matter how hard he tried, he could not close the gap between him and Lin Yuan and keep pace with him.","This only motivated Liu Jie even more to improve himself.","It was likely that Wen Yu was feeling the same pressure!","...","Deep within the Great Lush Federation where the Truth Association was based, there was a restricted zone that none of the secret aristocratic families could enter. A strange gold tower rose from the space that gleamed faintly crimson.","There were 36 kneeling Chanters chanting in a circle around the tower. All of them had extreme terror and astonishment on their faces.","The Lead Chanter held a tome as his gaze flicked intermittently at the four balls of flesh on the high platform.","One of the balls of flesh had cracked two days ago and grayish-green fluid had seeped out of it.","At the moment that the ball of flesh cracked, the 36 Chanters sensed a terrifying aura from within the tower.","All of them knew that this was the key juncture in Fifth Page Truth’s attempt to break through.","Yet, at such a time, one of the Spawns he had cultivated had broken.","He had planned on eventually storing the four Spawns in a vessel and reabsorbing them into his body.","If one of the Spawns was broken, he could not combine the other three.","It would take close to 40 years to nurture a new Spawn, and that was much too long.","There was no way Fifth Page Truth could wait all that time just to combine the remaining three Spawns.","It seemed that regardless of whether he successfully increased his power, he had lost his temper over the cracking of one of the Spawns.","Only those who had stayed with Fifth Page Truth the longest knew how fearsome his methods were.","Suddenly, the uncontrollably terrifying aura in the tower retracted.","At that same instant, the doors to the tower opened.","A throne made of white bones floated out of the tower.","There was a large ball of flesh seated on the white bone throne.","...","Suddenly, the ball of flesh started to vibrate violently. It now looked like a bizarre toy that was contorting constantly.","Even when it shrunk by several times, it still radiated evil.","A pair of small pale hands picked up the toy and a baby-faced young boy with brunette hair walked on a path of bones until he arrived and took a seat on the white bone throne."]},{"number":2063,"title":"Chapter 2063 Sacred Source Lifeform, Divine Order Evil Fetus","paragraphs":["2063 Sacred Source Lifeform, Divine Order Evil Fetus","As he looked up at the cracked ball of flesh leaking viscous yellowish-green fluid, a foreboding smile appeared on the young boy’s adorable face.","This foreboding smile filled the 36 Chanters and one Lead Chanter with a barbarian feeling.","Suddenly, a voice could be heard from the white bone throne. It sounded like an old violin being stepped on.","“The Spawn I’ve been nurturing for almost 60 years has broken! Hehe, I wasn’t planning to use all the lifeforms in the Divine Wood Federation to enable the Divine Order Evil Fetus to break through past 11 Stars. But now that one of my Spawns is ruined, I have no other choice.”","The voice that resembled that of a violin being stepped on quieted, before it was followed by a wicked roar. “Send out my word for those idiots in the Great Lush Federation to hold a Truth Meeting. For the Spawn’s vessel to break and the Spawn to crack, it means that an Eternal fellow has appeared in the Startling Lines Continent. No matter who you are, I will make sure to use you to replace my cracked Spawn once I get my hands on you. You will be sacrificed to enable the Divine Order Evil Fetus to break through to 12 Stars.”","The Lead Chanter immediately replied, “Lord Truth, I will immediately inform the secret aristocratic families to hold a Truth Meeting. However, you are only one step away from your power breaking through. Why don’t you let me handle the Truth Association’s matters? This way, you won’t have to waste time on such a distraction!”","Fifth Page Truth looked at his Lead Chanter with satisfaction.","“I didn’t want to waste time anyway. You can handle it. Since the Spawn in the Divine Wood Federation has cracked, it means that the Divine Wood Federation is no longer under my control. Go to the Iron Hammer Federation and point the canons at the Divine Wood Federation. Turn the entire Startling Lines Continent into a furnace. I will make my appearance then.”","While he spoke, Fifth Page Truth looked conniving. It was as though he could not care less about the lives of the lifeforms in the Startling Lines Continent. It was as though it was only right for all the lifeforms in the Startling Lines Continent to be sacrificed to raise the Stars of his sacred source lifeform.","The Lead Chanter understood what Fifth Page Truth meant and asked, “Lord, the Great Lush Federation—”","Before the Lead Chanter could ask his question, Fifth Page Truth interrupted him impatiently. “It is the privilege of those morons in the Great Lush Federation to become fodder in my furnace!”","When he was done speaking, the white bone throne went back into the tower.","A rhythmic power could be felt from within the tower.","In response to the power, the three Spawns started pulsing.","Fifth Page Truth did not answer the Lead Chanter’s question but only interrupted him and went back into the Tower of Truth.","Two of the Spawns had been planted in the Great Lush Federation and maintained by the Truth Association. Since they were so near to Fifth Page Truth, it went without saying that there would be no problems.","There was another Spawn that had been placed in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court.","If the enemy was able to crack the Spawn in the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court, he would be able to crack the one in the Iron Hammer Federation’s Spawn.","If the enemy managed to infiltrate the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court and cause the Spawn to crack, Fifth Page Truth would certainly blow his top again.","At that moment, the Lead Chanter was unsure if he should recall the Spawn within the Iron Hammer Federation.","After thinking for a moment, Fifth Page Truth’s Lead Chanter decided to allow the Spawn to remain in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court.","After all, Fifth Page Truth did not ask him to do so, and he did not know what Fifth Page Truth’s plan was. If recalling the Spawn ruined Fifth Page Truth’s plan, he would end up as part of a Spawn once Fifth Page Truth woke up.","Since Fifth Page Truth wanted the Startling Lines Continent to turn into a furnace, a war between the three federations could not be avoided.","Since the Truth Association was in the Great Lush Federation, each faction did not have to nurture as many experts as the factions in the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","The Great Lush Federation had always prided itself on its top combat power. Moreover, they had the smallest land area and was at the corner of the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation, bordering the sea.","Given that they were facing such looming peaks, they had no choice but to attack the Iron","Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.","After all, the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court was within Fifth Page Truth’s Leader Chanter’s control. Thus, there was nothing to fear about allowing the Iron Hammer Federation to spread the fire to the Divine Wood Federation.","He hoped that he could use Luo Cai to prove his usefulness to Fifth Page Truth. If Luo Cai turned out to be useless after the Truth Association aided him, the Truth Association could always replace him with someone more competent.","...","The air was crisp, and clouds rolled across the sky.","A baby-blue-colored butterfly flapped its wings, each movement causing air currents to ripple tens of kilometers across the sky. This created a breathtaking scene in the sky.","The people traveling between the Divine Wood Federation’s cities all thought that a god was about to descend.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly landed in Oak City, but Lin Yuan did not intend to stay there for too long.","Ever since Listen took over the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce, it had changed its management model to replicate that of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s management model had been formulated by Listen and Wen Yu after almost a year of discussions and was extremely effective. It could lead to the earning of a large amount of resources and was suited to Sky City’s development path.","While he managed the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce, Listen intended to create a storage space where he could store one of each type of the Startling Lines Continent’s resources so he could use them whenever he needed them in the future.","Since Lin Yuan planned to turn the entire Startling Lines Continent into Sky City’s incubator, Listen would turn Oak City into a breeding base for feys and spiritual ingredients.","Listen had invested a lot of effort into managing the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce.","At first, Li Wan had been unwilling to acknowledge Listen. But after witnessing Listen’s abilities and determination, she could not be more satisfied with having him around.","Now, both Li Wan and Zhao Jiazhi were doing their best to assist Listen.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to worry about the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce.","Lin Yuan instructed the Kill Food Sky Butterfly to land in Oak City because he wanted to send Ding Chengshuo back home to the Ding family.","Ding Chengshuo was the City Lord of Oak City and had been away from Oak City for too long. It was time for him to return.","Lin Yuan had accepted Ding Chengshuo as his subordinate because he had coincidentally found out about the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm from Ding Chengshuo and wanted to use him to gain entry into the realm."]},{"number":2064,"title":"Chapter 2064 Nurture and Choice!","paragraphs":["2064 Nurture and Choice!","After interacting with Ding Chengshuo as they journeyed together, Lin Yuan saw many commendable traits in Ding Chengshuo.","When it came to handling matters, he was very detailed. He was always able to do every task to the best of his ability.","Moreover, Ding Chengshuo had a good eye.","When they were in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm, he had been by Lin Yuan’s side but managed to hold himself back from retaliating against those who were insulting him for fear of affecting Lin Yuan’s plan. When it was necessary, he had even been willing to lower his head in front of the Su family.","Ding Chengshuo’s action made Lin Yuan want to give him and the Ding family a chance.","The structure of the entire Startling Lines Continent was about to change.","The capitals of the Divine Wood Federation, Iron Hammer Federation, and Great Lush Federation would not change.","The large city that he instructed Ta Lei to construct would become the finance and arts hub of the entire Startling Lines Continent.","Oak City would also become one of the main cities in the Divine Wood Federation.","Lin Yuan handed one of the Diamond fey storage boxes to Ding Chengshuo.","This was the first Diamond fey storage box that Lin Yuan had ever given Ding Chengshuo.","Ding Chengshuo was overcome with delight when he received the Diamond fey storage box.","Diamond fey storage boxes were much more convenient than the Item-Storing Walnuts.","By being willing to give one to him after the events in Sacred Forest City, it proved that Lin Yuan thought highly of him and would not see him as useless and abandon him.","At that moment, Lin Yuan said, “There should be enough Law Crystals in this bracelet for you to evolve your fey to Suzerain X/Creation V after you reach thearch-class. When you need to overcome the World Cleansing, you can go to seek help at the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce. Someone will help the Dragon Horns Mysterious Turtle to overcome the World Cleansing.","“You comprehended a new Willpower Rune in Sacred Forest City. There is also a Bronze/Legend fey that is suitable for your Willpower Rune inside the bracelet. I have also added 20 plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline that have all reached Bronze/Epic.","“You can share them with prospective young experts in your family. I hope to see a new Oak City when I return. I can only help you when it comes to resources. The development of Oak City rests solely on you.”","Ding Chengshuo had already lived a significant portion of his life and weathered all types of storms.","Yet, he almost cried when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","In all his years, not even his wife treated him as well as Lin Yuan did.","Lin Yuan had given him enough resources to build several Oak Cities.","It was unlikely that even the Su and Bai families could have produced 20 of the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline. After all, the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm had only been in the Divine Wood Federation for a few decades.","Ding Chengshuo had spent most of his time in the Sacred Wood Mystic Realm inside the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad, unaware of what happened in the outside world.","He did not know that Begin Lady which had created the plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline was now Lin Yuan’s Protector.","But at the same time, Ding Chengshuo knew the significance of 20 plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Ding Chengshuo immediately bowed to Lin Yuan and said in a trembling voice, “Lord Lin Yuan, I definitely won’t disappoint you with my development of Oak City! I will do my best to strengthen Oak City! I will rebuild the two slums in the east and west of Oak City. Even the vagrants will have a job, a place to live, and full bellies in Oak City!”","Lin Yuan smiled but did not respond to Ding Chengshuo.","It was good that Ding Chengshuo had such a mindset. This mindset would not only bring fortune to the vagrants in Oak City but to the entire Oak City as well.","People were always the most valuable treasures.","For Oak City to develop properly, those vagrants had to be helped.","As the City Lord of Oak City, the extent of Oak City’s development depended on only Ding Chengshuo.","It was easy for Begin Lady to create piles of plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Begin Lady’s bloodline was the river water of the Gaea Begin River.","The Gaea Begin River’s river water could be reproduced using pure spirit qi.","Begin Lady did not mind Lin Yuan using its bloodline to affect other feys because these feys would never be able to break through Eternal unless Begin Lady itself reached a higher level and its bloodline was improved.","To Lin Yuan, being unable to reach Eternal was like a jail cell.","But to the young members of the Ding family whose goal was to gain Myth Breed feys, plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline were treasures to them.","While Begin Lady had been locked up, it had still been able to nurture plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline.","Lin Yuan wanted to instruct Begin Lady to nurture more plant-type feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline until the Startling Lines Continent was irrevocably strengthened.","He would also be able to use Begin Lady to control the affected plant-type feys through their bloodline, as well as their contractors.","Begin Lady’s bloodline could affect animals as well, but it required many times more bloodline power to affect animals than plants. Although Begin Lady’s bloodline power could be recovered, there was no point in wasting it. It would be better to focus on nurturing plant-type feys.","As for whether the white-clothed followers needed to contract feys with the Sacred Wood bloodline, Lin Yuan had discussed this with Liu Jie. Eventually, they decided that there was no need.","After the white-clothed followers joined Sky City, the worst of their feys were Bronze/Epic. The feys had also been assigned to them according to their Willpower Runes.","Every white-clothed follower was a genius when it came to comprehending Willpower Runes.","Since Sky City had given them the chance to soar, there was no need to clip their wings and limit them to never being able to reach Eternal.","The large dark gold snake scale opened Lin Yuan’s eyes to a wider world.","Limiting the white-clothed followers would affect Sky City’s eventual potential to develop. Thus, Lin Yuan preferred to keep the white-clothed followers weaker at first.","Liu Jie agreed with Lin Yuan’s idea.","As a spirit qi professional, Liu Jie understood the helplessness of only being able to evolve to a certain level and not being able to take a step forward.","Sky City had been fearless in its advancement so it went without saying that the white-clothed followers who followed Sky City also had to charge forward bravely."]},{"number":2065,"title":"Chapter 2065 Diamond Grade Silver Corona!","paragraphs":["2065 Diamond Grade Silver Corona!","Although Begin Lady’s bloodline was not suited to affect the feys that the white-clothed followers had contracted, it could affect the Insect Queen’s army of insects.","It was too much of a waste to use Begin Lady’s own bloodline to affect large numbers of insects.","However, it could affect the 50 insects produced by the Specialization Insect Nest.","Begin Lady did not hesitate to agree to Lin Yuan’s request.","By the time Lin Yuan and Liu Jie returned to the Radiance Federation, Begin Lady’s bloodline would be almost done evolving the Specialization Insect Nest’s insects. At that time, Liu Jie’s combat power would definitely be raised.","When Lin Yuan returned to the underground palace, he realized that Silver Corona had evolved the sea of bone lotus flowers beyond his imagination.","He had already been away from the underground palace for two months.","At first, he only opened four Class 1 dimensional rifts for Silver Corona.","But later, he opened 16 dimensional rifts for Silver Corona that the Dimensional Light Moth had bitten and turned into pinnacle Class 2.","In the short span of a month, the sea of bone lotus flowers had grown to a point that would have taken it ten years to achieve in the past.","The tide of alien beasts from a pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rift was completely different from that of a pinnacle Class 1 dimensional rift.","Lin Yuan saw that Silver Corona had covered the entire border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation. The sea of bone lotus flowers was now the bridge between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.","Without Silver Corona’s consent, no spirit qi professional would be able to cross that bridge regardless of whether it was by land or sky.","When Lin Yuan left, Silver Corona had been Gold VI/Legend. But after its mad rush forward using the alien beasts from the 16 pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts as a launch pad, it was now Diamond III/Legend. It only needed to increase by another seven minor grades before it could naturally comprehend a Willpower Rune and evolve to Myth Breed.","Red Thorn had also produced the sea of flowers on a large scale but there was a big difference between that and the one produced by Silver Corona.","Red Thorn’s sea of flowers was fully controlled by Red Thorn. It could decide the rate of the flowers’ growth or even trigger the entire sea of flowers to wilt.","However, Silver Corona had no way of increasing the speed of the growth of the sea of bone lotus flowers. It also did not have as comprehensive control over the bone lotus flowers as Red Thorn did over its sea of flowers.","In order for Silver to increase the size of the sea of bone lotus flowers without using up its own spiritual energy, it relied on controlling the main lotuses in the sea of flowers to control the entire sea of flowers.","Otherwise, there was no way for Silver Corona to expand the sea of flowers to such a large extent that it encompassed the entire border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.","In the past, Lin Yuan kept thinking about what he would do if the Iron Hammer Federation declared war on the Divine Wood Federation before Luo Lan could take back her throne.","The border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation was very long.","No matter how capable he was, Lin Yuan could not ensure that no person from the tribes of the Iron Hammer Federation made it into the Divine Wood Federation.","In the Iron Hammer Federation, even a small child barely past ten years of age could also be an outstanding warrior.","But now, Silver Corona’s improvement had solved this issue for Lin Yuan.","Previously, Silver Corona’s power and the size of the sea of bone lotus flowers could be conquered and crossed by top experts from the Iron Hammer Federation.","But if the expert flew above the sea of bone lotus flowers, Silver Corona could use the abilities Spotted Coral and Bone Powder Mist to easily detect the positions of the top experts even if they could not keep the experts out or do them harm.","Lin Yuan could not help but use True Data to check on the freely growing and splendid Silver Corona.","[Fey Name]: Sea Burial Lotus Flower (Silver Corona)","[Fey Species]: Water Willow/Water Bone Lotus","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Fairy","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Spotted Coral]: When trained according to the spots on the coral jade, different effects are generated.","1. Nurture Spot Style: Nurture the spots that were absorbed from the spotted coral jade in the bone lotus flowers. The bone lotus flowers will use a living being’s life and soul to nurture the spots to give them vitality. The spots with vitality can use the living being’s original strength to increase the strength and stamina of the bone lotus flowers.","2. Burial Spot Style: Place the spots in between the bone lotus flowers. The spots will eat the bone lotus flowers and become bone insects. The bone insects will retain the spot’s abilities and can deal with attacks on the bone lotus flowers according to the abilities. The external lifeforce will be absorbed and when the external lifeforce is still weak, their soul can also be absorbed.","[Bone Powder Mist]: The bone lotus flowers will vomit out the living being’s bones that could not be digested. The bone powder will fly up into the sky and stay in the coral spots once it reaches a set thickness of layer.","[Blood Bone Insect Drunk]: While the bone insects are eating, they will enter a drunken state. When they’re in a drunken state, they will not feel any pain. The circulation of their root power will also slow down.","[Blooming Lotus]: The bone lotus flowers’ structure will change and gain split into main lotuses and branch lotuses. The branch lotuses will strengthen combat power while main lotuses will lose all combat power. Every time the main lotuses blooms, the spots will use the vitality they absorbed to produce a skeletal insect. The skeletal insect can consume gus to repair damage done to the body.","[Arrival of Grant of Death]: When the hermit’s dead servants could not stand up against the enemies, they will change into the grants of deaths that place death penalties on the targets’ souls.","[Soul Parasite Rebirth]: The soul will be hosted in the main lotus. The main lotus will make a copy of the aura of the lifeform’s soul and vitality. When the target’s body and soul are damaged, the main lotus can be sacrificed while absorbing vitality and soul power to enable the target to be reborn. Once reborn, the target will be in a very weak state and its soul and roots will also be diminished.","Exclusive Skill:","[Hermit’s Dead Servant]: The Bone Lotus Flower will absorb the target’s body when attacking it. 1% of the target’s power will be injected into the target’s soul to cause the target to be pregnant with its dead soul. The dead soul will consume itself and when the bone lotus flowers gain 36 hermit dead servants, every hermit dead servant will be able to create a layer of mist over the bone lotus flowers."]},{"number":2066,"title":"Chapter 2066 Might of the Grants of Death","paragraphs":["2066 Might of the Grants of Death","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up at what he saw.","He always had high hopes for Silver Corona, and it was now apparent that Silver Corona had not let him down.","Silver Corona’s Arrival of Grant of Death ability perfectly amplified Hermit’s Dead Servant.","When Lin Yuan first arrived at the Divine Wood Federation a month ago, he had lamented how long it took to produce a hermit dead servant in the sea of bone lotus flowers.","But after Lin Yuan opened 16 dimensional rifts and evolved them to pinnacle Class 2, 36 hermit dead servants had been produced.","This was why visibility was so low in the sea of bone lotus flowers.","Each hermit dead servant seemed to add only a thin layer to the fog, but 26 layers were enough to lower visibility to the point that a person in the thick of it would not be able to see their outstretched fingers.","Even if the sea of bone lotus flowers did not attack spirit qi professionals, the fog of bone powder mist would prevent a spirit qi professional from seeing their surroundings, thus halting their free movement.","The hermit dead servants particularly attacked souls, and their strength depended on the strength of the dead souls they had consumed. They had managed to kill Class 4 dimensional lifeforms that were comparable to Platinum feys.","Silver Corona’s Arrival of Grant of Death ability would allow the hermit dead servants to be fused to form the grants of death. This would increase their strength of attacks on souls. It would then be much easier for Silver Corona to eliminate enemies that had no defense against such attacks.","Lin Yuan felt that Soul Parasite Rebirth was functional-type and stood out in its ability to increase the foundational level. It could allow a lifeform’s soul and vitality to be hosted within a main lotus. When the target’s soul and body were injured, the main lotus could be sacrificed to trigger rebirth. This would be akin to humans being revived.","The main lotuses in the sea of flowers were produced through the consumption of lifeforms’ flesh and souls.","Each time a dimensional rift opened, a main lotus could be produced. Thus, it was fine to use them up.","However, when Silver Corona consumed a portion of the lifeform’s body and soul to leave a mark, this would harm the target’s roots.","Both an injury to the body or soul would cut into a spirit qi professional’s potential.","However, Ji Feng’s Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus could heal souls while Lin Yuan’s Jasmine Lily could use Severed Limbs Growth to regrow body parts.","Lin Yuan and Ji Feng’s existence had resolved this issue.","But as he continued to learn more, Lin Yuan understood that a rebirth ability like this not only resulted in the reborn target being weak. It would also have memory and emotional loss.","Such an ability was a far cry from the Remembrance Soul Whale’s ability to piece together soul fragments in combination with the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring and Jasmine Lily’s abilities to put together a body.","However, storing a lifeform’s soul and vitality within a main lotus was a safety net that had no disadvantages to have around even if it was never used.","Moreover, it took a greater toll on the body for Rememberling to use Soul Knot.","Lin Yuan could not instruct Rememberling to use Soul Knot frequently to collect all the souls of the people around Sky City who died.","Hence, there were still likely opportunities for Soul Parasite Rebirth to be used in the future.","Whether the white-clothed followers were out on assignment or fending off enemies, they were always mired in danger.","If their souls and vitality could be stored within the main lotuses, they would have a chance of coming back to life after they were killed. Losing their memories and emotions would still leave them better off than losing their lives.","Silver Corona had already noticed Lin Yuan nearing the underground palace and immediately rushed to him to hug his neck as it nudged his face affectionately.","Compared to Red Thorn’s displays of affection, Silver Corona was much more reserved.","Silver Corona was not much more intelligent than the average person, and Lin Yuan could effectively communicate with it.","Lin Yuan asked, “Silver Corona, are there any limits when you use Soul Parasite Rebirth to enable other lifeforms to be reborn?”","Silver Corona immediately replied, “Master, when the soul power and vitality of any lifeform is stored within a main lotus, the soul power and vitality will disappear from within the main lotus once the lifeform is reborn. The main lotus will not keep any record of the soul power and vitality.”","Lin Yuan nodded gently.","It seemed that Soul Parasite Rebirth could only be used once on each target.","However, even if the effects were only one-time, it was enough to prove the merit of the ability.","Lin Yuan said to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, help Silver Corona to raise the class of the 16 dimensional rifts! Add another group of the same type of dimensional rifts as well.”","Liu Jie immediately summoned the Dimensional Light Moth.","Once the Dimensional Light Moth appeared, it flew around Silver Corona as an act of flattery before it started to bite away at the 16 dimensional rifts.","It did not take long for the 16 pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts to reach pinnacle Class 3.","The strongest dimensional lifeform that could emerge from a Class 3 dimensional rift was Class 5, which was comparable to pinnacle Diamond grade.","Even without Liu Jie positioning 10 of the Diamond V/Fantasy V Execution Blade Insects, Silver Corona’s sea of flowers was strong enough to kill Class 5 dimensional lifeforms and turn them into nutrients.","Once the Dimensional Light Moth was done evolving the 16 pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts to pinnacle Class 3, Liu Jie brought it far ahead to pick out the locations for another 16 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts.","Liu Jie had already sent out the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths to scout out the surroundings. Thus, he already had locations in mind.","The difference in scale between a pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rift and a pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rift was even larger than that between a pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rift and a pinnacle Class 1 dimensional rift.","From the moment the dimensional rift opened, Class 5 dimensional lifeforms started pouring out.","Lin Yuan said, “Silver Corona, show me how strong the grants of death are!”"]},{"number":2067,"title":"Chapter 2067 Greedy Silver Corona!","paragraphs":["2067 Greedy Silver Corona!","The moment Lin Yuan was done speaking, Silver Corona’s eyes lit up, and the light from its eyes soon enveloped its whole body.","Flowing patterns of energy danced around it, and Silver Corona’s fairy source-type lifeform’s soul power could be felt within the energy patterns.","Lin Yuan could not help but raise his eyebrow.","It seemed that it took Silver Corona great effort to use Arrival of Grant of Death. Thus, regardless of the strength of the grants of death, Silver Corona could not use the ability repeatedly during combat to attack enemies.","Lin Yuan could understand the immense effort that was required of Silver Corona to use Arrival of Grant of Death. After all, combining the hermit dead servants to produce grants of death was considered rolling grades.","It would be strange if it was easy to roll grades to fight.","At first, the hermit dead servants were like ghosts in the sea of flowers as their solid bodies were not visible. Only their faint silhouette could be seen at the moment of their attack.","But now that the 36 hermit dead servants’ bodies solidified after Silver Corona used Arrival of Grant of Death, the hermit dead servants’ bodies were fully wrapped in robes.","A skeletal hand holding a bone sickle longer than the body holding it reached out of each robe. The sickles held by the 36 dead hermit servants were all very different.","There were some hermit dead servants who were larger and the sickles they held were made of three connected blades.","Only a few of the dead hermit servants held sickles made of three connected blades, but there were also a few holding sickles made of two connected blades. The rest of them were only sickles made of a single blade.","It was clear that the hermit dead servants who were holding sickles made of only one blade had only been born a month ago when the 16 pinnacle Class 2 dimensional rifts were produced.","The more dead souls the hermit dead servants consumed, the stronger they would be.","From the energy fluctuations coming from the dead hermit servants, the aura of the ones wielding sickles made of three connected blades were about five to six times stronger than the one whose sickles were only a single blade.","One of the hermit dead servants holding a three-bladed sickle could easily put an end to 10 of the hermit dead servants holding single-bladed sickles.","The strongest hermit dead servant raised its sickle high in the air while the other hermit dead servants flew around it.","Soon, they all fused with the strongest hermit dead servant like shadows melding together.","In an instant, a powerful soul power could be felt growing within the fused hermit dead servants.","Two feet encircled by bone lotus flowers peeked out from beneath the large robe while soul power solidified a flesh-like substance over the hand.","But the robe was so large that a face still could not be seen.","The giant sickle morphed into a tome made of bones. Ten bone lotus flowers grew out from the tome.","As the bone lotus flowers moved, they were stained in a light blue by the massive amount of soul power.","It only took a moment for the 16 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts to produce 10 Class 5 dimensional lifeforms.","Silver Corona did not immediately instruct the grant of death to attack but rather waited quietly.","It only gave the order to attack when the number of Class 5 dimensional lifeforms had climbed to 50 and there were already droves of Class 4 dimensional lifeforms.","A large amount of soul power flowed from the grant of death into the white bone tome.","It started to chant in a hoarse voice.","Lin Yuan noticed that the grant of death’s voice was very similar to Silver Corona’s own voice.","The grant of death was chanting in the language of fairies.","A gust of ominous wind blew from the grant of death to the 50 Class 5 dimensional lifeforms and armies of Class 4 dimensional lifeforms.","It seemed as though the gust of wind was not going to be very damaging.","But at the instant that the wind made contact with the Class 5 and 4 dimensional lifeforms, it solidified and every single one of the dimensional lifeforms swayed before crumpling to the ground.","The main lotuses controlled the branch lotuses and started feasting on the fallen bodies like mincing machines.","Lin Yuan knew that every single one of the 50 Class 5 dimensional lifeforms and Class 4 dimensional lifeforms had been killed by the grant of death.","The power of the grant of death exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectations.","From the strength of the soul power from the recent attack, it indicated that the Diamond III/Legend Silver Corona was already capable of killing the souls of Diamond X/Fantasy V feys.","Even if the fey was soul-type and pinnacle Fantasy Breed, it would be difficult for it to escape the grant of death’s attack unscathed.","Dead souls were very effective at contaminating living souls. Once contaminated, the living souls would become seriously affected.","Thus, when the grant of death took on Myth Breed feys, it would still be able to cause significant damage even if it did not manage to kill.","Silver Corona was an elite fairy that bulked up on dimensional lifeforms and had already reached pinnacle six wings.","All it needed was an opportunity, and it would be able to gain its fourth pair of wings.","Whether it evolved to Fantasy Breed or Myth Breed, both would be advantageous opportunities for Silver Corona.","If Silver Corona evolved to eight wings, the entire sea of bone lotus flowers would be strengthened from the inside-out.","While Lin Yuan had been checking on the grant of death’s power, Liu Jie and the Dimensional Light Moth were escorted by two of the Lonely Night Hurricane Moths to far-off locations.","It was no longer a challenge for the Dimensional Light Moth that had already comprehended a Willpower Rune to produce a pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rift.","Liu Jie said seriously, “Lin Yuan, I have already instructed the Dimensional Light Moth to open the 16 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts. I arranged them in a criss-cross pattern. When dimensional lifeforms from different types of dimensional rifts are gathered together, a more violent conflict will ensue. This will greatly reduce the burden on the sea of bone lotus flowers.”","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “Big Brother Liu, thank you for your hard work!”","By now, the total of 32 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts were spewing dimensional lifeforms in an endless stream above the sea of bone lotus flowers.","This about met Silver Corona’s maximum rate of digestion.","At that moment, Silver Corona said, “Master, you can actually open another 16 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts for me! I will make a space for the 16 dimensional rifts and surround them with the sea of flowers. Once the dimensional lifeforms join the melee, even those who managed to survive will be covered with injuries.”"]},{"number":2068,"title":"Chapter 2068 Stupid Fellow’s Feeding and Growth!","paragraphs":["2068 Stupid Fellow’s Feeding and Growth!","Silver Corona gently touched Lin Yuan’s face and said, “All I need to do is handle the injured dimensional lifeforms that are trying to escape the sea of flowers. As long as I leave a large enough space so that the dimensional lifeforms don’t feel like they’re squeezed together, none of the stupid fellows from the dimensional rifts will want to enter the sea of flowers!","“I already tried in the past! However, those with injured bodies will immediately be swallowed by the sea of flowers once they’re pushed to the edge of the space. I like it when these stupid fellows feed themselves to me.”","Silver Corona’s words gave Lin Yuan a new awareness of the intelligence of elite fairies.","Silver Corona was never the type to crow about its achievements.","!!","Since Silver Corona said that it could handle another 16 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts, Lin Yuan would set it up for Silver Corona.","This would quicken Silver Corona’s increase of power.","With a food supply from 48 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts, it would not be long before Silver Corona evolved to Fantasy Breed and then to Myth Breed.","Lin Yuan turned his head to say to Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, please go and find another suitable location to open another batch of dimensional rifts for Silver Corona!”","Liu Jie immediately replied, “When I chose the second location for the dimensional rifts, I took into consideration that Silver Corona will likely be needing a third batch of dimensional rifts soon and have already marked a location. The third location is in a corner. If a fourth batch of dimensional rifts needs to be opened in the future, the third location can act as the center, with more batches of dimensional rifts being opened around it.”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “Big Brother Liu, 48 dimensional rifts are enough. From now on, as Silver Corona becomes more powerful, all we need to do is increase the class of these dimensional rifts.”","Liu Jie immediately took the Dimensional Light Moth with him to open the dimensional rifts.","When Liu Jie left, Lin Yuan jumped down from Blackie’s back.","By this time, Liu Yanshan had picked up Luo Lan from the Iron Hammer Federation.","At the time that Liu Yanshan spotted Luo Lan, she had already been noticed by Luo Cai’s men and was being hunted by them.","Luckily, the imperial guard that noticed her was only beginner emperor-class.","This imperial guard had been very hasty, and Luo Lan had been by herself. Thus, he thought that it would be an easy task for him and the men under him.","Given the expected rewards of such a task, there was no way that he would want to share it with others.","In the end, while they were trying to capture Luo Lan in the river, the emperor-class imperial guard and his men were all easily killed by Liu Yanshan’s Ghost Arched Demon Beast.","At that time, Luo Lan felt a mixture of shock and fear as her life had just been hanging by a thread. She did not have a single ounce of strength left in her body.","At the moment that she was saved by Liu Yanshan, Luo Lan felt as though she had just been given a new life.","After Liu Yanshan brought her back to the underground palace, Luo Lan met with Ta Lei and Su Yiren.","Her fright was calmed.","The most important thing for Lin Yuan to do now was to meet with Luo Lan.","Ever since he came across the dark gold snake scale, Lin Yuan’s prospects exploded open.","Now, he was increasingly anxious.","Thus, Lin Yuan did not intend to stay in the Iron Hammer Federation for too long.","After meeting with Su Yiren, Ta Lei, and Luo Lan, Lin Yuan would return to the Radiance Federation to see the Moon Empress.","When he returned from the Radiance Federation, he would take Luo Lan to the Iron Hammer Federation.","Lin Yuan was more interested in exploring the marsh world than he was in training in the Startling Lines Continent.","In the marsh world, the territory from just one Apostle was already one-quarter the size of the Divine Wood Federation. The entire Marsh East Circle was around the size of the Radiance Federation.","Exploring the marsh world would bring about much quicker growth than training in the Startling Lines Continent.","Both Ta Lei and Su Yiren were busy.","Under Su Yiren’s tutelage, Ta Lei was already in the process of transforming from a young man that came from a tribe to an exceptional City Lord.","All the adventurers who had entered the sea of flowers to train had been gathered by Silver Corona. Lin Yuan had pardoned them and sent them to work in Ta Lei’s city and allowed them to become citizens there.","However, many of the adventurers did not like to be disciplined, and some even formed gangs in the city.","A few of them had deceived a young girl from Ta Lei’s tribe who ended up committing suicide out of self-loathing.","Given the circumstances, Ta Lei remembered Su Yiren teaching him that a superior had to be ruthless when it was necessary.","Thus, Ta Lei ordered the trouble-causing adventurers to be killed in front of the entire city and their bodies to be strung up on the city walls.","In less than a day, their bodies were picked to the bone by birds.","Ta Lei’s gruesome methods stamped out any ideas that anyone in the city had of disobeying the laws.","Su Yiren continued to collect information dutifully as she communicated with Jin Qianxun to understand the Truth Association.","Jin Qianxun was afraid of the Truth Association, but he had already sworn his loyalty to Lin Yuan in Oak City.","Bound by the oath, Jin Qianxun had no choice but to succumb to Su Yiren’s interrogations and tell her everything he knew about the Truth Association, in spite of his fear of them.","During this time, Jin Qianxun had been living while constantly walking on eggshells.","He had lost a significant amount of weight, and many people in the Jin family were wondering what had happened to him.","In order not to attract too much attention and raise suspicions that there was something wrong with him, Jin Qianxun forced himself to eat three meals a day in spite of his lack of appetite in order to maintain his weight.","Su Yiren knew that there was a binding in place, but she did not push Jin Qianxun too far.","She was a Dark Envoy and understood that cruelty alone could not yield as beneficial of a result as when coupled with kindness.","Lin Yuan had given Su Yiren a significant number of resources, and she picked some that would be useful to Jin Qianxun to send to him.","When Jin Qianxun received these resources, his fear slowly started to change.","He would never be able to receive the resources that Su Yiren gave him from the Truth Association.","Thus, Jin Qianxun started to willingly offer information to Su Yiren instead of her pressing him.","Su Yiren learned fresher information about the Truth Association from Jin Qianxun.","..."]},{"number":2069,"title":"Chapter 2069 Face the Truth Head On!","paragraphs":["2069 Face the Truth Head On!","Su Yiren knew that the information related to the Truth Association would definitely be useful to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was eventually going to have a final clash against the Truth Association in the Startling Lines Continent.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan were members of the Astronomical Parliament.","Su Yiren learned about Luo Lan’s situation through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","!!","Both of them had similar experiences and shared a bond.","Su Yiren was well aware that Luo Lan would be emotionally weak now after the death of her father, becoming a prisoner, and going on the lam. Hence, she stayed by Luo Lan’s side and counseled her.","Su Yiren could see her past self in Luo Lan.","When Seventh Page War conquered the Seven States of Darkness and caused it to fall to ruin, all of the servants in the Seven States of Darkness became Seventh Page War’s servants.","After Su Yiren escaped, all she thought about was using the Absolute Love Poppy to take revenge.","But when it really came time to battle against Seventh Page War, Su Yiren knew how pathetic she was in front of absolute power.","She went on to flee to the Divine Wood Federation. Along the way, everyone who had been protecting her died one by one, and she had been helpless to do anything to help them.","Once she reached the Divine Wood Federation, she became a vagrant who lived each day in fear.","Her experiences allowed her to understand Luo Lan’s pain.","Luo Lan felt a warmth she had not felt in a long time from Su Yiren’s counseling.","At the same time, Su Yiren told Luo Lan about a few matters regarding the Great Lush Federation and Truth Association, so Luo Lan would understand the circumstances in the Startling Lines Continent.","This was so that Luo Lan would better be able to communicate with Lin Yuan once they met.","While Su Yiren was counseling Luo Lan, she accurately guessed the pain that Luo Lan was feeling.","However, rather than the urge for vengeance borne of the pain she felt, Luo Lan hoped that Lin Yuan could live up to his promise of ensuring that no one from the Iron Hammer Federation would ever have to starve in winter again.","Luo Lan was well aware of Luo Cai’s temperament and mindset. There was no way he would pay any mind to the citizens who died of hunger during winter.","Su Yiren handed the organized information to Luo Lan and said, “If my guess is right, the Truth Association should be hiding within the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court. The death of your father is definitely linked to more than just Luo Cai. As his sister, you must know what his capabilities are.”","While they spoke, Su Yiren started to scorn Luo Cai.","Su Yiren had always been a part of the upper echelon and detested a person like Luo Cai, a distant relative, who had received a helping hand to usurp the throne.","According to the information, Su Yiren knew that the previous king nurtured Luo Cai to turn him into an Imperial Guard Captain.","It was a travesty to the Iron Hammer Federation for someone of Luo Cai’s capabilities to sit on the throne.","After several days of interaction, Su Yiren learned of the burdens that Luo Lan carried and her ideas of governance.","Su Yiren felt that it would be a great blessing to the Iron Hammer Federation for someone like Luo Lan to become queen.","Luo Lan did not have strong spirit qi professional or Creation Master talent, but her spirit was what made her capable of enabling the Iron Hammer Federation to thrive.","Su Yiren pitied and envied Luo Lan from the bottom of her heart. She pitied Luo Lan because of her experiences and envied her because she had the chance to take back the throne of the Iron Hammer Federation while she could not picture the day where it would be her turn to take revenge.","Su Yiren was well aware of the giant that was Tower Canon.","There was no way that Su Yiren could ask Lin Yuan to help her regain the Dark Continent.","With this thought, Su Yiren let out a long sigh.","When Luo Lan received the information from Su Yiren and was about to look through them, she saw a young man in a white robe and another in a silver half-armor walk into the underground palace.","Su Yiren hurriedly grabbed Luo Lan’s hand and said to her, “Luo Lan, that’s Leo!”","Luo Lan immediately performed the Signum Ceremony to Lin Yuan, which was the highest honor in the Iron Hammer Federation. She crossed her hands to form a cross and bent over.","Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Luo Lan and said, “Let me tend to some business first. Then, I’ll need to leave for three days. Luo Lan, I will take you and Ta Lei into the Iron Hammer Federation three days later.”","Luo Lan was elated and anxious to thank Lin Yuan.","At that moment, Lin Yuan went on to say, “I’m sure that Yiren has already told you about the situation in the Startling Lines Continent. During my trip to the Divine Wood Federation, I learned that the person behind the Truth Association is Tower Canon’s Fifth Page Truth.”","The person who reacted the most to what Lin Yuan said was not Luo Lan but Su Yiren.","Luo Lan was the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation, and it was only natural for her to have heard of the Truth Association.","The Truth Association was a secret existence in the Great Lush Federation.","Luo Lan had been shocked when Su Yiren gave her information about the Truth Association to read.","In all her years in the Iron Hammer Federation, Luo Lan had thought about seeking information about the Truth Association. But she had never managed to insert a spy in the Truth Association.","All the spies she had sent had been killed.","Luo Lan had no idea who the Fifth Page Truth that Lin Yuan spoke of was. As such, she was unaware of Tower Canon as well.","The Iron Hammer Federation did not even have a Class 5 Creation Master so there was no way they could know about Tower Canon.","While Luo Lan was oblivious, Su Yiren was well aware that Fifth Page Truth was on the same level as Seventh Page War.","If what happened in the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court was related to the Truth Association, Lin Yuan would have to take on Fifth Page Truth in order to help Luo Lan.","If Luo Lan managed to take back the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court with Lin Yuan’s help, that meant that there was the possibility of him helping Su Yiren in the future to defeat Seventh Page War and take back the Dark Continent!","Luo Lan could submit to Lin Yuan as a representative of the Iron Hammer Federation and so could Su Yiren. In fact, she might be able to give Lin Yuan even more.","With this thought, Su Yiren’s breathing became unsteady.","When she regained her senses, Su Yiren saw that both Lin Yuan and Liu Jie were staring at her.","Su Yiren immediately realized that she had been acting inappropriately. By doing this, she had made it clear to Lin Yuan what she was thinking.","Su Yiren was well aware that it was not a good thing for her to reveal what she was thinking now. It made it seem that she was only by Lin Yuan’s side to take advantage of him.","During the time that Su Yiren interacted with Lin Yuan, she became a part of Sky City’s family.","..."]},{"number":2070,"title":"Chapter 2070 Birth of Immortality!","paragraphs":["2070 Birth of Immortality!","Su Yiren truly saw herself as a part of Sky City. Otherwise, she would not have put so much effort into the underground palace in the last few months.","At the same time, Su Yiren was very grateful to Lin Yuan for saving her.","Although she had dedicated her loyalty to Lin Yuan, it was insignificant compared to a life.","Su Yiren would have no way of disputing her behavior to Lin Yuan.","!!","Su Yiren looked at Lin Yuan and met his gaze in the hopes that he would see her sincerity.","At that moment, Su Yiren saw Lin Yuan’s eyes curve as he smiled and said, “Once we settle the matters in the Startling Lines Continent, we will fix up the harbor in the Great Lush Federation so Wo Lun can bring his boat here to kickstart the trade in the Startling Lines Continent.","“At that time, we’ll also be able to ride a boat to the Dark Continent. Help me to settle the business in the Great Lush Federation. There’ll be even more for you to do in the Dark Continent.”","Su Yiren almost cried tears of joy when she heard what Lin Yuan said. Lin Yuan’s words had fulfilled Su Yiren’s greatest wish and allowed her to return to her native land.","Once they snatched the Dark Continent back from Seventh Page War, she would be able to rebuild the Seven States of Darkness.","Su Yiren knew that she had no means of repaying Lin Yuan. The only thing she could do was work as hard as she could for Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, leave the matters in the Startling Lines Continent to me! Since you already know that Fifth Page Truth is behind the Truth Association, it looks like there isn’t much use for the information about the Truth Association I got from Jin Qianxun. I plan on threatening him to squeeze more out of him. Go and do what you need to do. I don’t have any issues here.”","Su Yiren’s words came out as very confident. Since she had been a Dark Envoy, she had the right to be this confident.","The Love Music Centers built by the 14 Poppy Fruits bloomed all over the Startling Lines Continent.","There were eight Poppy Fruits in the Divine Wood Federation.","This was because the citizens and nobility in the Divine Wood Federation liked song and dance, and included it as part of their daily life.","Furthermore, Su Yiren was in the Divine Wood Federation at the moment, and it would be better to leave more Poppy Fruits in the Divine Wood Federation.","As for the remaining Poppy Fruits, two were in the Iron Hammer Federation while four were in the Great Lush Federation.","It was a struggle to even obtain food in the Iron Hammer Federation, and the two Love Music Centers there offered the least help.","Nonetheless, having Love Music Centers all over brought in a torrent of information for Su Yiren.","Su Yiren’s sacred source lifeform had reached 8 Stars. She never expected that she would be able to improve at such a rate.","Her sacred source lifeform now had three abilities.","Even when she faced Immortal experts, she could use the Absolute Love Poppy to beguile the Immortal expert immediately and cause him to fall in love with her as long as he did not have his guard up.","Otherwise, given Su Yiren’s character, there was no way she would say such a thing.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before saying, “Go and make a promise to Jin Qianxun. If ever the day comes that the Truth Association disappears from the Great Lush Federation, I can allow him to become the head of the Great Lush Federation, and the Jin family will then become the rulers of the Great Lush Federation. I believe that Jin Qianxun is smart enough to spill the information he previously did not have the courage to say.”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan suddenly heard Genius shouting for him in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","A hopeful expression immediately spread across Lin Yuan’s face when he heard Genius’ child-like voice.","The female of the two Flower Branch Mice that he had obtained from the Yi family had been pregnant. Now, it was finally about to give birth.","After he told Su Yiren about the situation, Lin Yuan let Liu Jie know and immediately returned to his room in the underground palace to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone so he could help the female Lifespan Mouse during the birthing process.","From what Genius said, it seemed that the female Lifespan Mouse was having a difficult birth. This was because its abdomen was too large, and it was clear that it was going to have many children.","Lin Yuan was very excited to see if the baby Flower Branch Mice would also have red tails.","Recently, Lin Yuan used spirit qi to massage the female Lifespan Mouse’s abdomen whenever he entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan was very hopeful that the female Lifespan Mouse would be able to surprise him.","Su Yiren was stunned when she heard what Lin Yuan said. She could not help but be slightly envious of Jin Qianxun.","Jin Qianxun was about to be rewarded with an enormous opportunity. It was not just Jin Qianxun who would enjoy the benefits but his entire family would as well.","In order for Jin Qianxun to become a thearch-class expert, he had to be more ambitious than the average person. Someone with ambitions would also have great aspirations.","For the sake of his ambitions, Jin Qianxun would take the gamble even if it cost him his life.","There were four secret aristocratic families more powerful than the Jin family who were part of the Truth Association. All of them maintained pressure on the Jin family to prevent them from climbing the ranks.","It could be said that Lin Yuan’s promise was the Jin family’s only chance at a brighter future.","Once Lin Yuan left, Su Yiren immediately contacted Jin Qianxun.","After Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he saw that Genius was holding the female Lifespan Mouse with a hand made of spiritual energy. It used spiritual energy to soothe the female Lifespan Mouse as it massaged its belly. The female Lifespan Mouse was chittering loudly in pain.","Lin Yuan smiled wryly when he saw this.","It was likely that in spite of the ever-evolving and mercurial animal world, there had never been a cat acting as a midwife.","The Flower Branch Mouse was already very smart. Once it evolved into the Lifespan Mouse, its intelligence would rise again.","The two Lifespan Mice were a loving couple.","The most important thing for feys was to procreate.","This was why high-grade spirit qi professionals always helped their feys to find mates. Even if they did not contract the offspring of their feys, they would carefully nurture them to be contracted by their own descendants.","This situation was because feys needed to continue their bloodline and for the spirit qi professionals to provide their descendants with strong feys.","After all, no spirit qi professional would think badly of the main fey that had given their all in nurturing.","When he saw the male Lifespan Mouse rolling on the ground and chittering loudly, Lin Yuan picked it up and prepared to help the female Lifespan Mouse with its labor.","He was going to witness the birth of immortality."]},{"number":2071,"title":"Chapter 2071 Large Harvest!","paragraphs":["2071 Large Harvest!","After Genius saw that Lin Yuan had come, it used the hands made of spiritual energy to hand him the female Lifespan Mouse.","Genius was a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master, and it would be easy for it to help the female Lifespan Mouse with its labor.","However, Genius could sense that Lin Yuan wanted to personally help the female Lifespan Mouse to give birth.","After Lin Yuan received the female Lifespan Mouse, he gently cooed at it as he injected spirit qi into its body to cleanse its flesh and bones.","!!","This would increase the durability of its flesh and body and prevent it from being injured during the birth.","If all their children had black tails, and the female Lifespan Mouse’s safety was jeopardized, the loss would be irreparable.","As Lin Yuan continued to use pure spirit qi to massage the female Lifespan Mouse’s abdomen, he noticed that it had a big craving for vitality.","Lin Yuan could not help but find this strange.","Why would an unborn lifeform have such a great craving for vitality?","There was no way that Lin Yuan could allow the unborn lifeforms within the female Lifespan Mouse to absorb the female Lifespan Mouse’s vitality.","The Death Demon Concubine Beast had formed a contract with the male Lifespan Mouse. After consuming the spiritual ingredients that contained vitality, it accumulated a decade of lifespan despite only being Normal I.","On the other hand, the female Lifespan Mouse was uncontracted and had not consumed any spiritual ingredients that contained vitality and did not have any lifeform and vitality stored in its body.","If its children absorbed its vitality, the weakened female Lifespan Mouse would die immediately.","Once he realized the seriousness of the issue, Lin Yuan summoned the Jasmine Lily so it could inject vitality into the female Lifespan Mouse’s body.","After the Lifespan Mouse injected a large amount of vitality into the female Lifespan Mouse’s body, its pain was immediately lessened.","While Lin Yuan was using his fingers to massage the female Lifespan Mouse’s abdomen, hairless squirming lifeforms soon tumbled out of the female Lifespan Mouse. They were all around the size of grapes.","When Lin Yuan took a closer look at them, his eyes immediately widened.","He noticed that they did not have tails.","The Lifespan Mice all lacked tails.","Could it be that the children birthed by the female Lifespan Mouse skipped the stage of Flower Branch Mouse and were directly born as the Lifespan Mouse?","Lin Yuan intended on testing this guess.","There had to be at least six children being birthed by the female Lifespan Mouse. To prevent congestion, Lin Yuan needed to supply pure spirit qi constantly.","Soon, seven babies were born. Of the lot, only two did not have tails while the remaining five only had tufts.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and injected pure spirit qi into the seven babies. Then, he fed them Grade 4 potions that had been specially concocted by Genius to speed up the growth of mouse-species feys.","The seven babies started to grow and change visibly.","Just as Lin Yuan expected, the two who had been born without tails grew tangerine-red fur, meaning that they were Lifespan Mice.","Of the remaining five, four grew dark purple tails while the last one grew a bright red tail.","Lin Yuan could not help but be pleasantly surprised.","The Lifespan Mouse could not reproduce.","The female Lifespan Mouse could produce young because it had gotten pregnant while it had been the Flower Branch Mouse.","Lin Yuan evolved it to the Lifespan Mouse when it was pregnant.","The Flower Branch Mouse with a bright red rail was the result of Lin Yuan’s nurturing.","The product of the Lifespan Mouse’s labor told Lin Yuan that the Lifespan Mouse with the red tail could reproduce.","Lin Yuan found that the newly born Flower Branch Mouse with the red tail was female.","In the future, he just needed to find one that was male, and he would be able to breed more of the Lifespan Mice.","Lin Yuan had received the Flower Branch Mice with red tails more than once. They were very rare but did exist in the wild.","Lin Yuan intended to contact Yi Huailong and ask for his help in collecting the Flower Branch Mice with bright red tails.","It was likely that the pregnant Lifespan Mouse needing so much vitality was related to the two Lifespan Mice it had given birth to.","Lin Yuan felt a sense of assurance now that he had more of the Lifespan Mice. If he had a need for them in the future, he would not have to hesitate to use them.","Lin Yuan thought, Now that I’ve accidentally nurtured the Lifespan Mice, does that mean that I have obtained the secret to immortality?","Immortality was a dream that all experts chased.","Moreover, Begin Lady had said that one’s lifespan was limited even after one successfully set their spirit fire alight.","Setting one’s spirit fire alight was not the ceiling for an expert. Rather, it was the starting point for advancement to a higher level.","If one was only talking about living longer, one only needed to provide the Lifespan Mouse with sufficient spiritual ingredients that contained vitality in order to live virtually forever as long as one was not killed.","This was because the Lifespan Mouse used up the lifespan stored in its body.","If the spirit qi professional’s own lifespan was left untouched, one would be able to continue living and increasing one’s power.","Even if the most average person contracted the Lifespan Mouse, they would have the chance to eventually start walking down heaven’s path as long as the Lifespan Mouse had enough lifespan to offer.","The more Lin Yuan thought about it, the more he saw the Lifespan Mice as treasures.","Lin Yuan currently had three of the Lifespan Mice.","If he did not want to nurture even more of the Lifespan Mice, he could have used pure spirit qi to evolve them into the Lifespan Mice.","The Lifespan Mouse’s existence told Lin Yuan that he would never have to worry about experiencing the grief of death or death itself unless there were inevitable factors.","Lin Yuan had already instructed Silver Corona to produce more of the main flowers.","In the future, through Silver Corona’s Soul Parasite Rebirth ability, the main flowers would protect the members of Sky City from life-threatening dangers.","Even if there were issues, it would be like they had two lives.","...","Under Lin Yuan’s nurturing, Rememberling’s power rose continuously.","The Mother of Bloodbath had been carefully nurturing the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring.","Once it arrived in the Divine Wood Federation, its store of plant-type feys was raised substantially.","Presently, the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring had already consumed more than 8,000 types of plant-type feys and was about to reach 4 Stars."]},{"number":2072,"title":"Chapter 2072 Return to the Radiance Federation!","paragraphs":["2072 Return to the Radiance Federation!","If things continued at this rate, the Ten Thousand Medicine Hot Spring would reach 7 Stars and gain its third ability in around two years.","Now that Lin Yuan was done helping the Lifespan Mouse give birth, he left the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He had already told Su Yiren that he would be leaving for a period of time.","Lin Yuan used 200 of the Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts to pass through the Space Tunnel with Liu Jie and ended up back in the Radiance Federation, in the basement of the Return from Faraway Mansion.","When Lin Yuan first transported himself through the Space Tunnel, he had used up all of the spatial spiritual ingredients that he possessed. As such, he felt that a trip between the Radiance Federation and the Divine Wood Federation was very costly.","But he had since obtained many of the Item-Storing Walnut Trees and nurtured them to Bronze/Legend. Later, the army of Hundred Questions Beasts nurtured them to Diamond grade.","The close to 1,000 Item-Storing Walnut Trees growing in Lin Yuan’s territory in the marsh world were growing very well. A few that had more potential even comprehended Willpower Runes after being evolved to Diamond/Legend and evolved to Fantasy Breed.","There was a large amount of marsh soil buried in the territory.","The three Sentient Being Protective Dragons’ ability Place in the World could protect these Item-Storing Walnut Trees and ensure they could not be more comfortable.","Furthermore, the ancient green tree transformed from the Endless Gem grew in size under the radiation from Klein Hub. Now, its range included the 1,000 Item-Storing Walnut Trees.","Normally, the Item-Storing Walnut Trees only bore fruits yearly.","But now that they were being blessed by various actors, they bore fruits three times a year.","Each Item-Storing Walnut Tree produced almost 100 of the Item-Storing Walnuts.","With 30,000 Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts being produced yearly, Lin Yuan could use them as he pleased.","The emerald green ancient tree benefited dimensional lifeforms greatly as well.","Lin Yuan intended to utilize its range well.","Since he already had enough of the Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts, Lin Yuan intended to move the 1,000 Item-Storing Walnut Trees slightly further so that the emerald green ancient tree’s benefits could be focused on increasing the believers of Wendy and Rising Lizard.","When Lin Yuan returned to the Return from Faraway Mansion, he fetched Wen Yu from the marsh world.","Both of them had agreed on this long ago.","Although Listen was not currently in the Radiance Federation, Endless Summer was doing a good job of looking after the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Metal-type resources were very rare in the marsh world.","Wen Yu and Sun Ningxiang had been working overtime the last few days to plan out all the resources needed for development in the marsh world.","Wen Yu would let Endless Summer know what resources they needed so that Endless Summer could prepare them over the next two days.","Lin Yuan was only going to be in the Radiance Federation for three days.","By preparing the resources in two days, Wen Yu would have one day left to look through them.","Wen Yu had not seen her master in some time and missed Mystic Moon.","She was filled with respect and gratitude to Mystic Moon.","It was indeed Lin Yuan who had saved her life.","But if Mystic Moon had not accepted her as his disciple, helped her to contract the Astronomical Parliament, and taught her what to do, the combat-talent-lacking and mediocre Creation Master Wen Yu would have long been relegated to one of Sky City’s peripheral members. There was no way she could have become one of Sky City’s three main pillars alongside Lin Yuan and Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan noticed that not a single Heavenly Family Fey could be seen in the Return from Faraway Mansion.","A month had passed and Purple Love should have already led the other members out of the Radiance Federation.","But as per the promise that was made to Lin Yuan before he left, White Phoenix had become Lin Yuan’s sworn Protector and should still be in the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and quickly puzzled out what had happened.","It was likely that the Moon Empress had told White Phoenix about Fifth Page Truth after Lin Yuan told her about it.","The entire Heavenly Family Cottage had an absolutely irreconcilable grudge against Fifth Page Truth.","Since the Radiance Federation and Heavenly Family Cottage had become allies, the Radiance Federation would immediately inform the Heavenly Family Cottage about such a matter after learning about it.","It was likely that Purple Love and the rest who had just departed the Radiance Federation would go and seek their revenge very soon.","In order for Jade Sundial to be revived, the heavenly family crystal was not enough. Her Eternal Heart was needed as well.","Her Eternal Heart would have to be forcefully snatched back from Fifth Page Truth.","Lin Yuan knew that the Moon Empress was very worried about him. Thus, once he returned to the Radiance Federation, he did not dawdle anywhere else and immediately went to the Radiance Federation to see the Moon Empress.","Liu Jie had obtained the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle and wanted to have a discussion with Night Leaning Moon about it.","Night Leaning Moon was the one who had opened up the path for Liu Jie to begin taking control of insect-species carcinoma feys. As such, he still liked to seek her opinion when it came to choosing the insect-species carcinoma feys.","Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Node Transportation to transport himself to the inner palace of the Radiant Moon Palace like he always did.","While Lin Yuan was traveling to the inner palace of the Radiant Moon Palace, Jin Qianxun was having the greatest dilemma of his life.","Normally, he did not have the authority to participate in the Truth Association’s meetings as he was only the fifth strongest expert in the Jin family. It was always the head of the Jin family, his oldest brother, who attended and relayed the Truth Association’s instructions when he returned.","But this time, all the experts of the secret aristocratic families who were thearch-class and above could participate in the meeting.","It was true that Jin Qianxun had not been completely open with Su Yiren. But the main reason for his lacking information was that he did not have the chance to learn of the Truth Association’s big secrets.","Jin Qianxun had been trying to make a choice.","It was true that he was being controlled by Lin Yuan, but he could leave some information about the Truth Association out in his reports. This lowered the risk that he had to undertake.","Nonetheless, Jin Qianxun understood that real money could be found in taking risks.","He would not be able to obtain many benefits from the Truth Association.","But ever since he joined Lin Yuan, Su Yiren would provide him with resources whenever his information was useful. This allowed his power to skyrocket.","He had become the third strongest expert in the Jin family.","As long as he continued to provide information that met Lin Yuan and Su Yiren’s satisfaction, he would be able to surpass his oldest brother before long to become the strongest expert in the Jin family.","..."]},{"number":2073,"title":"Chapter 2073 Something Wrong With the Truth Association!","paragraphs":["2073 Something Wrong With the Truth Association!","The extremely pure heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls allowed Jin Qianxun to understand how strong of a faction he had sworn his loyalty to.","Thus, before the meeting with the Truth Association, Jin Qianxun was more willing to side with Lin Yuan.","However, everything that happened during the meeting with the Truth Association caused Jin Qianxun to change his mind out of fear.","Jin Qianxun never expected that the Truth Association, which was in control of the entire Great Lush Federation, would have power beyond Immortal.","Jin Qianxun had never interacted with a Class 5 Creation Master and did not understand what heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls produced by Class 5 Creation Masters signified.","But subconsciously, Jin Qianxun did not think that Lin Yuan stood a chance of triumphing over the Truth Association.","These were experts who were more powerful than Immortal! There were more than one of them!","Moreover, in line with the Truth Association’s goal, the entire Startling Lines Continent was about to be thrown into chaos.","Two days later, all the tribes in the Iron Hammer Federation would be ordered by Luo Cai to attack the Divine Wood Federation. The secret aristocratic families of the Great Lush Federation would also join the fray.","At first, Jin Qianxun thought that the Truth Association wanted to swallow up the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation so that the entire Startling Lines Continent would be theirs.","But now, Jin Qianxun sensed that something was not right.","If they only wanted to destroy the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation and take control of them, there would be no need for the Great Lush Federation to become involved.","It would be much better to get involved only once the victor was decided between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","There was no way that the Truth Association would make a mistake when it came to this decision.","For some reason, Jin Qianxun was filled with a sense of foreboding.","If the Great Lush Federation decided to enter the battle alongside the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation, the entire Startling Lines Continent would be turned into a giant furnace.","Could such a situation be what the Truth Association was after?","Jin Qianxun wanted to have a good talk with his oldest brother once they returned home from the meeting.","Jin Qianxun’s understanding of the situation came from his deductions and analysis of this meeting.","But his older brother attended such a meeting two to three times each year in the years after their father died. After attending so many meetings, his brother would definitely have a better understanding of the Truth Association than him.","Thus, his brother would be more capable of guessing what the Truth Association’s aim was.","Jin Qianxun stood up and started walking to his oldest brother’s study room. Along the way, he ran into his second brother, Jin Qianxing.","Before Jin Qianxun could greet Jin Qianxing, the latter said to him anxiously, “Qianxun, are you here to talk to First Brother about the events of the meeting? If you’re here about anything else, let me go first. I need to speak with him.”","The entire Jin family was very respectful of Jin Qianding.","Jin Qianding had been the head of the Jin family for more than a decade and also the only Immortal expert in the Jin family. He had absolute authority in the Jin family.","Jin Qianding had a habit of dealing with one thing at a time.","As such, the members of the Jin family only sought him out individually.","Jin Qianxun knew what kind of person Jin Qianxing was.","Jin Qianxing was domineering.","If both of them went in together, Jin Qianxing would cut in front of him to speak to Jin Qianding.","Jin Qianxun had been ticked off by Jin Qianxing’s despotic behavior more than once.","Jin Qianxun felt that Jin Qianxing was slow and did not like to think things through.","Since he also wanted to speak with Jin Qianding about the Truth Association, it was likely that he had also sensed that there was more to the meeting than what appeared on the surface.","Jin Qianxun hurriedly said, “Second Brother, I’ll go in with you! I’m also here to see First Brother. I won’t interfere in the discussion between you two!”","Jin Qianxing did not turn Jin Qianxun down.","This was because both of them had the same parents.","Furthermore, Jin Qianxun was only the fifth strongest expert in the Jin family and there were some things that did not need to be hidden from him. Thus, they walked into the study room together, with Jin Qianxun leading.","Jin Qianding was frowning at the map in front of him.","The map was of the Startling Lines Continent, and it was drawn with very fine details.","The Great Lush Federation was full of scholars. Moreover, the chambers of commerce from the Great Lush Federation often added to the map based on their travels.","If Lin Yuan saw the map, he would immediately notice that this map was several times more detailed than the one that the Yang family kept in the imperial court.","Even the distance between each marked location was noted.","It was clear that this map had been prepared for war and had extremely strong strategic significance.","Before Jin Qianxun and Jin Qianxing entered, Jin Qianding had been mulling over the map for close to two hours.","But when he saw his brothers walking in, Jin Qianding could not help but ask, “Why are the both of you here together?”","Jin Qianxing immediately replied, “First Brother, I’m here to speak with you about the Truth Association. On the way here, I bumped into Qianxun, and he said that he also wanted to come to greet you. So, I brought him in with me!”","Jin Qianding nodded and asked, “Qianxing, what about the Truth Association do you need to speak to me about? Can it be that you have some thoughts after attending your first meeting?”","Jin Qianxun was crafty and immediately looked at Jin Qianding’s face when he heard what he said.","Jin Qianxun noticed that Jin Qianding was looking at Jin Qianxing with scrutiny and displeasure.","It was clear that Jin Qianxing had not noticed the meaning behind Jin Qianding’s gaze.","As such, Jin Qianxun’s chest tightened.","Jin Qianxing had not asked anything that was out of line. So why was Jin Qianding looking at him in such a manner?","Since Jin Qianxun had come for a similar reason, he decided to let Jin Qianxing ask the questions in his stead.","At first, he made this decision because Jin Qianxun was domineering. If he had not said what he said, Jin Qianxing would not have allowed him to tag along.","...","But now, Jin Qianxun thought, Luckily, I wasn’t the one who brought up the Truth Association. Otherwise, First Brother would be casting that gaze on me.","Jin Qianxun remembered that Jin Qianding had evolved from beginner thearch-class to Immortal very abruptly more than a decade ago. The entire process only took a few short years.","Jin Qianxun had been wondering if his brother’s rapid increase in power was related to the Truth Association."]},{"number":2074,"title":"Chapter 2074 Jin Qianxun’s Choice!","paragraphs":["2074 Jin Qianxun’s Choice!","If this was the case, his brother would definitely want to protect the Truth Association in every situation—just like how Jin Qianxun needed to protect Lin Yuan.","Regardless of whether he could find the answer he was searching for today, he could still learn of Jin Qianding’s attitude toward the Truth Association from his conversation with Jin Qianxing.","This was a huge opportunity for Jin Qianxun.","While Jin Qianxun was thinking, he never expected Jin Qianxing to say so brazenly, “First Brother, what was the Truth Association talking about? Why are we joining the war between the Divine Wood Federation and the Iron Hammer Federation instead of reaping the benefits of the aftermath?","!!","“If we charge in, we will suffer heavy losses. The Yi family is now in charge of the Divine Wood Federation’s imperial court. They have to have hidden power in order to be able to defeat the Yang family.","“The food-crazy Iron Hammer Federation likes nothing more than to plunder the Great Lush Federation’s merchant groups. Once we enter the fight, they’ll attack us as well. Our family only managed to stabilize our position as a secret aristocratic family after many years of development.","“Qianxun has been steadily growing. He might be able to reach Immortal too! At that time, there is no way we can throw in all of our combat power. Aren’t there experts in the Truth Association’s inner circle? Why don’t they join the battle themselves instead of pushing the secret aristocratic families into the war?”","The moment Jin Qianxing finished speaking, he saw Jin Qianding’s hand sailing toward him.","There was no way that a thearch-class expert could dodge a slap from an Immortal expert.","Jin Qianding’s slap stupefied Jin Qianxing and the watching Jin Qianxun.","The impression that Jin Qianxun had of his First Brother was that he was dignified and prudent.","No matter what mistakes the brothers made, even when Fourth Brother used evil methods to nurture feys, First Brother only reprimanded them. He had never ever laid a hand on them.","But now, Jin Qianxing had been slapped just for speaking with the Jin family’s best interests at heart.","The things that Jin Qianxun wanted to say were roughly the same as Jin Qianxing, but he would have done it more tactfully.","The slap that Jin Qianxing had received was almost no different from Jin Qianxun receiving it.","From the slap, Jin Qianxun knew that Jin Qianding needed to take the Truth Association’s arrangement into consideration, even if it cut into the Jin family’s profits.","Jin Qianxun could not help but lose his respect for Jin Qianding for such an action.","Jin Qianxun felt that Jin Qianding’s action had stripped him of the right to be the head of the Jin family.","Once the head of a family was bought off and no longer placed the family first, the family was doomed even if they were still prospering at that moment.","The Truth Association’s control over Jin Qianding reminded Jin Qianxun of Lin Yuan and Su Yiren.","Lin Yuan and Su Yiren were also controlling Jin Xianxun.","But every time he provided information, he would be rewarded accordingly.","This was less like being commanded and controlled and more like a trade.","He also had his own choice and rights when it came to the matter.","At that moment, Jin Qianxun suddenly stopped despising Lin Yuan and Su Yiren.","Jin Qianxun was very sad about the state of the Jin family, but there was nothing he could do to help.","The Truth Association had experts that were beyond Immortal. With such experts as members, Jin Qianding did not have any choice.","Jin Qianxun now understood the situation while Jin Qianxing had sobered from being slapped by Jin Qianding.","What happened next was a fight between Jin Qianding and Jin Qianxing.","The fight between the two brothers told Jin Qianxun that it was not a good thing to become involved with too much.","Jin Qianxun nodded at Jin Qianding before he left the study room and returned to his own room.","Back in his room, Jin Qianxun sighed a few times in succession.","He felt even more despair now than when he first started being controlled by Lin Yuan and Su Yiren.","The Jin family no longer had a future.","The glory of the Jin family was always the faith that Jin Qianxun held on to.","It was at this moment that Jin Qianxun realized that there was a message on the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Jin Qianxun thought that Su Yiren was asking him to find out more about the Truth Association again. He was unsure if he should tell her about the Truth Association’s plan.","The Jin family was going to become a pawn in this plan.","After collecting all that information, Su Yiren had to have a plan.","No matter what plan Su Yiren had for the Truth Association, it would affect the Jin family.","No matter how unwilling Jin Qianxun was, there was nothing he could do about his brother’s abandonment of the Jin family.","Jin Qianxun did not want to let down the Jin family’s ancestors after his death.","But once he read what was written on the Thoughts Letter Paper, Jin Qianxun was more astonished and overcome with emotion than when he saw Jin Qianding slap Jin Qianxing.","[Tell me everything you know about the Truth Association now. My faction will give you three opportunities. First, you’ll reach Immortal, and up till pinnacle Immortal. Second, you will become the head of the Jin family after the dust settles. Third, the Jin family will be able to enter the Great Lush Federation’s imperial court and become its new rulers. You can decide what to do for yourself.]","Of the three offers on the Thoughts Letter Paper, the ones that attracted Jin Qianxun the most were the first and third one.","It was every thearch-class expert’s dream to be able to reach Immortal, much less pinnacle Immortal.","The Jin family’s ancestors had never entertained the thought that they could one day become the rulers of the Great Lush Federation.","If this could be achieved with him at the helm, he would be changing the history books of the Jin family.","With support from such a faction, the Jin family would definitely be able to stand steadily once they took over the Great Lush Federation’s imperial court.","The Great Lush Federation’s imperial court was currently occupied by the Truth Association and no family was allowed to be a part of it.","In order for the promise to be fulfilled, the Truth Association had to first be kicked out of the imperial court.","This promise would allow any faction to be filled with confidence when they took on the Truth Association.","In spite of the knowledge that the Truth Association had experts that were beyond Immortal, Jin Qianxun still felt at ease.","As for the second offer of becoming the head of the Jin family, it was a position that Jin Qianxun had never been gunning for.","...","But now that Jin Qianding no longer placed the Jin family first, Jin Qianxun felt that he was a better fit to be the leader of the Jin family.","With this thought, Jin Qianxun decided to stake both his own future and that of the Jin family on this faction whose name was not even known to him."]},{"number":2075,"title":"Chapter 2075 The Moon Empress’ Troubles!","paragraphs":["2075 The Moon Empress’ Troubles!","Jin Qianxun decided to tell everything he knew to that faction as per their request.","Jin Qianxun’s report caused Su Yiren’s eyes to widen.","[The Truth Association has several experts beyond Immortal. I hope that you will decide what to do next after understanding the Truth Association’s power. Furthermore, according to the information from the Truth Association’s inner circle, The three largest tribes in the Iron Hammer Federation will join forces to invade the Divine Wood Federation three days later. They will charge directly into the capital, Sacred Forest City. After the invasion, the major secret aristocratic families of the Great Lush Federation will join the battle and form a three-way chaotic war. This is all I know so far. The Truth Association holds absolute power over all of the secret aristocratic families, and the Jin family will also participate. I don’t have a say in the Jin family’s participation, but I hope that the Jin family’s involvement won’t affect your plans.]","What surprised Su Yiren about Jin Qianxun’s news was not that the Truth Association had experts that surpassed Immortal. Su Yiren already knew that the Truth Association had a Class 5 Creation Master. Class 5 Creation Masters were capable of evolving thearch-class experts to Immortal. Su Yiren’s grandmother had also been capable of doing so.","However, Su Yiren had not heard anything like the Iron Hammer Federation was going to invade the Divine Wood Federation three days later.","If it was for food, they could tide over the winter season if they remained at the border and took over some of the Divine Wood Federation’s border cities.","Yet, the Iron Hammer Federation was going to use its resources to supply an invasion. This was no different from charging toward their own deaths.","No matter how useless and unfit to rule Luo Cai was, he would not come up with such a plan.","After Luo Cai became king, he needed to strengthen the Iron Hammer Federation in order to garner respect.","Thus, even if Luo Cai was a complete moron, he would never intentionally harm his own profits.","It seemed that the Truth Association already had a certain amount of control over the Iron Hammer Federation, to the point that Luo Cai was helpless even as king.","Su Yiren knew that she had to tell Lin Yuan about this immediately.","This matter was about a war between two federations, and Su Yiren dared not make a reckless decision on her own.","Thus, Su Yiren hurriedly sent a message to Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","When Su Yiren sent the letter, Lin Yuan was in the inner palace of the Radiant Moon Palace.","Lin Yuan carried the Moon Empress’ Extreme Token so she was aware that he had returned to the Radiance Federation the moment that he arrived at the basement of the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Thus, she had been waiting for him to come.","The Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan would come to see her first thing after returning to the Radiance Federation. This was the trust she had in him as his master and a display of their compatibility.","The Moon Empress was always unshakable, as cold and aloof as the moon that hung high in the sky.","But ever since the Moon Empress realized that Lin Yuan had used the Extreme Token, she had been on edge.","She knew that he would only use the Extreme Token if he was in life-threatening danger.","Since she did not have a clear grasp on his secret weapons, she always assumed that the Extreme Token was Lin Yuan’s final safety net.","She took this as an indication of Lin Yuan having encountered a strong enemy in the Divine Wood Federation.","Although Lin Yuan had let the Moon Empress know that he was fine, her troubled heart made her want to see him immediately. This was the only way that she could be set at ease.","When she first accepted Lin Yuan as her disciple, all she wanted was to be a good master.","But after a year together, Lin Yuan was now just as important to the Moon Empress as the Radiance Federation was. Otherwise, she would not have asked Lin Yuan to make the long trip just to set her mind slightly at ease.","To put it bluntly, the Moon Empress was so wracked with anxiousness that she had completely let down her guard.","She would only be able to relax when she saw Lin Yuan standing in front of her.","However, her brow did not fully relax even after Lin Yuan arrived.","This was because the Radiance Federation was about to undergo a strenuous trial.","None of the members of royalty, including the Moon Empress, had a concrete plan to deal with this trial.","Lin Yuan had not seen the Moon Empress in a long time, and he smiled brightly the moment he laid eyes on her.","The past years of experiences allowed Lin Yuan’s aura to become increasingly solemn.","But this smile seemed to return to Lin Yuan all the youthfulness he had lost.","When Lin Yuan noticed that the Moon Empress’ brow was slightly furrowed, he hurriedly asked with concern, “Master, is something troubling you?”","When Lin Yuan had been weak, he would not ask the Moon Empress such a question when he saw her brow furrowed.","But now, he could ask because his power had been growing, and he was now at the stage where he was capable of solving issues and sharing the Moon Empress’ burdens. In certain situations, he could even help the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress instinctively saw Lin Yuan as a child when she heard what Lin Yuan said. She did not want to pass on her troubles to him.","But then, the Moon Empress started thinking about how Lin Yuan was already stronger than her in some aspects. For example, the Moon Empress could not concoct the pure spirit qi that came from Lin Yuan despite being a Class 6 Creation Master.","The Moon Empress never tried to find out about Lin Yuan’s secret weapons. Rather, she told him to keep them to himself.","The Moon Empress had also encountered the same problem that the elderly man faced.","It was Lin Yuan who helped her and gave her renewed life.","The Moon Empress gently caressed Lin Yuan’s face before she plucked the Extreme Token from around Lin Yuan’s chest and said, “Let me take a good look at you. It’s almost time to eat. Stay for the meal and spend the night in Leaning Moon Mountain. I will tell you about my troubles after the meal. I’ll recharge the Extreme Token for you before you leave tomorrow morning.”","Lin Yuan did not ask what was happening but just nodded.","Since the Moon Empress was willing to be honest with him, it did not matter when she spoke.","Lin Yuan not only saw the Moon Empress as his master but also as his family.","He badly wanted to fix the issues that the Moon Empress was facing.","Lin Yuan had made the decision long ago.","He already knew that the world was not as simple as it seemed. He hoped that he would be able to take his friends, master, and family with him to experience the new world.","Cold Moon was currently training with Chu Ci.","Chu Ci had entered the Redbud Spirit Qi Intermediate Academy but did not spend a lot of time learning in school."]},{"number":2076,"title":"Chapter 2076 Only One or Two Years Left!","paragraphs":["2076 Only One or Two Years Left!","Chu Ci received a much better education from Cold Moon than she could have from the teachers at the Redbud Spirit Qi Intermediate Academy.","Cold Moon was fully invested in Chu Ci.","Thus, only Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress, and Mystic Moon were present at that meal in the Radiant Moon Palace.","Lin Yuan noticed that Mystic Moon had been frowning just like the Moon Empress and immediately knew that the problem plaguing the Moon Empress was serious, as well as that Mystic Moon was aware of it.","!!","Because of Lin Yuan’s arrival, there was a greater spread at the dinner at the Radiant Moon Palace than usual. All of it was food that suited his palate as well as his favorites.","Chef Supreme was still sore over the extinction of the Spirit Savory Pig.","After the Moon Empress became a Class 6 Creation Master, Chef Supreme brought the last female Spirit Savory Pig to her, and she used her Class 6 Creation Master methods, as well as refined the bloodline of other pig-species feys, so that the piglet born from this female Spirit Savory Pig was even more delicious than the original Spirit Savory Pigs.","Because of this, Chef Supreme owed the Moon Empress a large favor.","In the past, Lin Yuan liked to drink the soup stewed from the ribs of the Spirit Savory Pig as well as the marinated ribs. The Moon Empress knew this.","For this dinner, the Moon Empress had instructed the four tea attendants to cook one of the Spirit Savory Pigs to turn it into a feast.","After dinner, Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress returned to the lotus pool’s inner palace.","Lin Yuan noticed that after the Moon Empress became a Class 6 Creation Master, the lotus pool had also changed.","Its size was still the same, but there was almost half the number of lotus flowers than before.","Nonetheless, the lotus pool was even more luscious and beautiful than before. This was because the Moon Empress had evolved all of the lotus flowers to Creation Breed.","If not because the Moon Empress liked to admire them, they could have changed into human form at any time.","The lotus flowers spewed mist that covered the entire inner palace.","Although it was very difficult to evolve the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish in the lotus pool, the Moon Empress still managed to evolve them to pinnacle Myth Breed.","The spirit qi released by the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish caused the concentration of spirit qi in the inner palace to be 80 times thicker than that of the outside world.","If the concentration of spirit qi could be multiplied a few more times, it might reach the same concentration that the Spirit Lock spatial zone first had.","However, this was just the concentration of spirit qi. When it came to purity, not even the spirit qi of the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish could match up to the purity of the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Moon Empress poured a cup of the Calming Spirit Silver Leaf Tea. It was brewed using the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar and the evaporated dew from the Calming Spirit Flower.","It was considered an extremely high-grade tea.","With the calming effects of the tea, the drinker’s body would experience the same effects as if they had consumed three drops of the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar.","This was not the first time that Lin Yuan was drinking tea like this.","But whether it was the Three Treasures Tea or the Calming Spirit Silver Leaf Tea, Lin Yuan liked to drink both of them.","The Moon Empress was in no rush to explain the situation to Lin Yuan. Instead, they held a question-and-answer session first.","Now, most of the questions that Lin Yuan asked stumped the Moon Empress.","For example, if Lin Yuan did not tell her through the Thoughts Letter Paper, the Moon Empress would not know that there was a sixth type of dimensional rift in the main world.","The Moon Empress was shocked by Lin Yuan’s growth. But at the same time, she was very proud of him.","After the question-and-answer session, the Moon Empress said before Lin Yuan asked, “The old man from the Radiance Federation only has about one or two years left.”","The Moon Empress’ statement was short but made Lin Yuan feel overwhelmed.","The news about that elderly man in the Radiance Federation had not been leaked, and none of the regular citizens in the Radiance Federation were aware of it.","When Lin Yuan had been running the small store in the Xia Region, he did not know what this elderly man did for the Radiance Federation.","After Lin Yuan became a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence, he learned from Liu Wencheng just how much that elderly man had bent over backward for the sake of the Radiance Federation.","The Radiance Federation was one of the three major federations and was respected by all.","The other federations envied the citizens of the Radiance Federation.","The other federations, especially those without Class 5 Creation Masters, were warring year-round. Even those with one Class 5 Creation Master often stole resources from each other.","Every lifeform in those federations suffered in the midst of such fighting.","The Radiance Federation had also experienced such a period.","It was after the elderly man rose above the rest that he managed to stabilize the entire federation and raise the honor of the Radiance Federation.","There was a long period where his juniors, such as Cicada Song, Iron Prison, Long Lamplight, Night Leaning Moon, and the Moon Empress, grew.","After they grew up, the elderly man paid the price of his root power and reforged the Seven Secure Federation Treasures to secure the Radiance Federation’s environment.","Lin Yuan had seen the Mountain River Grain God Bells of the Secure Federation Treasures.","The Mountain River Grain God Bells had been unable to stand up against the Goddess of Mercy, who had awakened her birth horoscope but could effectively defend against Eternal experts.","The Secure Federation Treasures was an important reason the Radiance Federation was able to become one of the three major federations.","In order to become one of the three major federations, more than just sufficient Creation Master resources were needed. The power to safeguard the Creation Master resources was also needed.","However, these were just a small fraction of what the elderly man did for the Radiance Federation.","Not long ago, Night Leaning Moon and Du Miao had crossed swords and fought through their sacred source lifeforms in the air.","Du Miao’s sacred source lifeform was the Gold Leaf Boiling Balloon Flower. When he fully triggered them, the night sky above the Radiance Federation bloomed into thousands of gorgeous fiery-red balloon flowers.","A giant volcano at the center of the balloon flowers had spewed lava that fell from the sky.","A golden-yellow ancient tree had charged to the sky and covered more than half of the Radiance Federation. It had blocked the Gold Leaf Boiling Balloon Flower’s celestial phenomena and protected the Radiance Federation.","At the same time, the ancient tree had sealed off Du Miao’s body.","This was the first time that the elderly man had stepped in after the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, and Long Lamplight matured.","The elderly man had already fused his sacred source lifeform with the Radiance Federation and combined half of his soul with his sacred source lifeform.","...","The elderly man had already used his actions to safeguard the Radiance Federation’s faith.","When Lin Yuan first heard Liu Wencheng talk about the Radiance Federation’s history, he had been moved and filled with endless respect for the elderly man.","Lin Yuan dared not and was unwilling to believe that this elderly man only had one or two years left."]},{"number":2077,"title":"Chapter 2077 Problems That Can Be Solved by the Lifespan Mouse Aren’t Problems!","paragraphs":["2077 Problems That Can Be Solved by the Lifespan Mouse Aren’t Problems!","At that moment, Lin Yuan understood why the Moon Empress’ brow had been furrowed so deeply.","If the elderly man’s life came to an end, it would spell doom for the Radiance Federation.","It was apparent that the Moon Empress, or rather all the members of royalty in the Radiance Federation, were incapable of helping that elderly man.","The elderly man was not a Creation Master, and he could defend the Radiance Federation from any calamity.","!!","When it came to prying into the secrets of life, Creation Masters were more knowledgeable.","Lin Yuan still had three uncontracted Lifespan Mice.","He was willing to give one of them to this elderly man who had dedicated his life to the Radiance Federation in order to turn it into a haven.","However, the Moon Empress said that the elderly man only had one or two years left.","The end of a person’s life was not only related to one’s lifespan. One’s soul, spiritual energy, and body also played big parts.","If a person ran out of soul power and withered and died, they would never be able to open his eyes again, even if he still had a remaining lifespan.","A soul that had withered would be scattered across the earth.","A legendary lifeform like the Remembrance Soul Whale could gather the pieces of souls but could not search for dissipated souls.","Hence, Lin Yuan could not guarantee that he would be able to help the elderly man despite possessing the Lifespan Mice.","Lin Yuan asked the Moon Empress seriously, “Master, can you tell me why the elderly man is only left with one or two years?”","The elderly man’s condition was the Radiance Federation’s biggest secret.","However, the Moon Empress had already mentioned it to him. This meant that she would definitely reply to him when he asked.","The Moon Empress sighed and said, “Little Yuan, by the time I found out about the situation, the elderly man had already fallen comatose. Cicada Song said that he had met backlash when trying to advance and breakthrough.”","The Moon Empress spoke while lamenting to herself.","She had also experienced backlash because she had been too impulsive in trying to break through.","But given that the elderly man’s level was higher than hers, the backlash he experienced was much more severe.","The Moon Empress could stand in his shoes and guess how he was feeling now. It was a helplessness of one’s life coming to an end, desolate loneliness that could send anyone into a spiral of despair.","The Moon Empress had been able to handle it on and soldier on as though nothing was wrong because of Lin Yuan.","At that time, she had placed all her hopes in him. She hoped that she could help him to open up a long path before her lifespan ended. At least then, she would not have wasted her time being his master.","The elderly man’s heart belonged to the Radiance Federation.","It was unlikely that he was feeling lonely and desperate because his life was coming to an end.","It was more likely that he was feeling deeply reproachful.","This was because he was the one who had made the two-year gamble with the Freedom Federation.","According to the information from the Freedom Federation, the Mirror God had already set his spirit fire alight.","Previously, the God of Fools had been stronger than the Mirror God.","In order to set one’s spirit fire alight, it was more likely to be the result of an opportunity rather than hard work.","The God of Fools might not have set his spirit fire alight, but it was likely that he already had.","The elderly man had already guessed during an imperial meeting that the two of the Freedom Federation’s members of royalty had set their spirit fires alight before the news came from the Goddess of Mercy.","Regardless, the elderly man had still dared to make the bet with the Freedom Federation for the Major Federation Meeting.","This was because no one could be allowed to trample over the Radiance Federation’s honor. The elderly man needed to put some pressure on the trouble-causing brats.","Furthermore, the elderly man had already set his spirit fire alight seven years ago. However, he could not leave the Radiance Federation because half of his soul had fused with his sacred source lifeform, which was then bound to the Radiance Federation.","After sighing, the Moon Empress said, “Little Yuan, Cicada Song said that the elderly man had a drop of the Earth Center Fine Milk, but he gave it to me. Otherwise, the drop of Earth Center Fine Milk would have allowed him to live another year.”","Cicada Song had told the Moon Empress about the Earth Center Fine Milk because she had said during the imperial meeting that her issue had been resolved.","Thus, Cicada Song had asked the Moon Empress if she had used the drop of Earth Center Fine Milk.","Since the Moon Empress had given the drop of Earth Center Fine Milk to Lin Yuan, there was no way she could use it to extend the elderly man’s life by another year.","In fact, the Moon Empress did have a way of enabling the elderly man to continue living.","Lin Yuan had given her the Lifespan Mouse, which had solved her issue. She could now live seemingly forever and did not have to worry about the passage of time robbing her life.","The Moon Empress could choose to break her contract with the Lifespan Mouse and give it to the elderly man to contract instead.","But this would mean that the Moon Empress would have to give up on her life in order to save the elderly man’s life.","The more powerful the person, the more terrified of death they would be. This was because he would have a greater longing to see the view from higher levels.","It went without saying that the Moon Empress was no exception.","Apart from increasing her power, she also wanted to see Lin Yuan grow. She wanted to see Lin Yuan fly with his strong wings and do her duty as his master.","But if the day truly came that the elderly man’s life was going to end, she would make him promise to protect Lin Yuan before she gave up on the Lifespan Mouse.","This was because she knew that without the elderly man, the Radiance Federation would stand no chance of fending off the Freedom Federation.","The Moon Empress had the character befitting a member of royalty.","From the day she became a Radiance Envoy until she became a member of royalty, the Moon Empress had been ready to lay down her life to protect the Radiance Federation, just like any other member of royalty.","If the Moon Empress needed to make such a decision, she would not hide it from Lin Yuan. She would have called him and told him about her choice.","She believed that Lin Yuan would understand her.","When the Moon Empress sighed, her frown deepened.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan’s brow relaxed after he heard what the Moon Empress said.","...","The Earth Center Fine Milk could not only cleanse a body of its impurities and refine the genetic model, but it could also extend one’s lifespan.","Since the Earth Center Fine Milk could extend the elderly man’s life by a year, it must mean that his issue had been the same as that of the Moon Empress.","Both could be solved with the Lifespan Mouse.","Since the Lifespan Mouse could solve it, it was not a difficult issue at all."]},{"number":2078,"title":"Chapter 2078 Holding Master’s Hand!","paragraphs":["2078 Holding Master’s Hand!","The Moon Empress was silent, and her heart was heavy when she heard Lin Yuan say, “Master, I have another Lifespan Mouse that the elderly man can contract. Then, the elderly man will have more than just one or two years left.”","Lin Yuan hesitated.","He did not summon the female Lifespan Mouse but the baby it had just given birth to.","The Lifespan Mouse mated for life. The Death Demon Concubine Beast had already contracted the male Lifespan Mouse.","If the elderly man contracted the female Lifespan Mouse, the couple would be separated.","The Lifespan Mouse was a mouse-species fey and did not have a strong bond with its young.","The female Lifespan Mouse did not demonstrate any maternal instincts after it gave birth. Hence, it was unlikely that the couple would be affected by the loss of one of their children.","While the Moon Empress was speaking with Lin Yuan, she saw him summon a small mouse with tangerine-red fur into his palm.","The Moon Empress immediately recognized it as the Lifespan Mouse she had already formed a contract with.","The Lifespan Mouse should not exist in this world, and its existence broke the world’s natural order.","No lifeform in the natural world should be allowed to attain immortality.","Although the elderly man had set his spirit fire alight, his lifespan would still eventually come to an end.","The Moon Empress had carefully studied the Lifespan Mouse after she formed a contract with it and discovered that it could not reproduce through normal means.","Hence, the Lifespan Mouse was a lifeform that had mutated by chance.","The Moon Empress did not expect Lifespan Mouse to have another of the Lifespan Mouse and to be willing to give it up.","Lin Yuan had given the first Lifespan Mouse to save the Moon Empress’ life but would be giving the second one up to save the Radiance Federation.","By now, Lin Yuan had done as much for the Radiance Federation as any other member of royalty.","Lin Yuan went on to say, “Master, take this Lifespan Mouse! You can give it to the elderly man so he can form a contract with it.”","The Moon Empress immediately rose to her feet and took Lin Yuan’s hand as she said, “Little Yuan, go and change your clothes. I’ll take you to the imperial court. Although the Spacetime Elder has experienced backlash, he should be waking up from his coma soon. Little Yuan, this is your Lifespan Mouse. You should be the one to give it to him!”","Lin Yuan instantly realized the meaning behind the Moon Empress’ words.","She wanted the Spacetime Elder to owe Lin Yuan a favor.","Lin Yuan was right. This was exactly what the Moon Empress was gunning for.","Previously, the Moon Empress had given the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen to the Bamboo Monarch on Lin Yuan’s behalf because Lin Yuan had not been strong enough.","He had just made his debut at the Guard Ye Banquet and proved himself to be more talented than any other young expert of the Radiance Federation. It would not do him good to call too much attention to himself too quickly.","However, Lin Yuan had proved himself during the battle with the Freedom Federation.","Thus, he could now attract as much attention as he wanted.","The favor that the elderly man would owe Lin Yuan would be a helpful safety net for him.","Ever since she started walking heaven’s path, the Moon Empress realized that the world was not as simple as she thought.","This was because the Moon Empress saw an endless path of evolution along the road.","However, every stage of evolution on this path became increasingly difficult.","Lin Yuan did not turn the Moon Empress down.","However, he had no need for the elderly man to owe him a favor.","This was because Lin Yuan had Begin Lady with him, who had also set its spirit fire alight.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was not offering the Lifespan Mouse because he wanted some form of return.","A reward could not match up to the temptation represented by an endless life.","Lin Yuan offered the Lifespan Mouse because the Moon Empress was troubled by this matter and because he had boundless respect for Spacetime Elder. Otherwise, there was no way that Lin Yuan would give up a foundational resource like the Lifespan Mouse.","Lin Yuan was currently wearing a white set of spirit qi clothes that Wen Yu had specially prepared for him when he went to train in the Divine Wood Federation. It fit fully with the styles in the Divine Wood Federation.","It would not be appropriate to wear such clothes to the Radiance Federation’s imperial court.","Lin Yuan had around 2,000 sets of clothes in his spatial equipment. They had not been designed by Wen Yu but given by the Moon Empress. Every single set of clothes was appropriate to be worn to the Radiance Federation’s imperial court.","Lin Yuan had chosen a white set that was covered with many moon patterns. Faint blue moonstones were embedded all over the moon patterns.","The accessories he wore were exquisite but not gaudy. They suited the youthful Lin Yuan well.","After Lin Yuan had cleansed his body twice and consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk, his body and bone structure were in their best state and could be called the perfect mannequin.","No matter what he wore, Lin Yuan’s aura could carry off the clothes.","After Lin Yuan changed his clothes and returned to the inner palace of the Radiant Moon Palace, Lin Yuan noticed that the Moon Empress had also changed clothes.","Coincidentally, the Moon Empress’ clothes also featured moon patterns. However, the moonstones embedded in the clothes were not faint blue but soft white.","The two sets of spirit qi clothes with similar designs made Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress appear complementary.","The Moon Empress and Lin Yuan were stunned when they saw the clothes that the other was wearing.","The Moon Empress’ lips curled elegantly.","“Little Yuan, take my hand. We’ll ride the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage to the old man’s home.”","The Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage was the Moon Empress’ fey carriage, and the Eternal Frost White Celestial Rising and Frost Green Celestial Rising pulled it. It was iconic of the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan had only ever seen the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage but had never ridden in it!","The Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage traveled deep into the Radiance Federation’s imperial court.","If Lin Yuan had to describe what it was like to ride in the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage with one word, he would say that it was wonderful! If he had to use two words, he would say it was really wonderful! If he had to use three words, it would be really, super wonderful!","Lin Yuan never expected riding in a high-grade fey carriage to be so thrilling.","...","This renewed his desire to build a fey carriage of his own.","It was clear that the fey carriage he had rarely used could no longer meet his needs."]},{"number":2079,"title":"Chapter 2079 Purple Nether Demon Scorpion","paragraphs":["2079 Purple Nether Demon Scorpion","Lin Yuan used to use the Emperor Armored Martial God Insect to pull the fey carriage because he had 12 of the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies that could control insect-species feys.","Recently, while Di Wanmi had been forging precious instruments, she also evolved the 12 Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies.","Di Wanmi had evolved the 12 Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies to Fantasy Breed long ago.","Lin Yuan did not spare his use of Law Crystals, and the 12 Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies evolved to pinnacle Myth Breed. They were now in the midst of evolving to Creation Breed.","The Emperor Armored Martial God Insects that Lin Yuan had finally managed to capture had reached Suzerain/pinnacle Myth II.","The Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies were now stronger than the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects. Thus, the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects were not fit for the Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies.","It was a struggle for the pinnacle Myth Breed Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies to control Immortal insect-species feys, but it was child’s play for them to control pinnacle Creation Breed insect-species feys.","Many dimensional lifeforms were comparable to pinnacle Creation Breed insect-species feys.","Lin Yuan now had more choices apart from the Emperor Armored Martial God Insects.","There were not as many alien insects in the marsh world as there were in the alien insect world, but they did exist.","There was a powerful insect-species dimensional lifeform called the Purple Nether Demon Scorpion in the marsh world.","If the Dark Scorpion’s bloodline had been slightly better, it could have evolved into the Purple Nether Demon Scorpion.","The Dark Scorpion gave itself the same Dark Scorpion because it hoped that its bloodline could evolve again.","But even at the moment it was killed by White Speak, Dark Scorpion had not been able to evolve its bloodline.","Lin Yuan had already seen the Dark Scorpion’s true body.","Since the Purple Nether Demon Scorpion was an evolution of the Dark Scorpion, its appearance would be more pleasant than the Dark Scorpion.","Obtaining strong alien insects in Class 5 dimensional rifts was very difficult.","Lin Yuan could enter the marsh world anytime he wished through Klein Hub.","Lin Yuan had built his own faction in the marsh world and gained his own territory.","Searching for the Purple Nether Demon Scorpion in the marsh world would be much easier.","While he was searching for the Purple Nether Demon Scorpion, the 12 pinnacle Myth Breed Sky Fragrance Beauty Butterflies would be able to evolve to Creation Breed. At that point, the butterflies could control the Immortal Purple Nether Demon Scorpion.","Lin Yuan believed using the 12 Purple Nether Demon Scorpions to pull his fey carriage would be a good choice.","Lin Yuan intended to explore the marsh world. No matter how rare the Purple Nether Demon Scorpions were, Lin Yuan would definitely be able to find them.","At that time, he would ask Hu Quan to build a fey carriage that was fit for the Purple Nether Demon Scorpions so they could complement each other.","At that moment, the two imperial guards stationed in front of Spacetime Elder’s bedroom bowed to Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress before they moved apart to let them in.","However, their gazes could not help but land on Lin Yuan.","The Radiance Federation’s imperial guards all used to be members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and had been picked by the Spirit Guards.","All of these imperial guards had seen Lin Yuan’s fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group.","Thus, they were not only curious about Lin Yuan but also had a very good impression of him.","He had safeguarded the Radiance Federation’s honor and dealt a heavy blow to the Freedom Federation.","A Freedom Envoy and three members of their royalty had lost their lives in the Radiance Federation. Another member of the Freedom Federation had been lured to the scene to protect her son. All of this had been achieved by Lin Yuan.","Although the battle had been five versus five, anyone could see that Lin Yuan had been the key factor in the victory.","When he faced Qian Yu wielding a 7 Stars sacred source lifeform, Lin Yuan had managed to kill him while protecting his four teammates.","At the time, Lin Yuan’s strongest main fey had only been Diamond X/Fantasy V, while Qian Yu possessed a pinnacle Myth II fey.","The young man’s talent behind the Moon Empress was already higher than any person who had come before him.","After the imperial guards bowed to Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress, they saw that Lin Yuan had returned the greeting by bowing at them. He lacked any arrogance that a person of his capabilities and status should have.","This caused the two imperial guards to be even more taken with him.","A young person like him with such power and talent, who was also the Moon Empress’ adored disciple, had every right to act rebelliously and without reins.","Every elite in the Radiance Federation knew that the Moon Empress beloved her disciple, and he was very important to her.","Since the two imperial guards had remained in the imperial court, it was only natural that they were also aware of this.","However, they felt no such unruliness and savagery from Lin Yuan. Rather, he was very modest and respectful.","There were countless talented young people in the world, and the Radiance Federation, one of the three major federations, was the perfect breeding ground for such spirit qi professionals. It was only natural.","However, once a person started acting in an unrestrained manner because they had achieved some results, they would become blocked. During the period that they were blocked, their talent would be limited.","From how modest and humble Lin Yuan was, it was clear that he had experienced no such obstacle.","The Moon Empress noticed what Lin Yuan did and could not help but smile,","In the past year, Lin Yuan had experienced innumerable miracles and an explosion of power.","Yet, his character had not changed much from when she had just accepted him as her disciple.","When she had been in the prime of her youth and power, she also had two years where she had been blocked.","Lin Yuan’s character made him very suited to be a Radiance Envoy as well as a spirit qi professional who explored the highest limits of power.","When the Moon Empress pulled Lin Yuan in, she saw Cicada Song leave the bedroom with a dejected expression.","Cicada Song, Iron Prison, the Moon Empress, Night Leaning Moon, Long Lamplight, and the other members of royalty had been nurtured by the Spacetime Elder when they were Radiance Envoys. Although they were not officially master and disciples, there was a similar bond.","Later, Night Leaning Moon, the Moon Empress, and Long Lamplight decided to expand independently while Cicada Song and Iron Prison remained by the Spacetime Elder’s side.","Both Cicada Song and Iron Prison were very attached to the Spacetime Elder.","Cicada Song’s expression showed that the Spacetime Elder was in a very bad state.","...","The Moon Empress gently asked, “Cicada Song, he should be awake, right?”"]},{"number":2080,"title":"Chapter 2080 Hope to Die Before You!","paragraphs":["2080 Hope to Die Before You!","Cicada Song had been frowning as he tried to come up with a way to extend the Spacetime Elder’s lifespan.","Cicada Song was not a Creation Master and did not have Creation Master abilities. Thus, the only solutions he could come up with involved searching for treasures.","Cicada Song was in charge of the City Lords of the Radiance Federation’s 36 major cities. It could be said that every City Lord was his subordinate.","Furthermore, Cicada Song was in charge of organizing the information from different federations to keep the Radiance Federation’s network of information up to date.","Thus, Cicada Song knew that there were some treasures that could extend one’s lifespan within certain federations.","However, these treasures could save lives.","By increasing the lives of the strongest experts in the federation, the life of the federation itself would be safeguarded.","There was no way that the other factions would be willing to trade these lifespan-extending treasures, even if they lacked Creation Master resources.","Furthermore, the Spacetime Elder was not the type to start a war just so he could extend his lifespan.","The Moon Empress was the youngest and had the most talent. However, she had only just awakened her birth horoscope and still needed an untold amount of time before she could set her spirit fire alight.","Although the Moon Empress had declared to the Freedom Federation and Azure Federation during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection that she was a Class 6 Creation Master, there was no way she would be able to fend off the Freedom Federation, which was ready to go to arms at any time.","Thus, whether it was for the sake of their personal relationship or the Radiance Federation, Cicada Song did not want the Spacetime Elder to die.","While Cicada Song was thinking, he did not notice the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan. It was only when the Moon Empress spoke that his train of thought was broken.","Cicada Song was not shocked to see the Moon Empress, but he was confused to see Lin Yuan with her.","Cicada Song did not think too much of it and said to the Moon Empress, “The Spacetime Elder woke up yesterday evening. Xia Qing is tending to him now. Xiyue, you and Night Leaning Moon are on good terms with Xia Qing. Go and coax her. She is so pitiful now!”","Cicada Song could not bring himself to continue speaking. He sighed and walked out of the imperial court.","Lin Yuan knew about Xia Qing, but he did not know much about her. All he knew was that she was Sequence #2 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","It was only after he represented the Radiance Federation in the fight against the Freedom Federation envoy group that he was officially acquainted with her in the Radiance Sacred Hall.","Lin Yuan’s impression of Xia Qing was that she was sincere and friendly.","Liu Jie later told Lin Yuan about Xia Qing.","Liu Jie had said with certainty that when it came to power, she was above Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and An He.","It was practically a guarantee that she would become a Radiance Envoy a year later.","When Liu Jie had competed against Xia Qing, there was no way he could beat her even if he used all of the insect-species carcinoma feys under his control unless he used the Emperor Core of All Insects.","However, the price of using the Emperor Core of All Insects was too high. Liu Jie might not be able to rein it in properly, and it also had a large impact on the Insect Queen.","Thus, unless he had absolutely no choice, Liu Jie would not use the Emperor Core of All Insects’ power when he was competing in friendly matches.","Moreover, Liu Jie was not the only one with a sacred source lifeform. Xia Qing had one as well but had never shown it before.","Hence, in spite of the fact that Liu Jie now had two insect-species carcinoma fey fairies and the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, he could not be confident that he would be able to defeat Xia Qing.","Lin Yuan was shocked when he heard about Xia Qing’s power.","He knew that the extent of his power was due to Morbius.","However, Xia Qing was not a transmigrator, and there was no way she would have access to such external factors.","Although he had only been increasing his power for a year while Xia Qing had been doing so for over ten years, her talent alone was shocking enough.","Besides Xia Qing’s power, Liu Jie had also told Lin Yuan about Xia Qing’s background.","She was almost no different from a princess and had been born with a golden spoon in her mouth. Yet, she had never received the princess treatment.","Her parents had died protecting the Radiance Federation while she was young.","She already had memories at that time and experienced the full extent of the grief of losing her parents.","After that, the only family that Xia Qing had left was the Spacetime Elder.","But now, she was about to experience the pain of the Spacetime Elder leaving this world as well.","Xia Qing was indeed pitiful, as Cicada Song said.","The Moon Empress was silent for a long time and led Lin Yuan in.","The Spacetime Elder’s bedroom had minimum decoration. There was only a wooden table and chair, as well as a few wooden shelves outside of the bedroom. Inside the bedroom was a large wooden screen.","When the Moon Empress led Lin Yuan past the screen, the shriek of a young girl was heard.","“Grandfather, it’s not that I can’t take it! From the day that I learned that my parents gave their lives for the sake of the Radiance Federation, I knew that you would be leaving me one day too! I’m also prepared to sacrifice my life for the Radiance Federation.","“But Grandfather, this is all happening too quickly! Allow me to be selfish and say that I hope I can die before you. This way, I won’t have to bear the pain of you leaving me!”","The young girl’s shriek also had restrained sobbing, which indicated deep sorrow.","The young girl’s shriek was followed by an elderly and loving sigh.","“Little Qing, how can I continue living if you die before me? It’s only natural that the young see the old off. True sorrow comes from when the opposite happens.”","While she was talking, the source of the elderly voice seemed to think of something as he let out another sorrowful sigh.","The Moon Empress’ chest tightened when she heard this sigh. She knew that he always missed his son and daughter-in-law but never revealed his true feelings.","This was the first time that she was seeing him reveal his vulnerability.","Lin Yuan’s chest tightened when he heard Xia Qing’s shriek.","Luckily, he had the Lifespan Mouse and could effectively prevent this tragedy from happening.","When the Moon Empress pulled Lin Yuan across the screen, in actuality, from the moment the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan rode the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage to the imperial court, the Spacetime Elder knew that they were coming.","The moment that the pair crossed the screen, the Spacetime Elder smiled kindly and said warmly to them, “Come sit by the bed! Little Qing, don’t cry. Move the bench over so Xiyue and Little Yuan can sit!”","..."]},{"number":2081,"title":"Chapter 2081 Falling Moon Life Pear!","paragraphs":["2081 Falling Moon Life Pear!","Lin Yuan did not immediately walk over when he heard the Spacetime Elder. Instead, he turned to look at the Moon Empress.","Since they had come to give the Lifespan Mouse to the Spacetime Elder, Lin Yuan did not want to take a seat and chat before telling the Spacetime Elder the reason for his coming.","Xia Qing was currently in the throes of grief, and the longer it took to reveal the reason for their visit, the crueler it would be to her.","Lin Yuan did not want such a venerated man to reveal his weak and resigned side to his descendant.","When the Moon Empress caught Lin Yuan’s gaze, she immediately knew what he was thinking. A warm smile spread across her solemn face, and she could not help but smile warmly before she nodded at Lin Yuan.","Now that he had the Moon Empress’ permission, Lin Yuan said, “Spacetime Elder, form a contract with this fey, and you won’t have to worry about your lifespan.”","Lin Yuan summoned the Lifespan Mouse.","Xia Qing was not willful. She might be arrogant, but it was because she was experiencing the period of obstacles that every talented expert went through.","She always held herself to a high standard and worked hard. Furthermore, she was talented. Otherwise, she would not have the power she currently possessed.","Xia Qing only acknowledged two people amongst the Radiance Federation’s younger generation.","The first was Liu Jie, who had sacrificed for the sake of the Radiance Federation, and the other was Lin Yuan, who had defeated Qian Yu.","This was the reason she had approached Lin Yuan in the first place.","She had even made a deal with him that would allow Lin Yuan to use the Brocade Embroidered Fortuitous Dragon’s dragon pearls to produce the Sentient Being Protective Dragon.","She would not be bothered if the Moon Empress heard how she had lost control of her emotions. However, she would be embarrassed if Lin Yuan had heard her.","Xia Qing listened to her grandfather and moved the bench over. But when she heard what Lin Yuan said, her entire body froze.","The wooden bench clattered to the ground.","She immediately succumbed to happiness.","Xia Qing was not only a spirit qi professional but also a Creation Master.","As a Class 3 Creation Master, she immediately saw the Lifespan Mouse for what it was.","The Spacetime Elder also had Creation Master talent, albeit not as much of it as the Moon Empress, Bamboo Monarch, and Chef Supreme. Nonetheless, he had reached pinnacle Class 4.","The Spacetime Elder was stunned for a moment when he saw the Lifespan Mouse in Lin Yuan’s hands before he started to laugh merrily. At that moment, the light of new life appeared in his eyes.","Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress both smiled when they heard the Spacetime Elder’s laughter.","No spirit qi professional would be unaffected in the face of their own death.","Not even the Moon Empress had been able to calmly accept that her lifespan had come to its end. She still unconsciously wanted to fight back against fate to somehow win the chance to extend her life.","The Spacetime Elder was smiling so broadly because he saw the chance for him to extend his life.","Additionally, he had been blaming himself for making the two-year bet with the Freedom Federation and had been racking his brain for the sake of the Radiance Federation’s future.","The Spacetime Elder looked at Lin Yuan with gratitude, but Lin Yuan did not give the Spacetime Elder the chance to thank him.","He walked up to the Spacetime Elder and placed the Lifespan Mouse in the Spacetime Elder’s hand as he said, “After you form a contract with the Lifespan Mouse, make sure to protect it. Don’t summon it! The more vitality-containing spiritual ingredients you feed it, the greater the possibility of extending your lifespan endlessly.”","Lin Yuan did not continue standing in front of the Spacetime Elder. Instead, he walked over to the stunned Xia Qing, picked up the bench, and placed it by the Spacetime Elder’s bed.","Lin Yuan pulled out a chair and gestured for the Moon Empress to take a seat while he stood off to the side. This was his way of showing respect to the Spacetime Elder.","After the Moon Empress sat down on the chair, she took Lin Yuan’s hand and said, “Little Yuan, you don’t need to be overly courteous in front of the Spacetime Elder. Little Qing, take a seat too!”","The Moon Empress took out the Falling Moon Life Pear, which contained a lot of vitality.","The Falling Moon Life Pear was a special fruit that the Moon Empress produced using the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s tears after she contracted the Lifespan Mouse.","The Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s tears contained an immense amount of vitality and could even trigger flesh to grow on a skeletonized body.","Every Falling Moon Life Pear produced by the Moon Empress could allow the Lifespan Mouse to store up to 15 years of lifespan.","The Falling Moon Life Pear was small. It was a pear but was only around the size of a plum. It was perfect for the Lifespan Mouse’s meal.","After the Spacetime Elder accepted the Falling Moon Life Pear, he did not rush to contract the Lifespan Mouse. Instead, he turned his head to ask Lin Yuan.","“Little Yuan, with this Lifespan Mouse and the chance to attain immortality, why don’t you contract it yourself?”","Lin Yuan was stupefied by the Spacetime Elder’s question but replied with his honest thoughts.","“Ever since I got my hands on the Lifespan Mouse, I never thought of forming a contract with it. I’m still young and want to try using my own power to reach immortality.”","Lin Yuan still had more to say but paused.","He had spoken the truth, and this was exactly what he thought.","Spiritual energy needed to be used up to contract the Lifespan Mouse. Lin Yuan did not have much spiritual energy and did not want to waste it on the Lifespan Mouse.","Moreover, he was only 18 years old and had not tried using his own capabilities to attain immortality.","He might consider contracting the Lifespan Mouth in his later years when his powers had stopped budging.","Additionally, Lin Yuan would rather keep the Lifespan Mouse for his companions and family.","When Lin Yuan gave the Lifespan Mouse to the Moon Empress, he was unaware of the problem plaguing her. It was only later that he heard of it from Mystic Moon.","Ever since then, the thought of it filled Lin Yuan with fear.","If he had contracted the Lifespan Mouse after he obtained it, the Moon Empress would not have been able to contract it, and Lin Yuan would have ended up losing her forever."]},{"number":2082,"title":"Chapter 2082 You Don’t Owe Me Anything!","paragraphs":["2082 You Don’t Owe Me Anything!","As Lin Yuan continued down the path of power increment, he realized something that many people did not understand: that the people in one’s life were more important than power increment.","Power could not only allow one to climb to greater heights, but more importantly, it could also protect those in one’s life.","This was why Lin Yuan had not fallen into the period of obstacles experienced by other young experts, where they became arrogant and unruly.","There was no limit to the power to protect.","Lin Yuan might already have four of the Lifespan Mice, but he would still use each one carefully.","But today, the Lifespan Mouse was demonstrating its greatest worth. It was going to save the Spacetime Elder’s life, as well as protect the sacred land that was the Radiance Federation.","The Spacetime Elder could not help but laugh when he looked into Lin Yuan’s honest and sincere eyes.","“Young man, you are full of spirit. Of course you’ll have the chance to fight for immortality! Moon Empress, you have blessed the Radiance Federation by accepting this disciple!”","The Moon Empress smirked.","“Spacetime Elder, after all that Little Yuan said, why don’t you go ahead and form a contract with the Lifespan Mouse? The young are blessed by having many years ahead of them. Let them go and make something out of themselves!”","The Moon Empress’ words sounded like a parent bragging about her child.","The small sapling that she used to need to watch over had now grown into a small tree that she could be proud of.","The Spacetime Elder circulated his spiritual energy and formed a contract with the energetic Lifespan Mouse.","When he formed a contract with the Lifespan Mouse, the Spacetime Elder sensed how badly it yearned for the Falling Moon Life Pear.","The Spacetime Elder handed the Falling Moon Life Pear over, and the Lifespan Mouse clutched it with its small paws and quickly chomped down on it.","While the Lifespan Mouse was eating the Falling Moon Life Pear, the Spacetime Elder could clearly sense that his lifespan was increasing.","The Spacetime Elder knew that the issue with his lifespan that had been plaguing him all this time had been perfectly solved. He no longer needed to worry about his lifespan.","Although he could no longer try to break through for now after his recent failure, he could try again five years later and not worry about his lifespan shrinking if he failed again.","While the Lifespan Mouse was eating the Falling Moon Life Pear, Xia Qing looked at her grandfather before she looked at Lin Yuan with gratitude.","However, she was a girl, and it would not be appropriate for her to express her thanks to Lin Yuan in front of elders.","So now that Xia Qing had confirmed that her grandfather’s lifespan had been rejuvenated, she extended an invitation to Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, let me take you on a tour around other places in the imperial court. Auntie Moon and Grandfather will be chatting about formal business, and we won’t be able to give any input. It will be very boring.”","The Moon Empress immediately said, “Little Yuan, why don’t you go out for a spin with Little Qing? I will call you once I’m ready to return to the Radiant Moon Palace.”","Lin Yuan stood up and bowed to the Spacetime Elder and the Moon Empress before he walked out of the bedroom with Xia Qing.","Once they were out of the bedroom, Xia Qing sincerely thanked Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, thank you for allowing my family to remain complete! If there’s anything you want me to do, just say the word! I, Xia Qing, owe you a debt of life!”","Previously, Xia Qing already saw Lin Yuan as her friend. She was the one who had initiated the friendship.","She was not the type to beat around the bush with her friends.","As she faced Lin Yuan, she candidly told him what was going through her mind.","She was not the type to joke.","Since she said that she owed Lin Yuan a debt of life, she would not hesitate to give up her life in exchange for Lin Yuan’s if the situation ever called for it.","Xia Qing’s words were full of sincerity, but they put Lin Yuan in a slightly difficult position.","He hurriedly said, “There isn’t a debt of life to be owed here. I’m from the Xia Region. If your grandfather hadn’t been protecting the Radiance Federation all this time, my sister and I wouldn’t have been able to lead stable lives in the Xia Region after the death of our parents. You don’t owe me anything!”","Xia Qing did not say anything else.","She had always been stubborn and rarely changed her mind. This personality of hers had been the source of many headaches for her grandfather.","Xia Qing led Lin Yuan around the imperial court and happened to bump into Cicada Song and Iron Prison.","Both of them were frowning. It was clear that Cicada Song had roped Iron Prison into helping him find a solution for the problem he could not solve.","They looked shocked when they saw Lin Yuan and Xia Qing walking over to them from the distance, smiling away.","Cicada Song had just left the bedroom, where Xia Xing had been sobbing so pitifully that he could no longer stand to be there. The Spacetime Elder had been lying on the bed, with only about a year left to live.","No matter how much Xia Qing and Lin Yuan were in love, she should not be happily flirting with him on the streets at such a time.","At that moment, Cicada Song heard Xia Qing shout to him and Iron Prison, “Uncle Cicada Song, Uncle Iron Prison! The problem with Grandfather’s lifespan has been solved. You don’t need to worry anymore!”","Cicada Song and Iron Prison were stunned and looked elated.","Since Xia Qing was the one who spoke, there was no way it could be a lie.","Cicada Song and Iron Prison immediately rushed to the bedroom. They did not say much more to Xia Qing and Lin Yuan.","Although they knew that there was no way that Xia Qing was lying, they had to see the Spacetime Elder for themselves to rest easy.","Cicada Song remembered that the Moon Empress had also been helpless in the face of such an issue. Otherwise, the Spacetime Elder would not have had to give her the precious Earth Center Fine Milk.","The issue that the Moon Empress had been helpless to solve was later fixed without aid from anyone.","Now, the Spacetime Elder faced the same issue that the Moon Empress had, which was solved once the Moon Empress arrived.","This caused Cicada Song to instinctively think of Lin Yuan, who the Moon Empress had brought to the imperial court.","Could it be that Lin Yuan was the one who had solved the Moon Empress and Spacetime Elder’s problems?","While Cicada Song and Iron Prison were heading to the bedroom, the Moon Empress and the Spacetime Elder were chatting normally.","“Xiyue, I used to think that my granddaughter was too much of an introvert. But now, it seems like she just hadn’t met people on the same frequency!”"]},{"number":2083,"title":"Chapter 2083 Exchange of Information","paragraphs":["2083 Exchange of Information","The Moon Empress smiled when she heard what the Spacetime Elder said. She knew what he meant but did not chime in. Instead, she changed the topic.","The Moon Empress knew that the Spacetime Elder approved of Lin Yuan and wanted to match him with his granddaughter.","The Moon Empress might be Lin Yuan’s master, but she did not want to be involved in such matters.","Lin Yuan was only 18 years old, and there was no rush for him to dive into matters of the heart.","Spirit qi professionals naturally had long lives.","From the talent that Lin Yuan demonstrated, it was certain that he would be able to become a thearch-class expert.","When one lived hundreds of years, it was not too late to only start thinking about marriage at 100 to 200 years old.","Moreover, the Moon Empress did not want to restrict Lin Yuan when it came to these matters. He could make his own decisions when it came to this.","When the Moon Empress did not reply, the Spacetime Elder did not continue speaking.","The Moon Empress sensed Cicada Song and Iron Prison’s auras outside of the palace and said to the Spacetime Elder sternly, “When Cicada Song and Iron Prison arrive, I’ll briefly explain the information I received.”","The Spacetime Elder’s smile quickly disappeared when he saw the Moon Empress’ stern expression. He knew that the matter had to be important for her to be so solemn about it.","The Goddess of Mercy had decided to ally with the Radiance Federation because of the Moon Empress.","Hence, the Goddess of Mercy would contact the Moon Empress immediately with any information from the Freedom Federation.","It was likely that what the Moon Empress was about to say was related to information from the Goddess of Mercy.","The Goddess of Mercy was a member of the Freedom Federation’s royalty, and the Freedom Federation was one of the three major federations. Thus, the information that came from her had to be core information from the Freedom Federation.","The most important thing that the Radiance Federation needed to do now was to collect information on the Freedom Federation.","The two-year bet suppressed the war between the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation. Without it, a fight would break out at any time.","It had to be a serious matter in the Freedom Federation for Qian Yu to have died in the Radiance Federation after leading an envoy group there.","In recent years, the Freedom Federation had contacted the First Emperor Shark Clan and had become close with other sea clans. They had also formed an unknown collaboration with Tower Canon. All of this was indicative of the Freedom Federation preparing to cause trouble.","Tower Canon had always been a faction that was shrouded in mystery.","Before the Radiance Federation became one of the three major federations, Tower Canon’s reputation had already spread far and wide in the main world.","It became clear during the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection that Tower Canon and the Freedom Federation were colluding.","Luckily, the Radiance Federation had built a relationship with the Heavenly Family Cottage.","Otherwise, even the Spacetime Elder would experience great pressure if he had to take on both the Freedom Federation and Tower Canon. The pressure would not only be on the Spacetime Elder but also on the entire Radiance Federation.","The Spacetime Elder was pressured as he did not know if he could protect the Radiance Federation again if the Freedom Federation and Tower Canon joined forces and attacked.","Cicada Song and Iron Prison entered the bedroom.","Cicada Song had told Iron Prison that the Moon Empress brought Lin Yuan to see the Spacetime Elder.","Iron Prison had also seen Lin Yuan strolling on the streets with Xia Qing.","Cicada Song knew that the Moon Empress was not easy to get along with and reminded Iron Prison often not to clash with her.","The ever-cold Iron Prison rolled his eyes.","He clashed with the Moon Empress because they had different mindsets, but both of them wanted the best for the Radiance Federation.","Furthermore, the Moon Empress had already triggered her birth horoscope and was more powerful than him. Unless it was absolutely necessary, he did not want to get on the wrong side of her as well. It was possible that he would end up beaten to a pulp for his transgression.","First, Cicada Song and Iron Prison bowed to the Spacetime Elder before they nodded at the Moon Empress.","Both of them moved a seat over by the bed and asked anxiously, “Spacetime Elder, your lifespan”","Before they could finish speaking, the Spacetime Elder rose to his feet and said, “My lifespan is no longer an issue. The Moon Empress has something important to say. Let’s not talk about it in the bedroom. We’ll go to the study room next to the bedroom instead! After lying in bed for so many days, I’m long overdue to stretch my legs.”","Cicada Song and Iron Prison hurriedly went over to help the Spacetime Elder up but were stopped by his raised hand.","“I only injured my roots and need to rest for a few months. I don’t have any other serious issues. I can handle my day-to-day life on my own!”","While he spoke, the Spacetime Elder got off the bed and put on his jacket before heading to the study room.","Cicada Song and Iron Prison were ecstatic.","Although they knew that Xia Qing would not lie to them, they could not rest easy until they heard from the Spacetime Elder himself that he was fine.","After their happiness passed, their expressions turned solemn.","In the past six months, every piece of information from the Moon Empress had been extremely important.","For the information to be taken so seriously by the Spacetime Elder, it should have warranted an imperial meeting if not for the inappropriate timing.","Once the four of them entered the study room, they sat down in chairs, and the Moon Empress said, “Our previous guess was right. There are indeed experts in the Freedom Federation who have set their spirit fires alight. The Mirror God is one of them.”","Iron Prison and Cicada Song were stunned when they heard what the Moon Empress said. They did not know how the Moon Empress could be so confident about such sensitive information from the Freedom Federation.","The powers of the members of royalty were the biggest secrets of the Freedom Federation.","Even if someone from the Freedom Federation were to have set their spirit fire alight, it should be the God of Fools and not the Mirror God.","If the Mirror God had set his spirit fire alight, it meant that the God of Fools had already long set his spirit fire alight as well.","Only the Moon Empress and the Spacetime Elder knew that the Goddess of Mercy was working with the Radiance Federation. Even Lin Yuan, who was mainly involved, only guessed so but did not know for sure.","The more people who knew, the more likely that information would be leaked. It was better for fewer people to know of something like this. This was why Cicada Song and Iron Prison were unaware.","At that moment, the Moon Empress revealed another piece of information that caused the Spacetime Elder’s eyes to widen with astonishment.","“There is another dimensional world besides the five known dimensional rifts. It is filled with dimensional lifeforms that emanate the aura of death. Tower Canon has managed to take control of this dimensional world by some unknown means.”","As the Moon Empress looked at Cicada Song and Iron Prison’s expressions, she could not help but remember how she had the same expression when she heard the news from Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","..."]},{"number":2084,"title":"Chapter 2084 Sober Up After Being Scolded!","paragraphs":["2084 Sober Up After Being Scolded!","As Lin Yuan’s master, the Moon Empress knew Lin Yuan’s character well. Hence, she never suspected the information that came from him.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had released the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird during their previous question-and-answer session. The Moon Empress had sensed the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird and discussed it in-depth with Lin Yuan. Eventually, she concluded that the Pilgrimage Corpse Bird indeed came from a new dimensional world.","Cicada Song had been very imaginative when he was a Radiance Envoy, and many of the things he had imagined turned out to be true.","This caused Iron Prison to see Cicada Song as eccentrically clairvoyant.","When he heard what the Moon Empress said, Cicada Song instinctively said, “Tower Canon’s 100-year plan is called the Sleeper’s Revival. Is it possible that it’s related to this dimensional world full of the aura of death?”","The Moon Empress and the Spacetime Elder frowned.","It was likely that only the Eight Pages of Tower Canon knew exactly what the Sleeper’s Revival was.","Nonetheless, the plan that Tower Canon had been setting up for so long had to have serious repercussions for the main world.","Since the plan was called the Sleeper’s Revival, it seemed to be related to the dead.","Tower Canon had been inserting itself in various places all over the world. Many federations had reported this during the Major Federation Meeting eight years ago.","The Radiance Federation had been aware of Tower Canon’s schemes in the main world for over 70 years.","But recently, Tower Canon had been acting up more frequently.","Seventh Page War had even eliminated the Seven States of Darkness, which had a Class 5 Creation Master, and took control of the Dark Continent.","It was rumored that she had even moved her tower that represented her membership in the Eight Pages to the Dark Continent.","Such a reckless move meant that Tower Canon was no longer lurking in the shadows but was recklessly exposing itself.","From such a change, it seemed that Tower Canon’s 100-year plan was about to truly kickstart in the next few years.","The two pieces of information from the Moon Empress were too shocking. The group was silent for a while as they digested what they had just heard.","A while later, the Spacetime Elder said, “Hold an imperial meeting tomorrow morning so we can properly discuss the information Xiyue just revealed.”","The group chatted for a while before the Spacetime Elder stood up and said, “I am rather tired. It’s time for all of you to leave too!”","The Spacetime Elder’s face was pale when he spoke.","After he had fallen to break through, his spirit fire had damaged the roots of both his body and soul.","Before his injuries healed, his body and soul would be weak, and he would feel as though he was being stabbed by knives.","For the Spacetime Elder to have lasted so long, it showed that he had an iron will. There was no way that people with weaker wills would be able to hold out so long and appear as stable as he did.","Iron Prison, Cicada Song, and the Moon Empress all stood up.","Iron Prison had been wanting to report something to the Spacetime Elder, but he had been distracted with his concern over the Spacetime Elder’s injury and had not had the chance to bring it up.","But Iron Prison needed to seek the Spacetime Elder’s opinion when it came to this matter because it involved the Radiance Federation. Thus, he said, “Spacetime Elder, Night Leaning Moon, and the members of the Heavenly Family Cottage have left the Radiance Federation together. They worked together to eliminate the First Emperor Shark Clan.","“The First Emperor Shark Clan is one of the top three clans of sea emperors and a recognized sea emperor clan of Vast Sea Labyrinth. But now that a member of the Radiance Federation’s royalty was involved in destroying the First Emperor Shark Clan, will Vast Sea Labyrinth”","Before Iron Prison could finish speaking, he was interrupted by the Moon Empress, “Let the Spacetime Elder rest. I will answer all your questions!”","The Moon Empress started walking out of the study.","Iron Prison took into account the Spacetime Elder’s condition and followed the Moon Empress out of the study after hearing what she said.","Cicada Song could not help but let out a sigh of relief.","He had decided to drag Iron Prison out if he did not follow the Moon Empress out of the study.","Cicada Song felt that Iron Prison did not think things through sufficiently.","It was true that Vast Sea Labyrinth was the largest faction in the sea and ruled over the entire sea. It was also true that Vast Sea Labyrinth was favored by the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors.","But he needed to consider which faction had instigated the attack on the First Emperor Shark Clan! It was the Heavenly Family Cottage!","Vast Sea Labyrinth was linked to the Heavenly Family Cottage by marriage. Blue Lotus had accidentally let slip that every member of Vast Sea Labyrinth shared the same trait of being afraid of their wives. It could be said that all the members of the Heavenly Family Cottage who married into Vast Sea Labyrinth had significant sway in the faction.","Shark Awn had almost killed the Mother of Bloodbath, meaning it had almost killed a beloved direct descendant of a member of the Heavenly Family Cottage.","It was already lucky that the Heavenly Family Cottage did not hold Vast Sea Labyrinth accountable. There was no way they would cause trouble for the Radiance Federation!","Cicada Song and Blue Lotus got along well, and Blue Lotus liked to chat with him when she was free.","Vast Sea Labyrinth was a mystery to all the federations. They had not appeared for centuries and had been lying low alongside the Heavenly Family Cottage.","This was why the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors were allowed to do as they pleased and claim territories in the sea despite only being servants of Vast Sea Labyrinth.","Three members of the Heavenly Family Cottage had married into Vast Sea Labyrinth. One of them had the true form of a female tiger, the other was a female leopard, and the last was a female mantis. One could only imagine what kind of lives their husbands led.","It could be said that the female tiger and leopard were just fierce, and their husbands would be fine as long as their minds did not wander. However, female mantises were known to eat their husbands. The male mantis could very well one day wake up to find that their legs had been eaten because their wives had been hungry.","Once they left the study, the Moon Empress told Iron Prison, “The people from Vast Sea Labyrinth won’t cause trouble for the Radiance Federation.”","She rode on the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage and took off to meet Lin Yuan.","Iron Prison needed to know the reason before he did anything and was very stubborn. However, the Moon Empress had not explained the situation clearly.","Hence, Iron Prison frowned and looked at Cicada Song.","Cicada Song had become accustomed to Iron Prison’s block-headedness and started to give Iron Prison a clear explanation.","But when he was done explaining the part about the spouses, Cicada Song realized that Iron Prison could not understand why men would become submissive to their partners after marriage.","Since his explanation could not get through, Cicada Song did not continue trying.","Iron Prison would definitely bring up his queries during the imperial meeting tomorrow. He would sober up once Night Leaning Moon scolded him."]},{"number":2085,"title":"Chapter 2085 Urgent News!","paragraphs":["2085 Urgent News!","After getting to know Xia Qing, Lin Yuan realized that she was a very pure-hearted person.","Today, he and she officially became friends.","When the Moon Empress found Lin Yuan, and both of them were about to ride away to the Radiant Moon Palace in the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage, Xia Qing waved goodbye to Lin Yuan forcefully.","The Moon Empress realized that her disciple had very good luck with women. First, it was the Azure Envoy Yin Lin, and now it was Xia Xing. The Mother of Bloodbath, Wen Yu, and Condense Fairy Orchard’s Sun Ningxiang also fancied him.","One of the reasons for the many butterflies fluttering around him at his young age was his good looks and charm. The other reason was the way he carried himself and his character.","Lin Yuan was already 18 years old. If he were only 14 or 15 years old, the Moon Empress would have to carefully explain many things to him.","But now that he was 18 years old, there were many things that the Moon Empress saw no need to explain to him.","Lin Yuan was a strapping young man who was slowly becoming a man in his own right. There were many things that she should not meddle in as his master but allow him to make his own decisions instead.","With such a thought, the Moon Empress could not help but feel slightly bitter.","But she also felt slightly strange at the instant that the feeling appeared.","She suddenly remembered Chef Supreme saying that he also felt bitter when he had to marry his daughter off.","Could it be that she was feeling the same way that Chef Supreme did then?","Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress returned to the Radiant Moon Palace in the late hours before they did a video call with Chu Ci and Cold Moon.","Dew collected in the cold dark night as the moon continued to hang flamboyantly in the sky.","Lin Yuan returned to his room.","He had not been to his room in Leaning Moon Mountain for a long time.","During his absence, the Moon Empress had given careful instructions for his and Chu Ci’s rooms to be redone. There were also attendants who cleaned their rooms daily.","News of Lin Yuan spending the night in his room had been passed on to the four tea attendants. There were currently two moon attendants who were drawing up a bath in his room.","It could be said that every moon attendant in the Radiant Moon Palace envied Wen Yu.","Wen Yu used to be a moon attendant.","She had started out with noticeable talent. But after she was injured in the course of saving someone, the other moon attendants started to secretly bully her because they knew her roots had been injured.","Wherever people existed, so would greed, jealousy, and wickedness.","The competition was very stiff among the moon attendants, and many moon attendants were let go each year.","No moon attendant wanted to be let go because they could be nurtured into a Class 3 Creation Master by the Moon Empress after being a moon attendant for five years.","Wen Yu had already been on the brink of being fired, but Lin Yuan had taken pity on her and chosen her to be his assistant.","Later, due to her relationship with Lin Yuan, she became Mystic Moon’s disciple.","Now, every moon attendant needed to greet her with respect when they saw her.","Wen Yu was like a phoenix in the eyes of the other moon attendants.","All of the moon attendants were waiting for the same opportunity.","The moon attendants who came to the bedroom were hoping to catch Lin Yuan’s eye.","However, he did not have a single such thought going through his mind.","Once he entered the bedroom, he sent the two moon attendants away.","He had been working non-stop in the Divine Wood Federation for the past month. He not only had to address and fix issues but had also been continuously evolving feys. He only slept an average of four to five hours each day.","When Lin Yuan had fully relaxed, he heard Genius’ voice in his head, “Yuan, Wen Yu asked me to call you! She says that Su Yiren is in an urgent situation!”","Lin Yuan immediately jumped to his feet when he heard what Genius said.","Wen Yu was also in the Radiance Federation.","Su Yiren must have gone to her because she could not get in contact with him. The situation must have been dire for her to be willing to use up her willpowers to contact Wen Yu through the Astronomical Parliament.","Normally, Wen Yu could send her instructions to Su Yiren through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","But now that Wen Yu sent Genius to call him, it must mean that she could not solve the issue on her own.","Lin Yuan hurriedly retrieved the Thoughts Letter Paper from his spatial ring.","Once he returned to the Radiant Moon Palace, he stored the Thoughts Letter Paper away and had not checked it yet.","Now that he took out the Thoughts Letter Paper, he saw that Su Yiren had sent him more than ten messages.","With one look, Lin Yuan knew why Su Yiren was trying to get in touch with him so urgently.","The Truth Association had instructed the Iron Hammer Federation to invade the Divine Wood Federation tomorrow.","At first, Lin Yuan panicked as he thought that something serious had happened.","Now that he saw the messages from Su Yiren, he returned to his calm state.","Silver Corona had not been consuming so many dimensional lifeforms all this time for nothing.","By now, the sea of flowers had spread to the border of the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","After another 36 pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts were opened, Lin Yuan had instructed Silver Corona to fortify the part of the sea of flowers that was at the border.","The weakest part of the sea of flowers was now three kilometers away from the border.","These three kilometers were now like a moat that no expert below king-class could cross.","Even king-class experts would have to risk their lives in order to cross the sea of flowers. Unless they were being led by emperor-class experts who cleared the bramble in front of them, there was no way that king-class experts would be able to successfully make it all the way through.","The sea of flowers laid down by Silver Corona caused all the members of the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes to gather at the border.","There were very few of them who managed to cross.","...","It was impossible to cross by land and even more so by sea.","After testing, it was found that the fog produced by the bone insects could pass through Gold Black Rock Steel, which was three centimeters thick. Even Diamond defense-type feys struggled to avoid the bone insects’ bites.","Thus, even with the Truth Association fanning the flames of the war between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation, it could not properly take off.","This was unless the Truth Association sent experts to destroy the bone lotus flowers produced by Silver Corona.","Before Lin Yuan returned to the Radiance Federation, he stationed Begin Lady at the underground palace. If any expert that Silver Corona could not handle started to destroy the sea of flowers, Begin Lady would step in.","Lin Yuan did not know exactly how strong Fifth Page Truth was.","Even if Fifth Page Truth had set his spirit fire alight, he would be easy pickings for Begin Lady.","This was the reason Lin Yuan could return to the Radiance Federation without worrying about what was happening in the Divine Wood Federation.","Su Yiren and Wen Yu were already shaking with panic.","Lin Yuan sent them replies through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","The content of his replies was very simple.","..."]},{"number":2086,"title":"Chapter 2086 Dragon Pearl Embryo!","paragraphs":["2086 Dragon Pearl Embryo!","[There’s no need to worry about the Iron Hammer Federation invading the Divine Wood Federation. Su Yiren, Yi Huailong should have already received word. Contact him through the Thoughts Letter Paper to give him peace of mind.]","After he replied to Wen Yu and Su Yiren, Lin Yuan went back to relaxing in his bath and quickly went to bed.","Meanwhile, Su Yiren had indeed been beside herself with panic.","She had not expected to hear such explosive news from Jin Qianxun so soon after Lin Yuan left the Divine Wood Federation.","Firstly, she did not know that Silver Corona’s sea of bone lotus flowers had already covered the entire border between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","Additionally, she was afraid of ruining Lin Yuan’s plan.","Su Yiren’s biggest dream was to prove herself to Lin Yuan.","Then, she could ask Lin Yuan to help her recover the Dark Continent.","But if she ruined Lin Yuan’s plans after he left, she would not be able to face him to ask him to make good on his promise.","Su Yiren had strong individual power but could not stop the tribes of the Iron Hammer Federation from invading the Divine Wood Federation.","Luo Lan, the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation, was not capable of doing so either.","It was likely that the tribes of the Iron Hammer Federation had invaded the Divine Wood Federation without any backup troops.","Once Lin Yuan stopped them with his unknown means, it was likely that they would all starve to death.","Once Su Yiren calmed down, she did not know if she should tell Luo Lan about the news.","Su Yiren learned of Luo Lan’s troubles and knew of her plans and hopes for the Iron Hammer Federation.","She would be devastated if she found out about this!","Above the sorrow and despair, what would really torture Luo Lan would be the feeling of helplessness.","Lin Yuan had intended to remain in the Radiance Federation for three days. But now that the Truth Association had already made its move, Lin Yuan was going to shorten his stay to two days.","He would return at the same time that the Iron Hammer Federation sent out troops to invade the Divine Wood Federation. This would be the best time for Luo Lan to win the hearts of her people.","Lin Yuan intended to set up Luo Lan as a goddess of bountiful harvest.","There was a culture of worshiping idols in the Iron Hammer Federation, and almost every district had its own idol.","Thus, it would be much more effective to make Luo Lan seem like a goddess who was going to use her divine wisdom to govern the Iron Hammer Federation rather than thrusting her directly into the imperial court with her current status.","He had already accumulated a fair number of Diamond fey storage boxes containing the Soldier Ration Radishes. Now, they were finally going to be put to use.","Before falling asleep, Lin Yuan informed Wen Yu that he would return to the Iron Hammer Federation tomorrow.","Wen Yu liked to make advance preparations, and she would have all the needed resources prepared by tomorrow.","Of course, this was also due to the reliable foundation that Listen had built, as well as Endless Summer’s effective management.","Wen Yu planned on paying Mystic Moon a visit.","She sometimes felt that she and Mystic Moon were not just master-and-disciple but friends.","Mystic Moon did not just nurture her to help her become strong but also to enable her to help Lin Yuan more.","Wen Yu traveled through the inky night and arrived at the part of the palace that Mystic Moon occupied.","Mystic Moon and Cold Moon’s halls were side by side amongst the many halls on Leaning Moon Mountain that made up the Radiant Moon Palace.","It was just like real life, where Cold Moon and Mystic Moon were always standing next to each other behind the Moon Empress.","Mystic Moon was not surprised by Wen Yu’s arrival and immediately pulled out a chair before pouring out a cup of Three Treasures Tea and saying, “The weather hasn’t warmed enough yet, and it’s windy at night. Drink some tea to warm yourself!”","Mystic Moon flashed a small smile while he spoke.","As she sat at the table, Wen Yu looked at Mystic Moon with gratitude.","She did not pick up the cup of tea but poured another cup for Mystic Moon before saying, “Master, I should be the one to pour a cup of tea for you first!”","Mystic Moon downed the cup of tea before saying, “Actually, I no longer have anything to teach you. You are growing faster than I imagined. Remember to remain humble no matter how far you go! A humble heart will allow you to go even further in the future.”","Mystic Moon’s words to Wen Yu actually had two meanings.","The first meaning was to tell her that there would always be more powerful experts than oneself.","The second meaning was to tell her never to become arrogant over her abilities as Lin Yuan’s subordinate.","Wen Yu nodded seriously when she heard what Mystic Moon said.","“Master, I understand!”","Wen Yu was not trying to placate Mystic Moon. She genuinely understood the meanings behind his words.","She would never have the chance to be arrogant in front of Lin Yuan.","This was not a matter of status but that Lin Yuan’s talent was much too impressive.","She would have to give her everything just to chase after Lin Yuan. How could she have the time and energy to act up in arrogance?","Mystic Moon had given Wen Yu her final lesson and started to chat about personal matters with her.","While they chatted, Mystic Moon finally understood why the Moon Empress and Cold Moon were so taken with Lin Yuan and Chu Ci.","Mystic Moon flipped his hand, and a white pearl appeared in his palm.","The pearl was around the size of Wen Yu’s fist and did not emit any kind of glow. Instead, there was a terrifying spiritual energy swirling within.","Mystic Moon handed the pearl to Wen Yu and said, “This is the pearl embryo that came from my dragon pearl after my bloodline evolved. Use your spiritual power to refine this pearl embryo every day for half an hour. A year and a half later, you will be about done with refining the pearl embryo.","“At that time, your spiritual energy will greatly surpass that of your peers. The pearl embryo will also stain your body, and you’ll gain a portion of my bloodline. My bloodline will allow your body to become much stronger.”","Mystic Moon had not intended to give the dragon embryo to Wen Yu because it was also very useful to him.","But now, he had changed his mind and intended to use the dragon embryo that could refine an expert’s spiritual energy to pass on his legacy.","...","While speaking to Wen Yu, Mystic Moon understood the true meaning of legacy between a master and a disciple.","Wen Yu bowed to Mystic Moon before she accepted the dragon embryo.","From the moment she received the dragon embryo, she sensed its weight.","The aura of Mystic Moon’s bloodline was crashing against itself within the dragon embryo, and it caused the flow of Wen Yu’s blood to quicken."]},{"number":2087,"title":"Chapter 2087 Change in Talent!","paragraphs":["2087 Change in Talent!","The longer Wen Yu held the pearl embryo, the faster she could feel her blood rushing through her veins.","The rapid blood flow was a serious strain on Wen Yu’s heart as well.","Wen Yu was holding the dragon embryo with one hand as she clutched her chest with the other.","Mystic Moon immediately remembered that Wen Yu was not a fey but a weak-bodied human.","Wen Yu’s voice was so weak that it was a struggle for her to even be holding the pearl embryo, much less spend half an hour each day refining the energy within it.","Wen Yu’s body would have to be strengthened in order for her to be able to refine the pearl embryo.","Mystic Moon knew that his Dragon Pearl Embryo was full of pure dragon energy.","For Wen Yu to refine the bloodline power within the dragon embryo without being affected by the dragon energy, her heart needed to be fortified to the point of accepting the dragon energy. Then, the dragon energy would improve the strength of her body and affect Wen Yu’s bloodline in a complementary manner.","With this thought, silver dragon patterns appeared on Mystic Moon’s body, and dragon scales appeared on Mystic Moon’s forehead. A long and slender dragon horn protruded from his head.","Mystic Moon used his long pale finger to gently prod the dragon horn, and a drop of blood that had the consistency of mercury flew from Mystic Moon’s finger and landed on Wen Yu’s nose before sinking into her body.","Eventually, the drop of blood traveled through her blood vessels to reach her heart.","The instant the drop of blood reached her heart, Wen Yu no longer felt the pressure from the pearl embryo in her hand.","Instead, the energy from the pearl embryo was now flowing into her body through her palm.","Wen Yu could sense her power and energy rising under the influence of the pearl embryo.","Wen Yu had never experienced such a feeling before, and it made her fall into somewhat of a trance.","The drop of blood that Mystic Moon had passed to her was not a regular drop of blood but a drop of essence blood that he rarely produced.","The stronger the dragon-species fey, the less the amount of essence blood in its body.","With Mystic Moon’s power, his body could only produce three to five drops of essence blood.","Wen Yu could clearly tell that Mystic Moon was weakened after he gave her the drop of essence blood. His face was also very pale.","But when he saw that Wen Yu managed to begin absorbing the energy from within the Dragon Pearl Embryo, Mystic Moon waved his hand and said, “You’ve been here for some time. Go back! Come back and see me when you’re done absorbing the pearl embryo.","“Previously, your fey contraction direction was too narrow, limiting you to only being a support-type spirit qi professional. Luckily, you’ve only contracted the Sunlight Egret, which doesn’t take up too much spiritual energy.","“Don’t contract any more feys for the time being. Once you’re done refining the pearl embryo, you’ll become affiliated with support-type dragon-species feys. At that time, I’ll choose some suitable dragon-species feys to support you on the path you’ve chosen and enable you to go even further.”","Frankly, Wen Yu had been stunned from the moment she received the drop of essence blood from Mystic Moon.","Wen Yu could clearly sense the difference between his treatment of her today and in the past.","In the past, Mystic Moon seemed to be helping to teach the child of another family. But now, he seemed to be teaching his own child.","Wen Yu had always been sensitive and knew that she could not repay her gratitude to Mystic Moon with just a few words.","Wen Yu was a human and not a machine. The more matters she handled, the more responsibilities she would have resting on her shoulders.","When she managed Sky City in the past, she had not felt much pressure. After all, Sky City only called for the best in all matters, and there were not many members.","Listen was in charge of the business side, while Liu Jie oversaw the white-clothed followers.","All she needed to do was balance the relationship between Sky City and other major factions to build up Sky City’s network of intelligence.","Later, Lu Pinru joined Sky City and became Wen Yu’s assistant. She alleviated Wen Yu’s burden of managing Sky City’s intelligence network, which freed up spare time for Wen Yu to design three new sets of clothes for Lin Yuan weekly.","Ever since she arrived at the marsh world, Wen Yu realized that helping Lin Yuan to manage the territory in the marsh world was like building a new world. She had to handle every matter personally.","Sun Ningxiang was already exhausted managing the regular people and spirit qi professionals as they built the breeding base. As such, she did not have any time to help Wen Yu.","This caused Wen Yu’s ever-clear mind to become slightly fuzzy.","Dragon-species feys were the strongest type of fey. Additionally, they also possessed extreme talent. Both of which increased continuously as their bloodlines were improved.","If there was a dragon-species fey that could increase soul power or help to stimulate brain power, Wen Yu would have an easier time managing the marsh world.","Moreover, contracting a dragon-species fey would allow her to have more options as a spirit qi professional.","Wen Yu knew that she needed to stick closely to Lin Yuan. It was not enough to just be of significance because of her strategic abilities.","Wen Yu knew that what Mystic Moon needed the most now was rest. Thus, she bowed deeply to him and left the Radiant Moon Palace.","Mystic Moon smiled as he watched Wen Yu leave.","Besides following the Moon Empress, Mystic Moon found that he now had a new goal in life.","Wen Yu needed to head to the Divine Wood Federation, so she did not rest in the Return from Faraway Mansion. Instead, she instructed Endless Summer to prepare some resources that were not needed right now but were still greatly lacking in the marsh world.","There would eventually be a use for these resources. Rather than waiting until then to bother Lin Yuan, it would be better to prepare them in advance.","Deep at night, Liu Jie, who like Wen Yu had not rested, was currently at the Spirit Guards’ land.","After Night Leaning Moon crossed swords with Du Miao, she had been nursing a fiery hatred for the First Emperor Shark Clan.","She had slaughtered and vented to her heart’s content in this joint operation with the Heavenly Family Cottage.","At the same time, Night Leaning Moon learned how cruel the Heavenly Family Cottage was when they were fighting their enemies.","No survivors of the First Emperor Shark Clan were left.","A faction that was so fearsome when facing enemies was always equally as affectionate to their loved ones.","Night Leaning Moon did not know why the Heavenly Family Cottage had colluded with the Radiance Federation, but she expected that it was related to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":2088,"title":"Chapter 2088 Treasure! Sky Awakening Crystal!","paragraphs":["2088 Treasure! Sky Awakening Crystal!","Night Leaning Moon knew that the Moon Empress was the one who had saved the Mother of Bloodbath.","Night Leaning Moon and the Moon Empress had also been present when Fifth Page Truth attacked Jade Sundial.","If the Moon Empress and Night Leaning Moon had not stepped in, Blood New Moon and the Mother of Bloodbath would not have survived.","After the incident, Night Leaning Moon and the Moon Empress started paying attention to the Mother of Bloodbath’s growth.","However, saving the Mother of Bloodbath was insufficient to warrant such repayment from Heavenly Family Cottage.","Night Leaning Moon could not guess what had happened between Lin Yuan and the Heavenly Family Cottage in order for the proud leader of the Heavenly Family Cottage, Purple Love, to lay aside her differences with the Moon Empress.","Previously, Night Leaning Moon had been suspicious of the Moon Empress’ sudden acceptance of a disciple. She felt that no one in the world deserved to become the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Now, it seemed that it was also somewhat of the Moon Empress’ blessing to have been able to accept Lin Yuan as her disciple.","After slaughtering to her heart’s content, Night Leaning Moon returned to the Spirit Guards’ land to see Liu Jie there.","She had not thought much when she decided to help Liu Jie become the ultimate weapon. She also never expected Liu Jie to have such a smooth time going down this path.","Since Liu Jie was having an easy time going down this path, Night Leaning Moon just needed to focus on finding suitable insect-species carcinoma feys to become the core of his combat system.","When a spirit qi professional was organizing his arsenal of feys, he always centered his decisions around his core.","If Liu Jie did not know what his core was, he would not be able to use the Firefly Demon Fetuses freely.","Night Leaning Moon had flipped through the records of the insect-species carcinoma feys that the Spirit Guards had captured and found numerous ones that could increase Liu Jie’s power. However, none of them were suitable to become his core insect-species carcinoma fey.","Night Leaning Moon and Liu Jie chatted about some master and disciple matters before she said, “Little Jie, you don’t have to rush when it comes to the insect-species carcinoma feys. I will ask Long Lamplight to help look out for suitable insect-species carcinoma feys while he’s riding the Island Whale to conduct trades with other federations. I suggest that you don’t impulsively use the Firefly Demon Fetuses before you find a suitable insect-species carcinoma fey.”","When Liu Jie heard what Night Leaning Moon said, he immediately summoned the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle that the Insect Queen had taken control of.","Under the light, the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle that was more than ten meters long and had six-meter-long horns reflected a gleam even sharper than that from metals.","Night Leaning Moon was the Spirit Guards’ Chief Guard and a Class 4 Creation Master. She only needed a glance to see through the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","Night Leaning Moon’s usually expressionless face looked joyful.","When the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s abilities Metal Forge Angle, Spread Wings Insect Cry, and Insect Death were used together, it enabled the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle to be the core of Liu Jie’s combat system even if the exclusive skills it gained in the future were not of much help.","The Insect Queen and many of the insect-species carcinoma feys that it controlled had strong reproductive abilities.","The greatest weakness of using the sea of insects was when it faced an individually powerful opponent that could divide and conquer.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was perfectly capable on its own and could also boost the insect army so that even in death, every insect could still be useful.","Every time the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle appeared in the wild, a terrifying disaster would follow it.","The Radiance Federation had experienced one such disaster in the past.","The terror that was the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle resulted in Night Leaning Moon deciding not to capture it.","Night Leaning Moon was very curious to know where Liu Jie had obtained the Bronze Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","Liu Jie answered Night Leaning Moon’s question honestly, saying, “Lin Yuan bought it for me at an auction when we were out training!”","Night Leaning Moon was taken aback.","Lin Yuan was also the reason behind her increase in power. Now, it looked like he had once again saved this pair of master and disciple.","Night Leaning Moon once again agreed with the saying that there was no downside to having many skills.","“Little Jie, use the Firefly Demon Fetus to turn the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle into a fairy. It can be the core of your combat system! You need to kill the army of insects in order to strengthen the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle. Thus, you no longer have to evolve insect-species carcinoma feys like the Hypha Tapeworm! Your power will increase more if you contract more insect-species carcinoma feys like the Parasite Decay Locust!”","Liu Jie nodded seriously.","“Master, I already have a general idea of what kind of insect-species carcinoma feys to contract and which to turn into fairies using the Firefly Demon Fetus. The next step is for the fairies to comprehend Willpower Runes.”","Night Leaning Moon always knew that Liu Jie had his own goals when it came to increasing his power and that there was no need to guide or be overly worried about him.","Night Leaning Moon took out a treasure she had earned in her youth and placed it in Liu Jie’s hands as she said, “Hold onto this pendant made from the Sky Awakening Crystal. Make one of the fairies wear it every day, and it’ll increase its chances of comprehending a Willpower Rune. If not for the Insect Queen’s special quality, which prevents you from contracting any other feys, this pendant will actually be more useful for you to wear it.”","Liu Jie had heard of the Sky Awakening Crystal. It was just as rare as the Earth Center Fine Milk.","It could be said that the Sky Awakening Crystal was the best aid for helping feys to comprehend Willpower Runes.","With the Sky Awakening Crystal, it would be easy for Liu Jie’s insect-species carcinoma feys to evolve to Fantasy Breed and then to Myth Breed.","Night Leaning Moon did not give any other advice after Liu Jie received the Sky Awakening Crystal.","Given her understanding of Liu Jie, he was going to give the Sky Awakening Crystal pendant to Lin Yuan.","But after interacting with Lin Yuan, Night Leaning Moon also came to understand him.","Lin Yuan was always helping Liu Jie and saw him as family. Thus, there was no way he would steal Liu Jie’s opportunity.","The Sky Awakening Crystal was only useful in aiding the comprehension of Willpower Runes.","Lin Yuan could just as well use it after Liu Jie.","The Sky Awakening Crystal made Night Leaning Moon’s youth what it was, allowing her to surpass her peers in every way.","But now, she decided to give the opportunities to Liu Jie.","The Radiance Envoys had lost to the Freedom Envoys in the previous Major Federation Meetings.","After being targeted by the Freedom Federation, every Radiance Envoy ended up injured each year.","It was only Night Leaning Moon’s generation of Radiance Envoys who had managed to emerge victorious at the Major Federation Meeting.","Now, Night Leaning Moon believed that Liu Jie and Lin Yuan would be the Radiance Federation’s hope!"]},{"number":2089,"title":"Chapter 2089 Evolution of Core!","paragraphs":["2089 Evolution of Core!","No matter how strong the Radiance Federation was, they were still just enjoying the fruits of a previous generation.","The federation’s future would only be secured if it had a strong younger generation.","The appearance of young geniuses like Liu Jie and Lin Yuan gave the future of the Radiance Federation endless possibilities.","Liu Jie received the Sky Awakening Crystal pendant and bowed the Night Leaning Moon as he said, “Thank you, Master!”","Night Leaning Moon immediately looked displeased when she heard how polite Liu Jie was.","“Little Liu, you can be polite with anyone but me. I am your master, and it’s only right that I do things for you. Besides the Sky Awakening Crystal, I also have some mutated caterpillar fungi that I obtained from alien insect dimensional rifts. They will be able to help your sacred source lifeform increase its Stars quicker.","“Furthermore, I will go and request to retrieve some of the mutated caterpillar fungi in the Spirit Guards’ storage for you. With this, I’m sure your sacred source lifeform will be able to reach 7 Stars within two years.”","While she spoke, Night Leaning Moon patted Liu Jie’s shoulder.","When she accepted Liu Jie as her disciple, she had not expected him to improve so quickly nor that he would end up striving to become the ultimate weapon.","After Liu Jie contracted the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, he confirmed his future path.","As his master, Night Leaning Moon could only help him with resources.","The caterpillar fungus was a special product from the alien insect dimensional rift. It was just as rare as marsh soil and strange flames.","This was because the caterpillar fungus required alien insects and a specific bacteria in order to grow.","In fact, there were much fewer caterpillar fungi in the dimensional rift than there was marsh soil and strange flames.","Night Leaning Moon knew that Lin Yuan had Di Wanmi with him, so Liu Jie would not lack in resources when he was with Lin Yuan.","Unless Class 6 alien insect dimensional rifts opened in the Radiance Federation, it was very difficult to obtain a large number of caterpillar fungi there.","When she saw that Liu Jie was about to thank her, Night Leaning Moon hurriedly waved her hand and said, “Enough. I will stay here tonight to help the Insect Queen control the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle. Then, fuse the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle with the Firefly Demon Fetus to turn it into a fairy source-type lifeform. You are stronger now, so I don’t have to worry as much when you’re out training with Little Yuan!”","Liu Jie released the Insect Queen and sat cross-legged on the ground.","The Insect Queen was extremely intelligent and knew that it benefited greatly when it took control of insect-species carcinoma feys.","Moreover, as the Firefly Demon Fetuses turned the insect-species carcinoma feys into fairies, the Insect Queen could use them to strengthen its own fairy bloodline.","Hence, the Insect Queen often urged Liu Jie to transform more insect-species carcinoma feys into fairies.","But before he confirmed the core of his fey system, he could not make a decision no matter how much the Insect Queen urged him.","Now, with the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, Liu Jie could confirm the next few insect-species carcinoma feys that he was going to transform into fairies.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was not very intelligent.","The Insect Queen flapped its six wings a few times, and a dark purple color appeared in its eyes.","It injected the Blade Queen Bee’s mutated venom and sticky spiritual energy into the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros.","The venom and spiritual energy quickly surrounded and started to seep into the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s spiritual energy and soul.","In the past, Liu Jie would be in danger when he used the Insect Queen to take control of insect-species carcinoma feys because of the insect-species carcinoma feys’ strong resistance.","With its low intelligence and primitive reactions, the insect-species carcinoma feys could hurt the Insect Queen when they were resisting.","But as the Insect Queen became increasingly skilled at using its psychotoxin and its spiritual energy and soul power grew stronger, it could now easily contract and control the insect-species carcinoma feys.","In just 12 short minutes, the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle transformed from a violent insect to the Insect Queen’s obedient puppet.","It was easy to increase the power of insect-species carcinoma feys.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle needed pure spirit qi and a large amount of metal-type spiritual ingredients to increase its power.","Night Leaning Moon had no lack of metal-type spiritual ingredients.","Night Leaning Moon had collected over 100 pieces of Suzerain and Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredients during her stint as the Chief Guard of the Spirit Guards.","Night Leaning Moon was a Class 4 Creation Master and only needed a few bottles of spirit fluids to evolve an insect-species carcinoma fey from Bronze to Diamond grade.","Night Leaning Moon immediately started to increase the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s power.","When Night Leaning Moon saw the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s abilities and exclusive skill, she started to look forward to seeing what its abilities would be after it evolved.","As Liu Jie’s core fey, the strength of the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s new abilities would determine the strength of his combat abilities.","Although the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s abilities Metal Forge Angle and Spread Wings Insect Cry, as well as its exclusive skill Insect Death made it worthy of being Liu Jie’s core insect-species carcinoma fey.","However, there was no doubt that the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s subsequent abilities would only get better.","Night Leaning Moon placed many types of metal-type spiritual ingredients next to the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, and it immediately started to gobble them.","The hard metal-type spiritual ingredients were like fresh tofu in the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s mouth.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle had an extremely large appetite.","All insect-species carcinoma feys were able to consume terrifyingly large amounts of food, up to hundreds if not thousands of tonnes.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was done eating all of the metal-type spiritual ingredients in less than an hour.","After it was done eating all of the metal-type spiritual ingredients, many colored gleaming spots appeared on its long horns as a result of its ability Metal Forge Angle.","Each of the metal-type spiritual ingredients brought with them its own attributes.","Night Leaning Moon took out even more of the metal-type spiritual ingredients and placed them next to the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","After the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle consumed another 1,500 types of metal-type spiritual ingredients, many beautiful metallic patterns appeared on its long horns. The metallic patterns flowed and changed continuously.","Night Leaning Moon sensed the metal attributes on the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s horns and realized that they formed a miniature metal law.","It was just like how mixing thousands of types of medicinal plant-type feys could produce even more medicinal properties."]},{"number":2090,"title":"Chapter 2090 Indestructible Insect Soul","paragraphs":["2090 Indestructible Insect Soul","The miniature metal laws produced by the thousands of metal attributes would not affect the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s comprehension of Willpower Runes. They also made the horns even sturdier.","The more Night Leaning Moon looked at the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, the more satisfied she felt.","At the same time, she was grateful to Lin Yuan.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle would not be able to increase the metal attributes in its body in just a day or two.","Moreover, the strength of the metal attributes on the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was dependent on the number of metal-type spiritual ingredients it consumed.","Night Leaning Moon intended to fill two Diamond fey storage boxes with various metal-type spiritual ingredients from the Spirit Guards’ storage so Liu Jie could use them to continue nurturing the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","The stronger the spiritual energy of Liu Jie’s Insect Queen, the more insect-species carcinoma feys it could control.","He could not afford to use so many resources to nurture every insect-species carcinoma fey, but the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was Liu Jie’s core fey. It would not be a waste to use as many resources on it as possible.","Night Leaning Moon poured out all the spirit fluids she had on hand onto a rocky board.","When the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle ate the rocky board, it would also consume the spirit fluids full of pure spirit qi.","Once the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle consumed the spirit fluids, its aura increased rapidly, and its body expanded.","The larger its body grew, the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s shell shriveled and fell off continuously.","The new shell grew right under the shell that had just shriveled.","The color of the insect shell darkened until it resembled a black hole.","With a closer look at the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s shell, the golden patterns on its shell became clearer each time its old shell shriveled and its new shell grew out.","This meant that the collection of the metal attributes on the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s horns affected its body to a certain extent.","As the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle did more combat and its body became stronger, its combat abilities would also increase.","By the time it reached Diamond X, the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle had grown to almost 40 meters long, and its horns reached 17 meters.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle now took up most of the space in Night Leaning Moon’s room.","The stronger the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle became, the higher its intelligence grew.","It was now intelligent enough to know that it had to get in the Insect Queen and Liu Jie’s good books.","Night Leaning Moon sucked in a sharp breath when she saw the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle prostrating itself in front of Liu Jie in a subservient manner.","As a Class 4 Creation Master, she could see what abilities the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle had gained after evolving from Bronze to Diamond grade.","[Fey Name]: Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle","[Fey Species]: Scarab species/large rhinoceros beetle species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Insect/Gold","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Metal Forge Angle]: It can absorb every type of metal and apply it to its horns to increase its damage power.","[Spread Wings Insect Cry]: When it flaps its wings, it can attract other insect-species feys and apply its metal characteristics to them to provide them with protection.","[Halberd Banner]: Raise the halberd high in the air, and it will become a banner amongst the army of insects that will motivate them and increase their endurance.","[Insect Abdomen Battle Drum]: The abdomen will start to move and produce a roaring noise. The insects that hear the noise will go mad with bloodthirst.","[Metal Solidification Style]: Absorb all of the metal attributes on its body and turn its legs, horns, and shell into battle attire. The metal attributes will boost its combat abilities. (The metal attributes will be used up in the process of boosting).","[Indestructible Insect Soul]: The souls of the insects that the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle has protected will gather around it and form a stance. The stance of insect souls can help the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle to sustain damage while boosting its combat powers.","Exclusive Skill:","[Insect Death]: Whenever an insect dies around it, its metal characteristics will change from its original defense mode to offensemode.","Halberd Banner and Insect Abdomen Battle Drum made the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle even more suited to be Liu Jie’s core insect-species carcinoma fey.","Both of these abilities would be able to boost the entire army of insects.","When a colony of ants with a queen was compared to a colony without a queen, their combat abilities would be completely different even if they had similar numbers.","The colony of ants with a queen would easily be able to trample the colony without a queen. This was because the queen could motivate the colony.","The motivation from the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s ability Halberd Banner gave the army of insects a clear target. Furthermore, Halberd Banner would be able to increase the insect army’s endurance. This way, the insect army would be able to continue doing battle regardless of the circumstances without being affected by the harsh conditions.","The more serious the injury, the stronger their will to fight back would be.","This would allow them to clear away the injured enemies first as well as cause the injured friendly insects to die off first. From this, the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s exclusive skill Insect Death would become more effective.","Furthermore, Indestructible Insect Soul would also become useful once some of the insects in the insect army died. It would not only create a stance from insect souls and increase its own combat ability but also protect itself.","As for Metal Solidification Style, it allowed the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle to use its metal attributes in another way. Its metal attributes would give its combat and defensive abilities a final boost.","Night Leaning Moon had been amazed by the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s abilities more than once.","As it evolved from Bronze to Diamond grade, every single one of its abilities had been useful.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was so outstanding that Liu Jie did not have to be conflicted when he was picking other insect-species carcinoma feys and allowed his talent to be raised again.","Night Leaning Moon said with a smile, “Little Jie, now is the time! Transform the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle into a fairy!”"]},{"number":2091,"title":"Chapter 2091 Gentle Wind","paragraphs":["2091 Gentle Wind","As the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s contractor, Liu Jie immediately knew how much it had improved after it evolved.","Liu Jie was the type to never lose his composure.","When the Insect Queen was in a near-dead stateand he was essentially crippledhe had trained his mind to be tough.","Yet, at this moment, he still could not prevent his true feelings from shining through as he stood up and pressed a gentle kiss on the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s shell.","Liu Jie was happy because his core insect-species carcinoma fey was strong enough to increase his strength to the greatest extent. This way, his flaw of weak individual combat would be made up.","Furthermore, with the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle, it would be easier for him to chase after Lin Yuan.","Night Leaning Moon rarely saw this side of Liu Jie, and she could not help but smile.","At that moment, he truly looked like the young man that he was.","Still filled with excitement, Liu Jie took out the Firefly Demon Fetus and fused it with the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","Fairy source-type lifeforms did not have strong bodies and relied on special techniques.","There was no way that the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle would be able to properly wield its abilities while it was in its fairy state.","It did not need to exert additional energy in order to change its form, but it could not tap into the abilities of the other form while in one form.","Liu Jie instructed the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle to fuse with the Firefly Demon Fetus, so it could break through the limit of its grade. This alone would make the use of the Firefly Demon Fetus worth it.","Liu Jie already had two insect-species carcinoma fairies.","He had studied the fairy forms of the Blade Queen Bee and Dimensional Light Moth and noticed that changing forms came with their own merits.","They could escape the bonds of pressure exerted by the bloodlines of more elite fairies by changing back to their original forms.","This would allow Liu Jie’s core to remain unaffected when he fought against enemies with fairies with more elite bloodlines. In a way, he was making up for one of his weaknesses.","The Firefly Demon Fetus was like a core of energy that had entered the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s body and created a unique fairy bloodline for it. The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle could activate this fairy bloodline to transform into a fairy.","After another two hours, Liu Jie could sense that the Firefly Demon Fetus was done creating the fairy bloodline within the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle.","Liu Jie immediately instructed the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle to transform into a fairy.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s body was shrouded in black light and turned into a two-winged fairy with a muscular body covered in black armor.","The fairy had rosy cheeks and was exceptionally healthy.","Its large black eyes sparkled as it looked affectionately at Liu Jie and Insect Queen.","As it flapped its wings, it struggled to lift its body.","The horns that protruded from the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s head were almost as long as its body.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle was considered large for a fairy.","This was not the first time that Night Leaning Moon was looking at a fairy that the Firefly Demon Fetus had transformed. But despite already having seen it twice, Night Leaning Moon still could not but be amazed by the Firefly Demon Fetus.","“Little Jie, the insect-species carcinoma fey can change between its original and fairy forms even after fusing with the Firefly Demon Fetus. Regardless, its fairy bloodline is still very strong! I suggest you focus on evolving the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s bloodline once you’ve evolved the fairy’s power to four wings. As long as the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s fairy bloodline power doesn’t exceed that of the Insect Queen, the Insect Queen’s control over it will not be affected.”","Liu Jie nodded seriously.","He had long decided how he was going to nurture the insect-species carcinoma feys that had transformed into fairies.","Liu Jie hung the Sky Awakening Crystal pendant that Night Leaning Moon had given him around the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s neck.","Liu Jie hoped that the Sky Awakening Crystal pendant could help the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle evolve to Fantasy Breed as soon as possible.","When he saw the Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s new abilities, Liu Jie was hoping that it would bring new surprises when it evolved to Fantasy Breed.","The Halberd Corner Sky-Defying Rhinoceros Beetle’s intelligence rose significantly after it transformed into a fairy, and its mind was no longer clouded.","Due to the Insect Queen’s special requirement, Liu Jie could not contract any other fey.","But now that he had many fairies, Liu Jie knew what other people with numerous feys felt like.","When the sky started to lighten, Night Leaning Moon said, “Little Jie, you said you would return to the Divine Wood Federation to train with Little Yuan today. The sun has already risen. You should go back to prepare! I will let you know when I find suitable insect-species carcinoma feys for you to contract so you can pick which one you want.”","Liu Jie bowed to Night Leaning Moon before he left the Spirit Guards’ land and headed to the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Once he returned to the Return from Faraway Mansion, Liu Jie saw Wen Yu basking in the sun with the Earth Rush Golden Lotus.","This sight reminded Liu Jie of the time he, Lin Yuan, and Wen Yu spent in the Return from Faraway Mansion before Sky City was created.","A nostalgic expression spread across his face.","At that time, he decided he would be Lin Yuan’s retainer.","Wen Yu had contracted the Astronomical Parliament, and Mystic Moon had been helping her to increase her spiritual energy. Thus, her spiritual energy and soul power were just as strong as Lu Pinru, who had contracted more than 10 of the Glowing Silkworm Weavers.","Not long ago, Wen Yu had absorbed the energy from within the dragon embryo, and her sensitivity greatly surpassed that of an average person.","Hence, she noticed Liu Jie when he stepped into the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Wen Yu hurriedly stood up and waved to Liu Jie.","When their eyes met, they remembered their shared faith. Their curled lips caused the air around them to turn warm.","By this time, Lin Yuan had risen out of bed.","He sighed at the empty space next to him.","In the past, Genius would be on his left, while Chimey would be snuggled in his arms while he slept.","In the past, Genius and Chimey had been carefree.","But now, Chimey had evolved into the Command Phoenix New Day Sparrow and opened a new path for bird-species feys."]},{"number":2092,"title":"Chapter 2092 Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel and Decay Body Ghost Silver!","paragraphs":["2092 Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel and Decay Body Ghost Silver!","Chimey was continuously increasing its power so it could hold a fan meeting. It spent almost all of its time in its nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, continuously absorbing the energy from within the strange flames.","After Genius evolved to the Highest Access Fate-Knowing Beast, its size had not changed by much, but its tail was extremely long. It was so long that it no longer fit on the bed.","Ever since Genius became a Creation Master, it became a workaholic. Every day, it was either busy with nurturing feys or teaching the Hundred Questions Beasts.","Genius was growing stronger, and so was the army of Hundred Questions Beasts.","Lin Yuan stretched and was about to climb out of bed when he saw that Su Yiren had sent him another message through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Su Yiren: Lin Yuan, the tribes from the Iron Hammer Federation have already started moving toward the border! Yi Huailong has received the news, and the entire Divine Wood Federation is panicking. I have given Yi Huailong assurance.]","Lin Yuan already said that there was no need to worry, but Su Yiren could not help but be anxious when she noticed the army of tribes from the Iron Hammer Federation moving toward the border.","Su Yiren was most afraid that the underground palace she guarded would become involved in the conflict.","Luo Lan was one of them, and she already knew what was happening in the Iron Hammer Federation. All she could do was worry.","Nonetheless, Su Yiren decided to tell Luo Lan about the matter because she was the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation. It would be a tragedy if she was unaware of such matters.","No matter what the result was, Luo Lan needed to have the courage to face the music.","Although Su Yiren did not know why Lin Yuan was able to make such a promise, there was no way he could be lying.","When Lin Yuan saw Su Yiren’s message on the Thoughts Letter Paper, he knew that the battle between him and the Truth Association that would take place on the Startling Lines Continent was about to begin.","He had already told the Moon Empress that Fifth Page Truth was in the Startling Lines Continent, and she had relayed the news to the Heavenly Family Cottage.","The members of the Heavenly Family Cottage should arrive back in the Radiance Federation this afternoon.","Revenge had to be exacted personally.","Lin Yuan was well aware that Purple Love and the rest would definitely ask him to take them to the Startling Lines Continent.","If Purple Love and the rest went to the Startling Lines Continent to take revenge on Fifth Page Truth, Lin Yuan would have more help when he took on Fifth Page Truth.","He did not want to use Begin Lady unless it was absolutely necessary.","Currently, Begin Lady was Lin Yuan’s biggest secret weapon.","Besides Su Yiren, Luo Lan had also sent a message to Lin Yuan. In fact, she had sent more than ten messages.","Lin Yuan could sense how frantic she was from her messages.","Lin Yuan knew that what she needed most at this time were his assurance and guarantee.","[Lin Yuan: The situation we agreed on won’t change. The tribes at the border of the Iron Hammer Federation won’t die of starvation. All you need to do is cooperate with me!]","Lin Yuan’s promise allowed the almost-hysterical Luo Lan to relax.","Lin Yuan’s promise was a thread of hope for Luo Lan to cling to.","He did not say too much to Luo Lan. The Moon Empress had already left for the Radiance Federation’s imperial court.","Now, Lin Yuan needed to head to the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure vault to pick a Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredient that the Perfect Touch Wisteria could absorb to replace the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","Usually, only four people were allowed to enter the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure vault, and Lin Yuan was one of them.","Lin Yuan walked deep into the Radiant Moon Palace’s treasure vault without anyone stopping him and stopped in front of a jade-textured almond-wood shelf. He raised his arm and reached for four brocade boxes.","The Source Sand transformed into four hands that carried the brocade boxes to a nearby table.","The four brocade boxes contained four pieces of Sovereign spiritual ingredients.","Lin Yuan had told the Moon Empress about how he needed Sovereign spiritual ingredients, and she told him to take his pick.","She also said that if Lin Yuan needed them, he could take them at any time.","There were only four pieces of the Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredients, proving how rare they were.","There was no way that Lin Yuan would take all of them. He was planning to choose the one amongst them that was most useful to him and give it to the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Lin Yuan reached out and opened the first brocade box.","Even before he saw what was in it, he sensed a sharp aura slicing into his body.","If not for the Source Sand’s protection, his body would have several large cuts.","Lin Yuan sensed the Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredient and saw that it was called the Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel. Its metal attribute was sharpness.","When it cut a target, thousands of steel silhouettes would appear that would continuously cut the same spot where the first cut had been to deepen the injury.","The Sovereign Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel was so precious that it was not used carelessly. When it was used, it was to cut other metal-type spiritual ingredients.","The Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel could increase the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s combat abilities.","It was a good choice, and Lin Yuan was leaning heavily toward it.","However, he did not make his decision immediately but moved on to look at the next brocade box of metal-type spiritual ingredients.","When he opened the next box, Lin Yuan felt a dry heat.","The Burning Crimson Bronze was one of the top-three rarest metal-type spiritual ingredients. It was known to be even hotter than top-grade strange flames.","It was much more valuable than the Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel.","But no matter how hot the flames were, they could not compare to the fire from the snake scale.","There were only eight of the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines, and Lin Yuan could not allow there to be a repeat in abilities.","Hence, Lin Yuan gave up on the Burning Crimson Bronze.","When Lin Yuan opened the third box, an indescribable stench spilled out.","When Lin Yuan held his breath and looked in, he saw a strange metal that was a mix of blue, purple, and black. It looked soft, and the dappled color made it appear as though it was a decaying corpse.","The name of this Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredient fit its appearance, the Decay Body Ghost Silver.","...","It was extremely poisonous and had powerful soul-attacking capabilities. It could decay willpowers and apply curses that caused bodies to decompose.","If a comparison had to be made, the Decay Body Ghost Silver was much more useful than the Spirit Edge Thousand Shadow Steel and was more suited for the Perfect Touch Wisteria to use Swallow Same Source to absorb it."]},{"number":2093,"title":"Chapter 2093 Forever Frozen Frost Iron and Elemental Reaction!","paragraphs":["2093 Forever Frozen Frost Iron and Elemental Reaction!","However, the stench of the Decay Body Ghost Silver was unbearable. The Perfect Touch Wisteria would definitely carry the same stench after it absorbed the Decay Body Ghost Silver.","Lin Yuan found this smell too difficult to bear.","It was also likely that the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s appearance would not take a turn for the better after it used the Swallow Same Source to absorb the Decay Body Ghost Silver.","Nonetheless, when it came to strength, everything else could be endured.","The Decay Body Ghost Silver’s cursing of bodies was much harder to defend against and get rid of compared to its venom and decaying of souls.","Lin Yuan reached into the fourth brocade box.","If the metal-type spiritual ingredient within the fourth brocade box was not better than the Decay Body Ghost Silver, Lin Yuan would have no choice but to instruct the Perfect Touch Wisteria to absorb it.","As much as he disliked it, Lin Yuan did not cut corners when it came to power.","After all, the Perfect Touch Wisteria would change according to the metal-type spiritual ingredients it absorbed through Swallow Same Source. All he needed to do was switch out the Decay Body Ghost Silver with a more suitable metal-type spiritual ingredient in the future.","But the moment Lin Yuan opened the fourth box, he immediately sensed a bone-chilling frigidity from within. The coldness washed over Lin Yuan’s body in waves.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had absorbed many Law Crystal fragments that contained ice-type laws.","Thus, the waves of coldness did not affect Lin Yuan in any way.","Moreover, Lin Yuan could sense a layer of ice-elemental energy that had attached itself around him and froze the surrounding air.","In spite of his strong resistance to ice, such an occurrence could also limit his movements.","But as Lin Yuan’s power increased and his horizons were expanded, he learned that the cold air from these metal-type spiritual ingredients would be a good match to produce an elemental reaction with a fire-type ability. This would increase the damage felt by the target.","A spirit qi professional’s affiliation with feys and their direction represented their potential.","There was no accurate way of measuring a spirit qi professional’s ability to comprehend Willpower Runes because they were largely related to the opportunities that one stumbled upon in life.","This was why not even experts could compare this trait with each other.","As such, comparing one’s affiliation with feys and direction was more objective.","It went without saying that the more feys one was affiliated with, and the wider the direction one could go in, the better. This would make it easier to find a powerful fey that they could contract.","After comprehending a Willpower Rune, it would be easier to find and contract a fey suited to the Willpower Rune.","There were many spirit qi professionals whose fey affiliations and direction were too narrow. As a result, they could not find suitable feys to contract after they comprehended Willpower Runes.","This even occurred amongst the Radiance Federation’s top factions.","Besides being able to contract feys, those with broader fey affiliations and directions would also have an easier time creating elemental reactions.","For example, when the enemy sustained a water-elemental attack during battle, followed by an ice-elemental attack, it would freeze faster.","If the frozen enemy was later attacked by fire-elemental attacks, the expansion and contraction would cause its body to crack and become easy to shatter.","Elemental reactions were useless to low-rank spirit qi professionals, but all high-grade spirit qi professionals considered elemental reactions when they were organizing their feys.","When high-rank spirit qi professional teams were picking teammates, they were very picky.","They not only wanted their teams to be balanced in terms of healing, support, defense, and attack but also checked if the potential teammate’s feys could create elemental reactions with the feys of other teammates.","After opening the brocade box, Lin Yuan checked on it using True Data and found out that it was called the Forever Frozen Frost Iron.","The Forever Frozen Frost Iron could change all elemental energy it came into contact with into ice-elemental energy.","When it was used in conjunction with the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vine that had consumed the dark gold snake scale, it would produce a powerful elemental reaction.","The Perfect Touch Wisteria had a total of eight vines.","Currently, one of the vines had consumed the dark gold snake scale while the other had consumed the Gaea Begin River’s bloodline.","The vine that had consumed Begin Lady’s bloodline could produce water-type effects.","If the Forever Frozen Frost Iron’s third vine consumed the Forever Frozen Frost Iron, the three vines could produce different elemental reactions with each other.","This allowed Lin Yuan to see a potential path that the Perfect Touch Wisteria could go down.","Since it could collaborate with the other two vines, the Forever Frozen Frost Iron was much more suitable than the Decay Body Ghost Silver.","Since he had decided for the Perfect Touch Wisteria to absorb the Forever Frozen Frost Iron, Lin Yuan summoned the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","Next, he tossed the Forever Frozen Frost Iron at the vine that had consumed the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","While the vine that had consumed the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold was consuming the Forever Frozen Frost Iron, it continuously let out sad cries as though it was in great pain.","Lin Yuan knew that the Perfect Touch Wisteria was using Swallow Same Source to absorb the Forever Frozen Frost Iron.","The Forever Frozen Frost Iron was going to replace the Coiling Dragon Blood Gold.","The Coiling Dragon Blood Gold contained a dragon soul, and it was struggling with the knowledge that it was going to be replaced.","The gold and red vine was slowly covered with a blue and silver color. Faint black patterns were swirling within the blue and silver.","By the time the Perfect Touch Wisteria was done absorbing the Forever Frozen Frost Iron, its appearance had changed significantly.","The silver and blue vine was now covered with sharp spikes that shone with cold and malice.","The elemental energy in the air around the vine clearly changed to ice-elemental energy that continued to affect a widening range of air around it.","As a Sovereign metal-type spiritual ingredient, the Forever Frozen Frost Iron not only contained its unique metal attribute but was also exceptionally sharp.","When the spikes made contact with a target, they could change the target’s element type and cause serious damage to the target’s body.","Lin Yuan wanted to test how strong the elemental reactions produced by the three Perfect Touch Wisteria’s vines were.","However, there were no targets on hand that Lin Yuan could test on.","As such, Lin Yuan stored the Perfect Touch Wisteria away.","Its spirit qi professional’s rank did not limit the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power.","...","As the Perfect Touch Wisteria’s power increased, the chance to test it out would eventually appear.","Now that Lin Yuan was done picking a metal-type spiritual ingredient and the Perfect Touch Wisteria was done absorbing it, he prepared to return to the Return from Faraway Mansion."]},{"number":2094,"title":"Chapter 2094 Purple Love Joins!","paragraphs":["2094 Purple Love Joins!","Once they returned to the Return from Faraway Mansion, Lin Yuan planned on taking Liu Jie and Wen Yu to the Divine Wood Federation.","Sun Ningxiang was there to hold down the fort in the marsh world.","After all, Lin Yuan had not gone to the Marsh East Circle yet.","Currently, the territory’s development involved not only the building of the base but also fey breeding bases.","Rather than let Wen Yu stay in the marsh world at such a time, it would be better for her to work with Su Yiren to solve the issue in the Startling Lines Continent as soon as possible.","After the final fight against the Truth Association, the entire Startling Lines Continent would fall into Lin Yuan’s hands.","Lin Yuan did not have to worry too much about the management of the Startling Lines Continent. Yi Huailong was in the Divine Wood Federation, Luo Lan was in the Iron Hammer Federation, and Jin Qianxun was in the Great Lush federation.","Lin Yuan just needed to control the three of them, and by the process of transference, he would also be able to control the entire Startling Lines Continent.","Yi Huailu was a true talent and had become a Class 5 Creation Master.","The Startling Lines Continent would become an alliance similar to the Seven States of Darkness that was led by the Divine Wood Federation.","The Startling Lines Continent was rich in resources. As long as the resources could flow smoothly, the citizens of all three federations would never have to worry about their bellies going empty.","Back at the Return from Faraway Mansion, Lin Yuan saw Liu Jie discussing the white-clothed followers with Wen Yu.","In the past, Wen Yu felt that Liu Jie was unskilled when it came to strategy.","But now, she was shocked to discover that Liu Jie’s faction management skills had improved significantly.","Although there were already more than 1,000 white-clothed followers, Liu Jie was still able to manage them well. He instructed the more senior white-clothed followers to lead the training of the newer white-clothed followers.","After their discussion, Wen Yu and Liu Jie decided that they would cap the number of white-clothed followers at 1,500. After that, they would stop accepting new members for the time being.","Further decisions would only be made after the white-clothed followers became more mature.","Too many white-clothed followers would become a burden to Sky City’s development.","Both Liu Jie and Wen Yu were aware of the Floating Island Whale’s existence.","The number of resources needed to build Sky City atop Universe was innumerable.","Only when the current white-clothed followers matured and could start contributing to Sky City would new members be recruited.","This would ensure that the new white-clothed followers were properly looked after. Otherwise, the high-intensity training would cause the white-clothed followers to be in danger at all times, which could even put their lives at risk.","The training that Liu Jie planned for the new white-clothed followers was not considered dangerous, and the more senior white-clothed followers led them.","Nonetheless, more than 10% of them ended up dead or injured in a week.","Lin Yuan felt assured when he heard Liu Jie and Wen Yu speaking at the entrance of the mansion.","With them around, all he needed to do was provide as many resources to Sky City as possible. He did not have to worry about anything else.","After Lin Yuan joined the conversation, they started to talk about Sky City’s development.","In the afternoon, Liu Jie grilled seafood.","Once Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie were done eating, they saw that Purple Love, Blood New Moon, and Blue Lotus had appeared in the mansion.","When Blood New Moon spotted Lin Yuan, he immediately went to greet him and asked, “Little Yuan, are you sure that Fifth Page Truth controls the Truth Association behind the Great Lush Federation?”","Lin Yuan nodded and replied, “Uncle Blood, I have never truly seen Fifth Page Truth, so I can’t be absolutely sure. But from the answers I got from the Truth Envoys, I think that the likelihood is 80% and above.”","When they heard what Lin Yuan said, Blood New Moon, Purple Love, and Blue Lotus were all filled with excitement.","The Heavenly Family Cottage did not have any other major enemies in the world besides Tower Canon.","Purple Love had attacked Tower Canon and killed First Page Fate because she had failed to find Fifth Page Truth. She had no choice but to vent her murderous rage on First Page Fate.","Blood New Moon, Purple Love, Blue Lotus, and the rest were this excited when they heard about Fifth Page Truth because they could now exact their revenge and because Jade Sundial’s Eternal Heart was with Fifth Page Truth.","Unless they obtained the Eternal Heart, Jade Sundial would not be able to be truly revived.","At first, Purple Love was satisfied with Jade Sundial in her current soul state. But slowly, she began to hope that her sister would be able to walk the earth in her full-bodied state.","Blood New Moon was about to speak when he was interrupted by Purple Love.","Purple Love knew what Blood New Moon was thinking.","From the moment Blood New Moon heard the news, he balled his fists and his eyes were full of hatred.","Blood New Moon wanted to seek revenge for Jade Sundial personally.","However, it would not be easy to take down Fifth Page Truth.","Purple Love had heard of Fifth Page Truth’s sacred source lifeform, the Divine Order Evil Fetus.","But besides the Divine Order Evil Fetus, Fifth Page Truth also had another sacred source lifeform called the Truth Staff.","The Truth Staff was very special, and it was rumored that Fifth Page Truth had almost used it to kill Eighth Page Apoptosis but was stopped by Eighth Page Apoptosis.","Since they were both part of the Eight Pages, they should have comparable power.","After all, the Eight Pages were not ranked by power.","Blood New Moon’s power had increased significantly, but there was no way he was a match for Fifth Page Truth.","Purple Love could understand Blood New Moon’s thirst for revenge, but she could now allow Blood New Moon to dive to his death.","“Little Yuan, I will go to the Startling Lines Continent with you.”","Purple Love turned to look at Blood New Moon and Blue Lotus.","“Both of you remain in the Radiance Federation and wait for White Phoenix to return.”","Blood New Moon hurriedly said, “Sister Purple Love, I want to go to the Startling Lines Continent to get revenge for Jade Sundial!”","Purple Love sighed and said seriously, “Blood New Moon, Jade Sundial has come back to life in the form of her soul state, and you’ve reunited with Little Love. If anything happens to you, both of them will be left alone. As of now, you’re no match for Fifth Page Truth.”","...","Blood New Moon struggled with himself when he heard what Purple Love said but finally lowered his fists.","What Purple Love said was true, and every statement was rational. Blood New Moon had no means of rebuking her.","Lin Yuan did not say anything.","Frankly, he did not want Blood New Moon to endanger himself.","He had Begin Lady, who had set its spirit fire alight to protect him. With Purple Love, who had already awakened her birth horoscope, they were sufficient to take on Fifth Page Truth."]},{"number":2095,"title":"Chapter 2095 Troops Arrive at the Sea of Flowers!","paragraphs":["2095 Troops Arrive at the Sea of Flowers!","Lin Yuan had not returned to the Divine Wood Federation in spite of the dire situation there because he was waiting for Purple Love.","But now that the matter had been settled, Lin Yuan said, “Auntie Purple, I will need to trouble you, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie to remain in this item. I will let you out once you arrive in the Divine Wood Federation!”","Purple Love immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","When traveling over far distances, the more powerful the person, the more spatial energy they required.","Spatial equipment could perfectly counter the energy requirement.","Purple Love smiled and said, “It’s no trouble at all!”","Purple Love entered the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad, followed by Liu Jie and Wen Yu.","After apologizing to Blood New Moon and Blue Lotus, Lin Yuan went to the basement to transport himself to the Divine Wood Federation through the Space Tunnel.","After communicating with Silver Corona, Lin Yuan found out that many tribe members from the Iron Hammer Federation had gathered at the border, all of them heavily armed.","The armed tribe members had already made contact with the sea of bone lotus flowers more than once.","The Truth Association had ordered Luo Cai to launch an all-out invasion into the Divine Wood Federation.","In order to invade the Divine Wood Federation, the imperial guards needed to cross the sea of bone lotus flowers that was in their way. As such, many imperial guards had already led teams of tribe members into the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan could not allow the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial guards to cross the sea of bone lotus flowers. Thus, Lin Yuan instructed Silver Corona to mercilessly kill the imperial guards and capture the tribe members who never had much will to resist to start with, just like it had done with the adventurers.","As the sea of flowers shifted, the captured tribe members were herded to the center of the area.","Soon after, Luo Lan entered the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan could not allow the tribe members that Silver Corona had captured to die and become fertilizer.","From the tribe members’ display, it was clear that they had been forced to enter the sea of flowers. None of them actually wanted to invade the Divine Wood Federation.","It was currently deep in the winter season.","They were already starving, and many more died in the midst of the long journey.","If they truly had to invade the Divine Wood Federation, they much preferred to do so during the warmer seasons when there was no lack of food.","However, the imperial guards represented Luo Cai’s will and rushed the tribe members forward endlessly.","Many of them took advantage of their identities as imperial guards to reserve most of the food.","If these imperial guards were not comparatively stronger and these tribe members did not want to betray the Iron Hammer Federation, none of them would have followed Luo Cai’s order.","By strictly following Luo Cai’s erroneous order to invade the Divine Wood Federation at such a time, it was clear that the imperial guards were fully under Luo Cai’s control.","Since the imperial guards were now Luo Cai’s men and would not be loyal to Luo Lan, it was better to kill them.","It was likely that Luo Cai had already heard of the sea of bone lotus flowers’ existence at the border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.","Once he understood the situation, Luo Cai would immediately inform the Truth Association.","The Truth Association would immediately send experts to the scene when they found out that the sea of bone lotus flowers was blocking the invasion’s advancement and the plan.","Thus, it was already decided that the battle between Lin Yuan and the Truth Association would take place within the territory that Silver Corona had created.","When he arrived at the Divine Wood Federation, Lin Yuan just needed to quietly observe the situation.","The location where Lin Yuan would arrive after being transported through the Space Tunnel was the main area of the underground palace.","When Su Yiren learned that Lin Yuan was about to return, she pulled Luo Lan with her to wait for him by the entrance.","Su Yiren could no longer handle the situation. It now concerned a battle between two federations, or rather an internal conflict in the Startling Lines Continent. Thus, Lin Yuan had to be the one to make the decisions.","The consequences could be irreparable if her decision went against Lin Yuan’s.","Luo Lan could only imagine how many people had died on the long journey in the food-scarce winter.","If all the tribe members who were of age had come, it was likely that at least one-third of them had died.","But according to what Su Yiren said, even underage manpower, women, and the elderly had also been forced to join the crusade.","Thus, the number of people who had made it to the border alive had to be half of the original number.","Luo Lan could not understand why Luo Cai had made such a senseless order.","Luo Lan could understand if Luo Cai had killed her father after being blinded by power.","But now, he was disregarding the lives of the Iron Hammer Federation’s citizens. This was an unforgivable mistake.","But no matter how much hate was bubbling within Luo Lan, there was nothing she could do to prevent all of it from happening.","All she could do now was wait for Lin Yuan to arrive to change it all.","When Luo Lan saw Lin Yuan, she immediately kneeled before him and looked into his eyes as she said, “Lord Lin Yuan, please provide the border area with some food! Luo Cai sent all of the tribes out, and the elderly and children should have fallen long ago!”","“After the long journey, there can’t be many of the weak elderly, women, and children left. Luo Lan, go and change into this set of clothes. You can give out the food within these Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts at that time,” replied Lin Yuan.","Luo Lan received the ring that Lin Yuan handed her.","She saw that there was a long dress with a thousand white gems embedded in it. There was a long shawl next to the dress.","The outfit was so extravagant that even Luo Lan, the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation, was stupefied.","When she looked inside the ring with almost 100 Item-Storing Walnuts, she saw they were filled with green vines that resembled the Usnea.","The Usnea was slightly poisonous. Some plants were immune to the poison, but human spirit qi professionals would immediately feel their tongues go numb when they consumed the Usnea. The sap would infect their throats and travel down until their entire bodies went numb."]},{"number":2096,"title":"Chapter 2096 Face the War!","paragraphs":["2096 Face the War!","The Usnea could not fill a stomach well. A person had to eat one and a half of it at least in order to feel full.","Although the Usnea’s poison would not strongly affect B-rank spirit qi professionals, it was lethal to spirit qi professionals who were below B-rank.","If C- or D-rank spirit qi professionals consumed large amounts of the Usnea, their bodies would also numb until their hearts stopped.","Most of the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members were weak and below B-rank.","Even B-rank spirit qi professionals could lose their lives if they ate too much of the Usnea in a weakened state of hunger.","While Luo Lan was filled with doubt and sadness, Lin Yuan said, “I remember you saying that Luo Cai is hunting you because you’re the First Princess of the Iron Hammer Federation and because you are in possession of the crown. When you change into these clothes, don’t forget to place the Iron Hammer Federation’s royal crown on your head.","“The green vines in the Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts are not Usnea. You can pluck and eat one of the leaves. Once you eat one of the leaves, you’ll know if they can save the tribe members of the Iron Hammer Federation!”","Luo Lan pushed her concern aside, plucked one of the leaves from the green vines, and put it in her mouth.","The leaf tasted fresh and juicy.","Ever since Luo Lan learned of the situation, she had been worried. She had not eaten a proper meal in two days and had lost her appetite.","But she was a human made of flesh and bones. It was to be expected that she lacked energy after a prolonged period of lack of food.","After she ate the leaf, not only was she not numb in the slightest, but she felt full as well. Furthermore, she felt as though she had endless energy.","A singular leaf was already this effective.","The almost 100 Diamond Item-Storing Walnuts were enough to fill the stomachs of all the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members.","When Lin Yuan sent Luo Lan off to make preparations, Su Yiren said to Lin Yuan, “The city that Ta Lei built has many Land Imps, but the scale of the city is so large that construction is not even half-done yet. Hence, I asked him to close the city gates.","“Luckily, the sea of flowers has surrounded Ta Lei’s city, and there are mountains on the other side of the moat. Otherwise, the starving tribe members from the Iron Hammer Federation will definitely attack Ta Lei’s city.”","Lin Yuan nodded. He had expected such a situation.","When people were in a state of hunger, there was nothing they would not do.","“Yiren, you don’t have to worry about the battle anymore. Go and contact Li Wan to tell her to recruit more people in Oak City to support more merchant groups.”","Su Yiren knew that Lin Yuan was planning for the future.","Once all the dust had settledthe moment Lin Yuan took control of the entire Startling Lines Continenthe would indeed need a faction he controlled to manage the trades.","Almost all merchant groups doing business in the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation were from the Great Lush Federation.","Although a few of them were controlled by the Great Lush Federation’s secret aristocratic families, most of them were just trying to make a living.","The Truth Association wanted the Startling Lines Continent to be ravaged by war, and the biggest victims were these small merchant groups who were just trying to survive.","The Great Lush Federation’s secret aristocratic families controlled almost all of the chambers of commerce in the Divine Wood Federation.","Thus, these smaller merchant groups were in an awkward position in the Divine Wood Federation.","On the one hand, they were discriminated against by the locals in the Divine Wood Federation. After all, the Great Lush Federation’s merchant groups had killed too many of the bandits from the Divine Wood Federation.","On the other hand, the smaller merchant groups saw money as a resource. Once they lost the transfer hubs in the form of the chambers of commerce, the small merchant groups no longer had the money to travel and trade.","If Li Wan started to recruit at such a time, she would receive decent resources. It was likely that all members of the Divine Wood Federation’s chamber groups would end up recruited by Li Wan.","With such a large number of merchant groups working together, the scale of the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce would increase rapidly.","Su Yiren did not think that Li Wan and Zhao Jiazhi would be able to accomplish Lin Yuan’s plan if they were still the ones managing the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce. After all, their talents were just that.","But now, the Prosperous Chamber of Commerce was under Listen’s management.","Su Yiren had interacted with Listen a few times.","In terms of the management of chambers of commerce, no one was more capable than Listen.","Su Yiren felt that even she could not do a better job than Listen when it came to managing chambers of commerce.","Su Yiren was curious to know how Lin Yuan managed to garner so many talented people in his orbit.","At first, Su Yiren had been worried about the battle as they were going to take on one of the Eight Pages of Tower Canon.","But now, Lin Yuan was even done making plans for the aftermath of the battle. This meant that he had absolute confidence in emerging victorious!","Since that was the case, Su Yiren felt that she did not need to worry.","After Su Yiren left, Lin Yuan let Purple Love, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu out of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad.","Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Purple Love and said, “Auntie Purple, if any experts break through the sea of flowers, I hope you can help to kill them.”","Purple Love already saw Lin Yuan as a savior and thus would not reject his request.","Purple Love did not bring up Fifth Page Truth again.","Since she had come to the Startling Lines Continent, she would eventually have to take on Fifth Page Truth with Lin Yuan.","Rather than seeking him out, waiting for him to come to them would be better.","Otherwise, if he fled, it would be extremely difficult to find him again!","Purple Love had been seriously injured when she killed First Page Fate.","But after years of recuperation, her power had also reached a new level.","Hence, she was confident in being able to take down Fifth Page Truth.","As a Heavenly Family Fey, Purple Love’s arrogance around experts of the same level was legitimate.","When Lin Yuan made his request to Purple Love, he noticed that the imperial guards seemed to have received an order as they started leading the tribe members in a charge toward the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan sighed.","For the first time in his two lives, he was going to face a war.","..."]},{"number":2097,"title":"Chapter 2097 Importance and Plans!","paragraphs":["2097 Importance and Plans!","Although Lin Yuan had issued an order to Silver Corona to kill the imperial guards, there was not much that Silver Corona could do to the spirit qi professionals who were attacking the sea of flowers.","If Silver Corona did nothing and allowed the spirit qi professionals to attack it, even the thickest of sea of flowers would eventually be crossed.","Thus, there was no avoiding injuries and deaths.","Nonetheless, given Silver Corona’s intelligence, it could keep unnecessary injuries and deaths to a minimum.","Luo Cai attacked the Divine Wood Federation during winter on the Truth Association’s orders. It could be said that this had ruined the Iron Hammer Federation’s roots.","Even if Silver Corona did not cause too many injuries and deaths, the Iron Hammer Federation would definitely end up with more serious injuries than the Divine Wood Federation.","But if the sacrifices could lead to peace, for the Iron Hammer Federation, Great Lush Federation, and Divine Wood Federation to become one body in which resources flowed smoothly, the losses could be recouped in a few decades. In fact, they could become even stronger and more prosperous than they had been.","Just as Wen Yu was about to say something to Lin Yuan, Bai Qinghuan walked in and made a beeline for Lin Yuan with a stack of documents in her hands.","Bai Qinghuan had voluntarily detached herself from the Bai family.","If she had not interacted with Lin Yuan during the Crown Wood Banquet, the Yang family would have killed her for being a groomed bride for the Bai family’s first grandson when the Bai and Su families joined forces to attempt to remove the Yang family.","Bai Qinghuan’s status in the Bai family had not been high. Thus, she had not had the opportunity to learn of the Bai family’s biggest secrets.","She had not heard any news of the Bai and Su families’ joint attack on the Yang family before it happened.","Thinking back on it now still filled her with fear.","Bai Qinghuan was thankful to the past her who had been brave.","Alas, in her time spent in Lin Yuan’s camp, it was clear that he did not see her as sufficiently important.","Liu Jie, who was always by Lin Yuan’s side, had only exchanged a few words with her in the beginning, and they had not spoken since then.","She came to see Lin Yuan now because she wanted to prove her worth.","“Master, Yiren told me about the situation. This is the information I organized based on my understanding. It might be useful for the battle. Would you like to take a look?”","Bai Qinghuan held the information out to Lin Yuan with a slightly heavy heart.","It was clear that Lin Yuan was busy.","In a way, she was wasting his time by calling for his attention now.","If he decided not to look through the information she collected, she would fail to prove her worth at this juncture.","This was currently the best time for her to prove her worth to Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan dispatched her elsewhere in the future, she would not be able to prove her worth to Lin Yuan, no matter how hard she tried.","The nervous Bai Qinghuan had no idea that Lin Yuan never thought lightly of her.","If he had not seen value in her in the beginning, she would never have had the chance to stand next to him, much less be allowed to join Sky City.","He had recently not paid much attention to Bai Qinghuan because he had been too busy.","But when he saw the information that she was holding out, Lin Yuan knew that they contained her analysis of the battle circumstances.","Lin Yuan had already calculated how the battle was going to progress.","Given that he possessed the ultimate secret weapon, Lin Yuan had essentially gained a godlike view. Thus, he could make decisions based on what he saw from that viewpoint.","However, Bai Qinghuan did not have such capabilities.","In Su Yiren’s previous reports, she mentioned that Bai Qinghuan had not stopped gathering information.","Frankly, Su Yiren did not have much trust in Bai Qinghuan, who Lin Yuan had brought back with him from Sacred Forest City. After all, unlike Luo Lan, Bai Qinghuan was not a member of the Astronomical Parliament.","Su Yiren was willing to tell all the information she received to Luo Lan and not Bai Qinghuan.","Nonetheless, Bai Qinghuan was someone who had been brought back by Lin Yuan.","Before she ascertained Bai Qinghuan’s attitude toward Lin Yuan, Su Yiren had to extend basic courtesies to Bai Qinghuan.","As such, Su Yiren did not hide the less sensitive information from Bai Qinghuan when she asked.","Lin Yuan was curious to know how far Bai Qinghuan’s deductions could go with incomplete knowledge of the circumstances.","He knew that the main world was about to descend into chaos.","Bai Qinghuan’s strategic significance surpassed that of Su Yiren.","When Lin Yuan looked through the information, shock spread across his face.","Bai Qinghuan’s deductions were very accurate.","Her deductions of the deaths and injuries in the Iron Hammer Federation completely coincided with Luo Lan’s own.","Furthermore, she had even deduced that the Great Lush Federation would join the battle midway.","Lin Yuan knew that Bai Qinghuan did not know much about the Truth Association. Yet, she had been able to produce such detailed information.","The organization, analysis, and deductions in this piece of information made Lin Yuan even more impressed with Bai Qinghuan.","Since he understood her gesture, it went without saying that he had to do something for her in return.","However, her ambitions were too large. Lin Yuan needed to use this battle to teach her to keep her ambitions under control while still instilling some confidence in her.","“Bai Qinghuan, you don’t need to come along to help with matters in the Startling Lines Continent. During this time, reflect on yourself and build up your spirit. Once the matters in the Startling Lines Continent are settled, I will assign you to be Su Yiren’s assistant. She used to be a Dark Envoy of the Seven States of Darkness before the Dark Continent fell to Seventh Page War. At that time, you’ll analyze how the Dark Continent can be recovered with her.”","No matter how capable Bai Qinghuan was, she had not read widely enough nor gained sufficient experience.","Hence, she did not know who Seventh Page War was.","But Bai Qinghuan had heard of the Seven States of Darkness. It was a federation that had a Class 5 Creation Master and thus was much stronger than the Divine Wood Federation.","She was slightly shocked that the Seven States of Darkness had fallen to Seventh Page War. Just how strong was this Seventh Page War?","..."]},{"number":2098,"title":"Chapter 2098 Next, the Dark Continent!","paragraphs":["2098 Next, the Dark Continent!","Bai Qinghuan did not know Su Yiren well, and the latter had not told Bai Qinghuan about her identity.","But now, Bai Qinghuan found out from Lin Yuan just what caliber of a group he had assembled.","Given that Su Yiren used to be a Dark Envoy of the Seven States of Darkness, Bai Qinghuan did not feel indignant at all about being her subordinate in spite of her arrogant character.","Lin Yuan’s words enabled Bai Qinghuan to know that Lin Yuan had not abandoned her. Rather, he had an even more important task for her.","Bai Qinghuan forcefully suppressed her excitement and said calmly, “Don’t worry! I will rest well during this time. Then, watch as I perform with flying colors!”","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded.","Before he obtained Begin Lady, Lin Yuan would have immediately fled back to the Radiance Federations to request backup if he knew that he would have to battle against Fifth Page Truth.","Lin Yuan always had a thorough understanding of his own power.","Even if he had a11 Stars precious instrument, he would be no match for Fifth Page Truth.","But things were different now that he had Begin Lady.","Begin Lady was fully capable of shielding Lin Yuan from the Eight Pages of Tower Canon.","Lin Yuan knew what Su Yiren wished for, and she had done her duty well under him.","After they were done handling Fifth Page Truth, it was time for Lin Yuan to throw a wrench into Seventh Page War’s life.","Previously, he and Liu Jie had almost died as a result of Seventh Page War’s scheme.","Seventh Page War’s subordinate had wanted to kill him, and Liu Jie had blocked the attack on his behalf.","Although Liu Jie later benefited from such a disaster, he had almost lost his life.","Thus, it could be said that there was a blood grudge between Seventh Page War and Lin Yuan.","Once the Startling Lines Continent fell into his hands, he would continue developing the marsh world while moving on to cause trouble for the Startling Lines Continent!","Liu Jie was acquainted with Bai Qinghuan, but Wen Yu did not know Bai Qinghuan well.","Wen Yu was very curious about this girl, who Lin Yuan thought highly of.","She reached out and took the documents from Lin Yuan and scanned through them.","Later, she sighed in amazement and said, “This person is very capable of organizing information. Her deductions about the battle are also very accurate. She is an impressive talent! Young Master, congratulations on gaining another impressive subordinate!","“If you don’t have any other plans for her, send her to the marsh world to work with me once the situation in the Startling Lines Continent is handled!”","The marsh world was much larger than the continents in the main world.","White Speak had said that it would take him a month to fly around the Marsh East Circle.","Thus, the Marsh East Circle was even larger than the entire Radiance Federation. It was possible that it was three to four times larger.","Before Wen Yu came to know of the marsh world, she did not understand why the members of the Radiance Federation’s royalty wanted to expend so many resources and manpower to build habitable mirror cities in the abyssal world. They had even instructed the factions to move their families there.","However, after going to the marsh world, she started to understand the efforts that the Radiance Federation’s royalty was making.","It could be said that the dimensional worlds were treasure troves even larger than those of the main world.","Developing the marsh worlds would solve any scarce resource problem that the main world had and give spirit qi professionals a new training ground.","Wen Yu had been amazed more than once by the Radiance Federation’s royalty’s intelligence.","Now that she knew that the marsh world was a treasure trove, she put all her efforts into developing the marsh world.","What she needed now was a capable assistant.","Wen Yu saw Bai Qinghuan as a good choice.","Lin Yuan did not immediately reply to Wen Yu but changed the subject and said, “Once we’ve defeated Seventh Page War and recovered the Dark Continent, a year will have passed.","“Currently, the main world is in a mess. If there is no more conflict in the main world a year later, I can send Bai Qinghuan to you to be your assistant in the marsh world. If there continues to be conflict, I won’t be able to let you have Bai Qinghuan. At that time, I will assign her to be an assistant general for Sky City’s combat branch to aid Big Brother Liu.”","Wen Yu nodded in agreement.","If there was a conflict in the main world, it would not be suitable for Bai Qinghuan to assist her in the marsh world.","In order for a person to demonstrate their greatest worth, they had to be placed in the right position.","Liu Jie felt pressured when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","Lin Yuan said that Bai Qinghuan was going to become the assistant general of Sky City’s combat branch and assist him. That meant that Lin Yuan had decided that he would become the main general of Sky City’s combat branch.","Liu Jie had always been afraid of falling short of Lin Yuan’s trust in him.","He was always well aware of his abilities.","But since Lin Yuan had already made his arrangement, Liu Jie would have to ensure that he was up to the job when the time came.","Ever since he started following Lin Yuan, Liu Jie had been trying to increase his power.","But now, he was going to shift some of his focus away from purely increasing his power to also gaining skills that a war general needed to have and faction management.","Liu Jie needed to command an army of insects to fight. Thus, ever since he became a spirit qi professional, he had to research combat strategies.","As such, it would not be difficult for him to refine his abilities as a general.","Wen Yu kept her peripheral vision on Liu Jie while she spoke to Lin Yuan. When she saw his expression, she knew that he was adding more pressure on himself.","Wen Yu liked the feeling of being by Lin Yuan’s side. There was not only warmth and dependability, but Lin Yuan was also like a weather vane that guided her and Liu Jie constantly.","If not for Lin Yuan, there was no way that she and Liu Jie could have increased their strength so quickly.","This was not only because he provided them with resources but also bolstered their spirits.","When Wen Yu chatted with Lin Yuan back in the Return from Faraway Mansion, she had asked him, “Young Master, what is your biggest goal?”","At first, she thought that he would bring up a short-term goal. Yet, his answer was, “I want to see a wider world.”","..."]},{"number":2099,"title":"Chapter 2099 Let Her Go Alone!","paragraphs":["2099 Let Her Go Alone!","Wen Yu was stupefied when she heard Lin Yuan’s goal. She had never dared to imagine such a goal.","At first, she thought that Lin Yuan would say he wanted to become a Radiance Envoy or help the Radiance Federation to attain a good ranking at the Major Federation Meeting.","But clearly, Lin Yuan’s plans were much broader than she thought.","A wider world?","Wen Yu did not know what Lin Yuan meant by a wider world. But since this was his goal, Wen Yu would make it hers as well so they could see this wider world together.","It was likely that after Lin Yuan revealed his goal, it was also Liu Jie’s goal now!","Liu Jie took a deep breath and said, “Lin Yuan, before Bai Qinghuan leaves with Su Yiren to analyze the Dark Continent so as to recover it and to take on Seventh Page War, I hope she can come with me for some time. I want to learn from her.”","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “Big Brother Liu, you are already on good terms with Bai Qinghuan. You can ask her yourself. I don’t think she’ll turn you down.”","While Lin Yuan was speaking, Luo Lan finished changing into the clothes that Lin Yuan had given her.","The dress with 1,000 white gems embedded in it looked extremely dignified. The shawl around her shoulders that reached the ground did not look gaudy at all. Rather, it added a kind of majesty to her aura.","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he saw Luo Lan.","However, Luo Lan had been too anxious over the danger that the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members were in and worried that they would die of starvation. As such, it was clear that she had changed in a big rush. She had not even combed her hair properly but pressed it under the crown. In the end, many strands had already fallen out and were draping over her shoulders.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to take a step forward, Wen Yu had already reached Luo Lan.","Wen Yu looked over Luo Lan a few times before she introduced herself, “I am Libra. In the real world, my name is Wen Yu.”","While she spoke, Wen Yu helped Luo Lan to adjust her attire. She went on to say, “No matter what happens, don’t lose your cool. Lin Yuan must have his reasons for telling you to change into these clothes.","“But now, you aren’t even dressed neatly, and your hair isn’t properly done to fit the crown. If you appear before the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members in your current state, you will lack the authoritative aura of a ruler.”","Luo Lan had not thought much of it when she was changing into the clothes that Lin Yuan had handed her because she knew that with every passing minute, hundreds of tribe members could be losing their lives.","In order for every citizen in the Iron Hammer Federation to have full bellies, Luo Lan was willing to sacrifice her freedom and life to Lin Yuan. Thus, it went without saying that her mind was solely focused on the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members.","Given that Wen Yu was the Astronomical Parliament’s contractor, she had seen Luo Lan’s life experiences alongside Lin Yuan. Thus, she knew why Luo Lan had not even worn her crown properly.","Wen Yu and Lin Yuan had discussed Luo Lan and knew that he wanted the Iron Hammer Federation to see her as a god.","It was the best idea to turn the Iron Hammer Federation’s ruler into a goddess that all the citizens placed their faith in.","Soon, Wen Yu was done adjusting Luo Lan’s attire and combed all her hair under her crown.","When Luo Lan heard Wen Yu say that she was Libra, she immediately turned formal.","Both Wen Yu and Lin Yuan had been sitting on the 12 golden thrones.","Compared to Lin Yuan, Wen Yu was much more foreign.","It was clear that Wen Yu’s tone was instructive.","Luo Lan immediately realized that she had not properly done what Lin Yuan had instructed her to do.","She cast an anxious gaze at Lin Yuan, fearing that he would change his mind and give up on saving the Iron Hammer Federation.","When she learned about the Divine Wood Federation’s current circumstances from Su Yiren, Luo Lan’s impression of Lin Yuan immediately changed.","Lin Yuan sighed when he saw the expression on Luo Lan’s face.","However, she still needed to gain more experience in order to have an aura befitting the ruler of the Iron Hammer Federation’s imperial court.","Lin Yuan did not blame Luo Lan and said, “I will send you to a place. This place is where the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members who rushed into the sea of flowers under the imperial guards’ command are held. There are more than seven million of them, and the number is still growing. When you arrive, you will give out the Soldier Ration Radishes. At that time, you will have the accompaniment of an obedient shadow.”","Lin Yuan gently stomped his feet on the ground, and a pool of quicksand materialized below Luo Lan.","Luo Lan sank into the quicksand, and radium boards flew together to create a container for her.","Wen Yu remembered Lin Yuan saying that he was going to go with Luo Lan.","Did he change his mind and was only going to send her alone?","“Lin Yuan, many starving tribe members of the Iron Hammer Federation have been injured and are now in a frenzied state. Even if they don’t start cannibalizing their comrades, they will definitely start trampling over each other in order to obtain the Solder Ration Radishes that will be able to fill their bellies!","“They will see their comrades who are sharing the food with them as their enemies. In their frenzied state of hunger, where they’re unsure when their next meal will be, they will definitely try to stock up on as many Soldier Ration Radishes as possible. Luo Lan won’t be able to handle such a situation on her own!”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement. Wen Yu spoke the truth, and the situation might be even more terrifying than she described.","But in order for Luo Lan to grow quickly, she needed to gain experience.","If Luo Lan appeared in the crowd with the Soldier Ration Radishes that could save lives, those who were nearest to her would be able to obtain the Soldier Ration Radishes first. Those who were further would be dying of starvation, but those nearer would be unwilling to move. Eventually, a fight would break out.","The fight might even be more intense than the war between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation. This was because the fight stemmed from the basic need for food.","Once Luo Lan arrived, she would not only be able to grow quickly through this event but would also allow Lin Yuan to see the extent of her abilities.","More importantly, Lin Yuan would be able to see how the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members reacted when they were rescued."]},{"number":2100,"title":"Chapter 2100 Whose Order?","paragraphs":["2100 Whose Order?","The Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members’ reaction to being rescued represented the Iron Hammer Federation’s potential.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie held a discussion.","When the Startling Lines Continent was conquered, the Divine Wood Federation would become the core of the three federations, but not all of the Creation Master resources produced by Yi Huailu would go into the Divine Wood Federation.","Lin Yuan intended to send Yi Huailu to Ta Lei’s territory after increasing Yi Huailu’s power. This way, Ta Lei’s territory would become the core of the three federations.","They would pick talented people from the three federations to nurture them before they were returned to the three federations.","Thus, understanding how a federation handled danger would inform Lin Yuan of whether the talented people in the federation were worth being nurtured.","The Divine Wood Federation had not satisfied Lin Yuan when they had been in danger. Every faction only cared about themselves, causing the entire federation to be divided. None of them thought about the Divine Wood Federation’s overall welfare.","Lin Yuan hoped that the Iron Hammer Federation would be able to provide him with a satisfying result.","Through his interaction with Ta Lei’s Horseshoe Tribe, Lin Yuan felt that the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members were honest people.","At the time, every member of the Horseshoe Tribe had been ready to sacrifice themselves in order to create a chance for Ta Lei’s survival.","Meanwhile, none of the leaders of small factions in the Divine Wood Federation had thought about their juniors first in a state of emergency. Rather, they ensured their own safety and profits first.","In this aspect, the Iron Hammer Federation was better than the Divine Wood Federation.","After mulling for some time, Lin Yuan decided not to interfere in the selfish character of the Divine Wood Federation’s elite.","If the Iron Hammer Federation could not provide Lin Yuan with a satisfying result as well, Lin Yuan would have no choice but to turn to the Great Lush Federation.","However, the Great Lush Federation had been under the Truth Association’s control for the past few years. When Lin Yuan took over the Great Lush Federation, he would need to work with Jin Qianxun to do a deep cleaning first to empty the Great Lush Federation of all traces of the Truth Association.","The Source Sand quickly transported Luo Lan underground.","As per Lin Yuan’s instructions, Shadow followed Luo Lan.","He had given Shadow two orders.","The first order was to protect Luo Lan, and the second was to listen to her commands.","Silver Corona told Lin Yuan about the current state of the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribe members who were currently trapped within the sea of flowers.","All of them were starving but dared not enter the sea of flowers. Thus, they were pacing at the center of the area, causing numerous bloody fights to break out. All of them had looks of despair hanging off their faces.","The tribes who had occupied advantageous locations first knew that they were not dead but had been captured by the sea of flowers instead.","As they fled to where they currently were, they got a good look at how strong the sea of flowers was.","After capturing them, the sea of flowers surrounded them but did not attack them. They were like penned-up pigs waiting for the day they ended up on someone’s dinner plate.","There was a clear distinction in ranking between the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes. It resembled the ranking between the aristocratic families in the Divine Wood Federation.","Namely, they were ranked with Black Iron at the bottom, going up to Light Bronze, White Silver, Yellow Gold, Platinum, and more.","Platinum tribes usually had one or more Class 4 Creation Masters.","The tribes with the highest ranking of Black Gold had at least one pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master.","There were six Black Gold tribes that had been captured by the sea of flowers.","Normally, Black Iron, Light Bronze, White Silver, and Yellow Gold tribes lived within the territories of Black Gold tribes and served the Black Gold tribes.","They had to offer up a batch of resources to the Black Gold tribes annually.","The repeated offerings secured the power of the Black Gold tribes.","Although Platinum tribes were not reliant on Black Gold tribes, they usually had collaborative relationships.","The leaders of Black Gold tribes were not always the pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","In order for Creation Masters to continuously increase their powers, they could not spend much time managing the tribes.","However, the key decisions in the Black Gold tribes were always made by the pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","Now, six pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters had been captured.","There was no question that they were the true bigshots in the Iron Hammer Federation. Even the Iron Hammer Federation’s previous king had to bow and beg in front of them.","Presently, all of them had ashen faces and livid expressions.","“With so many of us trapped in the sea of flowers, even if we end up eaten by the sea of flowers, half of us will be gone in less than three days. Rather than so many of us waiting to die, why don’t we try to charge out in the direction we came in?","“We have already sent out feys to sense the sea of flowers, but they were attacked when they took flight. Moreover, this fog is much too thick. There’s no way for us to properly investigate this sea of flowers! Going back in the direction we came from is the only way for us to escape the sea of flowers!”","The rest of the five pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters nodded. It seemed that this was the only way to escape the sea of flowers.","However, it was clear that there was something hidden in the sea of flowers that could threaten Myth Breed feys.","A thearch-class expert from a Platinum tribe was sent to investigate the sea of flowers. But five hours had passed, and he still had not returned.","Before the thearch-class expert left, he had agreed to return two hours later.","Given that he had not returned despite being three hours late, it was likely that he had died in the sea of flowers.","Given that even a thearch-class expert had been killed in the sea of flowers, the six pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters dared not act recklessly.","Even if the sea of flowers was ineffective against Immortal experts, there might not be an Immortal expert amongst the Black Gold tribes.","Even if the Black Gold tribes did have Immortal experts, they would want to survive alongside their other tribe members.","At that moment, an enraged voice roared, “Damn it! If I’m ever able to return to the imperial court, I’ll cut down Luo Cai’s head even if it costs my life! What kind of order is this? On the journey to the Divine Wood Federation, even without the sea of flowers, at least half of our people died. How is such scum fit to be the Iron Hammer Federation’s king? With such a king, there’s no way that the snow beast on the snow-capped mountain will bless the Iron Hammer Federation.”"]}]);
